is possible. This is the critical level to watch out for because, if the bulls can propel the price above this level, the momentum is likely to pick up.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the pair below $56 and the 20-day EMA ($54.83), a drop to the critical support at $51 is possible. A break below this support will signal a possible change in trend but if the bulls buy the dip to this support, the pair might remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $0.15\u8211\'20\'13$0.1543051 resistance zone on Aug. 9, which shows that the bears are aggressively defending this zone. However, the upsloping moving averages suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f0c83bb607ac30f064342fa6a3aed2d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($0.1379), the bulls will make one more attempt to scale the price above the zone. If they succeed, a rally to $0.173 and then to $0.20 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the $0.13 support is likely. A bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days. A break below $0.13 is likely to shift the advantage in favor of the bears with the next support at $0.12.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the tight range of $21.7628-$22.93 for the past three days, which shows uncertainty among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7fb606d6b16f83621a908c40f6f06d49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While the bulls are buying the dips to $21.7628, the bears are defending the overhead resistance at $22.93.\par \par \uc2 However, the moving averages are sloping up and the RSI remains in the positive zone, suggesting advantage to the bulls. If the bulls can push the price above $22.93, a move to $24.4588 and then to $27.1905 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $21.7628, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($21) is likely. A break below this support will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) remains in an uptrend but it is facing resistance near the highs at $0.176596. Hence, it is likely to consolidate between $0.176596 and $0.154322 for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fb606fdf1156b9132d7919958d92daae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which indicates that the momentum is weakening. If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.159), it will indicate profit booking and a break below $0.154322 will shift the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 This assumption of a correction will be invalidated if the CRO/USD pair continues higher and breaks above $0.176596. Above this level, the next level to watch out for is $0.20.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8xY2MxNTBkOTVmN2E0NWVkODUxNzY5OTI5OGI1ZGVjOC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200810eg8a000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Bullish \highlight\uc2  Bitcoin Price Trend Intact Even After BTC Retests $11.4K Support\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Ray Salmond \par \uc2 460 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 August 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After dropping 4.89% to confirm $11.4K as support, Bitcoin price is slowly making its way back toward $11.8K\par \par \uc2 * Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price swiftly fell to $11,322 after reaching a daily high at $11,909\par \par \uc2 * The drop came as U.S. jobless claims fell to $1.2 million but lawmakers inability to reach a deal on the next coronavirus stimulus package has worried some investors\par \par \uc2 * Despite the pullback to the $11.4K support, Bitcoin price remains in an uptrend\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fe413e75bf4edd688b53d8be75f7e6fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market daily price chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-81mragpm6m_1596848785310"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Earlier today Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price abruptly dropped to $11,322 after topping out at $11,909.\par \par \uc2 The mild correction came as U.S. jobless claims fell to 1.2 million and U.S. markets opened slightly in the red but by the end of the day Dow and S&P 500 closed with a 0.7% and 0.17% gain.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile NASDAQ continued to trek higher, closing the day with a 1.66% gain.\par \par \uc2 While stocks continue to move higher each week, today\u8217\'20\'19s collapse of talks between U.S. lawmakers attempting to negotiate the next phase of coronavirus economic stimulus could weigh on investor confidence and cause markets to open in the red next week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/723387a5d2034ede009b3c807511a0dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders will note that BTC price had begun losing momentum around $11,800 and once the price dropped below the high volume VPVR node at $11,583, the price quickly fell to retest the support at $11,400.\par \par \uc2 While inconvenient for some, today\u8217\'20\'19s pullback shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t surprise as its routine for Bitcoin price lower levels to confirm that a former level of resistance now functions as support.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing BTC is holding above $11,650 but a drop below $11,500 and the $11,400 support could result in another drop to $11,200.\par \par \uc2 As long as the price holds above $11,100 the pattern of higher lows remains, meaning the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  uptrend remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/62ace538185629493172251725446c4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Surprisingly, as Bitcoin price dropped 4.89%, altcoins held up relatively well, except Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) which pulled back 8.76% to $362.35 before recovering to $379.80.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is down 4.19%, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XPR}}}\uc2  has dropped by 3.03% and Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) shaved off 5.99% to trade at $3.05.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 , the overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $350.7 billion. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/#dominance-percentage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dominance index}}}\uc2  currently at 61.1%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9hMzgyYTk2NDVlYjQwM2M0ZmI0OGExY2U4MTk4OGU5MC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200808eg8800003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, BNB, CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,782 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 August 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins might consolidate or correct marginally for a few days before a possible breakout to the upside\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/08/04/the-fed-is-expected-to-make-a-major-commitment-to-ramping-up-inflation-soon.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 contemplating}}}\uc2  a change in the way it responds to a possible increase in inflation. Previously, the Fed would kickstart tightening if its models forecast a 2% inflation increase. However, this time, the Fed wants to allow inflation to stay above its 2% target before raising rates.\par \par \uc2 Morgan Creek\u8217\'20\'19s Anthony Pompliano believes that due to Fed\u8217\'20\'19s poor track record with inflation targets, it might end up stoking \u8220\'20\'1Cinflation at the exact moment that they should be reigning it in.\u8221\'20\'1D Pompliano anticipates \u8220\'20\'1Creal estate, gold, Bitcoin and stocks\u8221\'20\'1D to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cointelegraph.com/news/feds-inflation-efforts-likely-to-end-disastrously-says-pomp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally much higher than the current levels}}}\uc2 , with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rising the most.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4c594c85ddb5dc19cfe6d659014506ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 This week, Real Vision founder and CEO Raoul Pal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cointelegraph.com/news/raoul-pal-it-may-not-be-worth-owning-any-asset-other-than-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pointed out that Bitcoin was the only asset}}}\uc2  that has \u8220\'20\'1Coffset the growth of the G4 balance sheet.\u8221\'20\'1D Therefore, Pal believes that Bitcoin might be the only asset worth owning in the long term.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Pantera Capital founder Dan Morehead said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cointelegraph.com/news/panteras-founder-foresees-100k-bitcoin-on-the-horizon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has grown at the rate of 209% annually}}}\uc2  for the past nine years. If it maintains this growth rate, it could reach $100,000 in about two years.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 After the up move on Aug. 5, Bitcoin formed a doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 6, which showed hesitation among the bulls. The failure of the bulls to push the price above $12,113.50 has resulted in profit booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b53ed614460be7398977b57ef0433a3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will use the weakness to their advantage and attempt to sink the BTC/USD pair to the 20-day exponential moving average ($10,798). A strong bounce off this support will signal buying on dips and will increase the possibility of a break above $12,113.50.\par \par \uc2 However, a break below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) will indicate weakness and could drag the pair to the critical $10,400\u8211\'20\'13$10,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to defend this zone aggressively. A strong bounce off it could keep the pair range-bound between $10,400 and $12,113.50. The moving averages are sloping up, and the relative strength index (RSI) is close to the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The rebound off the $366 support hit a resistance at $407.295. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) had formed an inside day candlestick pattern on Aug. 6, which suggested indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7b7551bac14476ab9e6a70933e53f109.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This uncertainty has been resolved to the downside today, suggesting that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The first support on the downside is $366, and if it cracks, the correction can deepen to the 20-day EMA ($337).\par \par \uc2 If the ETH/USD pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will be a positive sign, and the bulls will again attempt to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the $415.634 resistance. Above this level, the next target to watch out for is $480.\par \par \uc2 However, if the 20-day EMA cracks, it will indicate that the bulls are not buying the dips. This could intensify selling and result in a drop to $300.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s intraday range has been shrinking since Aug. 2, which suggests a lack of clarity among the bulls and the bears about the next likely move. This has formed a pennant, which is known to act as a continuation pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9c0d43a2ccbd140ebe18b965ea56ecb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the XRP/USD pair breaks out and sustains above the pennant, the bulls will try to push the price to $0.326113 and then to $0.346727. A break above this resistance will be a huge positive and could result in a move to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI is still above 78 levels, which suggests that the pair has run up sharply in the short term; hence, it might catch its breath for a few days. The bulls might face stiff resistance in the $0.326113\u8211\'20\'13$0.346727 zone.\par \par \uc2 The pair will signal a deeper correction if the bears sink and sustain the price below the immediate support at $0.284584.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 After forming an inside day candlestick pattern for three successive days, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the immediate resistance at $304.79 on Aug. 6, which indicates that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b4abba402368f260864449dd80ed5642.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $353. If they succeed, a rally to $400 is possible. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($279) and the RSI in the positive territory suggests that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the BCH/USD pair turns down from the $337.90\u8211\'20\'13$353 resistance, a few more days of consolidation between $280 and $353 is likely. A break below $280 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) to the overhead resistance at $260.86, but the move lacks momentum, which shows a lack of urgency among traders to buy at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/22ad573f72ab25fb8138c7969f11c2a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This sentiment could keep the BSV/USD pair stuck inside the $200\u8211\'20\'13$260.86 range for a few days. The 20-day EMA ($213) is rising, and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests an advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the pair above $260.86, the uptrend is likely to start. The first target is $320, and then $382.47. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink and sustain the pair below $227. Such a move will signal a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is likely to remain range-bound between $51 and $65.1573 for a few days. The bulls have been gradually pushing the price higher for the past few days, but without a pick up in momentum, a breakout above $65.1573 is unlikely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f66d3868e29d47d385a7f182ccf0912d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair consolidates near the top of the range, it will indicate strength. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 A break above $65.1573 is likely to start the next leg of the uptrend, with the target objective at $80. Contrary to the assumption, if the pair turns down and breaks below $55, a drop to $51 is possible. A break below this support will be a huge negative.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has repeatedly consolidated (marked as ellipses on the chart) after every sharp rally in this leg of the up move that started in mid-March. Following the surge on July 26 and 27, the altcoin has again entered a range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a4e2ad5542d915036c211fc4571ccf80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The previous consolidation lasted for 15 days, while the current range is 11 days old. If history repeats itself, the bulls might attempt a breakout early next week.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above the $0.15\u8211\'20\'13$0.1543051 resistance, the uptrend is likely to resume with the next target objective at $0.173, and then $0.20.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair turns down from the current level and plummets below $0.13.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink's LINK corrected on Aug. 5, but the decline was shallow, and there was no follow up selling on Aug. 6. This attracted buyers because when the uptrend is strong, traders view every dip as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/02c8dc5ff09a991902b92fb394f94548.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the up move is again facing selling pressure today, which suggests profit-booking by traders. The RSI remains in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which points to a weakening momentum and warns of a possible correction.\par \par \uc2 A break below $8.908 could intensify selling, and if the bears can sink the LINK/USD pair below the 20-day EMA ($8.35), the decline could extend to the 50-day simple moving average ($6.6).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls again buy the dips, the pair is likely to rally to its target objective of $11.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance in the $22.93\u8211\'20\'13$24.4588 zone, which indicates profit-booking by some short-term traders. However, the bulls have not given up much ground, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/424023981691d9b05278faa70f2ee42e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the BNB/USD pair above $23.54, a move to $24.4588 is likely. Above this level, the next target to watch out for is $27.1905. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest an advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the bears sink the pair below $21.7628, a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($20.57) is possible. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, a decline to $18.20 might be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.157) on Aug. 5, which is a positive sign. However, Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) has not been able to pick up momentum following the rebound, which suggests some hesitation to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e157d2d73514519af30e12907de27ebb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers fail to propel the CRO/USD pair above $0.176596, a few days of range-bound action is possible. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the pair sustains below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above $0.176596 will signal resumption of the uptrend with a target objective of $0.20. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy80Y2MzOGVhMzg0N2M4YmZiNWVjNjI2ODNmMGQ0YTc1MS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200807eg87000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 8/5: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, LINK, CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,748 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 August 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin can reclaim the $12,200 level, several altcoins are likely to resume their uptrend\par \par \uc2 Square\u8217\'20\'19s Cash App product has generated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-trading-generated-875m-in-quarterly-revenue-for-square"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $875 million}}}\uc2  in revenue from Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) trading in the second quarter of this year. This is a 600% increase over the comparable quarter in the previous year. This shows increased trader interest, which could have been spurred by the cash heavy \u8220\'20\'1Cgovernment stimulus programs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The recent breakout of Bitcoin above the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone could spark further interest among traders. \uc2 Twitter{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-influencer-wants-the-winklevoss-twins-to-explain-bitcoin-to-him"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 personality}}}\uc2  Dave Portnoy has shown interest in knowing about Bitcoin trading from the Winklevoss twins.\par \par \uc2 If Portnoy can influence his followers, then several new traders are likely to enter the crypto space. However, how many of them will stick around for the long-term is difficult to assess.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b0d239e21dea300404287fe6a9b79389.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The derivatives markets give a good insight into the expectations of the larger traders. Although the sharp drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price on Aug. 2 led to liquidations in futures contracts worth over $1 billion, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-futures-data-shows-market-favors-bulls-despite-15k-flash-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 open interest}}}\uc2  quickly recovered within 48 hours, suggesting strong accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 While these are positive signs, Glassnode believes that a sharp {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stocks-crash-can-stop-113k-bitcoin-price-in-its-tracks-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reversal}}}\uc2  in the US stock markets could halt Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cbull run in its tracks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 After forming an inside day candlestick pattern on Aug. 3 and 4, Bitcoin is attempting to resume its up move today, which suggests that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1e389ee56272906e5f822a9d04117963.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index in the overbought zone suggest that the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the BTC/USD pair above $12,113.50, the uptrend is likely to resume. The next target objective to watch on the upside is $13,000 and then $14,000. The bears are likely to defend the $14,000 levels aggressively, hence, a meaningful correction is possible at those levels.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the pair turns down from the $12,113.50 resistance, it could enter a consolidation between $10,400\u8211\'20\'13$12,113.50 for a few days. A break below $10,400 will be a huge negative as it is likely to catch several bulls off guard, resulting in liquidations of long positions.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the $366 support and is attempting to gradually inch higher. If the bulls can propel the biggest altcoin above the $400\u8211\'20\'13$415.634 resistance zone, a rally to $480 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f334d23417788e7b1b3557bfdfe24d2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages suggest an advantage for the bulls, the deeply overbought reading on the RSI warrants caution.\par \par \uc2 The failure to break above the $415.634 level could attract profit booking by the short-term traders that could pull down the ETH/USD pair to $366 level. A break below this support will be the first sign that bears are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Below $366, the correction can extend to $346.857 and $325.612, which are 38.2% and 50% Fibonacci retracement levels of the most recent leg of the rally. A bounce from either support will be a positive sign as that will indicate buying interest at lower levels. However, if the bears sink the price below $304.367, a trend change is likely.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has formed successive inside day candlestick patterns on Aug. 3 and 4, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears. However, the bulls have kept the altcoin above the $0.284584 support since Aug. 2, indicating buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2766a0045ec57fc63a15091ce2a9e0f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought territory, which suggests that the bulls are in command. If the bulls can push the price above $0.32, it will increase the possibility of a retest of the overhead resistance at $0.346727.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the XRP/USD pair sinks below $0.284584, it will indicate that the momentum has weakened. The next support to watch on the downside is the 20-day exponential moving average ($0.249).\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds off this support, the bulls will again attempt to resume the uptrend. However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a deeper correction is likely.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the $280 support for the past two days, but the failure to rebound sharply from this level signals a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1b8cc29b6f00978320abb34017b645d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($272) is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. A break above the $305 level is likely to indicate that the up move has resumed. The next level to watch out for is $320 and then $353.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the BCH/USD pair below $280 and the 20-day EMA, it will signal advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating around the $227 level for the past two days, which suggests that both the bulls and the bears are trying to establish their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a60f1fbae34af77e17f708de27f60061.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($208.55) is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting an advantage to the bulls. They will now try to carry the price to the overhead resistance at $260.86.\par \par \uc2 If the momentum picks up and the buyers are able to scale the BSV/USD pair above this resistance, a rally to $300 and then to $320 is likely.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair turns down from $260.86, the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days. A break below the 20-day EMA will signal weakness.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in small ranges since the large outside day candlestick pattern on Aug. 2, which suggests a lack of clarity among the bulls and the bears about the next likely direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5034eb7c8356f4843c8f575e51ec5b18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price above $60, a retest of the $64\u8211\'20\'13$65.1573 resistance zone is possible. A breakout of this zone will signal resumption of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $75 and then $80.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($53) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the LTC/USD pair breaks below $55, a drop to the critical support at $51 is possible. A break below this level will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating between $0.13\u8211\'20\'13$0.15 levels. Both moving averages are sloping up, which suggests that the trend is up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/90c0b743c79f682345e699210b8e634a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair above the $0.15\u8211\'20\'13$0.1543051 resistance zone, it will indicate that the bulls have absorbed the selling and have reasserted their dominance. The next target is $0.173 and then $0.20.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair turns down from the overhead resistance zone, the range-bound action might extend for a few more days. A breakdown and close (UTC time) below $0.13 will signal weakness and can result in a deeper correction to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend and the momentum has picked up in the past few days. The bulls have pushed the price above the $22.93 resistance, which indicates demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4c394e2e77f7c80c06815a35cdafad3f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next level to watch out for is $24.4588 and if this resistance is also scaled, the rally can extend to $27.1905. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which shows that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the BNB/USD pair turns down from the $22.93\u8211\'20\'13$24.4588 zone, it will suggest selling at higher levels. A break below the 20-day EMA ($20) could result in a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) surged on Aug. 3 and broke above the $8.908 resistance, which is a positive sign as it shows strong demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d3d52e29fd42698cf15b03aa4f8362f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the next target objective is at $11, the bears are currently attempting to stall the up move at $10. The moving averages are sloping up, indicating an advantage to the bulls. If the bulls buy the dip to $$8.908, that will increase the possibility of a resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which warrants caution. If the bears sink the price below $8.908, a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($7.96) is possible.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) formed an outside day candlestick pattern on Aug. 2, which sometimes signals a reversal. That was followed by an inside day candlestick pattern on Aug. 3, which indicated that the bulls and the bears were indecisive about the next move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7cbc2e94deb6c3e4ce0bf5afe7cdec31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears sold aggressively on Aug. 4 and dragged the CRO/USD pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.155). The pair has not sustained below this support for more than a day since March 29, hence, the bulls are likely to defend it aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA aggressively, it will indicate that the bulls continue to buy the dips to this support. A break above $0.176596 will resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.139) is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81YWM3OTgwMzgyMzVlYjcyZWZkMzUwMGZkODYyNWZhZC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200805eg85000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 8/3: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , CRO, BNB, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,813 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 August 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The strong recovery in Bitcoin and altcoins from their weekend lows suggests that the traders are aggressively buying each dip\par \par \uc2 On Aug. 2, the total crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/charts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market capitalization}}}\uc2  dropped from about $359 billion to $310 billion within a few minutes of Bitcoin's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price surging above the $12,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 A fall of such magnitude usually drives away the bulls, or at least keeps them at bay, until the market stabilizes \u8212\'20\'14 but that is not what happened.\par \par \uc2 The bulls aggressively purchased the dips, which led to a sharp recovery, suggesting that the sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders expect the rally to continue in the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b1bd1d3a206e6c28e7f8e205bb8aad16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-gold-will-hit-2-300-by-2022-what-about-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  on gold and forecasts a target of $2,300 per troy ounce before the end of 2022. The main reason for the continued rally in gold according to the analysts at \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  is the \u8220\'20\'1Crecord level of debt accumulation\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Creal concerns around the longevity of the US dollar as a reserve currency.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  only talked about gold, the same logic could be applied to Bitcoin. Even if Bitcoin only manages to retest its all-time high before 2022, it still would have outperformed gold by a huge margin.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin corrected from just below the $12,304.37 level on Aug. 2, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-31-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-ada-cro-bnb-eos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 as suggested in the previous analysis}}}\uc2 . It dipped to an intraday low of $10,525, which completed a retest of the breakout level from the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/63c2df5c7f7b75cf44a5ce5d0c9871b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers purchased the dip on Aug. 2, which is a huge positive, as it suggests that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If the sentiment was weak, traders would not have stepped in to buy at $10,500.\par \par \uc2 Due to the fall on Aug. 2, the relative strength index corrected from its overbought levels, suggesting that the weaker hands have been shaken out.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will once again attempt to carry the BTC/USD pair above the resistance at $12,113.50. If they succeed, the uptrend is likely to resume with the next target at $13,000 and then $14,000.\par \par \uc2 This assumption will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the $10,400 support.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The strong rally in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pushed the relative strength index (RSI) to 88 levels, which had previously resulted in a correction. This time also, the biggest altcoin plunged on Aug. 2, but the correction was short lived.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ff9dda86b1a55ce2571f12cee68a4069.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the ETH/USD pair dipped to a low of $328.507 on Aug. 2, the bulls aggressively purchased at lower levels that resulted in a close (UTC time) at $372.629. This shows that even after the sharp rally of the past few days, the bulls expect the uptrend to extend further to $480.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below $366. Such a move will increase the possibility of a pullback to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($311). A break below this support could signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  formed a doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 2, which indicates indecision among the bulls and the bears. In a hugely volatile trading day, the altcoin hit an intraday high of $0.326113 and an intraday low of $0.25041.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/53187244e825f78d26ef3f923a705620.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to resume the up move, which is a huge positive. This shows that the bulls are unperturbed about the volatile trading day yesterday and are buying aggressively.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI has risen deep into the overbought territory, which increases the possibility of a minor correction or a pullback from the overhead resistance of $0.346727. Therefore, chasing prices higher from the current levels might be risky. A break below $0.284584 will indicate weakness and could result in a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the momentum can push the price above $0.346727, the uptrend can extend to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), which was rising toward the target objective of $360, turned down from $337.90 and plummeted to an intraday low of $245 on Aug. 2. However, the only positive thing was that the price recovered from the intraday lows and the altcoin closed (UTC time) at $283.78.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/30df2020affa9833049714d2e2044bc6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the BCH/USD pair took support at $280.47, and the bulls are now attempting to push the price back toward $353. The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($267) and the RSI in the positive territory suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the pair again turns down from the higher levels and breaks below $280.47, it will be a huge negative. Such a move will indicate a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bsv-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from just below the overhead resistance of $260.86 on Aug. 2, which suggests profit booking by the short-term traders. This pulled the altcoin back below the critical $227 support, which is a negative sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/271f0459f146c7ef6a1ee31422f24394.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to stage a strong recovery and push the price back above $227 on Aug. 2 suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls have driven the price back above $227. If they can sustain the higher levels, the BSV/USD pair can move up to $260.86. A breakout of this level can result in a rally to $300.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $227, the pair is likely to remain range-bound between $200 and $227.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from just above the overhead resistance of $64 on Aug. 2, which suggests profit-booking by short-term traders. This pulled down the altcoin to $51.885, which is close to the critical $51 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/99a56848e8d69926bb8e431554675b50.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip aggressively, which helped the LTC/USD pair recover the intraday losses and close (UTC time) at $56.7891. Both moving averages have started to turn up, and the RSI is trading in the positive territory, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently attempting to carry the price back toward $64 levels. A breakout and close (UTC time) above $65.1573 will resume the uptrend with the next target at $80. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $51.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the $0.13\u8211\'20\'13$0.15 range on Aug. 2 and also the 20-day EMA ($0.132), but the positive thing is that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to $0.1201664.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/122ca024a0b9364560af671df930be8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 By close (UTC time), the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair had risen back above the 20-day EMA. Currently, the bulls are attempting to push the price above the $0.15\u8211\'20\'13$0.1543051 resistance zone. If they succeed, the next target to watch out for is $0.173.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to push the price above the resistance zone, the pair might remain range-bound for a few more days. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the pair sinks below the $0.13\u8211\'20\'13$0.12 support.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong uptrend. The dip on Aug. 2 did not even reach the 20-day EMA ($0.155), which suggests that the majority of the bulls are in no hurry to book profits, as they expect the rally to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c8e34f5a9f55e9ba43d0e4df095c0d1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend. If they can push the price above the $0.176596 resistance, the next target to watch out for is $0.20. Both moving averages are rising, and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which indicates that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the CRO/USD pair turns down and plummets below the $0.15306 support, it would signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The short-term traders booked profits on Aug. 2 as Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) failed to sustain above the overhead resistance at $21.7628. This dragged the altcoin to the 20-day EMA ($19.54).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/30c7024b2102a8f9243466db73302df8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased this dip aggressively, which helped the BNB/USD pair recover sharply from the intraday low of $19.10 to close (UTC time) the day at $20.9898. Today, the bulls have pushed the price above $21.7628.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up, and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. The first target on the upside is $22.93, and above that $24.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels or from one of the overhead resistance levels and drops below $19.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 The correction in Chainlink's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  token that started from $8.908 on July 15 repeatedly found buying support closer to the $6.8221 level, which is the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of the most recent leg of the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b44f0acdab1792063c7b947fc451ea09.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Even on Aug. 2, the LINK/USD pair dropped to an intraday low of $6.87, but strong buying at lower levels resulted in a sharp recovery. By close (UTC time), the pair had risen to $8.2814, which shows that the bulls continue to buy the dips as they expect the uptrend to continue.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the price above $8.908, the next target to watch out for is $11. The uptrending moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. This positive view will be negated if the bears sink and sustain the price below $6.50.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81MTQwODRmZTBhODBlMTFiMmRiMWNkYmM3NGMyYjkzYS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200804eg830008k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 8/3: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , CRO, BNB, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,801 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 August 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The strong recovery in Bitcoin and altcoins from their weekend lows suggests that the traders are aggressively buying each dip\par \par \uc2 August 2 the total crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/charts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market capitalization}}}\uc2  dropped from about $359 billion to $310 billion within a few minutes of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price surging above the $12K mark.\par \par \uc2 A fall of such magnitude usually drives away the bulls or at least keeps them at bay until the market stabilizes, but that is not what happened.\par \par \uc2 The bulls aggressively purchased the dips, which led to a sharp recovery, suggesting that the sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders expect the rally to continue in the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b1bd1d3a206e6c28e7f8e205bb8aad16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-gold-will-hit-2-300-by-2022-what-about-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  on gold and forecasts a target of $2,300 per troy ounce before the end of 2022. The main reason for the continued rally in gold according to the analysts at Goldman is the \u8220\'20\'1Crecord level of debt accumulation\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Creal concerns around the longevity of the US dollar as a reserve currency.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  only talked about gold, both the same logic could be applied to Bitcoin. Even if Bitcoin only manages to retest its all-time high before 2022, it still would have outperformed gold by a huge margin.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin corrected from just below the $12,304.37 level on Aug. 2, as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-31-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-ada-cro-bnb-eos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis. It dipped to an intraday low of $10,525, which completed a retest of the breakout level from the inverse head and shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/63c2df5c7f7b75cf44a5ce5d0c9871b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers purchased the dip on Aug. 2, which is a huge positive as it suggests that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If the sentiment was weak, traders would not have stepped in to buy at $10,500.\par \par \uc2 Due to the fall on Aug. 2, the relative strength index corrected from its overbought levels, suggesting that the weaker hands have been shaken out.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will once again attempt to carry the BTC/USD pair above the resistance at $12,113.50. If they succeed, the uptrend is likely to resume with the next target at $13,000 and then $14,000.\par \par \uc2 This assumption will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the $10,400 support.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The strong rally in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pushed the RSI to 88 levels, which had previously resulted in a correction. This time also, the biggest altcoin plunged on Aug. 2, but the correction was short-lived.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ff9dda86b1a55ce2571f12cee68a4069.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the ETH/USD pair dipped to a low of $328.507 on Aug. 2, the bulls aggressively purchased at lower levels that resulted in a close (UTC time) at $372.629. This shows that even after the sharp rally of the past few days, the bulls expect the uptrend to extend further to $480.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below $366. Such a move will increase the possibility of a pullback to the 20-day EMA ($311). A break below this support could signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  formed a doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 2, which indicates indecision among the bulls and the bears. In a hugely volatile trading day, the altcoin hit an intraday high of $0.326113 and an intraday low of $0.25041.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/53187244e825f78d26ef3f923a705620.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to resume the up move, which is a huge positive. This shows that the bulls are unperturbed about the volatile trading day yesterday and are buying aggressively.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI has risen deep into the overbought territory, which increases the possibility of a minor correction or a pullback from the overhead resistance of $0.346727. Therefore, chasing prices higher from the current levels might be risky. A break below $0.284584 will indicate weakness and could result in a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the momentum can push the price above $0.346727, the uptrend can extend to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), which was rising towards the target objective of $360, turned down from $337.90 and plummeted to an intraday low of $245 on Aug. 2. However, the only positive thing was that the price recovered from the intraday lows and the altcoin closed (UTC time) at $283.78.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/30df2020affa9833049714d2e2044bc6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the BCH/USD pair took support at $280.47 and the bulls are now attempting to push the price back towards $353. The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($267) and the RSI in the positive territory suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the pair again turns down from the higher levels and breaks below $280.47, it will be a huge negative. Such a move will indicate a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from just below the overhead resistance of $260.86 on Aug. 2, which suggests profit booking by the short-term traders. This pulled the altcoin back below the critical $227 support, which is a negative sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/271f0459f146c7ef6a1ee31422f24394.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to stage a strong recovery and push the price back above $227 on Aug. 2 suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls have driven the price back above $227. If they can sustain the higher levels, the BSV/USD pair can move up to $260.86. A breakout of this level can result in a rally to $300.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $227, the pair is likely to remain range-bound between $200\u8211\'20\'13$227.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from just above the overhead resistance of $64 on Aug. 2, which suggests profit-booking by short-term traders. This pulled down the altcoin to $51.885, which is close to the critical $51 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/99a56848e8d69926bb8e431554675b50.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip aggressively that helped the LTC/USD pair recover the intraday losses and close (UTC time) at $56.7891. Both moving averages have started to turn up and the RSI is trading in the positive territory, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently attempting to carry the price back towards $64 levels. A breakout and close (UTC time) above $65.1573 will resume the uptrend with the next target at $80. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $51.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the $0.13\u8211\'20\'13$0.15 range on Aug. 2 and also the 20-day EMA ($0.132), but the positive thing is that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to $0.1201664.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/122ca024a0b9364560af671df930be8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 By close (UTC time), the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair had risen back above the 20-day EMA. Currently, the bulls are attempting to push the price above the $0.15\u8211\'20\'13$0.1543051 resistance zone. If they succeed, the next target to watch out for is $0.173.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to push the price above the resistance zone, the pair might remain range-bound for a few more days. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the pair sinks below the $0.13\u8211\'20\'13$0.12 support.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong uptrend. The dip on Aug. 2 did not even reach the 20-day EMA ($0.155), which suggests that the majority of the bulls are in no hurry to book profits as they expect the rally to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c8e34f5a9f55e9ba43d0e4df095c0d1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to resume the uptrend. If they can push the price above the $0.176596 resistance, the next target to watch out for is $0.20. Both moving averages are rising and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which indicates that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the CRO/USD pair turns down and plummets below the $0.15306 support, it would signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The short-term traders booked profits on Aug. 2 as Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) failed to sustain above the overhead resistance at $21.7628. This dragged the altcoin to the 20-day EMA ($19.54).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/30c7024b2102a8f9243466db73302df8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased this dip aggressively, which helped the BNB/USD pair recover sharply from the intraday low of $19.10 to close (UTC time) the day at $20.9898. Today, the bulls have pushed the price above $21.7628.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. The first target on the upside is $22.93 and above that $24.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels or from one of the overhead resistance levels and drops below $19.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 The correction in Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) that started from $8.908 on July 15, repeatedly found buying support closer to the $6.8221 level, which is the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of the most recent leg of the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b44f0acdab1792063c7b947fc451ea09.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Even on Aug. 2, the LINK/USD pair dropped to an intraday low of $6.87 but strong buying at lower levels resulted in a sharp recovery. By close (UTC time), the pair had risen to $8.2814, which shows that the bulls continue to buy the dips as they expect the uptrend to continue.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the price above $8.908, the next target to watch out for is $11. The uptrending moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. This positive view will be negated if the bears sink and sustain the price below $6.50.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81MTQwODRmZTBhODBlMTFiMmRiMWNkYmM3NGMyYjkzYS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200803eg83000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ,CRO, BNB, EOS\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,786 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin finally broke through the $11.2K resistance and Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s continued strength is likely to pull several altcoin prices higher\par \par \uc2 Economists are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-printed-more-money-in-one-month-than-in-two-centuries"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 divided}}}\uc2  on the consequences of record low interest rates across the globe and the incessant money printing by the central banks. However, one thing that most experts agree upon is that investors should get out of paper money and invest in hard assets.\par \par \uc2 Gold has been the traditional safe haven asset which is preferred by institutional investors looking to hedge their portfolio or protect their purchasing power.\par \par \uc2 However, in this digital age, crypto enthusiasts believe that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is a better bet than gold. Fidelity Digital Assets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-calls-bitcoin-an-aspirational-store-of-value-and-an-insurance-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believes}}}\uc2  that the \u8220\'20\'1Cdecentralized settlement network and its digitally scarce native asset\u8221\'20\'1D makes Bitcoin a potential store of value.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/395dc4ba1f645c4ac89c680487118f4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto naysayers are quick to point out that the majority still do not consider Bitcoin as a safe haven asset. While this is true, an increasing amount of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/maturity-of-the-crypto-derivatives-market-attracting-more-institutional-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional money}}}\uc2  has been gradually flowing into the crypto space lately.\par \par \uc2 If retail traders wait until all the institutions step in, then it might be too late. Therefore, retail traders should realize the potential of the asset class and benefit from the early-bird advantage they hold over institutional traders.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) had been trading close to the $11,000 level for the past three days, which is a positive sign. This suggests that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits and are not allowing the bears to have their way.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/370d976a483056030ca376a8afdf524f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair has formed a small ascending triangle pattern and if the bulls can sustain the price above $11,377.55, the uptrend is likely to resume. There is a minor resistance at $12,304.37, which might again lead to a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 However, as long as the price stays above the upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($10,077), the advantage remains with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the pair turns down and breaks below the triangle, it could retest the $10,500 level once again. A break below this level will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 In a strong uptrend, the corrections usually do not last for more than three to five days. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) corrected on July 28 and followed that up with an inside day candlestick pattern on July 29, which showed indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ee2fd5b9e76453cf0dfc801c89a5892b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, with the sharp up move and breakout above $332.931 on July 30, the bulls have asserted their supremacy.\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USD pair has an immediate target objective of $366, which might act as a stiff resistance because the relative strength index is deep in the overbought territory, but if this level is scaled, the next leg of the up move can reach $480.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, $305 is likely to act as a strong support. A break below this level will be the first indication that the bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  reached the pattern target of the breakout from the inverse head and shoulders setup on July 29 when it reached the $0.25 level. After an inside day candlestick formation on July 30, the bulls have resumed the up move today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fa6f877ab34b4a0aa043a792c9403b30.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $0.25, the XRP/USD pair is likely to start its journey towards the next target at $0.284584. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.216) suggests that the trend has turned in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 During a change in trend from down to up or range-bound to up, the RSI can stay in the overbought zone for a long time, hence, this should not be a reason alone to become \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, traders should remain cautious.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the uptrend has lost momentum.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has not picked up momentum after breaking out of the $280.47 level, which shows some hesitation among the bulls. However, the positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip back below the $280.47 level, which will now act as a strong support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e3e2f4e2e7037b31dd4dc5697f7e1808.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the $280.47\u8211\'20\'13$300.38 resistance zone. If they can sustain the BCH/USD pair above this zone, the up move is likely to pick up momentum and rally to $360 and then $400.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI is close to the 80 level, which has resulted in a pullback during the previous two occasions, hence, the pair might enter a correction or consolidation near $360.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the pair back below $280.47 and sustain the lower levels for three days. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the $227 resistance, which is a huge positive. If the altcoin closes (UTC time) above $227, a new uptrend is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/080afe4fd44a489f94bcbee29b5d5262.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($195) has turned up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand. The target objective of this up move is $308 but the bears might pose a stiff challenge at $260, which could result in a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the BSV/USD pair fails to sustain above $227 and plummets back below $200. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) made an inside day candlestick pattern on July 29, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty was cleared on July 30 when the altcoin formed an outside day candlestick pattern and the bulls asserted their supremacy with a positive close.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1e7fa65406cf35f5760ff8242887f5ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first level that might offer stiff resistance to the bulls is $64 but if the bulls do not allow the price to dip below $56, then it will indicate strength and increase the possibility of a breakout of the overhead resistance. If that happens, the LTC/USD pair could rally to $80.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels and plummets below $51.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are facing stiff resistance close to the $0.15 level and are struggling to keep Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the $0.1380977 support, which suggests profit-booking by short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5445e4f10260cf33f6ad5c1db1dbe0f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.13) support, it could attract further selling by the bulls that can result in a fall to the next support at $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Such a move will indicate that the uptrend has ended in the short-term and could result in a consolidation for a few days. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI is a negative sign as it suggests that the momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are buying the dips. They will then try to push the price above the $0.15\u8211\'20\'13$0.1543051 resistance zone. If they succeed, the uptrend is likely to resume with the next target being $0.173.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a strong uptrend for the past few days, which suggests that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits yet, as they expect higher levels in the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c8c47f93a3e020753ca69d9c7c6c39ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above $0.169481 will resume the uptrend with the next target being $0.20. Although there is a minor resistance at $0.174114, it is likely to be crossed. Both moving averages are trending up and the RSI remains in the overbought zone, suggesting advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the CRO/USD pair turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.15). Such a move will indicate profit booking by the bears and could result in a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average at ($0.133).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it lacks momentum, which suggests that the higher levels are not attracting aggressive buying from the bulls. Unless the altcoin picks up momentum, it could face stiff resistance at $21.7628.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/18f4eff8b372f3c5b8ecb873ad56a723.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Any pullback is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA ($18.80), which is rising up. If the BNB/USD pair rebounds off this support, the bulls will try to carry the price above $21.7628. If they succeed, the rally could extend to $24.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will be a negative sign as it will indicate that the bulls are not buying the dips. In such a case, a drop to the breakout level of $18.20 is possible.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are defending the critical overhead resistance of $3.1104 but they have not been able to sink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  to the immediate support at $2.83, which is a positive sign. A consolidation close to the resistance usually resolves to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d465778838d5123b019a7ce0661f913c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above $3.2 is likely to attract buyers who have been waiting for a trending move to start. Above this level, the first target to watch out for is $3.8811 and then $4.40.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the EOS/USD pair turns down from the current levels and plummets below $2.83, then the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8zYzA0NTE1ZDUxMDhjMTlhN2RlNDIxNDYwMjcxYjY4Ni5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200731eg7v000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/29: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, CRO, BNB, EOS\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,833 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most altcoins could consolidate for a couple of days before resuming their uptrend\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) trading volumes in spot and derivatives markets have been surging since the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  rallied above the $10,000 level earlier this week. Bakkt reported {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bakkt-bitcoin-futures-smashes-records-two-days-running"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 record}}}\uc2  Bitcoin futures volume on July 28 and 29, which indicates that the traders who had been waiting for a trending move to start have established fresh positions.\par \par \uc2 A similar volume increase was seen in the Chicago Mercantile Exchange (CME) and the other crypto exchanges that offer futures trading.\par \par \uc2 A breakout that is followed by an increase in activity and higher open interest is usually a positive sign as it shows that the traders expect higher prices in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 However, traders should be careful and keep a close watch on the price action because if the rally fizzles out Bitcoin might trap a number of bulls, leading to long liquidation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/83ed3ef01729cedc2fea3aa12adc56c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Nigel Green, the CEO and founder of financial consultancy firm deVere Group, believes that Bitcoin could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/12b-advisory-group-ceo-btc-is-safe-haven-asset-amid-political-tension"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 replace}}}\uc2  gold as the ultimate safe haven asset as \u8220\'20\'1Cthe world becomes more tech-driven.\u8221\'20\'1D The escalating tension between the US and China could act as one of the triggers for investors to shift from traditional markets to \u8220\'20\'1Cdecentralized, non-sovereign, secure digital currencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) surged above the critical overhead resistance zone of $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 on July 27 and hit an intraday high of $11,377.55, which shows aggressive buying by the bulls and short covering by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7ad4041c9a0026a43785dd80d2de04c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair witnessed profit booking on July 28, which dragged the price to $10,569 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels and by close (UTC time) the price had recovered to $10,910.32. This suggests strong demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $11,377.55, the uptrend is likely to resume. There is a minor resistance close to $11,870.50 but if this level is crossed, the uptrend can extend to $14,000.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($9,840) has turned up and the relative strength index is in the overbought zone, which suggests that the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns around from the current levels and plummets back below the $10,500\u8211\'20\'13$10,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $332.931 on July 27 as short-term traders decided to book profits following the blistering rally of the past few days. However, the correction could not even reach the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of the latest leg of the rally, which suggests strong demand on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d729b0f0381f6edf0d3739561dcb801c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now attempt to resume the uptrend by pushing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $332.931. If they succeed, the uptrend can reach $366 and if this level is also scaled, the next target is $480.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the ETH/USD pair again turns down from close to $332.931 resistance, it can decline to $288.599\u8211\'20\'13$284.261 support zone. The bulls are likely to defend this zone aggressively. If the price sustains above this zone, the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend is high.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rebounded off the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern on July 27, which is a positive sign as it suggests that the bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ea6043be78623c6116fe09aec6cfeec7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $0.25. This level is likely to attract aggressive selling by the bears as they try to stall the up move. This may result in a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground, then it will increase the possibility of a breakout above $0.25 and rally to the next target objective of $0.284. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the XRP/USD pair back below the neckline of the setup.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above $280.47 on July 28 after spending about four months in a consolidation. This is a positive sign as this suggests that the bulls have finally overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8a54473de61a0b33ac4b9191b18d60d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $280.47 for three days, it will confirm the breakout and could result in the start of a new uptrend, with the first target objective at $360 and then $400.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap back below $280.47. If that happens, it will suggest that the current breakout was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has reached the resistance of the $146.20\u8211\'20\'13$227 range for the first time since April 30. The bears are likely to defend the $227 level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/204bebe5b17a8ff8eae7a8d68836f5e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels and slides below $200, it will suggest a lack of buyers at higher levels. Such a move could extend the range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($189) has started to slope up and the RSI has risen into the overbought zone, which suggests that the bulls are attempting to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above $227 will indicate the possible start of a new uptrend that has a target objective of $308.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $0.13\u8211\'20\'13$0.15 range for the past three days, which shows that the bears are trying to stall the uptrend while the bulls are attempting to absorb all the selling and extend the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a06a292a8703edb02d23bb4c31c0f804.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While the upsloping moving averages suggest an advantage to the bulls, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI points to weakening momentum.\par \par \uc2 A breakdown and close (UTC time) below the 20-day EMA ($0.128) will be the first sign that the bulls are losing their grip. Below this level, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can drop to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can propel the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair above the $0.15\u8211\'20\'13$0.1543051 resistance, the uptrend is likely to resume with the next target at $0.173.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) soared above $51 on July 27, which indicates a change in trend from consolidation to an uptrend. The first target objective of this new uptrend is $64.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/30412c91bb5dd81124a8434e8ed172e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the sharp move of the past few days has pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory, which suggests that a minor correction or consolidation is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the critical support to watch out for is $51. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off this level, it will confirm that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the buyers are accumulating on dips.\par \par \uc2 A successful retest of a breakout level offers an opportunity for traders to initiate long positions if they missed buying the breakout.\par \par \uc2 It is better to wait for the price to rebound before considering a purchase because sometimes the breakout turns out to be false and the price traps the aggressive bulls.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) surged on July 27 to a high of $0.169481, which was close to the target objective of $0.174114. This attracted profit booking on July 28 but the positive thing is that the altcoin did not break below the $0.15306 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/dc4a693955d3b6de894ad86ae62ad449.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Generally, in strong uptrends, the corrections do not last for more than three to five days. Currently, the bulls are attempting to resume the uptrend, which is likely to pick up momentum above $0.169481.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can scale the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.174114, a rally to $0.20 is possible. The trend remains strong with the moving averages rising up and the RSI in the overbought zone.\par \par \uc2 A break below $0.15306 will be the first sign of weakness and a decline below the 20-day EMA ($0.148) will indicate a possible short-term top.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply from the breakout level of $18.20 on July 27, suggesting that the bulls aggressively bought this dip. The 20-day EMA ($18.48) has started to slope up and the RSI is close to the overbought zone, which indicates advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a894a2d32addc265cacc811e74c51ff5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first target on the upside is a rally to $22.93, which is the pattern target of the breakout from the ascending triangle. If this level is crossed, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tenth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap can rally to $24.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the BNB/USD pair below the critical support at $18.20.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  broke above the $2.83 resistance on July 27 and has reached the $3.1104 resistance for the first time since April 30. This suggests that the bulls are attempting to make a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/319219f73f7a8e41ae43754ea01c7322.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has risen into the overbought zone and the 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually, suggesting a mild advantage to the bulls. A close (UTC time) above $3.1104 will signal the possible start of a new up move that can rally to $3.8811.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from $3.1104, it could drop to $2.83 and consolidate between these levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Also, don\u8217\'20\'19t miss our upcoming conference {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/vYeKVcxc4DU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Crypto Traders Live}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 More than 30 star speakers including Raoul Pal, John Bollinger, Mike Novogratz, DataDash and Jon Najarian will gather on July 30th to discuss the challenges of crypto trading. Join the show for over 9 hours of crypto trading content!\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82ZTU3NDFlN2M0MGQyYTBiMThiMTQ3OWQwZTdkZDUxMi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200729eg7t000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Regulation\par \b \uc2 Open the Floodgates: US Customers to See More Crypto Accessibility\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rachel Wolfson \par \uc2 1,189 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Digital payment platforms add more cryptocurrency features for U.S. customers, but will big banks take the lead?\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market has come a long way in a seemingly short amount of time. Digital payment platforms have particularly taken note of the crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s impressive growth, which is evident, as many have adopted new features and support for more cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 United States-based customers in particular seem to be reaping the benefits of recent implementations being made by digital payment providers. It\u8217\'20\'19s especially notable that these new features are coming at a time when the \uc2 Office of the Comptroller of the Currency{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-banking-regulator-green-lights-crypto-custody-at-federally-chartered-banks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has granted permission for federally chartered banks to custody cryptocurrency}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mati Greenspan, a crypto market analyst and the founder of Quantum Economics, told Cointelegraph that the advantages of cryptocurrencies and other digital assets are now quickly becoming apparent to all:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt did take a while, but governments and large corporations are finally realizing the power of programmable money and the necessity for digital scarcity. The internet of value is now under construction and they don\u8217\'20\'19t want to be left behind.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A race to drive adoption\par \par \uc2 Just as the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  has started taking note of cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s intrinsic value, digital payments platforms seem to be adding support for more cryptocurrencies for their American customers. For example, Uphold just added support for Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Zilliqa (ZIL), LINK, Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 JP Thieriot, the CEO of Uphold, told Cointelegraph that these five cryptocurrencies fall into Uphold\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1CTier 4\u8221\'20\'1D category, which includes up-and-coming digital assets that are quickly gaining adoption. \u8220\'20\'1CAlthough these were all launched on Uphold last year, they have been unavailable in the U.S. until today,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. Interestingly enough, Uphold {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://uphold.com/en/blog/buy-ada-link-eos-zil-and-atom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  support for the five new cryptocurrencies shortly after the company\u8217\'20\'19s competitor, \uc2 Revolut\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/revoluts-crypto-trading-app-expands-to-49-states-following-significant-delays"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expanded its cryptocurrency trading services to 49 states}}}\uc2  in the United States.\par \par \uc2 While the neobank\u8217\'20\'19s service has been available to its European clients for many years now, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/revolut-app-to-add-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 as the company first added support for}}}\uc2  Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  in 2017, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  finally launched in the U.S. this March. Initially, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  went live without crypto support, but the platform now allows U.S. users to buy, sell and trade Bitcoin and Ether within its app through its partnership with Paxos. Edward Cooper, the head of crypto at \uc2 Revolut\uc2 , told Cointelegraph that the company also plans to extend support for additional cryptocurrencies to its U.S. customers:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur job will be to support the tokens we support in Europe including \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  and Bitcoin Cash. Stellar Lumens has also been a popular request from our users. So, we\u8217\'20\'19re looking into that. There are about 14 other tokens that have passed our internal due diligence tests that we\u8217\'20\'19re currently looking into adding as well.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 More than just speculation for retail investors\par \par \uc2 Cooper further noted that \uc2 Revolut\uc2  has about 60,000 U.S.-based customers and that the company is aware of additional features being requested from these individuals. For instance, the ability to offload crypto from the platform has been a feature that \uc2 Revolut\uc2  users have been anxiously awaiting. While Cooper previously told Cointelegraph that limiting users to trade only within \uc2 Revolut\uc2  is a unique advantage over incumbents like \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , he noted that the company has been working with partners and regulators on ways to enhance the product to meet certain requests.\par \par \uc2 Unlike \uc2 Revolut\uc2  and the popular stock and trading platform Robinhood, Uphold claims to be the only digital money platform that allows for the easy withdrawal of cryptocurrencies. According to Michelle O\u8217\'20\'19Connor, the vice president of marketing at Uphold, the platform has implemented full connectivity to support onboarding and offboarding across seven blockchain networks.\par \par \uc2 Thieriot believes that Uphold offers more crypto-friendly features to its U.S. customers compared to other digital payment platforms, saying that users \u8220\'20\'1Caren\u8217\'20\'19t buying the crypto but rather buying participation in a unit of account for that crypto. This means users can\u8217\'20\'19t deposit, withdraw or move the crypto anywhere. Rather, they can just speculate in it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Yet as the cryptocurrency market continues to mature, Thieriot pointed out that full-integration platforms that allow users to deposit, withdraw, send and ultimately do more with their crypto will become more important than ever before.\par \par \uc2 Greenspan stated that the U.S. customers have been mainly buying cryptocurrencies for speculative purposes. However, he pointed out that as with most markets, capital allocation is important. \u8220\'20\'1CMoney flows tend to determine the future of innovation and vise versa, and it\u8217\'20\'19s quite clear at this point which direction the world is headed,\u8221\'20\'1D he remarked.\par \par \uc2 Digital payment platforms act more like banks\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s also interesting that digital payment platforms {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-companies-adopt-features-similar-to-banks-only-better-to-drive-growth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continue to adopt features similar to traditional banks}}}\uc2 , both for U.S. and global customers. For example, cryptocurrency investment app Abra just announced the launch of a savings account, providing its global users with the opportunity to earn up to 9% interest per annum of digital assets and USD-backed stablecoins. Abra CEO Bill Barhydt told Cointelegraph that this has been one of the most requested features from users:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMany investors use Abra for trading, but there are users outside of the U.S. that use the app for dollar deposits. Abra has now become a bank account. Earning interest not only protects users dealing with local currencies in markets where currencies are being devalued but now these individuals can earn interest at rates much higher than any bank can offer.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Moreover, Barhydt emphasized that users will be able to earn 9% interest on USD-backed stablecoins, noting that the market currently seems to be supporting that rate. \u8220\'20\'1CIt starts to set the stage for cryptocurrencies to look more like bank account replacements, as opposed to crypto just for the sake of crypto,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 Will traditional banks eventually replace digital payment platforms?\par \par \uc2 Although a number of new features are being implemented by digital payment platforms to make crypto more accessible to users \u8212\'20\'14 particularly those based in the U.S. \u8212\'20\'14 some may wonder if traditional banks will eventually replace these platforms. Especially now that the OCC is exhibiting interest in cryptocurrencies, digital payment platforms may be racing to ensure that big banks don\u8217\'20\'19t take the lead.\par \par \uc2 Fortunately, at least for now, this doesn\u8217\'20\'19t seem to be the case. In fact, this may open doors for digital payment platforms to collaborate with major banks in the future, according to Thieriot, who added that it is great for adoption: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m not too worried about being out-innovated by the banks. Probably creates space for greater collaboration between companies like Uphold and the more forward-thinking banks we work with.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Barhydt further explained in an Abra {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.abra.com/blog/altcoins-ethereum_2_0-stablecoins-fed-allows-banks-crypto/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blog post}}}\uc2  that the implications of the OCC\u8217\'20\'19s actions are far-reaching, writing: \u8220\'20\'1CAbra could in theory become a nationally chartered bank in the US. It also means that existing national banks could eventually compete with Abra. Welcome to the party banks!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jODc2ZTFkMmRjNmEzYTQxMGU4NTA3MzNjMGE1NTBmOS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200728eg7s0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/27: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, CRO, BNB, EOS\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,819 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has made a decisive move above $10,500, which is likely to boost sentiment and pull several altcoins higher\par \par \uc2 Gold made a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/07/27/gold-prices-touch-record-high-amid-coronavirus-worries-us-china-tensions.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lifetime high}}}\uc2  today, eclipsing the previous high made in 2011. This is possibly the result of investors buying the asset as a way to hedge against the possible debasing of fiat currencies due to the huge stimulus packages announced by various central banks around the world.\par \par \uc2 To date, gold has rallied just over 26% under very favorable circumstances, while Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is up about 50% even when it has been out of favor among investors. This shows that the relatively new asset is braving its first crisis since formation and outperforming traditional safe havens with ease.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/039b6d0c47c4b8a091f0c53cfc41b6a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap followed gold higher by breaking sharply above a stiff overhead resistance at $10,500. This is likely to improve sentiment across the crypto space and also attract new investors.\par \par \uc2 If institutional investors decide to allocate even a small portion of their funds into Bitcoin, the rest of the year could see a sharp rally.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the critical overhead resistance at $10,500. This completed three different \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setups that can provide the traders with short-term, medium-term, and long-term target objectives.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c0a4a5aa633862eb43af52a0ae1895a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price closes (UTC time) above $10,400, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $11,870.50. This is the short-term target.\par \par \uc2 Next, if the BTC/USD pair closes (UTC time) above the $10,400\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 resistance zone, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern that has a target objective of $16,997. This is the medium-term target.\par \par \uc2 The bulls have already driven the pair above the resistance line of the large symmetrical triangle. This setup has a target objective of $28,881.90, which is likely to be achieved in the long-term.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair fails to sustain above the $10,400\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 resistance zone, the bears will try to sink the price back below $10,000. If that happens, it will be a huge negative as it will indicate a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend since breaking out of the $253.556 resistance, which shows that traders are aggressively buying as they fear missing out on the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e2f61c4173e269e926e8479c1515851b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The vertical rally of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index deep into the overbought zone. History suggests that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap enters a correction when the RSI reaches above 87 levels.\par \par \uc2 In mid-May of last year, the correction was shallow and the ETH/USD pair resumed the up move after a few days of consolidation. However, in mid-Feb. of this year, the pair formed a top and the price plunged, giving back all its gains.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, chasing the price after the recent rally might be a risky strategy. It is better to wait for a dip or a consolidation before entering fresh positions as it gives a logical stop-loss and improves the risk to reward ratio.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $288.599. A bounce off this support will be a positive sign as it will indicate strong demand on dips. The next target on the upside is $366. If the momentum scales above this level, the next target on the upside is $480.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the bears sink the price below $288.599, it will signal that the momentum has weakened and it could result in a deeper correction or a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern on July 25. The pattern target of a breakout from this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $0.25. Generally, after the breakout, the price retests the neckline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c4d87aece71a438155abe199cf7d8334.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the neckline, the up move is likely to start. There is a minor resistance at $0.235688 but it is likely to be scaled. The rising 20-day Exponential moving average ($0.20) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggests that the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink and sustain the XRP/USD pair below the neckline, it will be a huge negative. This could result in a drop to $0.188499 as traders who had bought following the breakout of the neckline will be forced to cover their positions.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the $260 resistance, which shows that the bulls continue to buy at higher levels. The next level to watch out for is $280.47.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/aeaf2dcae3140aac0879ebd5e67cdfe3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $227, a new uptrend is likely. The pattern target of a break above the large $280.47\u8211\'20\'13$200 range is $360.94.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to push the BCH/USD pair above $280.47, a drop to $260 is possible. A break below this level will signal weakness and will indicate that the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the overhead resistance at $200, which is a positive sign. The bulls will now try to carry the altcoin to the next resistance at $227.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/97a28dd20ce99920207ae638dfaf39e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks above $227, a new uptrend is possible. The pattern target of such a breakout is $308. There is a minor resistance at $260 but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the BSV/USD pair turns down from $227, it could remain range-bound between $220\u8211\'20\'13$227 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) surged on July 25 and broke above the pennant and the horizontal resistance at $0.1380977. The pattern target of this move is $0.173.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fbc026c820059cbc5e211cdc2f166af7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, profit booking at higher levels has resulted in a retest of the breakout level from the pennant. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off this level aggressively, the bulls will again attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair below $0.13, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.12) is possible. A break below this level will signal a possible change in trend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests that the momentum has weakened in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the $39\u8211\'20\'13$51 range. The altcoin soared above $46 on July 25 but the bulls have not been able to push the price above $51, which shows that the bears are aggressively defending the resistance of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1efa393bd92f000a25e0f602b53462ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap dipped below $46 on July 26 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels, which suggests that the bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par \uc2 They are likely to make another attempt to propel the price above $51. If successful, a new uptrend is likely with the first target objective at $64.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the LTC/USD pair turns down from $51 and plummets back below $46. Such a move will indicate that the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) rallied above the $0.15306\u8211\'20\'13$0.15416 resistance zone on July 26 and reached a high of $0.158288. However, short-term traders booked profits at higher levels due to which the altcoin gave up ground and closed (UTC time) at $0.153329.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/80b48f903d93dda111b1793e2ce71a6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has again surged, which suggests that the bulls are buying on every minor dip. If the bulls can sustain the price above $0.158288, the rally can extend to $0.174114.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping higher and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that the bulls are in command. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears drag the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.144).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed (UTC time) above $19 on July 24, which completed the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. This setup has a target objective of $22.93 and above it the rally can extend to $24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/83a7aca0d042d9b03d3e534ea834781a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tenth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap had pulled back to the breakout level of $18.20. The 20-day EMA ($18) is also close to this level, hence, the bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the BNB/USD pair sustains the rebound off $18 levels, it will indicate buying on dips and will increase the possibility of a move to $20.49. Above this level, the up move is likely to resume. However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has risen to the top of the $2.33\u8211\'20\'13$2.83 range. If the bulls can push the price above this range, a rally to $3.1104 is possible. The bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ca3c90c4b7aced4038738bd3a9b7567d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $3.1104, a new uptrend is likely. The target objective on the upside is $3.8811.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the EOS/USD pair turns down from $2.83 or from $3.1104 levels, the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Also, don\u8217\'20\'19t miss our upcoming conference {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/vYeKVcxc4DU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Crypto Traders Live}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 More than 30 star speakers including Raoul Pal, John Bollinger, Mike Novogratz, DataDash and Jon Najarian will gather on July 30th to discuss the challenges of crypto trading. Join the show for over 9 hours of crypto trading content!\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy84ZjRkN2E4NjRlM2FkMjgyODMzYWFmOGIzMGNlN2RjYS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200727eg7r000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Cryptocurrencies to Watch This Week: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XMR, CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,664 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin finally moved above the $10K mark and analysis suggests that BTC and altcoins will continue to rally together\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization has reached {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $300 billion}}}\uc2  for the first time since mid-February, which is a huge positive as it suggests increased investor interest in cryptocurrencies. The interest has largely been in smaller altcoins with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) taking a back seat until early this morning.\par \par \uc2 Even Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) recently joined the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-price-hits-2020-high-key-reasons-why-eth-outperforms-others"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altseason party}}}\uc2  and once it broke out of its resistance the price skyrocketed higher. This could have resulted in a missed opportunity for several traders who did not buy on the breakout.\par \par \uc2 Now, traders are likely to expect a similar move from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap as it has also been range-bound for a long time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bacfff51dc5adf9f4436e6bb4ea81707.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market data daily view}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-fpje2fq19a_1589129732773"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Therefore, several bulls are likely to start buying Bitcoin without waiting for it to breakout and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-bitcoin-suddenly-spiked-to-10-200-liquidating-75m-in-fast-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 short positions}}}\uc2  are likely to cover, which could provide the needed push to carry the price above the stiff overhead resistance. As the momentum picks up, there could be a buying stampede as traders fear missing out on the rally.\par \par \uc2 The upcoming week is critical as it will provide insight into whether the altcoins will continue to lead the market or if Bitcoin will join in and shift traders\u8217\'20\'19 focus away from altcoins.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $10,100 level today for the first time since early-June, which is likely to boost sentiment. However, the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight as they will aggressively defend the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,400 resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ae46d427362ce1fb079bea2e80bedbb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the price has dipped back below the $10,000 levels but the positive thing is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that minor dips are being purchased.\par \par \uc2 This change in sentiment increases the possibility of a break above the $10,400 resistance. If the price sustains above $10,400, it could result in short covering and aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Such a move could quickly carry the price to $11,870.50, which is the pattern target of the breakout from the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above $10,400 will also complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern that has a target objective of $16,997. However, this target is likely to be achieved in the medium-term as the bears will aggressively defend the $14,000 levels.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the trendline of the ascending triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/818229de2e996b46b5a61f14291bdc28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the relative strength index is in the overbought zone, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand. The price is currently consolidating between the $9,800\u8211\'20\'13$10,000 level, which is a positive sign.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can again push the price above $10,000 and sustain the higher levels for four hours, a move to $10,400 levels is likely. A break above this level will be a huge positive and could result in a sharp move higher.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the short-term if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-exponential moving average. Such a move will indicate that the momentum has weakened and could lead to a minor consolidation.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 After consolidating for about two months, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $253.556\u8211\'20\'13$216.006 range on July 22. This breakout attracted buying by the bulls who had been waiting on the sidelines for the up move to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/152f1396af588653588796cdeeb19235.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The aggressive buying quickly pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to the first target level of $320. The relative strength index has risen above the 80 levels, which suggests that the rally has become overbought in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 As the price is close to a stiff resistance, profit booking by the short-term traders is possible, which could result in a minor correction or consolidation. In a strong uptrend, the pullbacks usually last for one to three days, after which the uptrend resumes. If the bulls can propel the price above $320, the next level to watch out for is $366.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8a28f76c48d993198a078a54c8995d62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the ETH/USD pair did not even correct to the 20-EMA after breaking above $253.556. The RSI has been trading in the overbought range, which suggests that the trend is very strong.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the price below $300, a drop to the 20-EMA is possible. A bounce off this support will indicate that the bulls continue to view the dips as a buying opportunity. The uptrend is likely to pick up momentum once again if the price closes (UTC time) above $320.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-EMA, the pair could consolidate for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the symmetrical triangle and made a new 52-week high, which indicates that the uptrend is strong and the bulls continue to buy at higher levels as they expect the rally to extend further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ac1b274b7d2e53d7353e8feeb2032b8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, after breaking out of a pattern, the price retests the breakout levels but If the trend is strong only a consolidation occurs.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is facing profit booking at $0.1543051, which could result in a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.13 aggressively, the bulls will attempt to resume the up move and extend the rally to $0.173 and then to $0.20. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  up move will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below $0.12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d234bf22715478bf9ccdef714cfcb292.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair picked up momentum after breaking out of the triangle and surged to $0.1543051 levels, which pushed the RSI deep into the overbought zone.\par \par \uc2 History suggests that the pair corrects when the RSI rises above the 80 levels. The current pullback is likely to find support at the 20-EMA. A strong rebound off this level will indicate strength and increase the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 XMR/USD\par \par \uc2 Monero ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/monero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2  ) had been consolidating between $60\u8211\'20\'13$70 for two months. This range resolved to the upside with a breakout and close (UTC time) above $70 on July 22, which suggests that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/386ce25e0f9c03593a754a29fbd74407.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XMRUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The immediate target of the breakout from the range was $80 and the price had reached a high of $79.10 today. The bears might now attempt to pull the price back into the range, hence, a retest of the $70 levels is possible.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/monero/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 16th-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap rebounds off this support, then it will act as a new floor and signal the possible start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The first target on the upside is $85 and if the momentum can scale this level, then the rally could reach $95. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears drag the price back below $70.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f5fac7be6b7c92aa52aa19852bbef00d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XMRUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages on the 4-hour chart are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand. The XMR/USD pair had reached overbought levels on the RSI, hence, a minor correction or consolidation is possible.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is likely to be the 20-EMA. A strong rebound off this level could offer an entry opportunity to the traders but if this support breaks, it could signal a deeper pullback to $70.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend as it continues to make higher highs and higher lows. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, suggesting that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/53b80333fa1c0ca09c4f511d70323a2e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the $0.15306\u8211\'20\'13$0.15416 resistance zone. If the price closes (UTC time) above this zone, it will increase the possibility of a move to $0.174114 and then to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the resistance zone, a minor correction or consolidation is possible. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.143).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5c07688a22c2cefa6626b642116888af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the CRO/USD pair dips when the RSI rises close to 75 levels. The first level to watch out for is $0.15306 and below that the 20-EMA, which usually acts as a strong support when the trend is strong.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below both these supports, then a drop to the 50-simple moving average and below that to $0.14 is possible. Such a move could signal weakening momentum and result in a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9hNDM5MTMzYjM2NWU3ZDkzZGJkMTljNWU0OGRmYWM5MC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200726eg7q000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 Ethereum Price Rally to $370 Depends on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Upcoming Weekly Close\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Ray Salmond \par \uc2 614 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally to $9,700 brings the asset to a key resistance level, meanwhile Ethereum rallied above $300 to a new 2020 high\par \par \uc2 On Saturday Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) price perked up as BTC briefly pushed above $9,700 and Ether set a 2020 high at $309.\par \par \uc2 The weekend surge comes as a bit of a surprise as weekends are typically marked by low trading volume and some traders avoid the markets due to the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  that sometimes accompanies the weekly close.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9f2f416526384dd022eb2186bc08cb7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-t59ta1b42t_1595731518535"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Technicals aside, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s rapid ascent to $309 could also be receiving a sentiment boost from the news that the total value of funds locked into decentralized finance platforms (DeFi) reached $4 billion today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f8d5fd6e6e2061138f0532b2085337cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total value locked (USD) in DeFi}}}\par \par \uc2 Total value locked (USD) in DeFi. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defipulse.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFi Pulse}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the top three DeFi platforms are Maker Aave, and Compound with each having $875 million, $639 million and $616 million locked into an assortment of contracts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/defipulse/status/1287018575245516800?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Data from DeFi Pulse shows}}}\uc2  that the decentralized finance sector has grown tremendously in 2020 as the value locked at the start of the year was slightly below $1 billion.\par \par \uc2 As discussed in a previous market update, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-price-nears-300-as-bitcoin-defi-tokens-fuel-new-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s was expected to push toward the $317 level if the Feb. 14, 2020 high at $288.32 was cleared}}}\uc2  and Saturday\u8217\'20\'19s rally to $309 fell just $8 short of topping the resistance cluster extending to $317.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6a1a2dbb644de7741e0550682a706dd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether daily price chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/ethereum-eth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 After a nearly 30% rally this week, a period of consolidation is to be expected but if bulls find renewed or Bitcoin rallies into the weekly close, there is a possibility that the price could clear $317 and the absence of overhead resistance could see bulls target the 2019 high at $367.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin approaches a key resistance\par \par \uc2 As Ether surged to a new 2020 high, Bitcoin price pushed higher to $9,733. Traders are now watching closely to see if the top-ranked \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  on CoinMarketCap can surge above the $9,900 level as this would place the price above the long-term descending trendline from the 2017 all-time high.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/with-10k-near-is-bitcoin-price-ready-for-a-big-breakout-next-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Michael van de Poppe}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CA major parabolic move is unlikely to happen so soon, as the price has some untested levels above, namely $9,900 and $10,100.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Van de Poppe further explained that:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe most likely scenario would be a \u8220\'20\'1Cstaircase\u8221\'20\'1D pattern where the price of Bitcoin rallies towards the resistance zone, rejects, and then successfully tests the previous resistance zone for support. Next, the price move is likely to accelerate upward once Bitcoin breaks above the high of $10,100.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing Bitcoin price has pulled back slightly from the daily high at $9,733 but the daily chart shows the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to notch higher highs and high lows and the price remains above the 20-day moving average.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ce0ca021891d9dadd1fe6b787b8ed733.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin and Ether pushed higher, a number of altcoins also made significant moves.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) surprised investors with a strong 21% upside move to $0.1457, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) also continued to rally with a 5% gain. \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) followed alongside Bitcoin with a 12.88% move to $49.47.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 , the overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $294.6 billion. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/#dominance-percentage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dominance index}}}\uc2  currently at 60.5%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9hNGFmN2ZlNWY5MTBmOGM4ODM2YjA0NzE2MDkxNmE2ZC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200726eg7q00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 Ether Price Nears $300 as Bitcoin, DeFi Tokens Fuel New Bull Run\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Ray Salmond \par \uc2 388 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin price moved to $9.6K, the price of the Ethereum token Ether (ETH) is on the verge of rallying to a new 2020 high\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) price has shown an incredibly strong performance this week, rising more than 22% since the start of the week and currently less than one dollar away from setting a new high for 2020.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b1aa5ef87b25a9304916d7eb6d4ba99e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-sn8xnlrsk0_1595665483293"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As reported by Cointelegraph, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-options-traders-jump-the-gun-as-eth-price-soars-to-280"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 upcoming Ethereum 2.0 upgrade and the explosive growth of the decentralized finance (DeFi)}}}\uc2  sector are being attributed to the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment surrounding the second-biggest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 The strong upside move began on July 21 when the Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price surged to $9,430 and a high volume spike pushed Ether price above the descending trendline and the high-volume visible profile visible range (VPVR) level at $246.\par \par \uc2 Once above $245, Ether price exploited the VPVR gap from $246 to $263 and pushed through the resistance level at $263-$271.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4fdca24c1ca11caf5451e651b6571819.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls are able to push the price above the Feb. 14, 2020 high at $288.32, then a quick rise to $317 is a possibility. Breaching this level will put ETH price in position to retest the June 2019 high at $367.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/da1872594c90f8d2b1b60b310ccbbc15.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether price as % of BTC price}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether price as % of BTC price. Source: Skew\par \par \uc2 The ETH/BTC pair is also showing strength and according to data from Skew, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price as a percentage of Bitcoin price has risen to a new high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/54cb807c13966aba2d15fb34696b7c51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether daily price chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/ethereum-eth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Ether price rallied to $287.23, Bitcoin price fluctuated around the $9,600 level. Many of the top-20 altcoins also posted moderate gains.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rallied 8.42%, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) added 7.73%, and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) gained 6.42%.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 , the overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $289.3 billion. At the same time, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/#dominance-percentage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dominance index}}}\uc2  has been trending down since the 2020 highs of 67% to the current 61%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy84OGI4NzJlYjg4NWZjNTNhYjQyYTc3N2MxOWI0YjRlMS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200725eg7p0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, BNB, CRO, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,795 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum price looks to make a new 2020 high as Bitcoin bulls fight to hold BTC price above $9,600\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has covered a considerable amount of ground over the past few years. Initially considered as an asset mostly used for unlawful activities, it has finally received the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rallies-5-as-us-regulator-greenlights-bank-crypto-custody"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approval}}}\uc2  of the \uc2 Office of the Comptroller of the Currency\uc2 . This means banks in the U.S. will now be able to provide crypto custody services to their clients.\par \par \uc2 This move could further encourage institutional investors to enter the crypto space because they are likely to trust their banks more than the other custody services on offer. However, funds are unlikely to start flowing immediately as institutions are known to tread cautiously.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e5d03856c002d3200832645b018e21a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In the short-term, \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to be swayed by the performance of gold and the U.S. equity markets. As gold is backed by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/07/24/gold-prices-head-for-best-week-in-3-months-on-us-china-woes.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 momentum}}}\uc2 , the institutional investors are likely to remain invested in it.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, if the U.S. equity markets enter a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rally-in-danger-wall-street-veterans-warn-of-nasdaq-bubble"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 correction}}}\uc2  as anticipated by a few stock market veterans, then the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap might show weakness due to its strong correlation with the S&P 500.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $9,500 level on July 22 and followed it up with another positive close on July 23. However, the lack of momentum following the breakout of $9,500 is a mild negative as it suggests that the bulls are in no urgency to buy at these levels because they are not confident that the rally will pick up steam.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/381e72dcb23d9f362f2ba6280cc1cf08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Still, if the bulls can keep the BTC/USD pair above $9,500, a rally to $10,000 is possible. A break above $10,000 will be a huge sentiment booster and could attract further buying. If the buyers can drive the price above $10,500, the subsequent pace of the rally is likely to be sharp.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the advantage is with the bulls but if they do not make use of this opportunity, then it might not take long for the bears to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 A break below $9,500 will be a huge negative as it will indicate a lack of buyers at higher levels. This could attract profit booking by short-term traders, increasing the possibility of a break below the trendline of the ascending triangle.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead resistance of $253.556 on July 22, which ended its consolidation and resumed the uptrend. The follow up buying seen since then adds to the positive sentiment suggesting that traders who were waiting on the sidelines have started to jump in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c317993ecf9dbcdc882d34cb87ca9611.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears might attempt to stall the up move at $288.599, which might result in a minor correction or consolidation at that level but the possibility of a break above this level is high.\par \par \uc2 On a close (UTC time) above $288.599, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could rally to $320 and then to $366.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair turns down from the current levels or $288.599 and plummets below $253.556.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the downtrend line and quickly rallied to the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern. However, the bulls could not push the price above this level, which suggests that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8da1b70797841f407733fa44fd0a272f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap does not give up much ground, the bulls will again attempt to propel the price above the neckline. The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($0.197) and the relative strength index in the positive territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above the neckline will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup that has a target objective of $0.25. There is a minor resistance at $0.235688 but it is likely to be crossed. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the bears sink the XRP/USD pair below $0.188499.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from just below the $246 resistance on July 23 and has again dipped to the moving averages. If the bears sink the price below the moving averages, a drop to $217.55 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/beef9d98a3e8e4633025fb7bcd4e4b41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will make another attempt to drive the price above the overhead resistance of $246.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, a rally to $260 and then to $280.47 is possible. However, the flattish moving averages and the RSI close to the midpoint suggests that the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on July 21 but they could not carry the altcoin to the first target of $200, which suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. The price has again dipped to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/38c343c38940e21fb114a42ce879f4b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the moving averages, a drop to $170 is likely. A break below this support could result in a decline to the critical support of $146.20.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BSV/USD pair rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will again attempt to push the price to $200. If they succeed, the pair could rise to $227.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The rebound of the 20-day EMA ($0.118) has not picked up momentum, which suggests that buying has dried up at higher levels. This could keep Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) inside the pennant formation for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7c3e57a5e9af239f9a094004d34ecf64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As the price is trading above the upsloping moving averages and the RSI is in the positive territory, the advantage remains with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to resume the uptrend if the bulls can propel the price above the pennant and the $0.1380977 resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair below the pennant, a deeper correction is possible. A break below the $0.11\u8211\'20\'13$0.10 support will signal that the uptrend has possibly ended.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $46 on July 23, which suggests that the bears are aggressively defending this level. However, the bears have not been able to sink the price below the moving averages, indicating buying on dips buy the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/77b43976ae4edaa7b73b07313e1bf3d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are not providing any insight about the next directional move because both of them are flat but if the RSI breaks above the 60 level, it could signal a pick up in momentum to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $46, a rally to $51 is likely. The bulls are likely to defend this resistance aggressively but if crossed, it could lead to a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the LTC/USD pair could drop to $39.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $18.20 on July 23 and followed it up with another up move that cleared the $19 resistance today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ac2f39ca7951b75eebc686bd927563f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This is a huge positive as a close (UTC time) above $19 will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $22.93 and then $24. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($17.5) and the RSI above 60 level suggests that bulls have the advantage.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels and plummets below $18.20 and the 20-day EMA. Such a move could intensify selling and drag the price to the trendline of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) has been hovering close to the $0.1462 level for the past two days, which suggests that the bulls are not booking profits yet as they expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a7c5a80a5cc5fd9c27b8b462aa034db3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Above $0.1462, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tenth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to the $0.15306\u8211\'20\'13$0.15416 resistance zone. If the momentum can push the price above this zone, the next target to watch out for is $0.174114.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which is the only negative development on the chart. During bull trends, such divergences tend to fail but traders should still exercise caution because sometimes they signal a reversal.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA ($0.14) will be the first sign of weakness and a deeper correction is possible when the CRO/USD pair dips below $0.13824.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on July 23, which was a positive sign but the bulls could not keep up the momentum and the altcoin turned down from $8.099. This suggests that the bears are selling on every rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c5489d74fc4d872a2f4545ea9770881d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA ($7), it will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 There is a minor support at the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.8224 but if this level gives way, a decline to the 50-day simple moving average is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the LINK/USD pair again rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to push the price above $8.1388. If they succeed, a retest of $8.9080 will be on the cards. Above this level, the next target to watch out for is $11.095.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy80ODY0NDc4ZTlhZDI4ODA4MmE4NjY1MzhlNTI4MjFjYy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200724eg7o000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Crypto Scammer on the Prowl as \uc2 YouTube\uc2  and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  Become Central to Bitcoin Scams\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jinia Shawdagor \par \uc2 1,534 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin giveaway scammers are getting away with Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Over the years, it has become a known fact for anyone dealing with cryptocurrencies that scams are running rampant. However, as more novice players enter the market, more scammers up their tactics to take advantage of unsuspecting Bitcoin enthusiasts with fake Bitcoin giveaways and other elaborate schemes.\par \par \uc2 Recently, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-twitter-account-apparently-hacked-by-bitcoin-thief"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new bout of scammers}}}\uc2  has emerged with even more sophisticated and aggressive tactics. As evident through most reports, the scammers are taking advantage of popular social media platforms like \uc2 YouTube\uc2  and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  to capture their victims. For instance, on July 13 Charles Hoskinson who is the founder of Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-warns-of-youtube-scams-promoting-fake-ada-giveaways"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned about a YouTube account}}}\uc2  that has been promoting fake giveaways of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Most recently a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-twitter-hack-recap-a-wake-up-call-for-centralized-platforms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sizable attack targeting high profile twitter accounts}}}\uc2  has exposed the inherent security risks on major social media platforms. As Cointelegraph reported, potentially thousands of people got scammed out of their Bitcoin after several prominent and verified \uc2 twitter\uc2  accounts were hacked to promote a fake Bitcoin giveaway. The scammers managed to reach an estimated 350 million people making away with about $110,000 in a matter of hours.\par \par \uc2 In almost every \uc2 twitter\uc2  account belonging to a prominent individual, the audience was encouraged to send $1,000 in Bitcoin to a specified address to receive $2,000 as a free giveaway.\par \par \uc2 YouTube\uc2  falls captive\par \par \uc2 Apart from \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , \uc2 YouTube\uc2  has also proven itself to be one of the favorite tools for scammers. According to a report published on July 10 by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/@whale_alert/chasing-crypto-criminals-db53edad43e1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Whale Alert}}}\uc2 , one scam project that operated in June 2020, made away with more than $120,000 in a day by using a single-page website and \uc2 YouTube\uc2  advertising to lure unsuspecting victims.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s CEO, Charles Hoskinson warned against scams promoting fake Cardano giveaways on \uc2 YouTube\uc2 . In a tweet, the founder of Cardano said that \u8220\'20\'1Ca scam has been floating around using my conference keynote to promote a giveaway,\u8221\'20\'1D he added: \u8220\'20\'1CThis is a scam. Please report it to \uc2 YouTube\uc2 . We will take legal action if we can against those responsible.\u8221\'20\'1D Although \uc2 YouTube\uc2  has since deleted the video, Hoskinson retweeted that there were still \uc2 YouTube\uc2  adverts promoting the scams.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-files-lawsuit-against-youtube-enough-is-enough"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s CEO Brad Garlinghouse}}}\uc2  has also been targeted by impersonators who hack and rename \uc2 YouTube\uc2  channels as \u8220\'20\'1CXRP Giveaways\u8221\'20\'1D eventually fleecing millions from unwitting XRP holders.In response, Ripple has filed a lawsuit against \uc2 YouTube\uc2  for allegedly profiting from the actions of the scammers while having the ability to stop them.\par \par \uc2 In another case of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fake-spacex-youtube-channels-scam-victims-out-of-150k-in-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 scams on YouTube,}}}\uc2  a number of victims were lured into a pyramid scheme in early June after promises of a possible 200% payback for their bitcoin donation to a \uc2 YouTube\uc2  account named \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 SpaceX\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to reports, the scammer managed to get away with 15.3 BTC. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/fake-spacex-youtube-channels-scam-viewers-out-of-150k-in-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bleeping Computer}}}\uc2  reports that the scammers operate by hacking existing \uc2 youtube\uc2  channels, changing their channel name to \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  and publishing archived footage of Elon Musk (or any other public figure) to make it look like Musk\u8217\'20\'19s archived speeches are live.\par \par \uc2 While the legitimate \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  channel has over 4 million subscribers, two of the channels hijacked by the scammers had 130,000 subscribers and 230,000 subscribers thereby giving the viewers the appearance of a legitimate following. Each of the fake \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  channels asked its viewers to send bitcoin to a specified address.\par \par \uc2 To further promote the fake \uc2 youtube\uc2  live streams to a wider audience the scammers used bots to scale up the number of viewers on the live streams thus giving an impression to the \uc2 YouTube\uc2  algorithm of a viral video.\par \par \uc2 With a combination of socially engineered tricks and boosted viewership from bots, the scammers managed to get their videos on top of \uc2 youtube\uc2  searches especially for keywords related to prominent individuals like Jack Ma and Elon Musk. Even though \uc2 YouTube\uc2  has since responded by taking down hacked channels that promoted the scams, there are still scam videos like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Caw8pNULcdk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 this}}}\uc2  that still exist on the platform.\par \par \uc2 Whale Alert reports that giveaway scams find it easy to use the identities of celebrities to lure large audiences with the help of tools such as \uc2 YouTube\uc2  advertising. An affiliated service Scam Alert has reported that since the start of the year, the outfit reports that more than 20 million in Bitcoin has been stolen.\par \par \uc2 The Scam Market is evolving\par \par \uc2 As it seems, scammers are using increasingly aggressive tactics in the form of fake companies with dozens of websites and fake social media accounts to promote their schemes. Dominik Scheiner, the co-founder of the IOTA foundation told Cointelegraph: "These Crypto Scams on social media have become a lot more sophisticated and aggressive over the last few months. The fact that they are continuing, clearly shows that these scams are working.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 True to Schiener\u8217\'20\'19s concerns, Whale Alert reports that prominent Giveaway scams that feature celebrities like Elon Musk as well popular exchanges can net upwards of $300,000 US dollars. As scammers increasingly change their methods by using professional teams to increase the quality of their attacks, experts warn that it is just a matter of time before \u8216\'20\'18deep fake\u8217\'20\'19 techniques are introduced to the scam market.\par \par \uc2 Last year, \uc2 Jack Dorsey\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theverge.com/2019/8/30/20841288/jack-dorsey-ceo-twitter-account-hacked-chuckle-gang-shane-dawson-james-charles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 account was hacked}}}\uc2  amid assurances from \uc2 Twitter\uc2  that the flaw was fixed. The recent bout of attacks, however, reveals that there are still many vulnerabilities on the platform. As to the reason why \uc2 Twitter\uc2  and \uc2 YouTube\uc2  are attractive tools for scammers, Schiener believes it\u8217\'20\'19s due to their popularity:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA comment on a popular tweet or \uc2 YouTube\uc2  video might be seen by thousands of people, making it easier to succeed with these scams. Also, nearly all social media platforms today lack better moderation tools and policies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to Schiener popular social media platforms cannot get rid of fake or harmful content and unless these platforms implement \u8220\'20\'1Cbetter content moderation tools, these scams will only increase and further evolve.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Alternative solutions?\par \par \uc2 With the U.S. presidential elections fast approaching, tight security measures on all major social media platforms are needed more than ever. Schiener mentioned that the recent bout of scams showcased that digital identities with verifiable credentials based on a distributed chain are a real way to fight back.\par \par \uc2 With a DLT identity and verification system, Schiener explains that it is impossible to \u8220\'20\'1Cimpersonate another person\u8217\'20\'19s identity or fake a credential\u8221\'20\'1D as the data is immutable and verifiable using KYC systems.\par \par \uc2 The notion of self-sovereign identity and verification systems are designed to give the user control over their information. Self-sovereign identity offers a solution to standard identity verification systems that cluster a user\u8217\'20\'19s information on central servers creating massive vulnerabilities.\par \par \uc2 However, by placing self-sovereign identity and verification systems on a DLT, centralized, external and third-party control is removed thereby reducing the risk of widespread data breaches.\par \par \uc2 Despite the optimism around the transformative potential of DLT based identity verification systems, experts reveal that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.jdsupra.com/legalnews/practical-application-of-distributed-71041/#_ftn16"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 less than 10%}}}\uc2  of apps are expected to take on DLT solutions by 2023. Even though there are existing solutions and the sector has an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.jdsupra.com/legalnews/practical-application-of-distributed-71041/#_ftn16"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 estimated yearly growth}}}\uc2  of 35%, adoption is still slow.\par \par \uc2 Some of the immediate solutions that social media platforms such as \uc2 Youtube\uc2  can adopt for now include, training its users on the platforms security risks. Also, \uc2 YouTube\uc2  can continuously monitor accounts on its platform to identify and stop any suspicious activity.\par \par \uc2 Scams Revealing a Rise in Retail Investors\par \par \uc2 The recent bout of hacks on \uc2 YouTube\uc2  has obviously eroded the trust of its users on the platform's security.\par \par \uc2 However, beyond the loss of trust, \uc2 YouTube\uc2  will likely face legal consequences given that the EU's General Data Protection \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  (GDPR) requires companies of its caliber to have top-notch security levels. In the past, other social media sites such as \uc2 Facebook\uc2  have also been called to attention to tighten their security and community management tools.\par \par \uc2 Already, \uc2 YouTube\uc2  is facing a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/youtube-were-not-liable-for-crypto-scams"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuit from Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s CEO}}}\uc2  Brad Garlinghouse and the company\u8217\'20\'19s attorneys for its failure to stop scammers and impersonators while benefiting from adverts that promote scams.\par \par \uc2 So far, \uc2 YouTube\uc2  has responded that it is not liable for crypto scams perpetrated by third parties.\par \par \uc2 As the crypto scam market grows, its impact on people\u8217\'20\'19s lives is increasingly becoming substantial. For most crypto and blockchain enthusiasts, scams have been their first introduction to the industry as the unregulated nature of the sector leaves room for scammers to go about unchecked.\par \par \uc2 Schiener suggests that the pandemic might have had a hand in giving rise to cybercrime in general as lockdowns around the world left many people out of work.\par \par \uc2 Schiener explains,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis meant that they had to work from less secure work environments and generally spend more time online. This gave scammers an obvious opportunity to increase their efforts.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Schiener opines that the rise in crypto scams could also be a signal indicating a rise in retail investors joining the crypto sphere.\par \par \uc2 He adds,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince many of these new investors are more novice, it\u8217\'20\'19s much easier to trick them into a giveaway or more elaborate phishing schemes."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9mNWUxMDkyZGMyMDU1OGM0NTcyYzdkNzk1NGVmNWVjMS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200723eg7n0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/22: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, CRO, LINK, BNB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,788 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Many altcoins could pick up momentum If Bitcoin and Ethereum break above key resistance levels in the coming days\par \par \uc2 Since March central banks have been printing money aggressively in order to combat the economic downturn brought about by the coronavirus pandemic.\par \par \uc2 Philip Lowe, the governor of the Australian Reserve Bank, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/australian-reserve-bank-blasts-money-printing-theres-no-free-lunch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  against the consequences of unlimited monetary expansion. Lowe said that \u8220\'20\'1Cthere is no free lunch,\u8221\'20\'1D and somebody always has to pay for the money printing \u8220\'20\'1Cin one form or the other.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 European Union\uc2  has also agreed on a massive recovery fund of about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/07/21/eu-leaders-reach-a-breakthrough-on-the-regions-recovery-fund.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $857 billion}}}\uc2  to buoy the social and economic crisis caused due to the coronavirus pandemic. In response, gold again broke out to a new yearly high, which shows that with every new announcement of a stimulus, investors are piling on gold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0b4b1bbb2d81c3b482f8d99838265a7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Most investors buy gold because they are looking for a way to preserve their wealth against the devaluation of fiat currencies. However, as gold continues to climb, investors might start looking for other assets where they can find considerable value. This is when Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could come into greater focus.\par \par \uc2 The next bull run in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap is likely to be a sustained up-move, unlike the vertical rally seen during the previous bull market in 2017. Hence, crypto investors should be patient with their holdings.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the moving averages with a large range move on July 21, which suggests that some bulls are buying aggressively. If they can push the price above the immediate overhead resistance at $9,500, several traders waiting on the sidelines are likely to jump in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/de5cb018f7898b9580a87ead61e2647a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Above $9,500, the bears will again try to stall the up move in the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone, but if the bulls can clear this hurdle, a new sustained up move is likely.\par \par \uc2 The ascending triangle pattern is still intact, which will complete on a breakout and close (UTC time) above $10,376.38. This pattern has a target objective of $11,870.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if bulls fail to propel the price above $9,500, the BTC/USD pair might again drop to the trendline of the triangle. A break below this support will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern and could result in a drop to $8,800.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) up-move on July 21 has carried it close to the overhead resistance zone of $249.195\u8211\'20\'13$253.556. If the bulls can propel the price above the zone, the next leg of the uptrend is likely to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/902c68c322147c78b1178bee68efe2cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first target is a rally to $288.599, which might act as resistance but if the bulls can clear this hurdle, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to extend the rally to $366.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls fail to propel the ETH/USD pair above $254.556, a few more days of range-bound action is likely. The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the support at $216.006 gives way.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears again tried to sink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  below the moving averages on July 20 but the bulls purchased the dip to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.19), which shows accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f17c905e406c5aa8a6adfd3a924a4216.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are facing resistance at the downtrend line but if they can scale the price above it, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could start its journey towards the next target of $0.214616.\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USD pair is showing first signs of forming an inverse head and shoulders pattern, which will complete on a breakout and close (UTC time) above the neckline at $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the pair turns down from the current levels and plummets below $0.188499, a drop to $0.17 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 After staying close to the $217.55 levels for the past few days, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) bounced on July 21, which shows some accumulation closer to these levels. However, the bulls are facing resistance at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bb1fe41d652fdc0359d3a81bf4bf4cb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the moving averages, a move to $246 is possible. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, the BCH/USD pair could remain range-bound between $217.55 and $246. The flat moving averages and the relative strength index close to the midpoint also support this view.\par \par \uc2 A break above $246 could shift the advantage in favor of the bulls while a break below $217.55 might indicate that the bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to capitalize on the break below the $170 support on July 19 and 20 attracted buying from the aggressive bulls who pushed Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on July 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/77d535de9e0eb4b2a0464adea3f28006.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Now, the onus is on the bulls to make use of this opportunity and carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to the overhead resistance of $200. Above this level, a move to $227 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the bears again sink the price below the downtrend line, a drop to $170 is likely. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is close to the midpoint, which suggests that the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average ($0.116) on July 21, which is a positive sign as it shows that the bulls are buying the dips to strong support levels because they expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/153e33c564a4c4178a027f4e62b0f723.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above the pennant and the $0.1380977 resistance will signal the possible resumption of the uptrend. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can then rally to $0.173 and above it to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 In this leg of the up move that started on April 22, the pullbacks to the 20-day EMA have worked as a good entry point to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA and the $0.11 support. Below this level, a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.097) is possible.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($43.13) on July 21, which shows that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. The first sign of strength will be a breakout and close (UTC time) above $46 and the momentum is likely to pick up above $51.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a619bcc7c4288d871eb9de8ef48a252f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $46, the bears will make another attempt to drag the price to $39. A break below this support could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Currently, both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is close to the midpoint, which suggests that the LTC/USD pair might extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at $0.1462 but the bulls do not seem to be in a hurry to book profits, which has resulted in a tight consolidation, instead of a pullback to the 20-day EMA ($0.138).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/52bb0fd34b27f572acdc6cd9da36bad2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a small ascending triangle that has formed, which will complete on a breakout and close (UTC time) above the overhead resistance at $0.1462. The pattern target of this setup is $0.15416.\par \par \uc2 However, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap fails to breakout or sustain above $0.1462, it could result in profit booking that could drag the price down to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support will signal a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($0.124).\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is currently attempting to bounce off the 20-day EMA ($6.9). Although the bulls purchased the dip to this level on July 21, the rebound was not very encouraging because the bulls could not sustain the higher levels, which suggests that the bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/12fee29844d0a976077e6f763c090416.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tenth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap plummets below the 20-day EMA, it will signal a deeper correction. The next support on the downside is the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.3298.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a breakout and close (UTC time) above the downtrend line. This will indicate that the short-term correction might be coming to an end. The next uptrend is likely to start after the LINK/USD pair breaks out of $8.9080.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the $18.20\u8211\'20\'13$19 zone but the positive thing is that the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below the 20-day EMA ($17.23), which indicates demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/79a7194e4ce37fedc2da34105017f0d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap had formed an inside day candlestick pattern on July 21, which suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears. However, with the 20-day EMA sloping up and the RSI in the positive zone, the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 They will make another attempt to scale the price above the resistance zone. If successful, the BNB/USD could start a new uptrend that can reach $22.93 and then $24. There is a minor resistance at $21.50 but that is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls again fail to push the price above the $18.2\u8211\'20\'13$19 zone, it could attract profit booking from the short-term bulls, which can result in a break below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82YmRmM2Y0M2Y1YWU5OWNkM2Q1NjhkY2NjNzY1MmFjMS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200722eg7m000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/20: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, BNB, LINK, CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,750 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Most major altcoins have witnessed profit booking as traders become cautious about the future of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 Gold continues to trade near its nine-year highs as investors hedge their portfolio against a possible devaluation of the U.S. dollar due to the expansive monetary policy of the Federal Reserve. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which has long been forecast as digital gold, is not finding favor among investors as it remains highly correlated with the U.S. equity markets.\par \par \uc2 However, Binance CEO Changpeng Zhao believes that over the long-term, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap will again start behaving as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-ceo-cz-bitcoin-has-been-really-stable"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 safe haven}}}\uc2  asset.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/20ca4494dec99bd500cbe481f949a715.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 One possible reason for investors\u8217\'20\'19 aversion to Bitcoin as a safe haven could be the persistent regulatory uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Despite this, Grayscale Investments and Digital Currency Group CEO Barry Silbert said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-ceo-us-regulators-cant-shut-down-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risk}}}\uc2  of a Bitcoin ban has passed as several policy-makers and regulators accept \u8220\'20\'1Cthat Bitcoin has a right to exist and ultimately you can't shut it down."\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) range continues to tighten making it extremely difficult to place any logical trades. As the intraday range shrinks, even day trading would become difficult. In such situations, traders usually wait on the sidelines until \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  picks up or a trending move starts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0dc7863bc9e8ab31807c14b338a134b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 When the volume drops, it makes it easier for a large trader or a group of traders to step in and move the markets.\par \par \uc2 In this case, if the price breaks above $9,500, it could be the first indication of strength. If the bulls who are sitting on the sidelines jump in and buy aggressively above $9,500, it could pose a serious challenge to the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone, above which a sustained up move is likely.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips below $8,800, the short-term traders owning long positions might cover them, which could drag the BTC/USD pair to $8,130.58. This is an important level to watch out for because if this support breaks down it could result in a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 It is very difficult to predict with certainty which of the above scenarios would play out. Therefore, instead of hazarding a guess, traders can wait on the sidelines and make an entry only after they believe that a strong trending move has started.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip below the moving averages on July 16, which is a positive sign as it shows that the buyers are not willing to wait for Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) price to drop to the strong support of $216.006 before buying.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1cf800e8b0a764132e25f8009d34a020.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the relative strength index is close to the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand. This suggests that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could extend its consolidation for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 With the ETH/USD pair staying close to the middle of the $216.006\u8211\'20\'13$253.556 range, it has become very difficult to predict the direction of the breakout. The random price action near the center of a range can hit stops very frequently, hence, traders should be cautious until a trending move starts.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day exponential moving average ($0.19), the demand dries up at higher levels. This suggests that the bulls are not confident that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  can start a new uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/14b3754b2a1f3b47b631eea07de57e83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the downtrend line will be the first indication of strength. Above this level, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can move up to $0.206424 and then to $0.211694.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the XRP/USD pair below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $0.188499 is possible. If this support breaks down, the pair could give back all its recent gains and drop to $0.17 levels.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has turned down from the 20-day EMA ($229), which is a negative sign. The bears will now make use of this advantage and try to sink the price below the $217.55 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4009596151c5d69c542d4cf2ae6244e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If this support breaks down, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could drop to the critical support at $200.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the BCH/USD pair rebounds off the $217.55 support, it might remain stuck in the tight $217.55\u8211\'20\'13$246 range for a few more days. A breakout of $246 will be the first sign of strength.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $170 support on July 19, which is a huge negative. The bulls purchased the fall to $161.10 but they have not been able to support the altcoin at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fa412a0b8946fd6cf480577b438374d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will again attempt to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $170. If they succeed, the decline could extend to $154.550, which would be a 100% retracement of the July 6 rally.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the BSV/USD pair below $146.20, the downtrend is likely to resume with the next support at $120 and then $100.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns around from the current levels and breaks above the downtrend line.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to keep Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) inside the pennant, which is a negative sign. If the bears sink the altcoin below the pennant and the 20-day EMA ($0.115), it will indicate that the momentum has weakened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3a8aaa3892946d79b451a0b5b5d755f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Such a move could result in a range-bound action for a few days. The critical support to watch on the downside is $0.11 because if this breaks down, the uptrend would be in danger.\par \par \uc2 Below this level, a drop to $0.10 and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.095) is possible.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make another attempt to push the price above $0.1380977. If successful, the uptrend is likely to resume. The next target on the upside is $0.173 and then $0.20.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below both the moving averages for the past few days, which shows that the bulls are in no urgency to buy at higher levels. This could drag the price to the critical support at $39.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/627f8788e586dfa4b973875d8d642aa0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have not been able to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $39 for about three and a half months. However, the previous rebound off this support could not rally to the top of the $39\u8211\'20\'13$51 range, which suggests weakness. A break below $39 will be a huge negative as that could drag the price to $35 and then to $30.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the LTC/USD pair turns up from the current levels and rises above the moving averages and the $46 resistance. If that happens, a rally to $51 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) sharply bounced off the 20-day EMA ($17.16) on July 19, which suggests aggressive buying by the bulls. However, the buyers are facing stiff resistance in the $18.20\u8211\'20\'13$19 zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1e50b755214abe76416d590be98f1a71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($17.14) is gradually sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap turns up from the current levels and breaks above the resistance zone, a rally to $21.50 and above it to $22.93 is possible.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bears sink the BNB/USD pair below the moving averages. Such a move could drag the price to the trendline of the ascending triangle.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend but it is currently witnessing profit booking since topping out at $8.9080 on July 15. The first support on the downside is at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $7.3144.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8744a2ea0749bbe4dbc5e784870c7265.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tenth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off this level, it will indicate that the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy. This could resume the up move with the first target objective at $8.9080 and if this is crossed, the uptrend could extend to $10.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the LINK/USD pair below the 20-day EMA ($6.87).\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong uptrend but the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance level at $0.1462. This has attracted profit booking by the bulls, which could result in a possible decline to the 20-day EMA ($0.137).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0f1bd1f5c029870ddfe5ff69cd060f32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to push the price above $0.1462. If they succeed, a rally to $0.15306 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests caution. If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the CRO/USD pair could drop to the 50-day SMA and if this support also cracks, the decline can extend to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8wNWUyZWM3YzNjN2Q2NzhkMGM2YmY5ZmNmODczZGZjYi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200720eg7k000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Cryptocurrencies to Watch This Week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, XLM, VET, DGTX*\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,179 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days, select altcoins continue to show promise\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) tight range has put analysts in a fix, meaning, every bit of data is being analyzed to determine the direction of the impending breakout. Bitcoin options open interest data can provide some clues on what the larger investors are expecting but there are many other factors at play that could influence Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s spot price.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the maximum {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-options-traders-are-not-betting-on-a-short-term-bitcoin-price-drop"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 open interest}}}\uc2  buildup in calls is at the $11,000 strike price and in puts at the $8,000 strike price. This suggests that the writers of these options do not believe that these levels are likely to be breached by expiry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/729dc58a083a540f16a198b5e738abee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market data daily view}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-fpje2fq19a_1589129732773"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The immediate support is at the $9,000 strike price where there is an open interest buildup of 2,042.4 put options. On the upside, the $9,500 strike price has open interest buildup of 1,056.3 call options.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the number of options buyers who believe that the price of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap will not break below $9,000 is more than traders who do not expect the price to rise above $9,500, which is a mild positive.\par \par \uc2 BTC options data largely supports the view that the price could remain range-bound until the expiry. However, in case the price breaks out with force, options sellers will be forced to cover their positions and this could add fuel to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The range in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has tightened in the past few days, which suggests that both the bulls and the bears are waiting on the sidelines for a trending move to start before jumping in to initiate a position.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a7427a4aea9fbb1df7aa3ab7acb55c36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While the range-bound action has been talked about for many days, the biggest question is which way the breakout will happen. The directional movement index (DMI) indicator can be used to identify whether the bulls or the bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Along with it, the average directional movement index (ADX) can be used to see when the trend is likely to pick up steam.\par \par \uc2 In the BTC/USD pair, history suggests that the ADX starts a strong trending move when it is close to 10.80 levels (marked as ellipses on the chart). Currently, the ADX is at 17.92, which suggests that the range-bound action might continue for a few more days and the ADX can drop further before the price breaks out decisively.\par \par \uc2 The -DI (colored red) is currently dominant as it is on top and the +DI (colored green) is at the bottom, which suggests that the bears have a slight edge over the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the immediate support at $8,900 and the ADX pushes above 25, it will increase the possibility of a deeper pullback. If the price rises from the current levels and breaks above $9,500 with a rally that pushes the ADX above 25, it will signal the possibility of a sustained up-move.\par \par \uc2 There are two critical things for traders to watch is the ADX level as it will indicate a possible sustained trend above 25 and the dominant DI.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d3da407bfa2c2762936c1ded066f5eed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price is trading below both moving averages and the downtrend line, suggesting that bears have a slight edge. The immediate support on the downside is at $9,089.17 and below that at $9,040.48.\par \par \uc2 If these supports crack, the bears will try to break below the psychological level of $9,000 and challenge the support at $8,900.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up and breaks out of the downtrend line, it will suggest accumulation by the bulls and could result in a move to $9,345.05 and possibly $9,500.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend with the ADX above 40. The altcoin has currently formed a symmetrical triangle, which mostly acts as a continuation pattern with the price generally breaking out in the direction of the prevailing trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/96ff1ed2031bc93047cb72796b5b528c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The uptrend will resume after the bulls push the price above the symmetrical triangle and the recent high at $0.1380977. Above this level, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $0.173 and then to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the triangle, the 20-day exponential moving average ($0.114) is likely to act as a strong support but if it cracks, a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.094) is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3a2a11c4efd9a01bda83a22ebc2d942f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair is currently below both moving averages and the -DI has become dominant, which suggests that the bears are attempting to make a comeback in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 A break below the triangle will be a negative sign as it could result in profit booking by the short-term traders. There is a minor support at $0.11 but if this support cracks, a deeper correction is possible. Hence, bottom fishing can be avoided if the price sustains below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price bounces off the support line of the triangle and the bulls push the price above the 50-SMA, it will indicate strength. Above this, a retest of the resistance line of the triangle is possible.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above the triangle is likely to resume the uptrend and could be an opportunity for the traders to consider long positions.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend with the ADX above the 54 level. However, after the sharp up move of the past few days, the altcoin is currently witnessing profit booking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7d69aeeae38a8725696fea9c71d36d57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, in a strong uptrend, the pullback lasts for one to three days. If the up move does not resume after a three-day correction, chances of a deeper pullback or a consolidation increase.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has support at $7.3144 and $6.8221, which are the 38.2% and 50% Fibonacci retracement levels of the most recent leg of the up move. The 20-day EMA ($6.75) is also close by and this zone is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off this zone, it could offer an opportunity to the traders to establish long positions if they expect the uptrend to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/979fa3548b8399a6ea6cbae71ad1a402.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the trend is weakening in the short-term as the ADX has dropped to 25 levels and the price is currently between the 20-EMA and the 50-SMA. A break below the 50-SMA could attract further selling by the short-term traders, which could result in a deeper correction to $6.8221.\par \par \uc2 However, if the LINK/USD pair rebounds off the 50-SMA and bounces above the downtrend line and $8.2241, it will be the first indication of strength. Above this level, a retest of $8.9080 is likely and if this level is crossed, the uptrend is likely to resume.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend with the ADX above the 42 level. However, the bulls could not sustain the price above the $0.101360 level, which suggests selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a43623dd28298d79edd052fc63874293.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/stellar/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 14th-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the trendline, the bulls will once again attempt to resume the uptrend. If they can push the price above $0.107455, a rally to $0.13 and then to $0.14 is possible.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of these levels can carry the price to $0.151491, which is the pattern target of the breakout from the inverse head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the short-term if the bears sink the price below the trendline. In such a case, a correction to the 20-day EMA ($0.088) is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/11bba775704861d2d55d18802476999e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bears have broken below the 20-EMA, which suggests profit booking by the short-term bulls. However, the bulls are likely to defend the trendline aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the XLM/USD pair rebounds off the trendline, the bulls will attempt to push the price above the $0.101360\u8211\'20\'13$0.102626 resistance zone, which could offer a trading window with a good risk to reward ratio.\par \par \uc2 VET/USD\par \par \uc2 VeChain ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/vechain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VET}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend with the ADX above 43 level. The altcoin broke above the stiff resistance of $0.020 on July 8 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels, which resulted in profit booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5530e210b513cf02d4cb385b4b24511e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VET/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 VET/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/VETUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Since then, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/vechain/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 19th-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap has been consolidating close to the $0.020 resistance. On the downside, the 20-day EMA ($0.016) is the critical support to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will again try to propel the altcoin above the $0.020 level. A close (UTC time) above this resistance is likely to resume the uptrend. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below the 20-EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6fca356837f13714493f96a89c02f589.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VET/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 VET/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/VETUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The VET/USD pair has been stuck between the $0.017\u8211\'20\'13$0.020 range for the past few days, which has dragged the ADX close to 12 levels on the 4-hour chart.\par \par \uc2 A break below $0.017 could be the first indication that the bears are back in action. Below this support, a drop to $0.014 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $0.017, the bulls will again attempt to carry the price to $0.020. The uptrend is likely to resume after the price sustains above this resistance.\par \par \uc2 DGTX/USD*\par \par \uc2 Digitex Futures (DGTX) will be launching its commission-free {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://digitexfutures.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin futures exchange}}}\uc2  to the general public on July 31, after eight months of extensive testing on both the testnet and mainnet with select traders. The world\u8217\'20\'19s first zero-fee Bitcoin futures exchange already has about 30,000 traders onboard with many joining daily, who are generating over $250 million in 24-hour trading volume.\par \par \uc2 Scalpers and high-frequency traders can benefit from the fast order matching engine and trading ladder interface as trading small price fluctuations is made easier by the fact that there are no commissions.\par \par \uc2 The exchange will hold a day-long trading event on the launch day and live trading competitions and will reward trades with up to $250,000 in DGTX tokens and other merchandise to the winners.\par \par \uc2 Digitex CEO Adam Todd said: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m just so excited to finally give crypto traders what they have been waiting for and what they deserve. Finally, an exchange that serves its users with no mechanical edge in the form of commissions working against them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/564164e3c3b03a9311e8a44ffb41f6ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DGTX/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 DGTX/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DGTXUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DGTX/USD pair had been stuck in the $0.0140038\u8211\'20\'13$0.0667020 range for over a year. It broke out of the long basing pattern on July 16 and reached close to its pattern target of $0.1194002, which suggests strong buying.\par \par \uc2 The ADX has risen above the 47 level and the +DI is surging, which suggests that the bulls are firmly in command.\par \par \uc2 However, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/digitex-futures/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 82nd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could face profit booking close to $0.1194002, which could result in a minor correction or consolidation for a one to three day period. The first support is at $0.0913870 and then at $0.0838730, which are 38.2% and 50% Fibonacci retrenchment levels of the most recent leg of the rally.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off any of these supports, the bulls will attempt to resume the uptrend. A break above $0.1194002 could carry the price to $0.1460132.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.0763589.\par \par \uc2 *Disclaimer: DGTX is a featured cryptocurrency from one of Cointelegraph\u8217\'20\'19s sponsors, its inclusion did not affect the price analysis in this article.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jYmRlM2ZhZDVmMTQ5YjgwN2M4YjAwOWE3MmU3M2EwNS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200719eg7j0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Chainlink Utility Drives LINK Price, but a Correction Could Be Coming\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Osato Avan-Nomayo \par \uc2 1,875 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The growing utilization of Chainlink oracles in DeFi protocols has seen LINK\u8217\'20\'19s token \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  considerably, but is a significant decline looming?\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s token, LINK, is once again among the most talked-about altcoins, having surged over 370% year-to-date. In July alone, the now ninth-largest crypto by market cap has gained close to 80%, with blockchain analytics firm Santiment identifying LINK as its top-ranked emerging cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Amid the price gains for LINK has come talk of a new altseason, especially for altcoins related to the currently booming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/defi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized finance}}}\uc2  market. As the DeFi market continues to experience significant growth, the need for decentralized oracles for smart contract protocols, like the type offered by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink}}}\uc2 , becomes even more important.\par \par \uc2 On the opposite side of the conversation, critics argue that LINK\u8217\'20\'19s price surge is only a speculative bubble driven by fear of missing out. Despite the growing utility for Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s oracle solutions, some pundits point to DeFi protocols developing their own in-house oracles as being the death knell for Chainlink utility.\par \par \uc2 With Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continuing on its range-bound trajectory, some commentators say altcoin tokens might be primed to deliver significant gains. Since peaking at 67% in mid-May, BTC has seen its market capitalization dominance dip slightly, owing to the price gains experienced by several major altcoin tokens.\par \par \uc2 How Chainlink works\par \par \uc2 A blockchain as a self-contained network should, in theory, offer robust immutability, which makes data manipulation difficult. To alter records stored in a decentralized ledger, a rogue actor would need a large amount of computing power. Since the novel tech emerged with the creation of Bitcoin over a decade ago, several other networks have come online offering different functionalities. Nowadays, it is common to see organizations, and even governments, talk about creating blockchain-based solutions for their operations.\par \par \uc2 Whether these blockchains have any technical merit is a discussion for another time. Assuming they do, their implied decentralization only exists within their network boundaries in isolation. Any interaction with data from another blockchain or \u8220\'20\'1Creal-world\u8221\'20\'1D service often requires a centralized \u8220\'20\'1Cmiddleware.\u8221\'20\'1D Tainted data from these third-party sources effectively nullifies the fidelity of the blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s data.\par \par \uc2 Thus, the idea of centralized oracles does not tally with the decentralized ethos of blockchain functionality. Oracles are intermediaries that translate data from off-chain sources to on-chain smart contracts and vice versa.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink is one of such projects that facilitates the secure and trustworthy decentralization of oracles via a network of nodes tasked with providing accurate information for on-chain smart contracts. Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s decentralized oracle consists of data purchasers and provides the former with requesting information and the latter acting as providers of secure data. Instead of communicating with centralized services for outside data, blockchain networks need only interact with Chainlink oracles. Providers stake LINK \u8212\'20\'14 the native token of the Chainlink network \u8212\'20\'14 to bid on information requests made by purchasers.\par \par \uc2 When a data purchaser submits a query for something like the weather forecast, for example, the Chainlink protocol registers this query as an \u8220\'20\'1Cevent,\u8221\'20\'1D creating a service level agreement. The SLA proceeds via three basic sub-smart contracts: a reputation contract, an order-matching contract and an aggregating contract.\par \par \uc2 The reputation contract tracks oracle metrics, while the order-matching contract examines the bids from participant nodes based on the parameters defined by the data purchaser. In the final step of the SLA, the aggregation contract collates the information provided by the nodes to determine which is best suited to satisfy the event. Thus, the aggregation contract involves three major steps \u8212\'20\'14 selecting the best oracle, reporting the data and result collation. Data from the aggregation contract also provides updated oracle metrics for future queries.\par \par \uc2 The DeFi connection\par \par \uc2 Back in mid-June, Cointelegraph reported that Chainlink price oracles were dominating the DeFi space with protocols like Kyber Network integrating Chainlink price data into its token swap market. For an emerging crypto market sector like DeFi, Chainlink should, in theory, offer enhanced connectivity, trusted price data, increased computational ability and robust privacy. Given the broad applicability of the DeFi sector, decentralized oracle services are a must-have with some projects having already developed their own in-house solutions.\par \par \uc2 Indeed, access to secure and trusted off-chain data is often the bane of many decentralized applications. DeFi applications can hardly function on data available on their native chains alone and often require access to enterprise systems, web APIs and payment systems, among others. DeFi protocols work by way of smart contract execution whose settlement depends largely on several types of off-chain data. Chainlink oracles provide access to these enterprise backend systems to help run the DeFi projects.\par \par \uc2 By interfacing with several DeFi protocols, oracle networks like Chainlink can also deliver customized data sets like aggregated price indices for major cryptos like BTC, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ). Instead of DeFi lending or a money market creating and maintaining price feeds that require constant updates, protocols can interface with these decentralized price oracles.\par \par \uc2 Data computation is also another problem for DeFi protocols and DApps, in general. Any process that requires input from two or more nodes or oracles means multiple gas fees that will negatively impact the network\u8217\'20\'19s practicality. Decentralized oracle networks like Chainlink should, in theory, offer low-cost data computation via pathways like threshold signatures, which should limit the gas cost for transactions. Part of this low-cost data computation occurs off-chain within trusted hardware that allows nodes to operate in a \u8220\'20\'1Cblack box ecosystem.\u8221\'20\'1D Reducing the volume of on-chain transactions while still maintaining security protocols is one of the ways of boosting blockchain scalability.\par \par \uc2 On the privacy side of things, Chainlink offers solutions like \u8220\'20\'1Cmixicles,\u8221\'20\'1D an oracle mixer that eliminates the correlation between smart contract inputs and outputs. This process makes it difficult for any on-chain observer to match the settlement of a smart contract to its input. Mixicles can provide the necessary privacy to protect things like trading strategies, internal positions, etc., from rogue actors looking to steal such data. The system works similarly to mixers for cryptocurrency payments.\par \par \uc2 Ninth-largest crypto by market cap\par \par \uc2 The 80% increase in LINK\u8217\'20\'19s price in July alone has seen Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s native token become the ninth-ranked crypto by market capitalization. But as is often the case, a surge usually has observers debating whether the current price action is FOMO-driven. For Konstantin Anissimov, the executive director at crypto exchange CEX.IO, LINK\u8217\'20\'19s upward push is a result of initial retail interest front running the market followed by whales looking to profit off the token. Anissimov pointed out to Cointelegraph that the 200% hike in Chainlink network activity occurred as soon as the token recovered from its mid-March slump:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COnce the decentralized oracle\u8217\'20\'19s token began reaching higher highs, investors rushed to exchanges to get a piece of the price action. On July 13th, however, there was a substantial spike in the number of large LINK transactions, which suggests that at this point whales entered the market. Approximately 300 large transactions were registered on this day alone, representing a 1,011% increase from July 11th. It seems like whales were able to give Chainlink the last push from $6 to nearly $9.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Indeed, as previously identified, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-key-on-chain-metrics-may-explain-chainlinks-meteoric-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 three on-chain metrics}}}\uc2 , including significant growth in the number of active addresses, explain the positive price action for LINK. Back in June, China\u8217\'20\'19s Blockchain Service Network integrated with the project and is reportedly running over 135 nodes.\par \par \uc2 However, some critics say the meteoric rise in LINK\u8217\'20\'19s price is not due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-integrates-with-social-network-led-by-distributed-computing-pioneer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-integrates-with-social-network-led-by-distributed-computing-pioneer}}}\uc2  the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-integrates-with-social-network-led-by-distributed-computing-pioneer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growing utility for the altcoin token}}}\uc2 . In a now-deleted document, little known asset management firm \uc2 Zeus Capital\uc2  classified the recent gains as being {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-key-on-chain-metrics-may-explain-chainlinks-meteoric-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-key-on-chain-metrics-may-explain-chainlinks-meteoric-rise}}}\uc2  the result of an elaborate pump-and-dump scheme by Chainlink.\par \par \uc2 Amid the litany of fraudulent activities ascribed to the Chainlink hierarchy in the 66-page document, the purported asset management firm described the project as being \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto\u8217\'20\'19s Wirecard.\u8221\'20\'1D However, it is important to note that \uc2 Zeus Capital\uc2  is reportedly holding a short position with a target of a 99% price decline for LINK.\par \par \uc2 According to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheLinkMarine1/status/1284617098124308482"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweet}}}\uc2  by TheLinkMarine \u8212\'20\'14 a Chainlink proponent \u8212\'20\'14 the \uc2 Zeus Capital\uc2  report allegedly leads to an executive at lending protocol Nexo. Meanwhile, Nexo borrowed 350,000 LINK from DeFi lending market Aave only two days before the document was published. This purported link between the publisher of the document and Nexo does call the veracity of the claims made in the report into question. Excerpts from the piece seen by Cointelegraph before its removal urged readers to short LINK on Aave.\par \par \uc2 Possible LINK decline and what about XTZ?\par \par \uc2 Short sellers disparaging Chainlink aside, there are indications that LINK could be seeing a significant downward retracement. In a conversation with Cointelegraph, Thor Chan, the CEO of AAX \u8212\'20\'14 a crypto exchange \u8212\'20\'14 opined: \u8220\'20\'1CLooking closely at LINK/USD price charts, we can see that the RSI has hit the overbought level, and historically, with LINK, that has led to some steep price drops.\u8221\'20\'1D Anissimov also shared a similar sentiment, stating that LINK has entered the overbought zone, adding that:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDifferent sell signals are popping up within different time frames, such as the 3-day, 1-day, and 12-hour charts. These \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  formations indicate that Chainlink could be bound for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  impulse. However, LINK is currently in price discovery mode, so a corrective period that could see it retest the $5 support level, it will likely resume its uptrend and reach new all-time highs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As previously reported by Cointelegraph, LINK and Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xtz-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) often move in tandem. In July, XTZ also mirrored LINK\u8217\'20\'19s gains, having risen 35% since the start of the month. With alts like XTZ and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) experiencing significant uptrends, talk of another altseason has been gaining some traction.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardanos-ada-price-continues-upward-push-as-goguen-upgrade-approaches"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  Price Continues Upward Push as Goguen Upgrade Approaches}}}\par \par \uc2 However, Anissimov pointed to the relatively high BTC dominance as an argument against the start of any sustained altcoin resurgence, stating that only when BTC falls below 60%, he will acknowledge the start of an altcoin season: \u8220\'20\'1CDuring the last altseason, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s dominance plunged from 95% to 61.5% within a two-month period between March and May 2017, then it dropped to 50% two months later, and bottomed out at 35% in January 2018.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin remains tightly range-bound between the $9,000 and $9,200 price levels, altcoins like LINK, XTZ and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  can see significant upward potential, as investors look for a quick profit. However, the FOMO created by such sudden \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  advances often sees these altcoin tokens quickly enter massively overbought levels. At such points, these tokens become likely to see a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence form between their spot price action and relative strength index. What follows next is often a massive downward retrace almost as large as the preceding \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  advance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8yM2FjZmQ0NmViNmNjYTc4MDg1OGFjYjhkYWEyMDBmMS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200719eg7j0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BSV, LINK, LTC, BNB, CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,798 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and a few altcoins are showing signs of weakness, which could result in a minor dip in the next few days\par \par \uc2 Grayscale Investments recent Q2 report shows that the firm took in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-grayscale-report-digital-assets-fund-adds-905m-in-record-quarter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $905 million}}}\uc2  into Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and other altcoins. In Q1 of this year, the inflow into various Grayscale products was $503.7 million. The sharp increase in investments indicates that the institutional investors are building positions when the price of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap is stuck in a range as they expect it to rise in the future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ba0252aaab85faec476b82a37191dbba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, in the short-term, the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s policy actions might dictate the next directional move. Although the economy is showing signs of recovery, several sectors are still struggling as coronavirus cases surge across the world. Therefore, investors are hopeful that the Fed will extend the current {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-stocks-set-to-correct-if-fed-fails-to-extend-stimulus"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stimulus}}}\uc2  programs which are slated to end soon.\par \par \uc2 Any disappointment is likely to result in a sharp drop in the equity markets as investors rush to lock in their gains. As Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correlation with the S&P 500 is high, it could also follow suit and breakdown from its range. Such a move could also result in profit booking in the altcoins that have been outperforming Bitcoin for the past weeks.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually giving up ground in the past few days and has now reached the trendline of the ascending triangle. If this support breaks down, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fc445f7a6d9ede16470ad614e85d3a62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the trendline, the bears are likely to pounce on the opportunity and sink the BTC/USD pair to $8,638.79 and then to $8,130.58.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to aggressively defend the $8,130.58 support, which could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair bounces off the trendline and rises above the moving averages, a rally to the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone is likely. Without momentum, the likelihood of bulls scaling above this zone is bleak.\par \par \uc2 Although the price action is still dull, the pair has been falling gradually for the past few days, which suggests that the bears are attempting to make a comeback. With the price trading below both moving averages and the relative strength index below the 50 level, the advantage might be slightly shifting in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on July 16, which is a negative sign. This increases the possibility of a fall to the support of the $216.006\u8211\'20\'13$253.556 range. If the bulls defend the support at $216.006, the range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4fca1b6f2031e5ed4cdb04b3a066c4df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($236) has flattened out and the RSI has dipped just below the 50 level, which suggests a balance between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the support at $216.006, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can decline to $178.506.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the ETH/USD pair turns up from the current levels and breaks out of $253.556, a rally to $288.599 is likely. As the price is currently in the middle of the range, it is difficult to predict the direction of the next breakout.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to keep {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the moving averages. If they succeed and push the price above $0.20, a rally to $0.214616 is possible. If this level is also crossed, the altcoin can move up to $0.235688.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/015120b8da5d5674853c40ebe7017ef4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears defend the resistance at $0.214616, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could again drop to the moving averages and remain range-bound between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sustain the price below the moving averages, it can result in a drop to $0.17, which should act as a strong support but if the bears sink the price below it, the XRP/USD pair could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) dipped to the $217.55 support on July 16. The bulls are currently attempting to defend this support and if they succeed, the altcoin is likely to extend its stay inside the $217.55\u8211\'20\'13$246 range for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/76bb2c01431f2df2c39cbd9dfa5c3415.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($231) has started to slope down and the RSI has dipped into the negative territory, which suggests that bears have a slight advantage. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks below $217.55, a retest of $200 is likely.\par \par \uc2 A break above $246 will be the first sign of strength that can result in a move to $260 and then to $280.47. On the other hand, a break below $200 can start a new downtrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong uptrend and has formed a pennant, which is a continuation pattern. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fe63d561f0f6b8ff173f034815322a20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive the price above the pennant and $0.1380977, the uptrend is likely to resume. The first target objective is $0.173 and if that is scaled, the next target to watch out for is $0.20.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks below the pennant and the 20-day EMA ($0.113). Such a move will signal weakening momentum that could pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) slipped below both moving averages on July 16 and is currently finding support at $170. However, the failure of the altcoin to bounce off this support increases the possibility of a break below it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6dea2355a7976e0e676eea7c742a6d81.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the $170 support cracks, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can drop to the critical support at $146.20. Such a move will be a huge negative as it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 However, if BSV/USD bounces off $170 and rises above the downtrend line, the bulls will again try to carry the price to $200.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) resumed its uptrend on July 15 as it broke above the resistance at $8.48, however, the up move stalled at $8.9080. The altcoin formed an inside day candlestick pattern on July 16 and has been trading in a smaller range today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/de1f4a802159845f4b68eac4309d768f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, the inside day candlestick pattern is considered as a continuation pattern, with the breakout happening in the direction of the prevailing trend.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $8.9080, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to the $10\u8211\'20\'13$11 zone, which is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could weaken if the bears sink the price below $7.8309. Such a move could signal a deeper correction to $6.8221, which is the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of the most recent leg of the rally.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the $39\u8211\'20\'13$46 range for over a month. Currently, the price has dipped below both moving averages, which increases the possibility of a drop to the support of the range at $39.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5c84fa19bd396a2068ae6a01cd24f16c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend the $39 levels aggressively as this support has not been broken down convincingly since April 2. A strong bounce off this level will indicate that the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $39, a new downtrend is likely. Trading opportunities could present either on a strong bounce of $39 or on a breakout and close above $46. A new uptrend can be expected if the LTC/USD pair sustains above $51.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining below the breakout level of $18.20 for the past few days, which suggests that the breakout on July 12 was a bull trap. The only solace is that the bulls have managed to defend the 20-day EMA ($17) on the way down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0760143a57b0fca2a30dfdaea6816d03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again attempt to propel the price above the $18.20\u8211\'20\'13$19 resistance zone. If they succeed, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tenth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap is likely to rally to $21.50 and if this resistance is scaled, the next target to watch out for is $22.93.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price slips below the moving averages, the BNB/USD pair can correct to the trendline of the ascending triangle. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggests a range-bound action between the 50-day simple moving average ($16.70) and $18.20 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) remains in an uptrend with both moving averages sloping higher and the RSI in the positive territory. However, the failure of the bulls to push the price above $0.146157 indicates profit booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d6f3709799938f93392fdb02580a3779.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are now likely to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap towards the 20-day EMA ($0.135), which has acted as a strong support during previous corrections.\par \par \uc2 If the CRO/USD pair again takes support at the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to resume the uptrend by propelling the price above $0.146157. Above this level, a rally to $0.15306 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears break the 20-day EMA support, the pair can slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.119).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9lYTYzZGVmMGIwZDdiOTlmNzRjYWFlMGU1NmNjMzI2OC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200717eg7h000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  Price Continues Upward Push as Goguen Upgrade Approaches\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anirudh Tiwari \par \uc2 1,015 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price has rallied on the base of Shelley and \u8220\'20\'1Csmarter contracts,\u8221\'20\'1D but mainstream adoption is still a faraway goal\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  hitting its lowest since late 2018 has forced investors to turn to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-altseason-visualized-top-10-cryptos-outperforming-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins that could act as more lucrative investments}}}\uc2  in their portfolios. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been one of the largest benefactors of this move. Its price has rallied around 400% in 2020; its market capitalization has almost quadrupled to surpass Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bsv-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ); and it has become the fifth-largest cryptocurrency in circulation by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 The recent price rally has demonstrated the faith the community and industry have in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s roadmap, its vision and its founder, Charles Hoskinson. The project, however, is still in its nascent stages. There is still a lot for Cardano to prove in terms of executing its plans and gaining recognition among prominent entities like Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 However, Ryan Fung, the CEO of Ankr \u8212\'20\'14 a firm that provides cloud solutions for blockchain applications \u8212\'20\'14 feels more confident in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s proven abilities, the community and its network. Talking also of his holdings in Cardano, he stated:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe price rally has been tremendous, as it broke two resistance levels. We have been watching Cardano from more than a year with their development since the testnet till the mainnet. The network has emerged a lot, and the price rally has proved the strong market sentiment of the project and the trust community has got on the project.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Shelley upgrade and staking\par \par \uc2 The price rally in 2020 went rampant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-rallies-60-following-shelley-proof-of-stake-upgrade-announcement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 after the announcement of the Shelley upgrade}}}\uc2  on May 25 and even further when Cordano began releasing the code for Shelley on July 7. This upgrade is said to be unique because Cardano claims it will make the network from 50 to 100 times more decentralized than other prominent blockchains. It has also enabled staking to reach 1,000 stake pools.\par \par \uc2 In contrast with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/pow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proof-of-work}}}\uc2  algorithm, Cordano runs on a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/pos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proof-of-stake}}}\uc2  algorithm called Ouroboros. PoS is a method that secures a decentralized blockchain network by allowing people who hold that blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s tokens to validate transactions and blocks. This process allows stakers to earn tokens, also known as block rewards, proportional to the amount staked. Fung further commented that the implementation will open up competition for consumer adoption, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s a very bold and challenging move to implement. ETH has been trying to do this since more than 2-3 years now. But Cardano being able to achieve the consensus protocol on Proof of Stake algorithm is commendable.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s incentivized testnet was first {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://staking.cardano.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched}}}\uc2  back in December 2019 to enable staking rewards for engagement during the testing period of the Shelley upgrade. Currently, there are more than $13 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  staked on ITN.\par \par \uc2 Smarter contracts, the Goguen Era\par \par \uc2 The term \u8220\'20\'1Csmart contracts\u8221\'20\'1D was introduced about 26 years ago by cryptography expert Nick Szabo and has been one of the most integral developments in the crypto industry. Smart contracts are transaction protocols maintained by computers that are intended to automatically execute, control or document transactions according to the terms of the contract.\par \par \uc2 For Cardano, the implementation of the Goguen era will take smart contracts a step further to \u8220\'20\'1Csmarter contracts.\u8221\'20\'1D While smart contracts eliminate the need for manual intervention for interactions on a particular blockchain, the Goguen mechanism will not prioritize \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions and contracts over other tokens issued on Cardano, like Ethereum does for Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) over ERC-20 tokens.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-comes-shelley-ada-price-excels-with-cardano-upgrade-inbound"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here Comes \u8216\'20\'18Shelley\u8217\'20\'19: \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  Price Excels With Cardano Upgrade Inbound}}}\par \par \uc2 Bakyt Azimkanov, the communications and marketing director at Cardano, told Cointelegraph how the Goguen era will create use cases through decentralized application: \u8220\'20\'1CThe Goguen era will open the way for the development of enterprise-level and mission-critical decentralized smart contract applications, which is the first crucial step to building and deploying real-world solutions on Cardano.\u8221\'20\'1D Sumit Gupta, a co-founder and the CEO of CoinDCX, shared his opinion with Cointelegraph:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRather than being a single-asset ledger, Cardano will become a multi-asset ledger that allows users to define, forge and transfer their custom tokens on the network. The Goguen update will help developers build decentralized apps on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s blockchain network with greater flexibility.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This mechanism intends to provide developers with more security on the network, as all the tokens will inherit all the security and smart contract behaviors that Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native cryptocurrency, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , would have. Azimkanov stated on the matter:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn the deployment of decentralized applications built on top of blockchain protocols, smart contracts become particularly useful. By virtue of their trustless nature, users can interface with Web 3.0 applications without entrusting their sensitive information to the app developer, and the developer or smart contract creator receives guaranteed and automatic settlement at the point of contract maturity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Community interest rising\par \par \uc2 Cardano has been looking to solve issues previously encountered on other platforms like Ethereum and Ripple. This aspect enables the platform to bring more investors without diluting its base of believers who don\u8217\'20\'19t hold the coin to speculate or hedge against another bet in their portfolio.\par \par \uc2 Looking at the one-year ownership structure composition, it\u8217\'20\'19s clear that Cardano has seen continued support, with the proportion of hodlers consistently being over 50%. However, the proportion of traders has also been significantly rising in 2020, proving that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has started to see more \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in anticipation of the official launch of Shelley.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/10fb3f5e19a813b4cc5f983989fa3214.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ownership by time held}}}\par \par \uc2 Even Ryan Selkis, the founder and CEO of Messari, has recently stated that Cardano has \u8220\'20\'1Cplenty of room for growth\u8221\'20\'1D and that the recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/messari-ceo-cardano-has-plenty-of-room-for-growth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price surge highlights the excitement around staking}}}\uc2  ahead of the Shelley upgrade. An announcement that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders would be able to stake their assets in \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  custody by Q4 2020 has fueled speculation even further that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardanos-ada-may-be-listed-on-coinbase-before-the-end-of-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  may be listed on Coinbase}}}\uc2  by the end of this year.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-in-on-pos-blockchains-an-overview-of-crypto-staking-networks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Overview of Crypto Staking Networks}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9lNWRmZWYxNWU2YWVjNTc4YjYxYmY4MGYwYWY3N2FmOC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200716eg7g0008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Is High-Frequency Trading the Reason Bitcoin Has Become Boring?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Hisashi Oki \par \uc2 457 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The increasing use of HFT may help explain Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s record low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin (BTC) market has been quiet lately. A little too quiet.\par \par \uc2 As of Tuesday Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/macro-indicators-predict-btc-rally-as-bitcoin-price-volatility-sees-3-year-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  to levels unseen since 2017. In recent weeks, Bitcoin has fallen behind as investors piled into altcoins such as Chainlink (LINK) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) .\par \par \uc2 One possible explanation for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s consolidation may be an increased presence of high-frequency trading (HFT) firms in crypto in recent months. Speaking to Cointelegraph, Paolo Ardoino, CTO of Bitfinex explained that he believes HFT is a major reason behind Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn crypto, we are back to the old days of HFT before it became the zero-sum game that it has become today. In crypto HFT firms can make a lot of money deploying relatively straightforward plays, such as cross-exchange arbitrage and exploiting the spread between one exchange and another.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 HFT and cryptocurrency\par \par \uc2 HFT is a trading method that uses algorithms to transact a large number of orders in fractions of a second. It has existed in the cryptocurrency space for a long time. But just as billionaire Paul Tudor Jones {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitmex-ceo-expects-investors-to-follow-paul-tudor-jones-move-to-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  his Bitcoin holdings recently, other institutional investors are increasingly joining the market. This may explain the greater use of HFT.\par \par \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2 , which claims to be \u8220\'20\'1Chuge for HFT in crypto\u8221\'20\'1D, recently revealed that between 80 percent and 90 percent of volume on \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  was now generated by HFT firms. \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  partnered with Market Synergy and has been offering \u8220\'20\'1Cinstitutional standard cryptocurrency connectivity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  concludes the growing use of HFT represents increasing \u8220\'20\'1Cmaturity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  space\u8221\'20\'1D. But why would Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  go down with increased use of HFT? Ardoino explains the increased liquidity due to the surge of HFT tradings leads to low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs Bitcoin becomes an established asset class, we anticipate the high levels of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  associated with cryptocurrency to recede,\u8221\'20\'1D he explained. \u8220\'20\'1CThere is generally an inverse correlation between liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 ; i.e., higher liquidity tends to lead to lower price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe increasing presence of HFT firms in crypto seems to have added more liquidity to crypto exchanges. This provides sufficient orders for both sides of the order book and increases market efficiency, contributing to prolonged low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  price consolidation in Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is famous for moving aggressively for a short period of time. Last year, Tom Lee of Fundstrat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fundstrats-tom-lee-reminds-us-of-bitcoins-ten-best-days-rule"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reminded}}}\uc2  investors that the majority of Bitcoin (BTC) gains come in the ten best trading days of the year. However, the growing presence of HFT may be changing the \u8220\'20\'1Crule of 10 best days\u8221\'20\'1D as well.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81ZmE5ZjBhMDE5MTU4Y2U0ZDE4OWZkYWJiNjQ0NWNhOC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200716eg7g00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/15: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BSV, LINK, LTC, BNB, CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,774 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Select altcoins are showing strength and if Bitcoin price perks up a fast paced, market-wide rally could occur\par \par \uc2 The People\u8217\'20\'19s Bank of China\uc2  (PBoC) is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/china-to-test-digital-yuan-on-food-delivery-platform-with-435-million-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rumored}}}\uc2  to be working with food delivery giant \uc2 Meituan Dianping\uc2  and ride-hailing application DiDi to test the digital yuan. Currently, \uc2 Meituan Dianping\uc2  is estimated to have more than 435 million users.\par \par \uc2 Video streaming platform, Bilibili, could also be the next to join the project. Although the PBoC has not committed to a specific launch date, the coronavirus pandemic seems to have accelerated the project.\par \par \uc2 Following China\u8217\'20\'19s progress on the central bank digital currency, Japan has also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japanese-government-set-to-include-cbdc-in-official-economic-plan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expedited}}}\uc2  its efforts to launch a digital yen. The Japanese government could add the development of the CBDC to the Honebuto Plan, which is the basis for Japanese economic and fiscal policy.\par \par \uc2 After these two nations launch working models of their CBDC projects, it is likely that other countries will follow suit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bd1b97e2f53d3112ca06d8c11e1e0461.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As reported earlier this week, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) realized \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has dropped to a three-year-low, hence, in the short-term, both the U.S. equity markets and gold might outperform the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 However, every low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  period is usually followed by a \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  expansion. This means when the next trending phase starts its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/macro-indicators-predict-btc-rally-as-bitcoin-price-volatility-sees-3-year-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strength}}}\uc2  is likely to surprise the traders.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been hovering close to the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,259) for the past few days and the relative strength index has flatlined, which suggests that both the bulls and the bears are waiting for a trigger to make the next move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4f4de448442ac2016f797791fe899f17.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Without a trigger, the bulls might find it difficult to push the price above the stiff overhead resistance zone of $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500. If the price turns down from this resistance zone, the BTC/USD pair might remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 However, with a strong trigger, the pair might rally above the overhead resistance zone and a new sustained uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break below the trendline of the ascending triangle will signal advantage to the bears. However, without a strong trigger in their favor, the possibility of a break below the critical support at $8,130.58 is low.\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the timing of the next trigger. Until then, the price is likely to trade inside the $8,130.58\u8211\'20\'13$10,000 range.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 20-day EMA ($236) for the past few days but the bulls have not been able to challenge the resistance at $253.556. This has kept the biggest altcoin stuck inside the $216.006\u8211\'20\'13$253.556 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/241d55d8229f9a54395199731c4f907c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above $253.556 will be the first indication that the bulls have overpowered the bears as they are confident of a possible rally to $288.599. If the momentum can clear this resistance, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $320.\par \par \uc2 However, if the ETH/USD pair does not bounce off the current levels within the next few days, it could result in a break below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair can drop to the critical support at $216.006, which is likely to be defended aggressively by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not sustain the strength in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  on July 13, which suggests hesitation at higher levels. However, the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the moving average, which is a mild positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0fbf2de39b557e0e3a0df7de48905a99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.214616, the uptrend is likely to resume with a target objective of $0.235688.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.192) is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests that the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the XRP/USD pair below the moving averages. Such a move can again pull down the pair to $0.17.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on July 13 and is now likely to correct to the immediate support at $217.55. If this support holds, the altcoin could remain range-bound between $217.55\u8211\'20\'13$246 for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9f320d22cc6c9cc9340e47d23eb1f920.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $217.55, a drop to the next support at $200 is possible. If this support breaks down, a new downtrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a breakout and close (UTC time) above $246. This will pave way for a possible rally to $260 and then to $280.47. The bulls will have to propel the BCH/USD pair above $280.47 to start a new uptrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at the current highs of $0.1380977 but the bears have not been able to sink the price below $0.12, which shows strong buying by the bulls on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fb5395bc7f536c6b4a44f8c4034a82a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The uptrend remains strong with both moving averages sloping up and the RSI in the overbought territory. This suggests that the path of least resistance is to the upside. On a break above $0.1380977, the first target is $0.173 and then $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $0.1380977, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap might remain range-bound between $0.11\u8211\'20\'13$0.1380977 for a few days. A break below $0.11 will be the first sign that the current uptrend is weakening.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has failed to bounce off the 20-day EMA ($177), which shows a lack of demand at higher levels. If the altcoin does not rise from the current levels in the next few days, the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA increases.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6a2c148024dbd16305d23267d3a6ab1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA and the $170 support, a drop to $146.20 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BSV/USD pair rebounds off the current levels, the bulls will try to carry it to $200 and a break above this level can result in a move to $227.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand. Therefore, the pair might remain in a tight range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 As suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-13-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ada-bsv-bnb-ltc-cro-link"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis, the bulls defended the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $7.0023, which is a huge positive. This suggests that the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction in Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) to establish fresh positions and the uptrend is intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/688cd8bd1071378e6fb0a5ba4332f297.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently attempting to defend the overhead resistance at $8.48 but if the bulls can sustain the price above this level, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI is deep in the overbought territory, which warrants caution. If the LINK/USD pair struggles to sustain above $8.48, it might enter a few days of consolidation or a minor correction.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) again failed to break above the immediate resistance of $46 on July 13, which shows that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance. Repeated failure to break above a resistance usually attracts profit booking from the short-term bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7504cda76a5c16893e443b70817d0560.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has dropped close to the first support at $42.50. If the price bounces off this support, the bulls will make another attempt to clear the overhead resistance at $46.\par \par \uc2 However, if the $42.50 support cracks, a drop to the critical support at $39 is possible. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the 50 level points to a balance between both the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to start on a breakdown below $39 or on a breakout above $51. Until then, the range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears could not sustain the breakout above $18.20, which shows a lack of demand at higher levels. However, if Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($16.94), the bulls will make another attempt to push the price back above $18.20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e33991810505cdf1aa517dd0ad320487.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tenth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap can rally to $21.50 and then to $22.93.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, which indicates that bulls have a slight advantage.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bears sink the BNB/USD pair below the 20-day EMA. In such a case a drop to the trendline of the ascending triangle is possible.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 In a strong uptrend, the pullbacks usually last between one to three days. After correcting for three days, Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to resume the uptrend. A break above the recent high of $0.146157 will confirm a new move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/665b861c5cfd88bdcd3be1a50aa10193.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next target objective on the upside is $0.15306 and if that resistance is crossed, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $0.20. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the bears defend the $0.146157 level aggressively, the CRO/USD pair can turn down and dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.133). A break below this support will be the first sign that the momentum is weakening .\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9hMGNmMzFlY2EzMTk2OWNhMDBlM2E1YWI1NTNhYmMyMS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200715eg7f000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Macro Indicators Predict BTC Rally as Bitcoin Price  \highlight22\uc2 Volatility \highlight\uc2  Sees 3-Year Low\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Joseph Young \par \uc2 1,277 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Four macro indicators suggest a Bitcoin uptrend is near, following nearly two months of stagnation in a tight range\par \par \uc2 Since early May, the price of Bitcoin has been at a standstill in a tight range between $8,500 and $10,000. For most of the past month, BTC has remained between $9,000 and $9,500 as realized \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a three-year low.\par \par \uc2 According to Skew, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tesla-eating-bitcoins-lunch-as-realized-volatility-hits-3-year-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  of Bitcoin has dropped to levels unseen since 2017}}}\uc2 . Researchers at Skew {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/skewdotcom/status/1282991051268128771"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1C#bitcoin realized \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a three years low, Tesla is eating Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s lunch!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/13056dabd0be18e87f99a8e748478033.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The realized \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  of Bitcoin hits a three-year-low}}}\par \par \uc2 The realized \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Bitcoin hits a three-year-low. Source: Skew.com\par \par \uc2 The multiyear low level of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid strong rallies of altcoins prompted expectations of a large price movement. In recent weeks, altcoins such as Chainlink (LINK), Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xtz-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) outperformed both Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ). LINK, for example, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-chainlink-link-a-bubble-on-chain-data-and-defi-suggest-otherwise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 achieved a new all-time high in the second week of July}}}\uc2 , despite the stagnant crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Based on the increase in appetite for cryptocurrencies with low market capitalizations, traders generally expect Bitcoin to see a spike in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Skew data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/skewdotcom/status/1282992293889347586"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  that major Bitcoin futures exchanges such as Bybit have seen a gradual increase in open interest.\par \par \uc2 The term open interest refers to the total amount of long and short contracts open in the futures market. The open interest of BitMEX and Bybit rising to $650 million and $500 million, respectively, indicates futures traders anticipate \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon. As various metrics point toward a decisive Bitcoin price movement, four key macro indicators suggest an uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5f0587802ba3bc675a1b560eeb1bf91c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Many fundamental factors align with a \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  Bitcoin sentiment}}}\par \par \uc2 Many fundamental factors align with a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Bitcoin sentiment. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://insights.glassnode.com/content/images/size/w2400/2020/07/Week-28_-Glassnode-Compass--1-.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Glassnode}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin network hash rate hits an all-time high\par \par \uc2 Data from Blockchain.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blockchain.com/charts/hash-rate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  the hash rate of the Bitcoin blockchain network hit a new record high on July 8, reaching 125.99 million terahashes per second. It surpassed the previous all-time high set in the first week of March, moments before BTC fell below $3,600 on Black Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The hash rate of Bitcoin surging to a new high so quickly after the block reward halving on May 11 carries weight. A halving typically leads to a substantial decline in hash rate because it overnight cuts in half the amount of BTC that miners can mine. After a halving, miners mine less BTC and generate less revenue, but their cost of mining remains the same. As such, analysts anticipated the hash rate would drop for a relatively long period throughout 2020.\par \par \uc2 Indeed, after the halving, the hash rate dropped to as low as 90.29 million TH/s. Within less than two months, it hit a new peak, indicating that the mining sector remains healthy and the probability of a death spiral is extremely low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/195345252b5e59c56dfe31fd1c37ef61.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin blockchain network hash rate hits an all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin blockchain network hash rate hits an all-time high. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blockchain.com/charts/hash-rate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchain.com}}}\par \par \uc2 A death spiral phenomenon, which occurs when the majority of miners in the Bitcoin network stop mining altogether, was also feared to be in the cards. Theoretically, a death spiral could occur if mining becomes largely unprofitable within a short period.\par \par \uc2 But possibly due to the rainy season in Sichuan, China that has decreased electricity costs, miners have recovered rapidly from the halving, reducing the likelihood of a sudden sell-off, which might drop the selling pressure on Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Extended ranges previously led to rallies\par \par \uc2 According to a chart {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pladizow/status/1282669042776629251"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 published}}}\uc2  by Bitcoin trader \u8220\'20\'1CNunya Bizniz,\u8221\'20\'1D the price of BTC historically saw extended ranges after a halving, which have led to substantial rallies in the past.\par \par \uc2 Currently, Bitcoin is entering its 10th week in a tight range. It saw a six-week range and a 15-week range in 2012 and 2016, respectively. Both ranges led to significant rallies within a few months. Nunya Bizniz wrote: \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin being Bitcoin. Sideways price action after the halving is the norm, as BTC now enters its 10th week in a tight range. When rocket?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 An extended tight range is considered to be an optimistic trend because it builds up a foundation for a stronger rally. When BTC rallies on the back of a short-lived range, it could leave it vulnerable to a steep correction.\par \par \uc2 The Hash Ribbons buy signal confirmed\par \par \uc2 On July 13, Charles Edwards, \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Capriole, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/caprioleio/status/1282464798396030977"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that the highly anticipated Hash Ribbons buy signal was confirmed. Edwards, who created the indicator, wrote in a tweet: \u8220\'20\'1C#Bitcoin Hash Ribbons \u8216\'20\'18Buy\u8217\'20\'19 signal just confirmed. The post-Halving signal is particularly special. It will probably be a very long time until the next occurs. ...and so the great bull run begins.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Hash Ribbons indicator spots the low point of Bitcoin by predicting a potential miner capitulation through the evaluation of the hash rate. The indicator is based on a theory that BTC tends to bottom out after miners sell-off, or after the hash rate of BTC reaches a low point. Both the record-high hash rate of Bitcoin and the Hash Ribbon buy signal indicate miners have already gone through a sell-off phase.\par \par \uc2 Record withdrawals equal mass HODLing\par \par \uc2 The \u8220\'20\'1CHODLwave\u8221\'20\'1D chart created by cryptocurrency investor Willy Woo {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://charts.woobull.com/bitcoin-hodl-waves/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 demonstrates}}}\uc2  an increase in newfound demand for Bitcoin. The lower HODLwaves tend to increase during a market bottom because new money enters the market. On his website, Woo explains the model: \u8220\'20\'1CThe upper contours, represent supply (old coins that have remained unmoved) while the lower contours represent new demand (coins that have recently shifted). The composite view clearly shows each bull cycle bringing in new demand.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e0792e21eab233d7fcc221994f158a8c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HODLwaves indicate an inflow of new capital into the Bitcoin market}}}\par \par \uc2 HODLwaves indicate an inflow of new capital into the Bitcoin market. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://charts.woobull.com/bitcoin-hodl-waves/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Woobull.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Various data points suggest that long-time investors in Bitcoin are increasingly holding onto BTC as the market sees a consistent inflow of new investors. The data indicates that BTC could be in an accumulation phase, wherein existing and new investors foresee a long-term bull market.\par \par \uc2 Alistair Milne, chief investment officer of Altana Digital Currency Fund, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/alistairmilne/status/1282630594107781121"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  that HODLing activity indicates a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Bitcoin trend. Likewise, Rafael Schultze-Kraft, chief technical officer of on-chain market analysis firm Glassnode, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/n3ocortex/status/1282721737596178432"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 agrees}}}\uc2  based on on-chain data points:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBTC supply not moved in over a year: 62%. BTC supply in a state of profit: 77%. Read: Many investors could be profitably cashing out, but instead choose to hodl. How can you not be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on #Bitcoin?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 External variables\par \par \uc2 Researchers at Glassnode found that external market forces are seemingly slowing Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s uptrend, as Liesl Eichholz, who is responsible for growth strategy at the company, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://insights.glassnode.com/the-week-on-chain-week-28-2020/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  in a newsletter: \u8220\'20\'1CExternal market forces such as systemic uncertainty and unknown correlations with traditional markets may prevent BTC from breaking out at this stage, but signals remain strong nonetheless.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported on July 15, technical indicators suggest that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stocks-td9-sell-sign-flashes-yet-bitcoin-traders-expect-higher-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the United States stock market rally is overheated}}}\uc2 . If equities drop, considering the recent correlation between Bitcoin and equities, BTC could become increasingly vulnerable to a near-term correction.\par \par \uc2 There is an external risk that a potential pullback in the U.S. stock market could cause the appetite for risk-on assets to drop. But a confluence of record-high hash rate, rising HODLing activity, the Hash Ribbons buy signal and historical Bitcoin price patterns have many investors optimistic heading into the fourth quarter of 2020.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy85OGM4MDlkZWY0ZmNiZGRiMWU5YWQyNmYyMGVkZGM2NC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200715eg7f0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/13: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BSV, BNB, LTC, CRO, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,807 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Equities markets are surging and many altcoins continue to push higher as Bitcoin price consolidates into a tight trading range\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/u.s.-stocks-move-sharply-higher-on-vaccine-news-nasdaq-hits-new-record-high-2020-07-13"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nasdaq}}}\uc2  has regularly been making new highs for the past few days, which has resulted in a strong rally in a few technology companies. Along with this, a few stocks in the S&P 500 are also on a tear, pushing their valuations to astronomical levels.\par \par \uc2 While the U.S. equity markets are on a strong footing, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/article/global-precious/precious-gold-gains-above-1800-oz-as-infection-cases-mount-idUSL3N2EK2YM"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gold}}}\uc2  is not to be left behind. It has also risen to a nine-year high, which shows that assets that are perceived as risky and safe havens, both are rallying at the same time. Ultimately, this proves that an abundant money supply is finding its way into these asset classes.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c95ea040c17a257013d7e05790e76f47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, there is a limit to how high both asset classes can go before they start to look overextended. With the money supply likely to remain high for a few more years, the attention of investors could shift towards cryptocurrencies and if even if a small portion of this excess liquidity flows into cryptocurrencies, their prices are likely to surge.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The Bollinger band is a good indicator to show how every consolidation (marked as ellipses on the chart) has been followed by a trending move. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) consolidated for about four months from December 2018 to March 2019 near the lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/37e4cd34a48ab993a5116afcad0c2ebb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This long period of consolidation resolved to the upside and started a strong trending move that continued till June 2019 before topping out at $13,973.50. After that, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap has entered several periods of consolidation and almost every time, the breakout has resulted in a trending move.\par \par \uc2 The current period of consolidation is also likely to result in a strong move. If the consolidation resolves to the upside, the possibility of a break above the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 resistance is high.\par \par \uc2 Such a move could result in a breakout of the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, which is another positive.\par \par \uc2 Even though the bulls have not been able to break above the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 resistance zone, the BTC to USD pair has been trading near the resistance levels, which suggests that the bulls are in no urgency to close their positions.\par \par \uc2 While the structure of the chart is positive, there are no guarantees in trading. Hence, traders should also be aware of other possibilities. If the resolution of the range happens to the downside, then, it will be a huge negative. The bears will be further emboldened if the support at $8,130.58 cracks.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($236) usually acts as a support in an uptrend as the bulls buy the dips to this level. Although Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is currently trading inside the $216.006\u8211\'20\'13$253.556 range, the bulls are defending the 20-day EMA, which hints at a possible change in trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/eaa4d6f9b6cd54e7ac994ec65e8d11c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout of $253.556 will indicate the resumption of the uptrend that has a target objective of $288.599. If the momentum can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above this level, a rally to $320 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index in the positive territory suggest that the bulls have a minor advantage.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and slips below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  bounced off the 50-day simple moving average ($0.19), which is a positive sign as it shows that the sentiment has changed from sell on rallies to buy on dips. The 20-day EMA ($0.19) has turned up and the RSI has risen above the 60 level, which suggests that bulls are making a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f21f26f7bfc815000cdb0871330ac02d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above the overhead resistance of $0.214616 will signal strength and increase the possibility of a rally to $0.235688.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears defend the resistance at $0.214616, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could remain range-bound for a few days. The XRP/USD pair will indicate weakness on a break below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has held the 20-day EMA ($234) for the past four days but the altcoin has failed to bounce strongly from this support, which indicates a lack of urgency among the bulls to buy at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e28a350307555a455387fa31f29893ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, a drop to the $217.55 levels is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the price above the overhead resistance at $245.49, a rally to $260 and then to $280.47 is likely.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI has been trading close to the midpoint, which suggests a balance between demand and supply.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The pullback to the breakout level of $0.11 was purchased aggressively by the bulls, which is a huge positive. Now, this level becomes the new floor for Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and a break below it could threaten the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5d630d80cfaa763c2d18287df843e1fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $0.1380977, the uptrend is likely to resume. Above this level, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $0.173 and then to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate that the bulls are in command. However, if the bears defend the $0.1380977 level, then the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair is likely to consolidate for a few days before attempting to resume its uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The pullback in Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) stalled at the 20-day EMA ($176) but the bounce off this level lacks strength, which indicates that the buyers are not confident that the rally will resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bb4812816e8a3e6208c9a488ebb8acab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap fails to break above $200, it is likely to consolidate between $170\u8211\'20\'13$200 for a few days. A break below $170 will signal weakness and could result in a drop to $146.20.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls propel the price above $200, the BSV/USD pair can rally to $227. A break above this level is likely to result in a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 After three months of consolidation, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the overhead resistance at $18.20, which is a huge positive. If the price closes (UTC time) above $18.20, it will complete an ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $22.93.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b1fa447c9ceee73b88b44f4cbb3166c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($16.79) is sloping up and the RSI has risen into the overbought zone for the first time since mid-Feb., which suggests that the trend might be changing in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels and dips back below $18.20. If that happens, it will indicate a lack of demand at higher levels and point to a few more days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at $45.3501, however, the positive thing is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($43.61) for the past few days, which indicates accumulation on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e9cc0d295b4a048b7cb3a548c93a091b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $45.3501, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $51, which is again likely to act as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the range-bound action could continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair has been an underperformer, which indicates a lack of buying interest. If the pair fails to sustain above $45.3501, it is likely to break below the 20-day EMA and remain stuck in the bottom half of the $39\u8211\'20\'13$51 range.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing signs of profit booking at $0.146157, which could drag the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.132). This is an important support because the bears have not been able to sustain the price below it for the past many weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bdf13055c61da5436086059f8f581d7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , hence, the sentiment is to buy the dips. If the bulls purchase the dip to the 20-day EMA aggressively, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to resume the up move and rally to $0.15306.\par \par \uc2 However, the CRO/USD pair has covered a lot of distance from its March lows, hence, if the traders decide to take some money off the table, then a break below the 20-day EMA is possible. If this support cracks, the correction can extend to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend, which has sent the altcoin skyrocketing into the top ten list of cryptocurrencies. However, due to the sharp up move of the past few days, the RSI has risen deep into overbought territory, which suggests that a consolidation or a minor correction is likely in the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/94fe9f55bbfb60ebf7bd6c95f17432e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is facing resistance at $8.48, which is just below the target objective of $8.5446 as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-link-atom-xlm-bnb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bulls are likely to aggressively defend the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $7.0023. If the LINK/USD pair turns around from this support, the uptrend is likely to resume.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sustain the price below $7.0023, then it could weaken the momentum and result in a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy80MWUwNTljOGI2NzMxYzBlNTBiOGNhOGFmNWZhMDMwNi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200713eg7d0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Significant\u8217\'20\'19 Ethereum Rally Signals New Altcoin Season \u8212\'20\'14 Peter Brandt\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Joseph Young \par \uc2 642 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum price saw a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout against Bitcoin on July 9 and veteran trader Peter Brandt believes this could trigger a new altcoin season\par \par \uc2 Popular trader Peter Brandt believes that Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) saw a significant breakout in its ETH- {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  pair on July 9. According to the veteran trader, the breakout could be a signal that a new altcoin season could occur in the near-term.\par \par \uc2 Brandt {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PeterLBrandt/status/1280954525801684994?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSignificant breakout in ETH-BTC with target of .03276 BTC. Most alts should gain on Bitcoin in near future.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8b936b3256e2025858435244ec617855.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH-BTC daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH-BTC daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PeterLBrandt/status/1280954525801684994/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Peter Brandt}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong performance of alternative cryptocurrencies in recent weeks coincides with an Ether rally and the expectation that upcoming network upgrades will solve the scaling issues that plague the network during peak transaction phases.\par \par \uc2 Cardano, Kyber Network, Compound, and Chainlink surge as Ether rallies\par \par \uc2 In the past week Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Kyber Network ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/kyber-network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 KNC}}}\uc2  ), Compound ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/compound/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 COMP}}}\uc2  ), and Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) four major altcoins recorded substantial gains against the U.S. dollar, Bitcoin, and Ether.\par \par \uc2 All four cryptocurrencies had key network upgrades, product launches, or high-profile announcements which drove their values higher.\par \par \uc2 Cardano, for instance, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-cardano-ada-suddenly-surged-by-85-in-10-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transferred a node containing all the changes of its Shelley upgrade}}}\uc2  onto the mainnet. On July 30, a hard fork on the Cardano blockchain will finalize the highly-anticipated Shelley upgrade. This positions Cardano to rival Ethereum as an established proof-of-stake (PoS) network.\par \par \uc2 Kyber Network also rallied after the release of Katalyst. To put it simply, Katalyst allows users to stake KNC in order to participate in KyberDAO and benefit from various incentives. In theory, it is similar to the staking mechanism of Ethereum 2.0.\par \par \uc2 Crypto market research firm Santiment {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/santimentfeed/status/1281035217247952898"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CKNC's top 100 non-exchange addresses have spiked since Katalyst, and it appears that the top 10 overall holders have upped their ownership of the total supply from 48.6% 48 hours ago, to 52.2% (over half) of the total supply at today's market close.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/452faec12878f93076c51d6b2b709063.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kyber Network demonstrates a highly optimistic on-chain trend}}}\par \par \uc2 Kyber Network demonstrates a highly optimistic on-chain trend. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/santimentfeed/status/1281035217247952898/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Santiment}}}\par \par \uc2 The positive sentiment around alternative cryptocurrencies combined with exploding demand for decentralized finance-related tokens seems to have added to the confidence of investors.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/binance/status/1281362496016744450?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data from Binance Futures}}}\uc2 , investors remain majority long on many altcoin pairs. In fact, more than 50% of traders on the platform are holding long contracts on LINK, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , KNC, and COMP.\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market structure could further benefit altcoins\par \par \uc2 Some traders predict the Ether rally will continue in the third quarter of 2020 due to a favorable market structure and currently the altcoin is testing a significant multi-year resistance level at $250. The altcoin briefly broke above this level three times in the past two weeks.\par \par \uc2 The last two times the price of ETH cleanly surpassed $250, it led to rallies to above $280 and $360.\par \par \uc2 Traders are seemingly optimistic on the near-term trend of Ether as the altcoin has weakened a key resistance level with multiple retests. This is because when a support or resistance level gets tested many times in a short period, the probability of it being broken rises.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/647ab2ed6a9f783cf2e16d184bf8e12f.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A comparison of ETH-USD fractals}}}\par \par \uc2 A comparison of ETH-USD fractals. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ByzGeneral/status/1281203684920131584/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Byzantine General}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView.com}}}\par \par \uc2 The increasing number of altcoins enabling staking in the wake rapid growth in the DeFi sector and the expectations of an Ether rally could support a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in the altcoin market.\par \par \uc2 Ether trading volume has also remained relatively high throughout the past ten days as the price hovers above $240. This suggests that buyers are keen to push the price higher despite strong selling pressure at a key resistance area.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy85MTNlNGVjYjc0NmYwMjkxNzA4MWMxZjBhZmU2NjZkMC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200710eg7a00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bad Day for Stocks Sends Bitcoin Price Below Key $9.3K Support\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Ray Salmond \par \uc2 395 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price dropped below $9,200 as stocks were rattled by the \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court\uc2  decision on President Trump\u8217\'20\'19s tax returns\par \par \uc2 Today Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price abruptly dropped 2.93% to $9,160 before traders stepped in to push the price back to the $9,200 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e67bb391efd4b24211f27ee976836d4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-ulidnkh4e5_1594320915880"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The mild correction occurred as the Dow pulled back 370 points and the S&P 500 and Nasdaq also saw small losses. Gold also pulled back 0.92% but still is only $17 away from its recent high at $1,818.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1fedfbe9bb5182a526e24bb7830c386f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BitMEX XBT-USD Liquidations. Source: Skew}}}\par \par \uc2 BitMEX XBT-USD Liquidations. Source: Skew\par \par \uc2 The drop below $9,200 resulted in $15 million in BitMEX liquidations and at the time of writing the price is pinched between the 100-MA and the descending trendline from the local high at $10,376.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2f6e0f493d12e1cfbc132c2d0c3f8df6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As shown on the 4-hour timeframe, there is a neutral doji candlestick, showing bulls and bears are in contention on the direction Bitcoin price will take.\par \par \uc2 Also, on the hourly time frame the RSI has dipped into oversold territory and traders will likely look for an oversold bounce shortly.\par \par \uc2 In such a situation, traders will need to keep an eye on trading volume as the price will need to clear the 20-MA ($9,300) to restore the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum seen on June 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/69f0da168bfd579cf74fe2506d2dc2fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Macro Assets Current Year Returns (%). Source: Skew}}}\par \par \uc2 Macro Assets Current Year Returns (%). Source: Skew\par \par \uc2 Despite the slight blip in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action, the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains the top performing asset year-to-date with a 28.21% return.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5641c1d3671fc6dbb6ef88a0a972bf8c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin price corrected, many altcoins also took a breather after a stellar week which saw many post double-digit gains. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pulled back 2.37%, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped by 7.37%, and Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) lost 4.52%.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 , the overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $271.5 billion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 62.8%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82ZDIyMzAyYjlkYTc5YWI0MGNhNTUzYWI4Y2QzMmI1Zi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200709eg79000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Litecoin\par \b \uc2 If Crypto Traders Abandoned \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  Why Are Investors Hoarding LTC?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 1,032 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 On-chain and trading data signal that traders have abandoned \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , but for some reason long-term investors are hoarding LTC\par \par \uc2 Price wise, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has had a pretty rough year and currently the altcoin is down 51% over the past twelve months. The lack of \uc2 GitHub\uc2  activity and planned protocol upgrades have Litecoin co-founder Charlie Lee to admit 2019 saw a historic low in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-founder-charlie-lee-addresses-project-abandonment-allegations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 number of developers working}}}\uc2  on \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  Core, the software behind network nodes.\par \par \uc2 The beginning of 2020 was no different and Charlie Lee asked for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-creator-proposes-miners-voluntarily-donate-1-for-development"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 voluntary LTC miner donations}}}\uc2  to help boost development funding. Uncertainties regarding \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 's future have caused investors to lose interest in the project and this is reflected both on-chain and in LTC\u8217\'20\'19s trading metrics.\par \par \uc2 The interesting thing is, even though most would consider investors\u8217\'20\'19 disinterest a negative driver, some have been quietly hoarding LTC.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  trading volume drops to a 2-year low\par \par \uc2 Volume is the single most relevant indicator of traders' interest and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  has been failing miserably in this area. Traded volume on major exchanges has been trending down for the past twelve months and has recently dropped to its lowest level in two years.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/65f008bf61be8def2f7a55b42a270be5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin 30-day average volume}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  30-day average volume. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCBTC/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ranks third on Nomic transparent trading volume at $80 million per day. This is 50% above Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  but the figure remains 45% below the previous eleven months when there was $146 million in daily volume on average.\par \par \uc2 A number of reasons could be behind the drastic change and it should be noted that even lower activity on exchanges does not necessarily translate to less blockchain usage, that has been the case.\par \par \uc2 On-chain metrics provide realistic insights into transfers, fees, active addresses, and many useful indicators that will be of interest to traders.\par \par \uc2 Adjusted transfer value\par \par \uc2 Transfer value is a leading on-chain indicator measuring user activity as it adds up all coins moved daily. CoinMetrics analysis provides more precise data by adjusting these figures to exclude mixers and transactions between the same entities.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8d7ff125451f46937a6b590fbbb6412f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin daily adjusted transfer sum 14-day average}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  daily adjusted transfer sum 14-day average. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmetrics.io/charts/#assets=ltc_log=false_roll=14_left=TxTfrValAdjUSD_zoom=1521406102867.9536,1594425452777.462"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMetrics}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily adjusted transfers have been hovering around $20 million which is 83% below peak 2019 levels. The current level is comparable to Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xtz-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ), a much newer and smaller cryptocurrency whose primary use-case has nothing to do with fast or cheap transactions.\par \par \uc2 A noticeable drop in transaction fees\par \par \uc2 Charlie Lee's proposal included smaller block intervals than Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and a simpler algorithm which removed the signature from the original data for a higher transaction output.\par \par \uc2 Such a move might have brought substantial interest in \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) in the past but it is no longer valid as users became aware that 270 confirmations were required to match the computing power behind 3 Bitcoin mined blocks, according to Luke Childs' How Many Confirmations analysis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0c692aef33213323f22063ea02f52d94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin mean fees per transaction 14-day average (USD)}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  mean fees per transaction 14-day average (USD). Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmetrics.io/charts/#assets=ltc_roll=14_left=FeeMeanUSD_zoom=1455083806083.5122,1594451931030.9214"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinmetrics}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC\u8217\'20\'19s mean fees per transaction dropped to $0.011 which is the lowest level since October 2015. Although many reasons could be behind this, including 75% SegWit usage, the previous daily transfer value analysis points to weak demand from its users.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s median block size exceeds 1.2 megabytes most of the time, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  averages below 0.2 megabytes despite both having similar capacity.\par \par \uc2 Low usage translates to small fees, reducing miners' interest and resulting in a negative feedback loop as investors pay attention to the processing power behind each blockchain.\par \par \uc2 Reduced hashrate\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4516f7a001fe82d8b947f3e0068fefdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin hashrate}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  hashrate. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinwarz.com/mining/litecoin/hashrate-chart"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinWarz}}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  hashrate decreased by 45% since its October 2019 halving, which usually raises concerns of 51% attacks. This unused processing power capability could theoretically be used to compete with honest miners.\par \par \uc2 Either way, there's no positive read of fewer miners directing investments towards \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 . Unlike trading, mining activity is exclusively a long-term commitment as the payout usually exceeds a quarter and sometimes an entire year.\par \par \uc2 Investors are hoarding instead of dumping LTC\par \par \uc2 After so many negative indicators, one would expect holders' activity to display weakness as both the price and network usage have been trending down for over a year.\par \par \uc2 One could also mention the lackluster performance of recent code advancements, including the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-foundation-pitches-opt-in-mimblewimble-via-extension-blocks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MimbleWimble-technology privacy capability}}}\uc2  proposed in October 2019.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8f68de0325e5031012bfab7aaf9e2bcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin unspent UTXO age}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  unspent UTXO age. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.investificar.com.br/preco-do-litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investificar.com.br}}}\par \par \uc2 Oddly enough, the opposite holds, as 63.8% of \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  supply remains untouched in the past 12 months. In fact, this is the highest level ever.\par \par \uc2 According to the above Hodl Wave chart, also known as the UTXO age distribution chart, the percentage of coins that haven't moved is increasing at an extraordinary pace.\par \par \uc2 The number of coins unmoved for 12 or more months at the beginning of 2020 stood at 56.7%. This additional 7% held by long term-investors is currently valued at $209 million which is enough to acquire 30% of the entire {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/dash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DASH}}}\uc2  supply.\par \par \uc2 There's no way to assure the rationale behind such hoarding activity, but its impact over circulating supply is a net positive.\par \par \uc2 This activity doesn't change the fact that the same amount of LTC will continue to be mined every day until next halving in 2023, nevertheless it provides a critical price support level.\par \par \uc2 Recently, investors have been speculating about a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/could-a-cardano-litecoin-team-up-be-in-the-works"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 potential Litecoin integration with Cardano}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and if true, this could be a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  factor for \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 There is also the possibility of a crypto-market bull trend occurring and as investors begin to speak about an \u8216\'20\'18alt season\u8217\'20\'19 starting, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  might face increased odds of large pumps as long-term investors tend to be less tempted to sell at the first price move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy85OTUzMzVmMDM2ZWYxYTA1ZjlkMzFjM2I2YjUxYzliZS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200709eg7900009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/8: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, BNB, CRO, EOS\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,837 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is range-bound but altcoins are rallying, indicating increasing interest among traders looking to make sizable gains off altcoins\par \par \uc2 Altcoins have been buzzing around this week and this has reduced Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dominance to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/#dominance-percentage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 63%}}}\uc2 . Pantera Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-og-thinks-altcoins-will-outperform-btc-in-the-near-future"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 founder}}}\uc2  Dan Morehead believes that altcoins are going to outperform Bitcoin, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap, over the next couple of years. This does not mean that Morehead is negative on Bitcoin price because he clarified that the firm expects Bitcoin to \u8220\'20\'1Cto go up a ton, but altcoins will go up even more.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, investors should be careful about what they invest because pump and dump schemes and liquidity issues continue to plague many altcoins. Take for example, the recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-gains-20-amidst-tiktok-pumping-challenge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TikTok challenge}}}\uc2  which saw \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) price pump by more than 60% in 24-hours.\par \par \uc2 Such challenges, when not backed by strong fundamentals, might end in disaster for several investors. As a caution against risky investing, the operator of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/dogecoin/status/1280749634089095171"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @Dogecoin}}}\uc2  Twitter account {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tiktok-sends-dogecoin-price-to-2-year-high-as-twitter-says-be-smart"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 appealed}}}\uc2  to investors and urged them to do their due diligence before buying instead of falling for \u8220\'20\'1CFOMO or manipulation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7d9e9ff8fe4c1e8477e7d5f764d1730d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Due to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-bitcoin-options-market-volume-shows-institutions-keen-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto derivatives volumes have dropped 35.7% in June}}}\uc2 , according to a CryptoCompare report. However, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-bitcoin-options-market-volume-shows-institutions-keen-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin options trading volume}}}\uc2  on the Chicago Mercantile Exchange rose to an all-time monthly high in June.\par \par \uc2 Options trading is difficult to decipher because the experts adopt various complicated strategies using several strike prices. Therefore, traders should not get carried away if they see an extreme out of the money call option being purchased.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 After stalling at the 50-day simple moving average ($9,376) for the past two days, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has risen above the resistance which is a positive sign as it indicates demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0581feabf46a6151ced8f5c117da333e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, a rally to $9,795.63 and then to $10,000 is possible. Currently, both moving averages are flat and the relative strength index is just above 50, which points to range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bulls can propel the BTC/USD pair above $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 resistance zone. However, this looks like an uphill task as of now.\par \par \uc2 The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the pair turns down from the current levels and slides below the trendline of the ascending channel. If that happens, a deeper correction to $8,130.58 is possible.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to consolidate between $216.006\u8211\'20\'13$253.556. The bulls will attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance of $253.556. If they succeed, the uptrend is likely to resume with the next target objective at $288.599.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d20c1f2d90cc0a4eee094612ec9a4717.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI has risen above 60, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to mount a strong defense at the overhead resistance of $253.556. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from this level, it could continue its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below both moving averages and the ETH/USD pair is likely to turn negative on a break below $216.006.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  dipped on July 7 but found support at the 20-day exponential moving average ($0.184). This is a positive sign as it shows that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the buyers are using dips to accumulate at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/54411674928fe665ce173ed2bae1b7d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the relief rally resumed when the bulls pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line. The first target is $0.214616 and if this is also crossed, the rally can extend to $0.235688.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bulls are likely to defend the 20-day EMA, which has started to turn up and the RSI has jumped into the positive territory. This suggests a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the bears sink the XRP/USD pair back below the downtrend line and the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been facing resistance at the $245.49 level for the past two days but the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 50-day SMA ($237), which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c99ca28e1864bafda10daa8c403ef569.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $245.49, which can result in a rally to $260 and above it to $280.47. A break above this resistance can propel the BCH/USD pair to $360.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the pair turns down from $260 or $280.47. In such a case, the pair is likely to extend its stay inside the range.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Since the 26.12% rally on July 6, Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating the gains. The positive thing is that the altcoin has not even broken below the immediate support at the 50-day SMA ($180).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/94770194984cac3e213ee0376a996225.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls are not closing their positions in a hurry because they anticipate the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to eventually break out of $200 and rally to the next target of $227. The bulls might attempt this move within the next couple of days.\par \par \uc2 If the momentum can pick up and the buyers can propel the BSV/USD pair above $227, a new uptrend is likely. The target objective of such a move is $308.\par \par \uc2 However, bears are likely to have other plans as they will try to sink the BSV/USD pair below the moving averages. If successful, it will suggest that the July 6 rally was an aberration.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the stiff overhead resistance zone of $0.10\u8211\'20\'13$0.11 on July 7, completing a huge bottoming process that has a minimum target objective of $0.20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a5700a6360ecc3e7a1c31ff75d1e4c8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, after breaking out of such a long bottom, the price usually retests the breakout level, which in this case is $0.11. If the bulls purchase the dip to $0.11, it will indicate the formation of a new floor at that level.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks below the $0.11\u8211\'20\'13$0.10 support zone, it will suggest that the current breakout was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has propelled the RSI to 80 levels, which has usually signaled a short-term top. Therefore, it is better to wait for a correction to buy on dips rather than chase prices higher as the risk to reward ratio is skewed to the downside.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bears defended the 50-day SMA ($44) on July 6 and 7, they could not sink \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($43), which suggests accumulation on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/dcc28dcdd5c29e5537e391ee6b681413.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls have pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the 50-day SMA. There is a minor resistance at $45.3501 but if the bulls can push the price above this, a move to $51 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone also suggest an advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, if the LTC/USD pair turns down from $45.3501, it can dip to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support will signal weakness.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has risen sharply for the past three days, which suggests that bulls are back in the game. The up-move has scaled above both moving averages and is on its way to the next resistance at $18.1377.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/462e3534e0f617d997fc6c52271dfc73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the momentum sustains, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap can break above $18.1377 and rally to $21.50. The 20-day EMA ($16) has started to turn up and the RSI has risen above 60 levels, which suggests an advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to throw in the towel easily. They will attempt to stall the rally at $18.1377 as they have done twice before (marked using ellipse on the chart). Therefore, traders should keep an eye on this level because if the BNB/USD pair turns down from it, the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) has continued its journey northward, which shows demand at higher levels. This up move can reach $0.15306, which is the intraday high made during the spike on July 12 of last year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7b02facc66938972edf9cf6dca6fadf9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend the $0.15306 level aggressively, resulting in a minor correction or a consolidation. A break below the 20-day EMA ($0.12) will be the first indication of a deeper pullback.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the momentum picks up and the bulls propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.15306, the next target is $0.20.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  corrected on July 7 but did not give up much ground, which shows that the bulls bought the dips and were in no hurry to close their positions. The bulls have pushed the price above the immediate resistance of $2.6209 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/be2d4c7cc9c5028f18603abf5d80bb49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can now rally to $2.8319 and if the momentum sustains, the possibility of a break above this overhead resistance increases. If the EOS/USD pair closes (UTC time) above $2.8319, the rally can extend to $3.1104.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to mount a strong defense at $2.8319. If the pair turns down from this level, it could remain range-bound for a few more days. As long as the price remains above the moving averages, the bulls hold a minor advantage over the bears.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jZDM2ZmRhZDQ5NzVkMjMxYzZmNzRiZmI3NjEyNzI0OC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200708eg78000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/6: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, CRO, EOS\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,790 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins pushed higher today and many are showing signs of a possible trend reversal\par \par \uc2 The U.S. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/07/05/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 equity markets}}}\uc2 , gold, crude oil and the crypto markets are all up today. This shows that the U.S. investors have returned from the holiday weekend charged up and ready to buy assets to fight the likely devaluation in the U.S. dollar due to the Federal Reserve\u8217\'20\'19s current monetary policy.\par \par \uc2 Sino Global Capital CEO Matthew Graham believes that China wants to internationalize the renminbi as a direct challenger to the dollar. Hence, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/expert-chinas-digital-yuan-will-target-the-dollar-not-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 digital yuan}}}\uc2  will use the latest technologies to counter \u8220\'20\'1CSwift, CHIPS, Fedwire [...],\u8221\'20\'1D which are all technologies used by the U.S. dollar but are antiqued and expensive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ba72f68771f9d28b23044ad0ad5bcfc6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dominance, which was close to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/#dominance-percentage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 70%}}}\uc2  on May 15, has gradually dropped and now rests below 64%. This suggests that after the halving, trader\u8217\'20\'19s interest in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap declined compared to the altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Does this mean that altcoins are likely to outperform Bitcoin in the short-term or is this a rally that will be sold into? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Repeated failure by the bears to sustain Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) below $9,000 has attracted buyers who have now pushed the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,255). The bears might aggressively defend the 50-day simple moving average ($9,392).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c5386ccee9b6365b8b47cfa43c429ba0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BTC/USD pair turns down from the moving averages, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the price below the $8,825\u8211\'20\'13$8,638.79 support zone. If successful, a deeper correction is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can drive the pair above the 50-day SMA, a rally to $10,000 is likely. The long-term downtrend line is placed just above this level, hence, the bears will try to defend it aggressively.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone will be an important event as that could result in a sustained uptrend in the pair.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 After staying below the 20-day EMA ($230) for the past few days, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) decided to climb above it. This is a positive sign as it shows strong accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4cf09d4af8c695f42656a43c2d6b1608.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next target is $253.556, which might act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls can drive the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above this resistance, the uptrend is likely to resume. The next target on the upside is $288.599.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears again defend the $253.556 level, the ETH/USD pair might remain range-bound for a few more days. The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping up and the relative strength index has jumped into the positive zone, which suggests that bulls have a minor advantage in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has broken out of the descending channel and the 20-day EMA ($0.18) suggesting an end of the downtrend. The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has risen above the midpoint, which shows that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/68d09e60fd48935268ac658c6fd28dd7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next target to keep an eye on is the downtrend line. The 50-day SMA ($0.19) is also located at the same level. If the momentum can drive the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above this resistance, a rally to $0.214616 and then to $0.235688 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the XRP/USD pair turns down from the 50-day SMA but does not break below the 20-day EMA, it could signal the formation of a higher low. However, if the price slides below the 20-day EMA during the next drop, it will indicate that the current rise was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to break below the $217.55 support on July 5 but the bulls again bought the dip, indicating strong buying at lower levels. Today, the buyers have propelled Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages, which is a huge positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b839f7a1cbb02352acee38a71f156e88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This is the first sign that the bulls are back in the game. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can sustain above $240, a rally to $260 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, it is not going to be easy because the bears have not allowed the BCH/USD pair to sustain above the $240 level since mid-June.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, they are likely to aggressively defend this resistance once again. If the pair turns down from $240, it could again drop to the 20-day EMA ($229).\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 In a surprise move today, Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has surged and broken out of the moving averages, which suggests huge buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fb84905145c5083a19b41ca0d40701f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next resistance to watch out for is $200. If the momentum can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above this level, a rally to $227 is possible. The 20-day EMA ($168) has turned up and the RSI has risen into the positive zone, which suggests a change in the short-term trend.\par \par \uc2 A similar sharp up move had started in end-March of last year (marked via ellipse on the chart) that had carried the BSV/USD pair from $146.20 to $227. Hence, a strong rally cannot be ruled out this time.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears defend the $200 level aggressively, the BSV/USD pair could dip back to the moving averages, which will now act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 After consolidating close to the $41 levels for the past few days, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the 20-day EMA ($42.60). The bears might attempt to stall the up move at the 50-day SMA ($44.05).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/aba533d389141e283a3ce8ea603dfec3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears succeed, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap might again dip to $41 and then to $39.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, if the bulls can push the LTC/USD pair above the 50-day SMA, a rally to $47.50 and above it to $51 is possible.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating close to the $0.10 resistance for the past three days, which shows that the bears are trying to stall the up move at this level. However, the positive thing is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/dd024719498802d6dfa082a92ba08470.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This shows that the buyers are in no hurry to book profits as they expect the uptrend to resume. If the bulls can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.11, it is likely to pick up momentum.\par \par \uc2 Such a move will complete a huge bottoming formation that has a target objective of $0.20.\par \par \uc2 However, the zone between $0.10 and $0.11 had previously acted as a stiff resistance (shown via ellipse on the chart), hence, the bears are likely to defend it aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair turns down from the current levels, it can drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.088), which is likely to act as a strong support. A break below this support will signal that the bulls are losing momentum.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Even though Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) had been trading below $15.72 for the past few days (shown via ellipse on the chart), the bears could not intensify the selling and take advantage of the weakness, which indicates a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2ebd850aca0a51bbf88bc4a4dc38c09e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has reached the 20-day EMA ($15.82), which is likely to act as a resistance but if the bulls can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap above this level, a move to the 50-day SMA ($16.47) is possible.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just below the 50 level, which suggests a range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the BNB/USD pair turns down from the 20-day EMA, it can again drop to $15 levels.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) continues to be in a strong uptrend as both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to the overbought territory. This suggests that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/376d1d25a680500803ef3c5e47c60b67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers have pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.133539. This has resumed the up move with the next target being $0.15306. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls can scale above it, the momentum is likely to pick up.\par \par \uc2 While the overall chart structure remains positive, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI is still intact. In an uptrend, these divergences are sometimes negated by a sustained up move but sometimes they result in a correction.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, to be on the safer side, traders can trail their stops to lock in their paper profits in case of a sharp pullback.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to sink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  below $2.3314 on July 5 but failed. This attracted huge buying by the bulls who have pushed the altcoin above both moving averages, which is a huge positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b67caaf97081d146060c3aeaa4b04479.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $2.6209 but if this level is crossed, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $2.8319. If the momentum can carry the price above this level, a retest of $3.1104 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $2.6209. Such a move will indicate selling by the bears at higher levels and could keep the EOS/USD pair in a $2.6209\u8211\'20\'13$2.3314 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82MDFmNzgxYjRhNWI0NDYxMTY3MDFmZTNiYTE1YzQ1Mi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200706eg76000gs\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/3: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BNB, EOS. CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,887 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and many altcoins are struggling to rise above the 20-day EMA, suggesting bears have the advantage in the short-term\par \par \uc2 Tesla\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization has surged from about $76 billion at the start of 2020 to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tesla-stock-surpasses-1-200-now-30-higher-than-bitcoin-market-cap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $224.18 billion}}}\uc2  at market close on July 2. This unending rally has also made it the largest car company in terms of market capitalization, even though it produces only a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/sites/sergeiklebnikov/2020/07/01/tesla-is-now-the-worlds-most-valuable-car-company-with-a-valuation-of-208-billion/#36eb76355334"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fraction}}}\uc2  of cars compared to the second-ranked Toyota motors. One of the reasons for the sharp rise in Tesla\u8217\'20\'19s stock is investors\u8217\'20\'19 expectation that the company will disrupt the cars running on fossil fuel.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins are likely to disrupt fiat currencies and gold over the next few years. However, the current price of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset on CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2  does not capture this change. This shows that the crypto space is still in its early days of development and as the space matures cryptocurrency prices are likely to rise higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6e73f7b8d9167ab79a49fd198d313765.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-rally-by-2021-looks-likely-from-five-fundamental-factors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fundamentals}}}\uc2  continue to improve and it is only a matter of time before the price plays catch up. However, until this happens, investors should be patient and use the dips to accumulate for the long-term. Instead of the vertical move seen in 2017, a gradual up move should be preferred as it is likely to last longer.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not propel Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,270), which shows that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance. However, a minor positive is that the buyers again stepped in and purchased the dip below $9,000 on July 2, suggesting accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/80ee6c2b8885e35ff4662733c45f077c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping down and the relative strength index is sustaining below the 50 level, which suggests that bears have a minor advantage. A break below $8,825 will open the doors for a fall to the next minor support at $8,638.79 and below it to the critical level at $8,130.58.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the BTC/USD pair above the 50-day simple moving average ($9,410), a rally to $10,000 is possible. It will be an uphill task for the bulls to clear the stiff resistance zone of $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 but if the momentum can carry the price above this zone, a new sustained uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) again turned down from the 20-day EMA ($230) on July 2, which suggests that the bears are selling on minor rallies to critical overhead resistance levels. However, the bears are not able to maintain the selling pressure at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/04284fbd45b73b5a923e6ee08a2d8474.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the 50-day SMA ($227). If they succeed, the possibility of a break above the 20-day EMA increases.\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $233 but if the bulls can propel the price above it, the up move can reach $253.56. A breakout of this resistance is likely to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair breaks below the $216.006 support. If that happens, a drop to $200 and then to $176.112 is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  continues to trade inside the descending channel with both moving averages sloping down and the RSI in the negative territory. This suggests that the bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c2fbaaba8ec8ef75e6d3401de9dae45b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the price action has been stuck inside a tight range for the past few days, which suggests that the bulls and the bears are undecided about the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the descending channel, it will be the first sign that the downtrend might be over. The bears might defend the 50-day SMA ($0.193) aggressively but if the bulls can push the price above it, a trend change is likely.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears can sink the price below the $0.172205\u8211\'20\'13$0.169012 support zone, the decline can extend to the support line of the channel. A break below the channel is likely to intensify selling resulting in a long liquidation. The next support on the downside is the $0.14\u8211\'20\'13$0.13 zone.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls seem to be in no hurry to buy Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) even at the current levels because they are not confident that the altcoin will start its journey northward. However, they have not allowed the price to dip below $217.55 either, which suggests accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/adc6af3c0d3fbfc46dd8b14d308f8112.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the moving averages, it will signal strength and could result in a rally to $260.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, if the BCH/USD pair again turns down from the 20-day EMA ($230), it will indicate that the bears are aggressively selling on minor rallies. A break below $217.55 can drag the price to $200 and if this support also cracks, a new downtrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $180 and if that gets broken, the decline can extend to $165.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls purchased the dip to $149.57 on July 1, they have not been able to push the price above $162.53, which suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears will now try to sink Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) below the $146.20\u8211\'20\'13$135 zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3667762b01856e85c06f315d7d6d795d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can decline to $120 and then to $100. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI close to the oversold territory indicates that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the BSV/USD pair rebounds sharply from $146.20 and climbs above $170, it will signal that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That will increase the likelihood of the pair gradually rising to $200 and then to $227.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not been able to push \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) even to the 20-day EMA ($42.64) in the past five days, which suggests a lack of urgency to buy even at these levels as the bulls are not confident that a bottom is in place yet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/80ccf733449221e3818d83c7d93fe19e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are now likely to attempt a breakdown below the critical support at $39. If that happens, a new downtrend is likely to begin, which has a target objective of $31.\par \par \uc2 However, it is unlikely to be a waterfall decline as the bulls will try to stall the decline at $35 and then again at $32.50.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rises from the current levels and breaks above the moving averages, it will signal strength and increase the possibility of a rally to $51.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 After a strong breakout from the symmetrical triangle on July 1, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) completed a quick retest of the breakout level on July 2. This showed that the sentiment remains positive with the bulls looking to buy the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bb5972110ce9793cf68cc76b5def9a79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has broken above $0.0970103 and touched the first target objective of $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Above this level, the rally can extend to $0.10686. However, the zone between $0.10\u8211\'20\'13$0.10686 is likely to act as a stiff resistance and a few days of consolidation or a minor correction cannot be ruled out.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair turns down sharply from the current levels and slips below the 20-day EMA ($0.0845).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($15.89) on July 2, which suggests that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance. The 20-day EMA continues to slope down and the RSI is close to 40 levels, which shows that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f3dfac0a88fb36c12797d3659a90bf9f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap below $14.80 and if they succeed, a drop to $13.65 is possible. This is a critical level and if this also cracks, a new downtrend could start.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BNB/USD pair bounces off $13.65, it could signal an extension of the range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the pair rises from the current levels and climbs above the 50-day SMA ($16.50), a move to $18.1377 is likely. A break above this resistance could start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 There is a tough tussle in progress between the bulls and the bears at the critical support at $2.3314. The bears want to break below this support and resume the downtrend while the bulls are attempting to defend the support and keep {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  inside the $2.3323\u8211\'20\'13$2.8319 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1c71e47967f492042cfeea77d65e8d9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above both moving averages to signal strength. Above this level, a rally to $2.8319 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the EOS/USD pair does not climb above the moving averages, the bears are likely to sink the price below $2.3314, resulting in a retest of the June 27 low of $2.1926. If this support also cracks, a deeper correction to $1.80 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($2.47) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, suggesting that bears have the upper hand\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) is going through a minor correction but the overall trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI remains in the positive territory, suggesting that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/16af7432848d90fe39adae122f176a1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to even drag the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.117) suggests that the bulls are not in a hurry to book profits as they expect the uptrend to resume. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rallies above $0.133539, a move to $0.15306 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI is still intact, which will come into play after the bears sink the CRO/USD pair below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, a drop to $0.11 and then to $0.101266 is likely.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9lYmU0NGQ5YTBjYWZmNmIzY2YzMzVhMmMwOTllMzk0My5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200703eg73000md\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 7/1: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , CRO, EOS\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,741 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 July 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and a few altcoins have bounced off their recent lows, suggesting that the sentiment remains to buy the dips\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gold-rallies-above-1-800-to-cap-strong-quarter-11593549228"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gold}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/07/01/oil-prices-brent-wti-crude-just-had-their-best-quarter-in-30-years.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crude oil}}}\uc2 , and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2020/06/30/dow-stocks-track-best-quarter-decades/3284359001/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US equity markets}}}\uc2  all rose {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-price-recorded-its-third-best-q2-performance-ever"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sharply}}}\uc2  throughout the second quarter of this year. This shows that investors\u8217\'20\'19 appetites remain strong as they are confident that central banks will continue to keep the money supply flowing.\par \par \uc2 While monetary easing can be a short-term solution, if it is not rolled back at the right time it can destroy the economy in the long-term, as seen in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analyst-central-bank-rate-cuts-mean-world-has-gone-zimbabwe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Zimbabwe}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Although the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset on CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2  has been stuck in a range for the past few days, the participation from both {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bullish-case-for-bitcoin-grows-as-btc-whale-population-tops-3-year-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional investors}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/whos-buying-bitcoin-retail-demand-expected-to-double-by-2024-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 retail investors}}}\uc2  has been increasing. This shows that informed investors have been buying Bitcoin for the long-term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e5442d68bd3aadfe5a3c6c7fd9c68524.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The third quarter has historically been the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/sites/lawrencelight/2020/06/30/here-comes-the-3rd-quarter-usually-the-worst-for-the-market/#3e7354167b69"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weakest quarter}}}\uc2  for the US stock markets, according to CFRA Research chief strategist Sam Stovall. If history were to repeat itself and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoins-correlation-with-sp500-at-2-year-high-amid-the-coronavirus-crisis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 correlation between Bitcoin and the S&P 500}}}\uc2  remains high, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action might remain subdued for a few more weeks.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears were unable to take advantage of the breakdown from the trendline of the ascending triangle on June 27 as there was no follow up selling in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) below $8,825. This indicates that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/80b6088c1d6e45c1d23aec3bc799c621.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to push the price back above the trendline. Even if they are successful, they will face stiff resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,314) and also at the 50-day simple moving average ($9,428).\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the 50-day SMA will signal strength and is likely to attract further buying, resulting in a move to $10,000.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the BTC/USD pair turns down from the overhead resistance. In such a case, the bears will try to sink the price below $8,825 and if they succeed, a drop to $8,638.79 and $8,130.58 is possible.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The rebound off $216.06 has reached the 20-day EMA ($230), which is likely to act as a stiff resistance, but if the bulls can push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above this resistance a rally to $253.556 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/60f3fff86f513ac150cf93620463b456.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the 20-day EMA, a retest of $216.006 is possible. A break below this support can result in a deeper correction to $200 and below that $176.112.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index has risen to the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand. This could keep the ETH/USD pair range-bound for a few more days until the bulls drive the price above $253.56 and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  could not scale above the $0.18 level, which shows a lack of buying support at higher levels. If the bears sink the price below $0.173278, a retest of the recent lows at $0.169012 is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d14f88db53018bf013ebb3562b5e04c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI has been trading near the oversold zone, which suggests that bears are at an advantage.\par \par \uc2 A break below $0.169012 is likely to attract further selling that can drag the price to the support line of the descending channel. A break below the channel could intensify selling resulting in a drop to $0.14.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bulls can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 After rising above $217.55, the buying in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has dried up, which has resulted in a tight range trading for the past two days. A bounce off the current levels is likely to face stiff resistance at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e49e395544c8499d40c3009c8c59bc7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($232) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap slips below $217.55 a drop to the critical support at $200 is possible.\par \par \uc2 For this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment to change the bulls will have to drive the BCH/USD pair above the 50-day SMA ($239).\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) fizzled out at $162.53 on June 28, which suggests that the bulls are hesitant to buy at higher levels. However, the bounce off the lows today indicates that lower levels are attracting some buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4d6fda79a406d228712083f896a486b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is close to the oversold zone, which suggests that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the $146.20\u8211\'20\'13$135 support zone, the downtrend is likely to resume. The next target objective on the downside is $110.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, the first sign of strength would be a breakout and close (UTC time) above the breakdown level of $170.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 For the past three days, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range of $40.5\u8211\'20\'13$42, which shows that the bulls are struggling to carry the price higher. The 20-day EMA ($43) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, suggesting that the bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/98cd0802e4731a33866d1c2fca409ff4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears again sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $41, a retest of $39 will be on the cards. A break below this critical support could signal the start of a new downtrend, with a short-term target objective of $35 and below it $32.50.\par \par \uc2 However, if buying picks up and the bulls are able to push the price above both moving averages, a rally to the resistance of the $39\u8211\'20\'13$51 range is possible. The next trending move is likely to start after the LTC/USD pair breaks out of the range.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to propel Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) back above the overhead resistance at $15.72. Above this level, the recovery is likely to hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($16).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/81ee406e75b73849a782cb68eb9805eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels or the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to sink the price below the immediate support at $14.80. Below this level, a drop to $13.65 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, if the buyers can push the price above the 20-day EMA, a move to the 50-day SMA ($16.54) and then to $18.1377 is possible. The next trending move is likely to start after the BNB/USD pair breaks out of the large $13.65\u8211\'20\'13$18.1377 range.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the symmetrical triangle and the overhead resistance at $0.0901373, which indicates a resumption of the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1d0c254909f5b1684e352134f466d655.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The pattern target of the breakout of the triangle is $0.10686 but it is unlikely to be a straight dash to the target as the bears might attempt to stall the uptrend at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 However, as both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to the overbought territory, the advantage remains with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels and plunges below $0.0901373.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) hit a swing high of $0.133539 on June 30, which was just below the target objective of $0.135202 as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-6-29-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-cro-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis. A series of higher highs, supported by the upsloping moving averages, confirms an uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/caba2e80aa76463d6ca3b9dc97fb4385.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI is warning that the uptrend might be weakening and a minor correction or consolidation is likely.\par \par \uc2 Sometimes, in strong uptrends, such divergences are invalidated as the asset continues the uptrend but traders should remain cautious when a divergence develops because several times they forecast a correction.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA ($0.116), it will be the first warning that the uptrend is weakening. A break below $0.11 will signal the likelihood of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the CRO/USD pair breaks above $0.133539 and resumes its journey towards the target objective of $0.135202 and then $0.15306.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls purchased the sharp dip on June 27, they are struggling to carry {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  higher, which suggests that buying dries up at higher levels. The price has been consolidating close to the $2.3314 support for the past three days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5b3106baee0005368b6961e92fec1649.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price does not move up, the bulls might lose interest and that could result in another fall towards $2.1926.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($2.49) and the RSI below 40 level suggests that bears have the advantage in the short-term. If the bears can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $2.1926, the decline can extend to $1.80.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the EOS/USD pair bounces off the current levels and breaks above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9kM2MxNDFhYWFhODM0ZmY2OTk1MGUyMWI4OWRkNmVlMi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200701eg71000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/29: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, CRO,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,712 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price dropped below the ascending triangle trendline, suggesting further \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action for BTC and altcoins\par \par \uc2 The total crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/charts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market capitalization}}}\uc2  has been stuck roughly between $240 billion and $280 billion for about two months. This range-bound action suggests that cryptocurrencies are waiting for a trigger to propel the market cap higher. As the saying goes, the longer the consolidation, the stronger the eventual breakout from it will be.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8b248efeeaa71882c125a2b75f3cca07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Researchers responsible for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-research-report-predicts-397k-bitcoin-price-by-2030"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recently published Crypto Research Report}}}\uc2  have projected a long-term target of $397,727 for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) by 2030. For 2020, the report forecasts a target of $19,044.\par \par \uc2 The researchers believe that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset on CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2  has penetrated only a fraction of its total addressable market, and over the next few years as the penetration increases, Bitcoin's price is likely to surge. The report also projected \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  targets for several altcoins based on the same metric.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the trendline of the ascending triangle on June 27. This has invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. The bears are currently defending the trendline that has flipped from being a support to a resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f8f4078feefa3946bf7f99d823fc4af2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BTC/USD pair turns down from the trendline, the bears will try to sink the price below $8,825. If the bears succeed, there is a minor support at $8,638.79 and if this level breaks down, a decline to $8,130.58 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover for the first time since mid-April, and the relative strength index is in the negative zone, which suggests that bears are at an advantage.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair breaks above the moving averages. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $225.783 support on June 27. In doing so, the biggest altcoin also broke and closed (UTC time) below the 50-day simple moving average ($224) for the first time since April 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e9215986aa716dd37f2671314bd756bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap back above $225.783. The 20-day exponential moving average ($230) is just above this resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair might attempt to rally to $253.556.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from either resistance, the bears will try to sink the ETH/USD pair below $216.006. If successful, a drop to $200 and then to $176.112 is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is currently trading inside a descending channel, and both moving averages are sloping down, and the RSI is close to the oversold zone. This suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bed5495e9d6843314db3cffa6f6c71af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls purchased the dip to the support line of the channel on June 27, they are struggling to carry the price to the resistance line of the channel, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels or from the resistance line of the channel, the bears will try to resume the down move.\par \par \uc2 A break below the support line of the channel will intensify selling, and the first strong support on the downside is at $0.14. If this support breaks down, the decline can extend to $0.124412, which is the pattern target of the breakdown from the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to the assumption, if the bulls can push the price above the channel, then this could signal the start of a trend change.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the immediate support at $217.55 on June 27 and fell to a low of $204.93. The bulls purchased this dip and pushed the price back above $217.55 on June 28, which suggests demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3512346f121d69249f3fdf5085dd0cbd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are not allowing the bulls to have it easy. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($233) and the RSI below 40 level suggests that bears have the upper hand. They will again attempt to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $200.\par \par \uc2 If successful, a new downtrend is likely. The first support on the downside is at $180, and if that cracks, the next level to watch out for is $140.\par \par \uc2 If the BCH/USD pair rebounds off $200 again, it will increase the possibility of a move to $240.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) plummeted to $135 on June 27 and currently, both moving averages are sloping down as the RSI is close to oversold levels. This suggests that the trend favors the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e192b49be65c2ac7007008f2ade15048.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting a pullback, which is likely to face stiff resistance at the breakdown level of $170. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from this level, the bears will try to resume the downtrend and sink the price to $110.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the BSV/USD pair turns down from $170 but stays above $135. In such a case, a few days of range-bound action is likely. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the pair rises and sustains above $170.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) plunged below $41 and hit a low of $39.1843 on June 27. Currently, both moving averages are sloping down, and the RSI is close to the 40 level, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5cb5ed1a03901778c64c5ca6bc17e9e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap bounced sharply from $39.1843, the bulls are struggling to sustain the price above $41. This suggests a lack of buyers at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair does not break out of the 20-day EMA ($43.26) within the next few days, the bears are likely to make another attempt to break below the $39 support. If they succeed, the price could drop to $34.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair bounces off the current levels and rises above the moving averages. This will open up the possibility of a rally back to $51.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the immediate support of $15.72 on June 27 and fell to a low of $14.80. The bulls purchased this dip, but they are struggling to push the price back above the breakdown level of $15.72.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0aaf5b5ab304986500d5abbf2634f905.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests a lack of buyers at higher levels. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 -ranked}}}\uc2  crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap turns down from $15.72, the bears will try to extend the decline to $13.65.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($16) and RSI below 40 level suggests that bears have the upper hand. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bulls push the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  broke below the critical support at $2.3314 on June 27, but the bulls purchased this dip and pushed the price back into the $2.3314\u8211\'20\'13$2.8319 range. However, the rebound lacks strength, suggesting that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/44aef910e938aabc1d66219e85230eef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA continues to slope down, and the RSI is close to the oversold levels, which shows that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($2.51), the bears will make another attempt to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 -ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the $2.3314\u8211\'20\'13$2.1926 support. If this zone cracks, a decline to $1.80 is likely.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the EOS/USD pair rebounds off the current levels and rises above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.114) on June 28, suggesting that the bulls continue to view dips as buying opportunities. The upsloping moving averages also show that the trend favors the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/86f28abe607cdc3d48fcc258a50a083a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 -ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has risen above the immediate resistance of $0.118234 and is now likely to retest the highs at $0.126245. A breakout of the highs can result in a rally to $0.135202 and then to $0.15306.\par \par \uc2 The only negative development on the chart is the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI. This suggests that the uptrend is weakening. If the bulls fail to sustain new highs, it could result in a pullback below $0.11. Therefore, traders should exercise caution.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has formed a symmetrical triangle. The 20-day EMA ($0.0797) is gradually moving higher, and the RSI has bounced off the 50 level, which suggests that bulls are at a slight advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f1414e11c9fe93651c3de3ffccbd9a57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a breakout and close (UTC time) above the resistance line of the triangle. If the momentum can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.0901373, the uptrend is likely to resume.\par \par \uc2 The next target on the upside is $0.10 and above it $0.10686, which is the pattern target of the breakout from the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair below the support line of the symmetrical triangle, a drop to $0.069488 is possible. Below this level, the decline can extend to $0.0549, which is the pattern target of the breakdown from the triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9lNmJkMmFlNGE3YmU2MzBjZDUxYWNmOGMyMjUyOTgyYy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200630eg6t0000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/26: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,666 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to lose momentum, signaling the possible start of a deeper correction below $8,200\par \par \uc2 Grayscale Investments has been taking in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) at a frantic pace. In the last week alone, the fund gobbled up {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/at-this-rate-grayscale-will-own-34-of-all-bitcoin-by-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 19,879 Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , which is way over the 7,081 Bitcoin mined during the period, according to crypto researcher Kevin Rooke. This shows that demand far exceeds supply at the moment, which is a positive sign.\par \par \uc2 However, Tone Vays believes that if the S&P 500 breaks {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tone-vays-bitcoin-price-wont-leave-6k-10k-range-until-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 below 3,000}}}\uc2 , it could fall another 12%. Due to the strong correlation between the S&P 500 and Bitcoin a crash in the equity markets could drag the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked asset on CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2  to the $7,000 levels. Vays expects Bitcoin to consolidate \u8220\'20\'1Cbetween $6,000 and $10,000 for the majority of this year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1d0c802803052ca179ac09756789c89f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Social Capital CEO and Virgin Galactic Chairman Chamath Palihapitiya has once again suggested that investors should put about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-says-an-exponential-btc-price-increase-would-be-a-disaster"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 1%}}}\uc2  of their money in Bitcoin as an insurance against bad government financial decisions.\par \par \uc2 However, Palihapitiya does not want Bitcoin to skyrocket to the moon because he believes that such a move will happen only if the financial system collapses and that would wreck the lives of friends and family who are not hedged in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to defend the trendline of the ascending triangle. If Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounces off this level and rises above the moving averages it will signal that investors remain keen to buy each dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f703e2bf1ff8b1dd22f94f9dd7f32f72.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the upside is the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone because if the bulls can propel the price above this area a new sustained uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the rebound off the trendline of the triangle turns down from the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a break below the triangle. If that happens a deeper correction is likely.\par \par \uc2 The first support is at $8,638.70 but if this level cracks, the decline can extend to $8,130.58. This is a critical support, hence, the bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has dropped to the support at $225.783. The 50-day simple moving average ($223) is just below this level, hence, the bulls are likely to aggressively defend the $225.783\u8211\'20\'13$218.331 zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/934e9c4a95dd642e601821727ece9172.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off the support zone is likely to keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap between $225.783 and $253.556 for a few more days. The flat 20-day exponential moving average ($233) and the relative strength index just below the midpoint also supports this view.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the $225.783\u8211\'20\'13$218.331 support zone, the ETH/USD pair is likely to start a deeper correction that can reach $200 and below that $176.112.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  closed (UTC time) below the support line of the symmetrical triangle on June 24, which completed the pattern. The target objective of this breakdown is $0.124412.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/be27ad4e685377245b3fc3f7289ae836.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is below the 40 level, which suggests that bears are in command. The next support on the downside is $0.16 and if that breaks, a drop to $0.14 is possible. Any pullback is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.19).\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rises and breaks above the downtrend line of the triangle. Such a move will suggest that the current breakdown was a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not been able to sustain Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages and the bears have failed to sink the price below the immediate support at $217.55.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/770a6285c42ed822eb535c699a9444f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($238) has been sloping down gradually and the RSI has been trading between 40 and 50 levels. This suggests that bears are trying to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 A break below $217.55 will be the first indication that bears have gained the upper hand. Below this level, a drop to $200 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks above the moving averages, a move to $255.46 is likely. A break above this resistance will indicate the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to keep Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) inside the large $170\u8211\'20\'13$227 range. Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI has slipped below 40, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/007d0272911d860982535959464e4cc6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap drops below the $170\u8211\'20\'13 $165.380 support zone, the decline can extend to $146.10. If the strong downward momentum breaks below this level, the next target is $110.\par \par \uc2 The possibility is low, but if the BNB/USD pair bounces off the current levels and breaks out of the moving averages it can move up to $209. Above this level, a rally to $227 is possible.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually moving lower for the past few days. On the upside, the bears are defending the moving averages while the bulls are attempting to hold the altcoin above the immediate support at $41.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4dd64ba2dfeb02cf9d1076c4cf53be31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap bounced sharply from $41.3866, which is a positive sign. If the bulls can push the price above the moving averages, a rally to $47.50 and above it to $51 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the LTC/USD pair again turns down from the moving averages, the bears will attempt to sink the price below $41. If successful, a drop to $39 is likely.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to stay above the $15.72\u8211\'20\'13$15.40 zone. This suggests that the bulls are not confident that the support will hold, hence, they are not buying in a hurry even at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ec3fd2f2a6fdce9b7f8864ddfc2914d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($16.36) is sloping down and the RSI has dipped below the 40 which suggests that bears have the upper hand. A drop below the support zone can result in a fall to $15 and then to $13.65.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the current levels and rises above the moving averages, a move to $18.1377 is likely. However, the possibility of such a move looks bleak.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  rebounded off $2.3889, which suggests that the bulls have still not given up on the altcoin. However, until the price remains below the moving averages it will continue to face selling from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9c602b199ccffb85a73b3a94863d421c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from the moving averages, the bears will make one more attempt to break below $2.3314. If they succeed a new downtrend is likely. The first support on the downside is $2.00 followed by $1.80.\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping moving averages and the RSI oscillating between 40 and 50 level suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bulls can propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the moving averages.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has held the 20-day EMA ($0.079) for the past two days but the bulls are struggling to sustain the rebound. This suggests that higher levels are attracting selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5c0cd4f1e9a781f6e8f3873ec243dc2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is still gradually sloping up and the RSI has been consolidating between 54 and 62 levels, which suggests that bulls have a minor advantage.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above $0.085 will signal strength. Above this resistance, a retest of $0.0901373 will be on the cards. If this level is scaled, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair below the 20-day EMA, a deeper correction is likely. The next support zone on the downside where buyers might step in is $0.0722722\u8211\'20\'13$0.0694880.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $0.118234 support on June 25. However, the uptrend is intact as both moving averages are sloping up and the price remains in the positive territory.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9e3d6fde20ffb153885bf71c7653b36f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradual fall from the recent highs suggests that only a few bulls have closed their positions, which is a positive sign.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($0.112), the buyers will attempt to resume the uptrend. Momentum is likely to pick up above $0.126245 and the target levels to watch out for are $0.135202 and then $0.15306.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the CRO/USD pair breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA. Such a move can drag the price to $0.101266.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8yMTM2NjJkOTAyZDJkNWEwZmM3ZjUwNjk0MmZjZjc1Ny5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200626eg6q000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/24: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,738 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A few major cryptocurrencies are close to breaking below their critical support levels, indicating further downside in the next few days\par \par \uc2 Coronavirus cases are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usnews.com/news/health-news/articles/2020-06-22/brazil-united-states-fuel-biggest-one-day-jump-in-coronavirus-cases-worldwide"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jumping}}}\uc2  across the world as nations reopen their economies and this raises the risk of a second wave which could slow down the current recovery in major markets. Global {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/06/24/imf-global-economy-to-contract-with-coronavirus-recovery-slow.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 debt levels}}}\uc2  are already at astronomical levels but it seems safe to assume that a resurgence in cases will result in central banks pumping more liquidity into the markets.\par \par \uc2 OKEx CEO Jay Hao recently said that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rallied about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/second-us-stimulus-package-could-drive-bitcoin-higher-says-okex-ceo-jay-hao"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 58%}}}\uc2  from $6,580 to $10,400 after the first stimulus bill was signed in late March. There are also expectations that the Trump Administration may announce a second $1 trillion stimulus package.\par \par \uc2 If this happens, Hao believes that a portion of funds from investors will re-enter Bitcoin as institutional investors \u8220\'20\'1Cspread their risk across risk and haven assets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ef69b90c2ea7890db35fa211df31697a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Even if institutional investors park roughly 1% of their money in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap, this could result in an inflow of about $480 billion. According to Messari researcher Ryan Watkins, this fresh influx could boost \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s market cap above $1 trillion, or over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/messari-1-allocation-from-institutions-could-drive-btc-to-50-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $50,000}}}\uc2  per BTC.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the long-term prospects for Bitcoin are strong, hence, any weakness can present an opportunity to buy at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) showed promise on June 22 but the rally fizzled out at $9,795.06. This suggests that a huge wall of sellers is defending the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 resistance zone. The price turned down sharply and plunged below the moving averages today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4f9db33b79e5965ed16d0e80d4366ad5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the bulls to break above the resistance zone could attract long liquidations from short-term traders. If the bears take advantage of this and sink the price below the trendline of the ascending triangle, a drop to $8,638.70 and below that to $8,130.58 is possible.\par \par \uc2 If the BTC/USD pair rebounds off $8,130.58, it could point to a few days of range-bound trading between $8130.58\u8211\'20\'13$10,000. The view will turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the bears sink the pair below the critical support at $8,130.58.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the trendline of the triangle, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price to $10,000 levels.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from just under the overhead resistance of $253.556 today, which suggests that bears are defending this level aggressively. This could keep the biggest altcoin range-bound between $225.783 and $253.556 for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a40fdfab50fe73707ce48530747a9613.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the relative strength index just above the 50 level also suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if they can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $225.783\u8211\'20\'13$218.331 support zone. If this zone cracks, a drop to $200 and below it to $176.112 is likely.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the ETH/USD pair rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average ($224), the bulls might make one more attempt to push the price above $253.556. If the price sustains above this level, the uptrend is likely to resume.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has broken down from the support line of the symmetrical triangle. If the bears can sustain the price below the triangle, a new downtrend is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9f714ec0b6831684fa2767d719e4e632.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the failure of the RSI to even reach 50 level suggests that bears have the upper hand. The pattern target of this breakdown is $0.124412.\par \par \uc2 However, it is unlikely to be a straight fall as the bulls will try to stall the decline at $0.16 and then at $0.14.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap reverses direction and rises above both moving averages. However, the possibility of such a move looks bleak.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the moving averages today, the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The altcoin quickly turned around and dipped below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f1154c723be48ee1443e926213c6776f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $217.55. This level has been holding up well for the past several days, hence, the bulls are likely to defend it aggressively once again.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off $217.55 will keep the BCH/USD pair range-bound between $217.55\u8211\'20\'13$255.46 for a few more days. Both moving averages are flattish and the RSI has been oscillating between 40 and 50, which also suggests a range-bound action but with a negative bias.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The rebound in Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($180), which is a negative sign. The 20-day EMA is sloping down gradually and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/06235dd7b31d225c476047ea822e1676.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the price below the support at $170, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to start a new downtrend. This will be a huge negative as it can result in a decline to $146.20 and then to $110.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BSV/USD pair rebounds off $170, the bulls will make another attempt to push the price above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair is likely to remain range-bound between $170\u8211\'20\'13$227.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are not allowing \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) to rise above the moving averages. This is the third such occasion (marked as ellipses on the chart) when the price has turned down from the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e1e34a3b0cf9ec85bdcec1f73459d9a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap slips below $41.63, it can dip to the critical support at $39. This support has not been broken down convincingly since April 2, hence, the bulls are likely to mount a strong defense of this level.\par \par \uc2 A sharp rebound off $39 can keep the LTC/USD pair inside the large $39\u8211\'20\'13$51 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($44) has started to turn down gradually and the RSI has been struggling to climb above the 50 level, which suggests a minor advantage to the bears. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns around and rises above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has turned down from the moving averages. The bears will now try to sink the price below the immediate support zone of $15.72\u8211\'20\'13$15.40. If they succeed, the altcoin is likely to turn weak in the short-term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6ca442de2592b744c308afe086cda874.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Below the $15.72\u8211\'20\'13$15.40 support zone, the selling is likely to pick up that can drag the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap to the critical support at $13.65.\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($16.50) and the failure of the RSI to cross above the 50 level suggests a slight advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears do not take advantage of this situation, the BNB/USD pair is likely to bounce off the support zone once again.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  again turned down from the moving averages. This suggests that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance. Repeated failure to break out of a resistance results in long liquidation by short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/11d455e0fc9ec778a9f2b7863c6ae72f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 That could drag the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to the critical support at $2.3314. As this support has not been breached convincingly since April 6, the bulls are likely to defend it aggressively once again.\par \par \uc2 However, if the selling picks up momentum and sinks the EOS/USD pair below $2.3314, a new downtrend is likely. The next key support on the downside is $2 and then $1.80.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the pair turns around from the current levels or $2.3314 and rises above the moving averages.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls carried Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above $0.085, they have not been able to sustain the breakout. This suggests that bears are aggressively defending the $0.085\u8211\'20\'13$0.0901373 zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4394114cd375cc32cf95ca828c6b09e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has again dipped back below $0.085 and the bears will now try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.079).\par \par \uc2 If they are successful, the short-term traders are likely to close their positions that can drag the price of the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair to the $0.0722722\u8211\'20\'13$0.0694880 support zone.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair again bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to propel the price to $0.0901373.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling above $0.125 levels. The sharp downturn in price today has pulled the RSI back below 70 and it has started forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-6-22-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-cro-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c43e3d0fb1e979f1eb432f21c82b9d8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks down and sustains below $0.118234, it will signal weakness.\par \par \uc2 The uptrend will be in danger of being broken if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.111). Below this level, a drop to $0.101266 is likely.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the CRO/USD pair bounces off the 20-day EMA. In such a case, the bulls will once again attempt to resume the up move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9kMGE1YjI5NzcyZjQ3ZGRmOTczZDQ2ODMxNDIzZTViYy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200624eg6o000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/22: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, CRO,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,650 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is flashing some \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals as \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to pick up over the next few days\par \par \uc2 The current economic environment has made it difficult for pension funds to sustain their expected rate of return. The \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  has continued along the path of cutting rates to zero and it seems likely to keep them there for at least a couple of years. This means pension funds may be forced to explore other {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/anthony-pompliano-continues-push-for-pension-fund-crypto-allocation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strategies}}}\uc2  to increase their returns.\par \par \uc2 Morgan Creek Digital co-founder Anthony Pompliano has suggested that pension funds allocate a small amount of 1 to 5 percent of their portfolios to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). Such a move \u8220\'20\'1Cwould increase the risk-adjusted returns for a public pension fund,\u8221\'20\'1D according to Pompliano.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cfc0d91e1b520e43054d653d89a7f2d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, several traditional investors remain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investment-guru-jim-rogers-the-value-of-bitcoin-will-drop-to-zero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 skeptical}}}\uc2  of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap. Although investment guru Jim Rogers believes that people who use cryptocurrency are smarter than governments, he also predicted that governments will use their armed power to make cryptocurrencies worthless.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largest \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap has been consolidating near the overhead resistance zone of $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 for the past few weeks. In doing so, it has formed an ascending triangle, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d0d71f8e887e1bd894c33afc9b12c94c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 For the uptrend to resume, the bulls will have to push the price above the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,376.38 resistance zone. This will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, which has a target objective of $11,869.42.\par \par \uc2 If the BTC/USD pair reverses direction from the current levels or from the overhead resistance, the bears will try to sink the price below the trendline of the triangle. Such a breakdown will weaken sentiment and attract selling by the short-term traders.\par \par \uc2 Selling could intensify on a break below $8,910.04 and this could sink the pair to a critical support at $8,130.58.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has bounced sharply off the $225.783 support and has cleared the hurdle at $239.45. This suggests renewed buying interest in the biggest altcoin. The next level to watch out for is $253.556.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6b1fc3edccc44e42b09808a0c4549997.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If momentum picks up, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to break out of $253.556 and move towards $288.599. This is an important resistance level, which is likely to be defended aggressively by the bears.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair reverses direction from the current levels or from $253.556 and breaks below the 50-day simple moving average ($220). Below this level, a drop to $200 and then to $176.112 is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  closed (UTC time) below the support line of the symmetrical triangle on June 21 but the price has quickly turned around and re-entered the triangle. This suggests a lack of follow up selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e1fb21e66f57eb7c081de4a07ef276b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rises above the 20-day exponential moving average ($0.19) a move to the downtrend line of the triangle is possible. A breakout of this level will signal advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, if the XRP/USD pair turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate a lack of demand at higher levels. In such a case, the bears will once again try to sink the price below the triangle. If they are successful, a new downtrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $255.46\u8211\'20\'13$217.55 for the past few days. The flat moving averages and the RSI close to the midpoint suggests that the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days. Trading in a small range can be difficult because the price action is usually choppy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c72ab6f8c1374db7b87470549915cb37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls drive the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the moving averages, a rally to $255.46 is possible.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to watch out for because a few days back, it had acted as a stiff resistance (marked via ellipse on the chart). Therefore, a breakout of it will be the first indication that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the BCH/USD pair turns down from the moving averages. In such a case a drop to $217.55 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears have not been able to sink Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) below the critical support at $170. This suggests a lack of sellers at lower levels. This has kept the price inside the $170\u8211\'20\'13$227 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4f4ae493647b78d72f5dfacf1edbfc20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the 20-day EMA ($180). If that happens, a move to the 50-day SMA ($190) and then to $200 is likely.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will be a negative sign as it will indicate a lack of buyers at higher levels. That will increase the possibility of a break below the critical support at $170.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is getting squeezed between the moving averages and $42. If the bulls can push the price above the moving averages, a move to $47 and then to $51 is possible. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ec81904ed2bd440ccb54a1c856da5119.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from $51, the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the moving averages, the bears will make another attempt to sink the LTC/USD pair to $39.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to start after the pair breaks out of the range. Until then, the volatile range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in the top half of the $13.65\u8211\'20\'13$18.1377 range for the past few days. On June 20, the bears attempted to sink the price below the $15.72 support but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/49d0d85a6bf150395ab79d6ee06d7b01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls are aggressively defending the $15.72 level. Currently, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap has bounced off the support and the bulls are attempting to propel the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If successful, a move to $18.1377 will be on the cards. A breakout of this resistance will signal the possible start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears again defend the moving averages, the price might dip back to $15.72. A breakdown of this support can drag the price down to $13.65.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  remains stuck inside the $2.3314\u8211\'20\'13$2.8319 range. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the 50 level suggests that this range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4604c276bbd17575179baf806388332c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to push the price above the moving averages. If successful, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can move up to $2.8319, which is a critical resistance to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the EOS/USD pair turns down from the moving averages, the bears will attempt to break the critical support of $2.3314. If they succeed, the pair can decline to $2 and below it to $1.80.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) broke above the overhead resistance of $0.118234 on June 20 and resumed the up move. The trend remains strong with both moving averages separating out and the price well above the 20-day EMA ($0.1090).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e50c73a6242758031ec70c09a487be6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $0.135202 and if that resistance is crossed, the next target is $0.15306.\par \par \uc2 The only warning sign on the chart is the possibility of the RSI forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. However, until the price slips and sustains below $1.118234, there is no danger to the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the CRO/USD pair turns down and slides below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will indicate selling at higher levels.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The dip from $0.0844398 on June 18 was short lived as the bulls defended the 20-day EMA ($0.078) aggressively. This suggests that the bulls continue to buy the dips as they expect Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) to resume its rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f410add3f69538ddfaa50671d6cdc8ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The trend is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory. A breakout of the downtrend line and the $0.085 resistance will signal the possibility of a retest of $0.0901373.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will try to sink it to the $0.0722722\u8211\'20\'13$0.0694880 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9kNjI2N2M4MjllMDgwN2ZmMzhjNzRkN2YxY2Y3MDdmOC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200622eg6m000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Cryptocurrencies to Watch This Week: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LEO, XMR\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,846 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A few major cryptocurrencies are attracting buyers on dips, which suggests that \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Only about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/114-m-bitcoin-held-as-long-term-investment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3.5 million}}}\uc2  Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) are available for trading, according to new data from blockchain analytics firm \uc2 Chainalysis\uc2 . The remaining 11.4 million are held as long-term investment and 3.7 million are believed to be lost.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that if institutional investors enter the crypto space and invest for the long-term, the tradeable supply of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap is likely to shrink further and possibly boost the price of BTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2349fb6b24014da7ad8097ff43d4d695.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market data daily view}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-fpje2fq19a_1589129732773"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In a recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paul-tudor-jones-to-be-biggest-bitcoin-holder-in-2-years-max-keiser"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with Cointelegraph Markets, Max Keiser, host of the Keiser Report, said that Paul Tudor Jones is likely to become \u8220\'20\'1Cthe biggest HODL\u8217\'20\'19er of Bitcoin within 2 years.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In other news, \uc2 Ray Dalio\uc2 's \uc2 Bridgewater Associates\uc2 , the largest hedge fund in the world, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/stocks/stock-market-verge-lost-decade-dalio-bridgewater-warns-outlook-globalization-2020-6-1029323589"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that equity investors might be staring at a possible \u8220\'20\'1Clost decade\u8221\'20\'1D as globalization "has already peaked.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 If this happens, institutional investors are likely to gradually enter the crypto space in search of higher returns. All these fundamentals point to higher prices in the future but how does the short-term picture look? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dipped below $9,078.96 on June 15 but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness as bulls provided support at $8,910.04. This suggests strong demand at lower levels. However, the rebound has not been able to sustain above the 10-day exponential moving average ($9,425), suggesting selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ac5dd9d6b3ce26cd8e7939f150c78f80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 50-day simple moving average ($9,402) is gradually flattening out and the relative strength index has been trading close to the midpoint. This suggests a balance between supply and demand, which could result in a range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the BTC/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the $9,078.86\u8211\'20\'13$8,910.04 support zone. If that happens, a short-term down move is possible.\par \par \uc2 There is a minor support at $8,638.79 and if that cracks, the decline can extend to $8,130.58.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls push the price above the 10-day EMA\u8211\'20\'13$9,600 resistance zone, a rally to $10,058.82 and then to $10,376.38 is possible. The pair is forming an ascending triangle, which will complete after the price closes (UTC time) above $10,376.38. This pattern has a target objective of $11,986.46.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/17c016e04399dec6f44cec96142abef6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a breakout of the downtrend line. If the price sustains above $9,600, the bulls who have been waiting on the sidelines are likely to jump in. Therefore, a quick rally to $10,000 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The bears are unlikely to allow the bulls to have it easy at the $10,000 levels. Hence, a minor correction or consolidation can be expected at those levels.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the pair slides below the trendline of the triangle. This could retest the recent low of $8,910.04. If this support also cracks, the bulls who have been holding on for the past few weeks are likely to liquidate their positions.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to remain high for the next few days as both bulls and bears attempt to assert their supremacy. Hence, trading with a smaller position size can help reduce the risk.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $253.556\u8211\'20\'13$217.670 for the past few days. The 50-day SMA ($220) is flattening out and the RSI is close to the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b735fb0b04c1ea080a05638d5a25a2d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This balance will shift in favor of the bulls if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rises above the 10-day EMA ($232). Above this resistance, a rally to $253.556 is likely.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can scale the price above $253.556, the uptrend is likely to resume. However, if the price turns down from this resistance, the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the biggest altcoin continues lower from the current levels, it can drop to $217.67. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively. A strong bounce off this level will indicate that the bulls are keen to accumulate at lower levels. A break below $217.67 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c00f9d31a9cf4c792733154dac6923fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the ETH/USD pair has rebounded sharply from $217.67 at twice before (marked as ellipse on the chart). This suggests that the bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, if the price again dips to $217.67, the bulls are likely to buy again. A strong bounce off this support might offer an opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a breakout of the downtrend line will be the first sign of strength. Above this resistance, a rally to $240 and then to $253.556 is likely. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the pair below $217.67.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The dip in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) to $0.069488 was purchased aggressively on June 15. This is a positive sign as it shows that several traders expect the trend to continue, hence, they are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ab2816ca8dec94919d6b22ab608b50fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unwilling to give up easily and currently they are defending the horizontal resistance at $0.085.\par \par \uc2 The 10-day EMA ($0.080) has flattened out and the RSI is just above the 50 level, which suggests that the bulls might be tiring out in the short-term. However, as the 50-day SMA ($0.065) is still sloping higher, the medium-trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the downtrend line and breaks below $0.075, it will signal weakness. If that happens, the decline is likely to extend to $0.0694880 and then to the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5a94131e75f1fcaab1add33e3c31e1a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair turned down from the downtrend line, the bulls are trying to keep the price above the immediate support of $0.0766328, which is a positive sign. The bulls are again likely to attempt to push the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the traders waiting on the sidelines are likely to enter, which can carry the pair to $0.0901373. There is a minor resistance at $0.085 but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the pair below $0.0766190, a drop to $0.069488 is likely. The bulls are likely to aggressively defend this support, which might present an opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 Unus Sed Leo ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/unus-sed-leo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) had been in a strong uptrend for the past few months. The strong rally had pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory a few days ago, which suggested that traders were piling on due to fear of missing out on the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/dcb7d2d23e70b6192a106dde79df73ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LEOUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/unus-sed-leo/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 15th-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap turned down and succumbed to profit booking between June 13\u8211\'20\'1316. However, a positive is that the bulls purchased the dip below the 50-day SMA ($1.149).\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the sentiment is to buy the dips but the bears are not willing to give up without a fight. They are aggressively defending the 10-day EMA ($1.175).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 10-day EMA, the bears will attempt to sink the price below $1.12. If successful, a deeper correction to $1.05 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the price above the 10-day EMA, a retest of the recent highs at $1.26 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/64ccafd0fb45c414d1a2496cc31aa1f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LEOUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart suggests that the bears are attempting to defend the overhead resistance at $1.184. However, the buyers are not allowing the price to dip below the 10-EMA, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign.\par \par \uc2 The 10-EMA has turned up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that the short-term trend is favoring the bulls.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above $1.184 is likely to attract further buying by the bulls. Above this level, a rally to $1.24 is possible.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the LEO/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $1.16. The first support on the downside is $1.14 and below that $1.12.\par \par \uc2 XMR/USD\par \par \uc2 Monero ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/monero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2  ) has been forming an ascending triangle pattern for the past few weeks that will complete on a breakout and close (UTC time) above the $68.4175\u8211\'20\'13 $70.0979 resistance zone. The pattern target of a breakout of the triangle is $82.7887.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/faba51c89d6de127b82b62b71d4fbd4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XMRUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to defend the trendline support of the triangle, which is a positive sign. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/monero/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 16th-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap rises above the 10-day EMA ($65), the bulls will make another attempt to carry the price to the overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the altcoin turns down from the 10-day EMA and breaks below the trendline. A break below the $62\u8211\'20\'13$60 support is likely to intensify selling resulting in a possible drop to $54.0463.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ffabeb4c36d51ff1eeb1a00e58f0c6d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR/USD 4-hour chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XMRUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The rebound off the trendline is facing resistance at the 50-SMA. If the XMR/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the trendline, a drop to $62 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can propel the price above the 50-SMA and sustain it, the bulls are likely to jump in and carry the price to $67 and then to $68.4175.\par \par \uc2 Although this level is likely to attract selling, the bulls have scaled this level on two previous occasions. Therefore, if they can drive the price above this resistance once again, a retest of $70.0979 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 The market data is provided by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9lMDcyNWQ0ODVhMjQyYzIwMDQ4NTFjYWU2Zjc3ZTMwMi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200621eg6l0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 Interest in Ether Options Outpaces Bitcoin, Can Drive ETH to New Highs\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anirudh Tiwari \par \uc2 1,463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ether options could be the new fuel that drives growth in the crypto market\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) options are having a fantastic year, with open interest on Deribit \u8212\'20\'14 the largest market for these options \u8212\'20\'14 having {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-options-open-interest-soars-315-are-institutions-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surged 315% to $158 million}}}\uc2  over the past two months, breaking the $150-million barrier for the first time ever.\par \par \uc2 Even though Ether first came about only to serve the users of the Ethereum platform as a wallet to use with the apps developed on the platform, it has in the recent past emerged as the clear competitor to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), being the second-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 Emergence of ETH options\par \par \uc2 ETH options mostly emerged in March 2019 when Derbit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/deribit-launches-ethereum-derivatives-options-futures-and-deribit-perpetual"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched Ether derivatives}}}\uc2  on its exchange, including options, futures and perpetuals. Almost a year later, after the Bitcoin halving and crypto\u8217\'20\'19s general 2020 price rally, Ether options have been the prime development to emerge from the altcoin side of the industry.\par \par \uc2 To capitalize on this new opportunity in the market, Chicago-based crypto exchange ErisX launched in the second quarter {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/time-for-eth-to-rise-and-shine-as-futures-trading-now-available-in-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the first United States-based Ether futures contracts}}}\uc2 , which will even be regulated by the \uc2 Commodity Futures Trading Commission\uc2 . Even-Malta based exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-exchange-okex-launches-ether-options-eos-options-to-follow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 OKEx has launched Ether options}}}\uc2  to get into the mix, and they have gained trading traction since their launch in June.\par \par \uc2 As observed by crypto derivatives analytics firm Skew in February, investors have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/skewdotcom/status/1226798660727508992"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anticipated}}}\uc2  growth in this market when pegged against BTC. Observing the ETH/BTC spread for the six-month period, the at-the-money implied \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  increased to a six-month high of 22%. Implied \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the standard deviation of the returns traders are forecasting, and it represents the market\u8217\'20\'19s expectation of how risky an asset will be in the future. The spike implied that investors were expecting higher percentage shifts in the price of ETH (in either direction) in comparison with BTC over the next six months.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c190c10f7df16ad7f811b7f16c6aa82c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH-BTC 6 month at-the-money \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  spread}}}\par \par \uc2 Growth isn\u8217\'20\'19t isolated\par \par \uc2 This phenomenon of Ether options picking up traction in the second quarter is not unique to the altcoin; it goes hand in hand with BTC options and crypto derivatives in general, with the market witnessing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-derivatives-volume-just-hit-a-new-record-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 record highs of $602 billion in May}}}\uc2 . What is interesting is that beyond May, investor interest in BTC futures \u8212\'20\'14 the largest BTC derivative \u8212\'20\'14 has begun to dwindle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/77fa3652cf5f583a95cb16e781c09316.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total ETH options open interest}}}\par \par \uc2 On June 12, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-futures-volume-posts-2020-low-eth-open-interest-surges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC futures hit their 2020 low}}}\uc2  while open interest in Ether options continued to rise to its all-time high. Luuk Strijers, the chief commercial officer of Deribit, discussed this increased interest in Ether options with Cointelegraph, saying:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe see increased interest in ETH options due to price performance since mid-March, new firms entering the options space and intensified sales efforts by our partners. Open interest is at an all time high at around USD 157m or ~660k contracts out of which 279k or 42% will expire 26 June 2020.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Even though the implications of Ethereum 2.0\u8217\'20\'19s launch are nuanced, as it will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/eth-miners-will-have-little-choice-once-ethereum-20-launches-with-pos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 impact miners and investors differently}}}\uc2 , the perspective in the market seems to be positive toward this change, which is also lucrative for market and investor interest post-Bitcoin halving. Strijers further added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe also see an increase in OTC interest resulting in dealers hedging on Deribit, possibly related to a shift in investor interest into ETH post halving and with the upcoming ETH 2.0 launch. Investors seem to appreciate the yield potential 2.0 might offer which could be one of the reasons for the price increase since March. Investors expect that staked ETH will diminish overall supply in the market and drive up the price.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Use of smart contracts and decentralized finance\par \par \uc2 As the team behind Ethereum itself {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://geth.ethereum.org"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 puts it}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum is a decentralized platform that runs smart contracts.\u8221\'20\'1D Running on the Ethereum Virtual Machine, smart contracts are tools that help investors exchange assets in a transparent, conflict-free way \u8212\'20\'14 without the services of middlemen. Thus, smart contracts enable Ethereum to become a distributed computing network with a blockchain that has multiple use scenarios. These, combined with the decentralized finance ecosystem, also increase investor confidence and encourage institutional involvement.\par \par \uc2 The rise of altcoins such as Ether, Komodo (KMD) and Cordano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is evidence of the fact that crypto investors are looking to diversify into avenues of speculation other than BTC. Cointelegraph spoke with Nobert Goffa, the executive manager of ILCoin \u8212\'20\'14 a blockchain storage system \u8212\'20\'14 who commented:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLaunching Ether options was only a matter of time. For the market as a whole, this is a good sign. More new users and classic instruments mean good financial results for crypto exchanges and, therefore, create a favorable news background. Ultimately, this helps integrate cryptocurrencies into the current economic system.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Transfer of investor assets and lending\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/crypto-lending-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto lending}}}\uc2  has been key to powering Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s decentralized finance ecosystem to over $1 billion in locked value. It essentially entails that the borrowers are able to use their crypto assets as collateral to obtain a fiat or stablecoin loan, while lenders provide the assets required for the loan at an agreed-upon interest rate.\par \par \uc2 According to Darius Sit, a managing partner of QCP Capital \u8212\'20\'14 a crypto asset trading firm \u8212\'20\'14 the company has seen a significant transfer out of lending and into options and it\u8217\'20\'19s clear in the market that the credit risk from lending to platforms, which are highly unregulated and rampantly rehypothecate, significantly outweighs the yield from interest payments. On the feasibility of options in this unregulated lending scenario, Sit further commented:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith options, one is able to generate a much higher yield than with lending. One is also able to better control the level of risk. With lending, one can lose the entire loan amount to a default many steps removed from the many layers of rehypothecated loans collapsing. [...] With options (given proper risk management), you get a much larger return and the ability to mitigate downside risk.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The fear of default and high rates from platforms has also contributed to a shift in perception toward options in general. As Sit further added, if crypto prices didn't recover as quickly as they did after the falls observed on Black Thursday in March, some of the borrowing/lending platforms would have become insolvent and would have defaulted on their obligations. He added: \u8220\'20\'1CThe fear of this very real systemic risk is a key factor driving interest away from crypto credit into crypto options.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Institutional interest\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph previously analyzed, there is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-options-open-interest-soars-315-are-institutions-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 slight short-term \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  sentiment}}}\uc2  that is currently prevalent in the market overall. To get further insight into this involvement, Cointelegraph spoke to Alex Batlin, the CEO of Trustology \u8212\'20\'14 a custody platform for crypto assets. He stated: \u8220\'20\'1CInstitutional Investors buy options because they believe the asset is going to go up in value so they want more exposure to maximise returns,\u8221\'20\'1D adding that the \u8220\'20\'1Cbelief is based, in this case, on new revenue opportunities generated by ETH2 staking and the growth of the DeFi market.\u8221\'20\'1D On the launch of new platforms that enable the trading of these options, he further said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNew offerings from platforms like OkEx and ErisX indicate there is enough reason to believe there is institutional interest in ETH options driven by new yield opportunities through staking and defi protocols coupled with lower barriers to entry due to maturing institutional-grade infrastructure.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Positive price correlation\par \par \uc2 When observing the correlation between open interest and price over time, it\u8217\'20\'19s noticed that prices rallying since mid-March goes hand in hand with the increase in open interest. Cointelegraph also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/300-eth-ethereum-looks-to-be-next-major-crypto-to-follow-cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported on the possibility of ETH touching $300}}}\uc2  in the near future. This adds to the evidence of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment in the market, which would make it even more lucrative for investors to consider, as Sit stated: \u8220\'20\'1CThe increasing interest and liquidity in the vol market is an encouraging step for the development of ETH as a trading asset. Larger institutional participation would likely be positive for ETH.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows a positive price correlation for ETH/USD when compared alongside the timeline of the aforementioned open interest statistics.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bc1fa3f896771db5c050389ba7adbb81.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD pair spot price fluctuation}}}\par \par \uc2 Gauging the indicative analytics and positive market sentiment around ETH options, it is evident that growth isn\u8217\'20\'19t expected to slow down until the launch of Ethereum 2.0, which may prove to provide a paradigm shift for the market itself. However, continuous technological innovation and the involvement of reasonable regulations and institutions will be integral to sustain this upward momentum.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/two-sides-of-the-same-derivative-comparing-traditional-and-crypto-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Two Sides of the Same Derivative: Comparing Traditional and Crypto Markets}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy84MzBmOWFiN2M3ZWEyZDI1ZjYwYmVlOGZmNTY0N2JkNy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200621eg6l0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/19: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,724 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Most major cryptocurrencies are stuck in a range suggesting a balance between supply and demand\par \par \uc2 Kraken crypto exchange CEO Jesse Powell has said that a large number of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hedge-funds-retail-investors-bought-the-dip-kraken-ceo-jesse-powell"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 both}}}\uc2  retail and institutional investors have opened accounts with them. This shows that all types of investors are concerned about the current economic condition, hence they have been diversifying their portfolio using cryptocurrencies. The influx of institutional money is a positive sign because it will give confidence to the other institutions to take the plunge.\par \par \uc2 WisdomTree Investments, a New York-based asset manager has sought approval to launch an exchange-traded fund that plans to invest about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fund-manager-files-for-etf-spanning-energy-agriculture-and-bitcoin-futures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5%}}}\uc2  of its net assets in cash-settled Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) futures and the rest in four commodity sectors. If the ETF receives the regulatory nod, it would be a huge positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a0f54faf5dea032a581454e26497eed6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 For the past few days, the S&P 500 has been rising but BTC, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap, has stalled. PlanB, the creator of the stock-to-flow model, said that both assets are highly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sp-500-correlation-means-it-should-cost-18k-says-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 correlated}}}\uc2  but their current performance is showing a large divergence in the short-term. Hence, he anticipates either the stock market to correct or Bitcoin to rally.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been facing stiff resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,476) for the past few days. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the 50 level suggest that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/04b8931f3d2557b281b2fcbe5fecd412.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the trendline of the developing ascending triangle pattern, a drop to $8,638.79 and then to $8,130.58 is likely. If the price rebounds off this strong support, the BTC/USD pair might remain range-bound for a few days. However, if the pair slips below $8,130.58, it would be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can scale the price above the 20-day EMA, a move to $10,000 is possible. A breakout of the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,376.38 zone will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $11,869.42.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating between $225.873 and $239.35. The 20-day EMA ($232) has flattened out and the RSI is close to the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c3c1dcfd2772bab7f7572d3e69b7d39b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A break below $225.783 and the 50-day simple moving average ($219) will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The next support on the downside is $196.875 and then the critical level of $176.112.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the current level and breaks out of $239.35, a move to $253.55 is possible. Above this resistance, the momentum is likely to pick up and the next level to watch out for is $288.599.\par \par \uc2 While in a range, it is difficult to predict which way the breakout will happen. Therefore, it is best to wait for the price to start a trending move before initiating any trades.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has dipped to the support line of the symmetrical triangle. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.195) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/58e92635266687f39d907d8ca5f3491f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the altcoin breaks and closes (UTC time) below the triangle, the bears will try to drag the price to $0.162 and then to $0.144.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns around from the current levels and breaks out of the downtrend line of the triangle. A close (UTC time) above the triangle can push the price to $0.214616 and then to $0.235688.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the moving averages on June 17. The bears are currently attempting to sink the price to the support at $217.55. If this support cracks, the decline can extend to $200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/64cfd67f49ff4ad8620421a8af946bf5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns up from the current levels, the bulls will try to push it back above the moving averages. If successful, a move to $255.46 is possible.\par \par \uc2 If the BCH/USD pair turns down from this level, the range-bound action is likely to extend for a few more days. However, if the bulls can propel the pair above $255.46, a rally to $280.47 is likely. This is a critical resistance because above this, the rally can extend to $350.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sink Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) below the $170\u8211\'20\'13$165.380 support zone. The 20-day EMA ($183) is sloping down and the RSI has drifted below the 40 level, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/64f65571ccf60019f6c95dd94dbdbc55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Although a fall to the support of a large range is usually a good level to buy, traders should wait for the price to rebound before initiating any long positions because, on the way down, there is a risk that the support might not hold.\par \par \uc2 A break below the support zone will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The next support on the downside is $146.2 and if that also breaks, the decline can extend to $120.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the current levels and breaks above the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a rally to $200 and then $227.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears again defended the moving averages on June 19. If \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) breaks below $41.7326, a drop to the support at $39 is possible. This is a critical level to watch out for because if it breaks, the next support is at $32.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f99b22205b66f9a8af9082ecf8b0f141.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rises from the current levels and breaks above the moving averages, the bulls will attempt to carry it to the resistance at $51.\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair turns down from this level, a few more days of range-bound action is likely. However, if the bulls can propel the price above $51, the momentum is likely to pick up with the next target objective being $64.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has again dropped to the support of the $15.72\u8211\'20\'13$18.1377 range. Repeated retests of a support level tend to weaken it. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($16.70) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/66409f9af12c4f702d373b421b2b2af2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap breaks below the $15.72\u8211\'20\'13$15.40 support, a drop to $13.65 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BNB/USD pair rebounds off the current levels and breaks above the moving averages, a rally to $18.1377 is possible. A breakout of this resistance can attract buyers who can push the price to $21.50.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has again turned down from just below the moving averages. The 20-day EMA ($2.61) is gradually sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, which suggests that bears have a slight advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/594a4235597545416fb9d04217687ce8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to the critical support at $2.3314. A breakdown of this support will be a negative sign and could result in a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the EOS/USD pair rises from the current levels and breaks above the moving averages, it can reach $2.8319. This level has been acting as stiff resistance for the past few weeks. If the pair again turns down from this resistance, a few more days of range-bound action is likely.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can push the price above $2.8319, a rally to $3.1104 is possible.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to stall Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rally at $0.085. However, the positive thing is that they have not been able to break the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.077), suggesting demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8822d2e2adb9e4f63c97650b90dc97f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can carry the price above $0.085, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can reach the recent highs at $0.0901373. A breakout of this resistance will signal resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair slips and sustains below the 20-day EMA. Such a move can drag the pair to $0.069488 and if this support gives way, the next level to watch out for is the 50-day SMA ($0.064).\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) has reached close to the overhead resistance of $0.118234. Both the upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/50fe2de7ce6267c7704303ff8389fcae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $0.118234, the uptrend is likely to resume. The first target objective is $0.135202 and if this resistance is scaled, the rally can extend to $0.15306.\par \par \uc2 However, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from $0.118234, it could get stuck in a range for a few days. The first sign of weakness would be a break below $0.101266.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy83MTY2NGMwN2RkMDQxN2I4MmY3ZTdmYjc1MTNjNTg5My5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200619eg6j000bc\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/17: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is struggling to overtake $9.6K even as Federal Reserve policy appears to be driving new investors into BTC\par \par \uc2 Stephen Roach, a faculty member at \uc2 Yale University\uc2  and former chairman of Morgan Stanley Asia, believes that the supremacy of the U.S. dollar is likely to be challenged and the greenback could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2020-06-14/dollar-crash-how-will-it-unfold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decline}}}\uc2  by as much as 35%. This impending dollar weakness could benefit gold and cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Several large traders have been accumulating Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and according to on-chain data this has boosted the number of whales \u8212\'20\'14 traders holding 1,000 or more of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap \u8212\'20\'14 to 1,882. Usually, large traders build huge positions when they expect a sustained uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3cceb3d664745e462ae3477db52f5106.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another interesting development is that investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2020-06-17/-bitcoin-boomers-fuel-volume-growth-at-startup-river-financial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over}}}\uc2  the age of 55 had largely stayed away from crypto assets but new data shows they have started investing in cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin financial services firm River Financial Inc., said that its clients have doubled every month in 2020 and 77% of the volume growth has come from the investors above the age of 55.\par \par \uc2 This shows that the current economic environment and the huge stimulus measures delivered by the central banks are attracting new investors into the crypto space.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the rebound off the lows on June 15 indicated strong demand at lower levels, the bulls are struggling to push Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) above $9,600. This suggests selling by the bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1773d644daada446ae8605c4c8114bdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($9,489) has flattened out and the relative strength index is close to the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 50-day simple moving average ($9,355) and $8,910.04 support zone will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. Below this zone, a drop to the critical support at $8,130.58 is possible. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, if the bulls can propel the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, a retest of $10,500 is likely. A break above this level could start a sustained uptrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply from the 50-day SMA ($218) on June 15 but the bulls are struggling to push the price above the immediate resistance of $239.35. This suggests that the bears are unwilling to throw in the towel easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1920c3dd8d482b66840848c9fb6f2064.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($233) has flattened out and the RSI is just above the 50 level, which suggests that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $239.50 within the next few days, the bears will again try to sink the price below the 50-day SMA. A close (UTC time) below the 50-day SMA could drag the price to $196.875 and then to $176.112.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can propel and sustain the price above $239.50, a move to $253.556 is likely. A break above this level could resume the up move with a target objective of $288.599.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The rebound from the June 15 lows is facing resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.19). This suggests that the bears are aggressively defending the higher levels. The bears are now likely to again attempt to sink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  below the support line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d730f1c67615699a6c07f6ec71ba18d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, a new downtrend is likely. The first support is at $0.162 and below that $0.144. The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, which suggests that bears have a slight advantage.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign of strength. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to pick up momentum after it breaks out of the downtrend line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded from the low of $224.35 on June 15, the bulls are struggling to push the price above the moving averages. This suggests that bulls are buying aggressively at lower levels but buying interest dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0d20ccaacb0187e74242517ae132446c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the moving averages, a drop to $217.55 is likely. If this support cracks, the decline can extend to the critical support of $200. A break below this level could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can scale the BCH/USD pair above the moving averages, a move to $255.46 and above it to $280.47 is possible. A breakout of this resistance could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) pulled back from $165.380 and closed (UTC time) above $170 on June 15. This suggests demand at lower levels but the bulls have not been able to carry the altcoin above the 20-day EMA ($186).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fa8dbb836dffdddef6296e0971cc7ca4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI remains in the negative territory, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks below the $170\u8211\'20\'13$165.38 support zone, a new downtrend is likely. The first support on the downside is $146.2 and if this cracks, a drop to $120 is possible.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the BSV/USD pair can breakout of the moving averages and the $200 resistance.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has again reached the moving averages, which are close to the center of the large $39\u8211\'20\'13$45 range. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the 50 level, which suggests a balance between bulls and bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f5a0ba2bdd8d8737888c97204068cde1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap once again turns down from the moving averages, a drop to $39 is possible. This is a critical support to watch out for because if this gives way, the decline can extend to $32.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the LTC/USD pair above the moving averages, a rally to $51 is likely. A breakout of this resistance could start a new uptrend that can carry the pair to $64.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bears broke below the $15.72 support on June 15, they could not sustain the lower levels. Strong buying again propelled Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) back into the $15.72\u8211\'20\'13$18.1377 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f5714d4e0ac10c76b2281faa9ecbdb7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are struggling to push the price above the moving averages, which suggests a lack of urgency to buy at higher levels. If the price turns down from the current levels, the bears will make another attempt to break below $15.72.\par \par \uc2 If the price closes (UTC time) below $15.72, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap can drop to $13.65.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls can propel the BNB/USD pair above the moving averages, a rally to $18.1377 is likely. A breakout of this level might start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been range-bound between $2.3314\u8211\'20\'13$2.8319 for the past few days. On June 15, the bulls stepped in to support the altcoin at $2.4208. If the bulls can push the price above the moving averages, a move to $2.8319 is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/541c7c138ab3a8eda6bc453224f61d03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend the $2.8319 resistance aggressively. If the price turns down from this level, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to extend its stay inside the range.\par \par \uc2 If the EOS/USD pair turns down from the moving averages, the bears will attempt to sink it below the critical support at $2.3314. If successful, a new downtrend is likely.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply from the intraday low of $0.069488, which is just below the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0705811. This suggests that the sentiment is to accumulate on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/14830d0c8f380ed31b6671b588123481.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $0.0806825, which is a positive sign. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can reach $0.085 and then retest the recent highs at $0.0901373.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests that bulls still hold the advantage.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $0.0740613. If that happens, a retest of $0.069488 is possible. If this support also cracks the pair can drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.0634).\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 The dip in Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) on June 15 did not even reach the 20-day EMA ($0.102). This suggests that the bulls were in no hurry to book profits as they expect higher levels in the future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f478d3686dc193f5f6c65d79ff8f73ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI remains near the overbought territory, which suggests that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of $0.118234 will signal resumption of the uptrend. The next level to watch on the upside is $0.135202 and above it $0.15306.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from $0.118234, a few days of range-bound action is likely. A deeper correction can be expected on a break below $0.101266.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jNWMyOGEzMzRkZmE0MjQwODZlNjE1NmU1NDcyYjc0MC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200617eg6h000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 $300 ETH? Ethereum Looks to Be Next Major Crypto to Follow Cardano\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 1,132 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum price is set for a major breakout and hitting as high as $330 next shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be ruled out\par \par \uc2 Recently, several altcoins have been showing strength. A few good examples are Theta Token ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/theta-theta"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 THETA}}}\uc2  ), Zilliqa ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/zilliqa-zil"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZIL}}}\uc2  ), and Elrond ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/elrond-erd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ERD}}}\uc2  ). However, the large caps are lagging heavily and the only large-cap performing well has been Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 As smaller cap altcoins begin to lift off, some investors might be wondering exactly what is needed for a significant surge in the large caps? Does the market need confirmation from Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap, or is the top altcoin Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) the signal?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/57fedf05a77127168a728a54617aab19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market daily performanc}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-iumedbh5g3_1592317603293"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether holds crucial $220 support level\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD rallied from $195 to $250 in the last month but it also corrected alongside Bitcoin in the previous days. As Bitcoin price pulled back this week, Ether endured a test and the green area between $271-$222 is the zone that needed to hold as support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/30da91df82111d1b634d8f0ecedbe77d."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USDT 1-day chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/8o8S76Ks/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As shown on the chart above, the bounce succeeded and confirmed that the $217-$222 level is a support level, whereas it was resistance throughout May.\par \par \uc2 The chart is also showing an apparent resistance at the $250 level, where a range appears This range has support between $217-$222 and resistance at $250. As the range is determined, the conclusion can be drawn that a breakout leads to a trend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD has been in an uptrend since the crash on March 12, after which it\u8217\'20\'19s more likely to see further upside above $250.\par \par \uc2 The next primary resistances can be found at $290 and $330-$340. If the price drops below $217, a potential support test of the 100-day and 200-day Moving Average can be expected at $168-$176.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f57ae841732d623f48e268b09a09f22d."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/624S9p5f/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bigger picture is showing a clear accumulation period for ETH/USD; and since July 2018, the price of Ethereum has been hovering between $100 and $300 \u8212\'20\'14 a range of two years \u8212\'20\'14 ready to break out.\par \par \uc2 The longer such a range sustains, the heavier the breakout likely becomes. Additionally, such a long accumulation period warrants an excellent risk/reward opportunity as well.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s crucial in this chart? The 100 and 200-day MA are beneath the current price, which warrants support and warrants further upwards momentum.\par \par \uc2 Another argument for further gains comes from the increased volume inside this accumulation. As is often said, volume precedes price, through which accumulation is often spotted by an increase in volume. Ether is currently showing this signal.\par \par \uc2 Total market cap shows an increased interest in cryptocurrency\par \par \uc2 The total market capitalization of cryptocurrencies is showing a clear breakthrough in the 2018 support level. The $215-$222 billion levels have been support earlier in the cycle and have again flipped to become support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bbbdc6ec5e86c260a6a170f6e7429234."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Total market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/y5QUr8Rg/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Similar cases are found in the market capitalization and ETH/USD charts. Increasing interest through rising volume is also a signal that accumulation is taking place.\par \par \uc2 The 100 and 200-day MA are beneath the current market capitalization, signaling that the market capitalization is currently moving into \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  territory.\par \par \uc2 The main priority for the total market capitalization would be a breakout above the $305 billion resistance as that would indicate a new higher high and another positive \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  argument for the start of a massive new cycle.\par \par \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization lags heavily\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5d1dad83ad8ff20baf72ba89b7b654b1."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart}}}\par \par \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/w53jZSXl/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market capitalization is showing a definite accumulation period, as the altcoin market capitalization has been hovering between $50 and $113 billion. As accumulation ranges come to an end, the climax is approaching for the total altcoin market capitalization as well.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s crucial again is that the 100 and 200-day moving averages need to provide support in the same way they did throughout the entire cycle before the peak in December 2017.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, a breakout is likely above $113 billion and a sustainable rally towards $135 or even $200 billion. To date, the resistance at $113 billion has been tested several times.\par \par \uc2 As a rule, the more a resistance gets tested, the weaker the level becomes. Another test would likely create enough strength for a breakthrough and a surge to the upside.\par \par \uc2 In that regard, $200 billion is not an impossible level to expect in the next rally.\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC is compressing\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5571da19caae77f4b14ff9267fd496b6."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/BTC 1-day chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/KkYXENmA/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/BTC chart is currently showing compression but what does this mean? Basically, it means that the price is moving within narrowing ranges and as the price moves inside these narrow ranges a breakout typically results in a heavy volatile move.\par \par \uc2 In the case of Ether, it\u8217\'20\'19s likely to expect this breakout to occur to the upside. A similar accumulation range is happening here, through which the BTC pair is hovering above the 100 and 200-day MA.\par \par \uc2 As long as these levels sustain support, a breakout to the upside is likely to occur. The next areas to watch are 0.029-0.03 sats and 0.036-0.04 sats.\par \par \uc2 The levels to watch on the USD pair\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ccbb55e8d4b90139c19697bc6a1f3156."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/4DBbPe4f/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The most likely scenario is shown in the chart above. As the previous resistance of $217-$222 is confirmed as support, a continuation to the upside is likely to occur.\par \par \uc2 As discussed earlier, the previous rally to $215 showed that consolidation is the most likely occurrence here. In this consolidation, strength can be gathered before the next massive impulse wave starts.\par \par \uc2 Once Ether price breaks above the $250 barrier, further continuation towards $290 and $330 are on the tables. In this case, the major resistance area to watch is at $330.\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, if Ether price drops below the support level of $217-$222, a downward continuation is likely. The final support is the 100 and 200-day MA area around $175-180.\par \par \uc2 This zone has to remain a support in order to sustain further upwards momentum. Otherwise, retests of $100 can even become likely.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8zZjZmY2ZiNzYxNjU4MTYzMTRlMTBiZDU4ZTU1NjljZC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200616eg6g000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Search Interest for Bitcoin Highest in Africa and South America\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Turner Wright \par \uc2 358 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Google Trends data compiled by Blockchaincenter.net shows search interest in Bitcoin is highest in Kenya and Brazil\par \par \uc2 An interactive map showing the level of cryptocurrency interest worldwide reveals that Bitcoin searches are most concentrated in countries in Africa and South America.\par \par \uc2 According to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blockchaincenter.net/cryptocurrency-world-map/?crypto=BTC;ETH;XRP;BCH;LTC;ADA;XMR;TRX;MIOTA;DOGE;"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 map published at Blockchaincenter.net}}}\uc2 , Google Trends data shows that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dominates search interest in Africa. 94.7% of all searches related to cryptocurrencies\u8212\'20\'14including BTC, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/iota-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IOTA}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ), Monero ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xmr-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , and Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  )\u8212\'20\'14in Kenya are for Bitcoin, while Nigeria and South Africa had high percentages of 89.4% and 89%, respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1acaa4cdc02873450c64c300b5fbd885.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 10 Most Bitcoin Maximalist Countries}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blockchaincenter.net/cryptocurrency-world-map/?crypto=BTC;ETH;XRP;BCH;LTC;ADA;XMR;TRX;MIOTA;DOGE;"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchaincenter.net}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Africa\par \par \uc2 The search indicates countries in Africa may become key crypto players in the future. Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/prominent-nigerian-politician-calls-for-legal-framework-for-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has reported}}}\uc2  that the speaker of the Nigerian House of Representatives called for a substantive legal framework for cryptocurrencies in July 2019.\par \par \uc2 However, South Africa has 13% of cryptocurrency ownership in Africa, the highest among internet users in the region. In April, the country\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/africa-is-experiencing-a-crypto-renaissance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 financial regulator issued a policy}}}\uc2  document asserting that crypto assets and activities relating to virtual currencies \u8220\'20\'1Ccan no longer remain outside of the regulatory perimeter.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin response to pandemic\par \par \uc2 South America had four countries in the top ten most \u8216\'20\'18Bitcoin maximalist\u8217\'20\'19 to Africa\u8217\'20\'19s three. Brazil had the highest search interest in BTC at 92.6%, while both Chile and Ecuador were roughly 89%. Argentina had the lowest interest of the top ten in the region at 87.7%.\par \par \uc2 The coronavirus pandemic seemed to spark a greater demand for crypto in these nations. Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/interest-in-bitcoin-spikes-worldwide-during-covid-19-crisis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported in April}}}\uc2  that BTC peer-to-peer trading volume in Argentina, Chile, and Venezuela had reached all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Venezuela did not make the top ten on the aforementioned map, but BTC search interest in the region was still 75.2%. The recent interest may be due to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/banking-shut-down-drives-crypto-adoption-among-venezuelans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suspension of the country's national banking system}}}\uc2  as part of quarantine measures.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy85YzcxZWNhZmNmZDMzNTc3MjAyM2IxNzE3Mzg1MmFhYi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200616eg6g00002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/15: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, CRO,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,783 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Recent surges in open interest on Bitcoin and Ethereum options contracts suggests institutional players are continuing to build positions in the top two cryptocurrencies\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) futures {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-futures-volume-posts-2020-low-eth-open-interest-surges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 daily trading}}}\uc2  volume plunged sharply from about $20 billion on June 11 to about $5 billion on June 13. This is a negative sign because the volume increased during the sharp fall on June 11 but reduced during the rebound on June 12 and 13.\par \par \uc2 On June 14, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap declined but the futures volume picked up, suggesting a higher number of \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades on market declines and a lesser number of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades during pullbacks.\par \par \uc2 While the trading volume fell, open interest on Bitcoin derivatives has risen to about $4 billion for the first time in three months. This suggests that the long-term players are not liquidating their positions yet as they do not see a major decline from the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d699ea1df475beeef78ca63137501f27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-pl0nevx5n8_1591987263073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only Bitcoin open interest that has been increasing, Ether (ETH) futures contracts have also been creating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-options-open-interest-soars-315-are-institutions-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 records}}}\uc2 . This suggests that institutional investors are diversifying their crypto portfolio by increasing positions in the biggest altcoin.\par \par \uc2 Retail investors are also not to be left behind. Data by glassnode shows that the number of wallets containing 0.1 Bitcoin and a similar quantity of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is at a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-record-number-of-investors-are-holding-at-least-01-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lifetime high}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,495) for the past three days attracted further selling. Today, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a29f937bcd45014d9ac26533e58b544d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 While the breakdown was a huge negative, the bears could not sustain the selling pressure at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair turned around from $8,910.04 and has currently climbed back inside the triangle. If the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA, another attempt to break out of the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone is likely.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears again defend the 20-day EMA, they are likely to make another attempt to sink the pair below the triangle. A close (UTC time) below the triangle will be a huge negative and can result in a decline to $8,638.79 and below it to $8,130.58.\par \par \uc2 As both the bulls and the bears are locked in a tussle to gain the upper hand, the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to remain high for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the ascending channel on June 11. Unlike previous breakdowns (marked as ellipses on the chart), the bulls could not push the price back into the channel and sustain it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/73e68362907f80101568ddf66bbbdcea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This attracted further selling and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap broke below the uptrend line. There is a minor support at the 50-day simple moving average ($217) below which the decline can extend to $196 and then to $176.112.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the ETH/USD pair bounces off the 50-day SMA and sustains above $225.783, it will signal strong demand at lower levels. That could result in consolidation between $253.556\u8211\'20\'13$225.783 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The weak rebound off the support line of the symmetrical triangle indicates a lack of buyers at higher levels. Currently, the bears are attempting to sink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  below the triangle. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.197) and the relative strength index in the negative territory suggests an advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1748eb721de210910b0baa258491f040.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On a close (UTC time) below the triangle, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can drop to $0.16 and if this support also cracks, the next support is at $0.14.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls manage to keep the BCH/USD pair inside the triangle, it will signal accumulation at lower levels. The advantage will turn in favor of the bulls on a break above the triangle.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the large $200\u8211\'20\'13$280.47 range for the past few months, the price has been stuck inside a tighter $217.55\u8211\'20\'13$255.46 range for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/62ff48fe26999990bc50b75966dada01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bears are attempting to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the $217.55 support. If successful, a drop to $200 is likely. The bulls are likely to defend the $200\u8211\'20\'13$217.55 zone aggressively and a break below this zone will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BCH/USD pair rebounds off the $200\u8211\'20\'13$217.55 zone, it will indicate accumulation at lower levels. This will also keep the pair inside the range and could offer a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) broke below the critical support of $170 for the first time since April 2. This is a negative sign as it suggests that the bulls are not able to defend this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d7d586f5444b05e3d1c69e335d60e0cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($188) has started to slope down and the RSI is close to the oversold levels, suggesting that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap closes (UTC time) below $170, it will indicate that the range has resolved to the downside. Below $170, a drop to $146.20 and then to $120 is likely.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the BSV/USD pair closes (UTC time) above $170. Such a move will suggest that the bulls are defending the support levels and the range-bound is likely to continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The rebound after the sharp fall on June 11 could not rise above the moving averages. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears are now likely to attempt to sink \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) to the support of the large $39\u8211\'20\'13$51 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b78e3474bb2bf510736637ead35cf28d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The $39 level has not been breached on a closing basis since April, hence, the bulls are likely to buy the dip to this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will increase the possibility that the range-bound action will continue for a few more days. In a large range, a strong bounce off the support can be viewed as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $39. If that happens, a drop to $32.50 is likely.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $18.1377 and $15.72 for the past few days. After failing to break out of the range between May 21\u8211\'20\'13June 2, the bears are currently attempting to sink the altcoin below the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4dba1d1cbd0a125a5ed08a490daffb5b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap closes (UTC time) below $15.72, a drop to $13.65 is possible. This support has held for more than two months, hence, the bulls will try to defend it once again.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls defend the $15.72 levels on a closing basis, it will be a huge positive and can result in a move to $18.1377. A breakout of this resistance is likely to start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The rebound in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  following the fall on June 11 could not even reach the moving averages. This suggests a lack of buying interest at higher levels. The altcoin has turned down and can now reach the critical support at $2.3314.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2bec7f88a546ee151b6f1783e3ecaaaf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink and sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $2.3314, it suggests that bears have overpowered the bulls. This could result in a drop to $2.09 and below it to $1.8309.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls have repeatedly defended the $2.3314 support. If the bulls successfully defend $2.3314 once again, the EOS/USD pair might extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past three months. This has helped the altcoin become the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/crypto-com-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d47a47d3dfbe8e4bdca7bdda9d5bd788.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/CROUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong rally from the lows had pushed the RSI deep into overbought territory. The CRO/USD pair is currently correcting the overbought levels but the trend remains up.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the 20-day EMA ($0.100). If the pair bounces off this support, the bulls will again attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the pair below the 20-day EMA, the selling can intensify and drag the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.079).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has broken below the 20-day EMA ($0.075), which suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has dropped to the 50 levels indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/17371b85a1e262ee2eed903c3a5cfebf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0705811. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap bounces off this support, it can move up to $0.080 and above it to $0.0901373.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the support cracks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair can decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.062). This is a critical support to watch out for because if this level breaks down, the decline can extend to $0.0510249.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8wNzZjMzkzYTVlY2ZlYWI5M2RkM2QxNTg5NjY1ZjUyNi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200615eg6f000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Cryptocurrencies to Watch This Week: BTC, XTZ, XLM,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , NEO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,924 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is likely to make a decisive move in the next few days and start a trending move that could remain in force for a few weeks\par \par \uc2 Takeshi Fujimaki, a former adviser to George Soros, has said that Paul Tudor Jones is attempting to capture the big trend. According to Fujimaki, Jones\u8217\'20\'19 recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paul-tudor-jones-bitcoin-investments-not-a-surprise-former-soros-adviser-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investment}}}\uc2  into Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) indicates that he is concerned about inflation and believes that cryptocurrencies could benefit in such an environment.\par \par \uc2 Following the recent growth and popularity of Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin Trust security in the past few months, investment firm Wilshire Phoenix has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wilshire-phoenix-files-with-sec-for-publicly-traded-bitcoin-backed-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed}}}\uc2  an application with the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  to launch a publicly traded Bitcoin fund. If the fund gets the green signal it is likely to attract institutional investors.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5440fc510d086fe3643aef4473733bdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-fpje2fq19a_1589129732773"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 For the past few weeks the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap has been struggling to break out of the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 resistance zone. This can attract profit booking by short-term bulls and shorting by aggressive bears. If BTC weakens further it is likely to have a knock on effect on altcoins but this could also bring about some lucrative investment opportunities. Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at a few cryptocurrencies that may offer trading opportunities to bulls and bears.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tussle between the bulls and the bears. The bulls are attempting to scale the price above the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 overhead resistance zone in order to resume the up move. On the other hand, the bears are trying to form a short-term top at the $10,000 levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/695282541ff2442c17c8debc5b5aebc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair turned down from the critical level of $10,000 on June 10 and slumped to the 50-day simple moving average ($9,254) on June 11. Hence, traders should watch these two levels carefully because the next trending move is likely to start after the price breaks out of either level.\par \par \uc2 If the pair rises above the 10-day exponential moving average ($9,548), the bulls will try to carry the price to $10,000 levels. A breakout of the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$10,500 zone will signal the possible start of a sustainable uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA a deeper correction to $8,638.70 and then to $8,130.58 is likely. A break below this support could attract further selling and result in a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Currently, as the 50-day SMA is still sloping up, the intermediate trend favors the bulls while the short-term trend has turned indecisive as seen from the up and down movement of the 10-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fd1e598be5a86a431578e8506687c170.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip below the trendline (shown via ellipse on the chart) but they are finding it difficult to sustain the rebound. This suggests selling on any pullback by the bears.\par \par \uc2 In the short-term, the downtrend line is acting as a resistance. If the pair breaks above the downtrend line, the bulls might make one more attempt to carry the price to $10,058.52. This move could present a trading opportunity to the aggressive traders.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks down of the trendline, it will signal an advantage to the bears. If the price sustains below the trendline the bears will make another attempt to sink the pair below $9,078.96. If this is successful then a new downtrend is possible.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) had been trading in an ascending channel for the past few weeks. However, on June 11, the altcoin plunged below the channel, which is a huge negative. The large red candle shows that bears were in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e7258e42e533fedbfa623172afe71a83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 With this breakdown, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap also slipped below the 50-day SMA ($2.75). Both moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative territory, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the $2.5202 intraday low formed on June 11, a downtrend is likely to begin. The next support on the downside is $2.24, which was the intraday low made on May 10.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bulls reverse direction and push the price back above the downtrend line. In such a case, the trend might turn range-bound in the near-term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fe7d38415d62f6ebc867728a2374f5e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the selling picked up momentum after the price slipped below the channel and further intensified on a break below the horizontal support at $2.8085.\par \par \uc2 On the pullback from the lows, the bears aggressively defended the 10-EMA, which is another \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. If the bears can sink the price below $2.5202, the XTZ/USD pair is likely to pick up momentum on the downside. This could offer a shorting opportunity to aggressive traders.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls defend the $2.589\u8211\'20\'13$2.5202 zone aggressively, the pair might rise to $2.70 and then to $2.7568 and remain range-bound for a few days. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bulls propel the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the support line of the ascending channel and the 50-day SMA ($0.071) on June 11. While this is a negative sign, the bears have not been able to build upon this breakdown.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ffb13bee7f4952c5068e9a85fa01c54a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that bulls are buying on dips and are trying to keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/stellar/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 13th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap inside the channel. However, the bears are not allowing the bulls to have it easy as they are attempting to stall the recovery and start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below $0.068607, a drop to $0.063509 and then to $0.59404 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can carry the price above the downtrend line, a rally to $0.079319 and then to $0.086277 is likely. The altcoin can go either way and offer trading opportunities to both bulls and bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9a7a1d8403c2b2265f04dc60b69009a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are aggressively defending the resistance at $0.074. If the XLM/USD pair continues lower and breaks below $0.068607, it is likely to attract further selling. This could offer a shorting opportunity to the aggressive traders.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can push the price above $0.074 and the downtrend line, the momentum is likely to pick up. This could offer a buying opportunity to the bulls. Above the downtrend line, a rally to $0.08 and then to $0.086277 is likely.\par \par \uc2 As the pair can move either way, traders should be careful with the first breakout or breakdown because the possibilities of a bull trap or a bear trap are high. It is better to wait for the breakout to sustain before initiating any trades.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently witnessing a pullback in an uptrend. The 50-day SMA ($0.061) is sloping up, which suggests that the intermediate trend is up. However, the short-term has turned negative as seen from the downsloping 10-day EMA ($0.079).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9a62f806460f5777cf7d71d7b5f9cfa4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The pullback is a healthy sign because it has helped the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap correct the huge overbought levels on the RSI.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to provide support at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0751964. If the rebound off this support can sustain above $0.0806825, it will increase the likelihood of a retest of $0.0901373 and if this level is scaled, the uptrend could resume.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below $0.0751964, a drop to the 50% and 61.8% Fibonacci retracement levels of $0.0705811 and $0.0659658 is possible. The deeper the pullback, lower will be the chances of a resumption of the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f2e3993c620f8a70cf34cb5945d56db3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages on the four-hour chart are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, which suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair rebounds off the $0.0740\u8211\'20\'13$0.0720 support zone, the bulls will attempt to push the price above the downtrend line. A breakout of $0.0806825 can open up trading opportunities to the upside.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair sinks below the support zone. Such a move will indicate that bears have a firm grip. In such a case, long positions can be avoided.\par \par \uc2 NEO/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/neo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEO}}}\uc2  is at a critical level. The 50-day SMA ($10.34) is sloping up, which suggests that the intermediate trend is up. However, on June 10, the altcoin broke below the support line of the ascending channel, which suggests that the upside momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/aa53f6c0ca6ae5ee34a8329026fdc1fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEO/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 NEO/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NEOUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Even though the bulls purchased the dips on June 10, the subsequent rebound has been weak. This suggests that buying dries up at higher levels. Another negative sign is that the bulls are struggling to keep the price inside the channel.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/neo/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 19th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $10.42133, the selling is likely to intensify. The next support to watch out on the downside is $9.21399 and then $8.60349.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the price back above the 10-day EMA ($11.27) and the downtrend line, it will suggest aggressive buying by the bulls at lower levels. This will increase the possibility of a rally to $12.2839 and then to $12.1711.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/75239cbe139ccea066095e79246946f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEO/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 NEO/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NEOUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that bulls are struggling to keep the price inside the ascending channel. This is a negative sign as this indicates selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 If the NEO/USD pair breaks below $10.42133, it could open up the gates for further downsides to $9.58498 and then to $9.21399. Traders may attempt to ride this move lower using short positions. The 50-SMA is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls purchase the dip once again and propel the pair above the downtrend line, it is likely to attract further buying. A buying opportunity is likely to open up for the bulls if the price sustains above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 The market data is provided by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8zOTgzM2Y0ODViY2NkOTAzYzExMjdmNzkyNGM1NzllNy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200614eg6e000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 6 Questions For...\par \b \uc2 6 Questions for Michelle O\u8217\'20\'19Connor of Uphold\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Editorial Staff \par \uc2 930 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe bridge from old to new money systems used to be a long one, and you couldn\u8217\'20\'19t quite see the other side \u8212\'20\'14 we\u8217\'20\'19re closer than ever today.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Each week we ask the buidlers in the blockchain and cryptocurrency sector for their thoughts on the industry\u8230\'20\'26 and we throw in a few random zingers to keep them on their toes!\par \par \uc2 This week our 6 Questions go to Michelle O\u8217\'20\'19Connor, VP of Marketing at Uphold\par \par \uc2 Michelle is passionate about building the future of inclusive finance through emerging technologies to both streamline and empower businesses and consumers through transparency and financial inclusion. She has spoken on FinTech, blockchain and digital financial services and community building efforts, and was recently recognized as one of the \u8216\'20\'18Most Inspirational Women in Tech 2019.\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Earlier in her career, she founded a hybrid marketing agency bridging the gap between traditional media, public relations, social media, and community marketing. In this role she focused on lifestyle brands, providing strategic and lean marketing strategies along with social media, public relations, and community programs.\par \par \uc2 1 \u8212\'20\'14 Which two superpowers would you most want to have, and how would you combine them for good\u8230\'20\'26 or evil?\par \par \uc2 Without a doubt, I\u8217\'20\'19d choose the ability to time travel and freeze time. How amazing would it be to wake up one day, think to yourself, I want to go back to meet \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2  Lovelace, a renowned mathematician who is widely considered to be the first computer programmer way back in the mid-1800s?! To experience the world alongside \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2 , knowing the world as it is now (in large part a result of her early work) \u8212\'20\'14 would be utterly inspiring.\par \par \uc2 My fascination with freezing time may be a direct result of growing up watching Evie Garland on the 1980\u8217\'20\'19s show Out of This World freeze time, and how those scenarios played out. Now, more than ever, I\u8217\'20\'19d love to have the ability to freeze things as they are, and in parallel fast-track the vaccine for coronavirus, then unfreeze time \u8212\'20\'14 and go back to before this all started.\par \par \uc2 2 \u8212\'20\'14 If you were investing in startup companies right now, what kind of blockchain-based business opportunity would catch your eye?\par \par \uc2 Blockchain companies working in healthcare are especially interesting; specifically those that improving medical record-keeping. This is important to me, as we need to ameliorate the level of care and democratize access for people who are under-insured or not insured.\par \par \uc2 Identifying trends across medical history, including family history, medication, allergies, and have it owned by the patient and accessible anytime, anywhere, regardless of their insurance status \u8212\'20\'14 game-changing.\par \par \uc2 3 \u8212\'20\'14 What\u8217\'20\'19s the unlikeliest-to-happen thing on your bucket list?\par \par \uc2 Sadly, the thing that I would love most to do, is the most unlikely. Unplug from all social media and sail around the world with my family.\par \par \uc2 4 \u8212\'20\'14 If there is a future for cryptocurrencies, what is the main hurdle the industry needs to overcome. And if not, what does the future of money look like to you?\par \par \uc2 If the pandemic has shown us anything, it\u8217\'20\'19s the need for alternatives to the legacy financial system.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, stablecoins, and digital assets face two main challenges as it stands now \u8212\'20\'14 established and consistent \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  to nurture mainstream adoption, and a reduction in speculation. At the moment if you look up Bitcoin, or any of the top cryptos \u8212\'20\'14 everyone\u8217\'20\'19s writing about their price, rather than the applications. (Editor\u8217\'20\'19s note: Well, not everyone\u8230\'20\'26)\par \par \uc2 As a real-world digital alternative to fiat currencies, cryptocurrencies need to shift from speculation to everyday use. Those changes have already taken place in countries where inflation and currency devaluation is more prevalent like Venezuela and Argentina. There, the need for stability and ease of use has driven acceptance of Bitcoin and other digital assets. In the U.S. we\u8217\'20\'19re seeing currency debasement as the stimulus prints trillions of dollars \u8212\'20\'14 heading toward an inevitable devolution of the USD and piquing interest in alternative currencies like cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 The bridge from old to new money systems used to be a long one, and you couldn\u8217\'20\'19t quite see the other side \u8212\'20\'14 we\u8217\'20\'19re closer than ever today.\par \par \uc2 5 \u8212\'20\'14 Tell us about a hidden talent \u8211\'20\'13 and give us a link to prove it!\par \par \uc2 Is gardening a talent? Not sure, but I love gardening and this year has taken it to the next level with three raised beds growing 20 different fruits and vegetables.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s been nearly a month since we planted our first garden & I\u8217\'20\'19d say things are coming in nicely! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/getoutdoors?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #getoutdoors}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/gardening?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #gardening}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XCj3IIEnXA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/XCj3IIEnXA}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Michelle O\u8217\'20\'19Connor (@Mq2Oco) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mq2Oco/status/1270550198863794177?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 10, 2020}}}\par \par \uc2 6 \u8212\'20\'14 From smart contracts, to DAPPs, to NFTs, to DeFi we have seen so many of the next \u8220\'20\'1Ckiller apps\u8221\'20\'1D for crypto, but none have really taken off quite yet. What will stick?\par \par \uc2 That\u8217\'20\'19s the billion-dollar question\u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 What if it\u8217\'20\'19s not the next killer app \u8212\'20\'14 but the next wave of use? If 2020 has taught us anything, it\u8217\'20\'19s the need to expect the unexpected. What you\u8217\'20\'19ve planned for can be upended overnight.\par \par \uc2 The winning solutions have to be designed around a real-world need or problem. Is there a need for something, what is the market fit? Companies that succeed need to design with their potential customer in mind. If they need what you\u8217\'20\'19re building \u8212\'20\'14 especially now, being strategic and focused on improving what\u8217\'20\'19s already been introduced.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/6-Questions-for-Michelle-OConnor-of-Uphold-300x169.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200613eg6d0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/10: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XTZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,854 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Institutional investors are showing greater interest in cryptocurrency and this could result in a sharp move within the next few days\par \par \uc2 About one-third of institutional investors surveyed by Fidelity said they have invested in digital assets. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/one-third-of-institutions-have-invested-in-crypto-says-fidelity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 25%}}}\uc2  of the survey participants said that they hold Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and 11% confirmed that they hold Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ). While these are encouraging signs, the future looks even brighter as 91% of survey participants expect to hold at least 0.5% of their portfolio in crypto assets in the next five years.\par \par \uc2 Total Bitcoin options open interest has risen from $1 billion on May 7 to over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-options-open-interest-rises-50-in-a-month-to-hit-15-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.5 billion}}}\uc2  on June 9, according to data from Skew. This shows growing interest among institutional investors who expect the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to make a decisive move within the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3298a770b9a2309e0cd5f62b8011be34.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-sglto3nf60_1591818932337"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 For the past few weeks, the U.S. stock markets have been surging as optimism for a sharp economic rebound grows. The technology-heavy Nasdaq hit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxbusiness.com/markets/us-stocks-june-9-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new lifetime}}}\uc2  highs which shows the euphoric sentiment among investors. However, eToro CEO Yoni Assia has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/etoro-ceo-predicts-market-crash-within-3-weeks-safe-haven-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautioned}}}\uc2  investors of a stock market crash within three weeks.\par \par \uc2 If the equity markets do correct sharply, the money is likely to flow into safe haven assets. Even if a fraction of these funds enter Bitcoin a sharp move to the upside could take place.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to determine the critical levels to watch.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is getting ready for a large move. As the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,556) is gradually sloping higher and the relative strength index is in the positive territory, the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a15ec2ad0625614ba435f09c608a1315.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above the symmetrical triangle will signal strength and could result in a possible rally to $10,500. This is the critical resistance to watch out for because if the bulls can scale the price above it, the BTC/USD pair is likely to pick up momentum and rally to $12,000.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair reverses direction from the current levels and plummets below the support line of the triangle. Below the triangle, a decline to $8,130.58 is likely. A break below this critical support will turn the trend in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Although Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) scaled above the immediate resistance of $247.827 on June 9, the bulls could not sustain the breakout. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. The price has again dipped back into the $247.827\u8211\'20\'13$233.449 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c8be65791828444d0d24a8cd639c279d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, as long as the price remains inside the ascending channel and the moving averages continue to slope up, the advantage remains with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($231), the bulls will attempt to push it above the $249.699\u8211\'20\'13$253.556 resistance zone. If successful, a move to the resistance line of the ascending channel at $280 is likely.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the ETH/USD pair below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the uptrend line and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($212) is possible. A break below the 50-day SMA will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been trading close to the moving averages for the past few days, which shows that both the bulls and the bears are not waging large bets. The flat moving averages and the RSI close to the midpoint suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/344b93c9e1c0f649f73b2f66ce9b4479.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has formed a symmetrical triangle. The next trending move is likely to start after the price escapes the triangle.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can breakout and close (UTC time) the price above the resistance line of the triangle, the uptrend is likely to begin. The pattern target of this formation is $0.2707. However, it is unlikely to be a straight dash up as the bears will mount a stiff challenge at $0.235688 and again at $0.246094.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will come into play if the XRP/USD pair turns down from the current levels and plummets below the support line of the triangle. Below this level, the target objective is $0.1244. However, the bulls are likely to defend the $0.16 and the $0.14 levels aggressively.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the 20-day EMA ($248), which is a positive sign. If the bulls can sustain the price above $260, a move to the top of the range at $280.47 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/aca7cd57d6fbf985cf1ab525716cfc21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $280.47, a new uptrend is likely. The target objective of this up move is $350.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BCH/USD pair turns down from $280.47, a few more days of range-bound action is likely.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario will come into play if the pair breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls and a drop to $200 could be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has been trading just below $200 levels for the past few days. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is close to the midpoint, which suggests a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f107184bda1b2d9f32abc12e8199e38d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $200, a move to $227 is possible. If the BSV/USD pair turns down from this level, the range-bound action is likely to continue. Instead, if the bulls can propel the pair above $227, a new uptrend is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the critical support to watch out for is $170. If this support holds, the pair will extend its consolidation for a few more days. But if the support breaks down, the pair can drop to $146. Traders can wait for the pair to make a decisive move out of the range before initiating a positional trade.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually grinding lower. The bulls have held the 50-day SMA ($45) for the past few days but unless the altcoin bounces off strongly from the current levels, the risk of a breakdown is high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c2ba362bdbd13a7a512772fc3f03754b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Below the 50-day SMA, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to drop to $41.72 and then to $39. If this support holds, the LTC/USD pair might extend its stay inside the $39\u8211\'20\'13$51 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the pair rebounds off the current levels, it can reach the overhead resistance at $51. If the price turns down from this level, the range-bound action is likely to continue. But if the bulls can propel the pair above $51, the momentum is likely to pick up. The target objective of this new uptrend is $64.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Although bulls have not been able to propel Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $18.1377, they have not allowed the price to sustain below the moving averages either, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2c5e0b43662bf3ece1c63bc09f2d0211.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to make another attempt to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap above $18.1377. If successful, the momentum is likely to pick up. The first target objective is $21.50 and then $24.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BNB/USD pair slips below the moving averages, the bears are likely to be back in action. They will attempt to drag the pair to $15.50 and then to $13.65.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been stuck between the moving averages and the overhead resistance of $2.8319 for the past few days. Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just above the 50 level, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/361029dc1cb5027bb607056f3e439664.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A break below the moving averages will indicate an advantage to the bears and can drag the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $2.3314.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the EOS/USD pair bounces off the moving averages and breaks out of $2.3314, it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par \uc2 Above this resistance, a move to $3.1104 is possible. If this level is also scaled, the momentum is likely to pick up, which could open the doors for a rally to $3.8811.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is witnessing profit booking after a strong run. The altcoin can pull back to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0751964. The 20-day EMA ($0.0748) is just below this level. Hence, the bulls are likely to defend this zone aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/882d4520104b8a64c823da66f8da3642.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to propel it above $0.0901373. If successful, the uptrend is likely to resume with $0.1\u8211\'20\'13$0.10652 as the target objective.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the 50% retracement level of $0.0705811 is possible. A break below this support will indicate that the momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 There is a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day EMA ($2.85). If Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) breaks below the 20-day EMA, it could slide to the immediate support at $2.7301.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/03f1b8743f5689c7b041f3b461a22dbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has been flattening out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which points to a balance between demand and supply. In the short-term, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap might remain stuck between $2.7301 and $3.1384.\par \par \uc2 The advantage will shift in favor of the bulls after the price breaks above $3.1384. Above this level, a rally to $3.60 and then to $3.9499 is possible. Conversely, if the bears sink the XTZ/USD pair below $2.7301, a drop to $2.24 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81NGUwYzFkYTZkZGE5ZjQ4NjgzODQ0YjJlYmJkZTI2NS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200610eg6a000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/8: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XTZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,694 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price remains range-bound, but as miners sell fewer coins and the BTC reserves on the exchanges drops, a possible up move could occur in the next few days\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization was close to $270 billion on May 8 and currently, the metric stands at $275 billion. This suggests that the crypto markets have been largely stuck in a range for about a month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/97513d6a1f40daa7cd7645ed0d07a3d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-gh6vgbvqpk_1591046430942"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As reported by Cointelegraph, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) miners are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/these-2-bitcoin-on-chain-metrics-suggest-the-post-halving-dip-has-ended"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 holding on}}}\uc2  to their newly minted coins and this behavior usually occurs when Bitcoin holders expect higher price in the future. Data also shows that Bitcoin reserves on cryptocurrency exchanges have plunged to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-turn-bullish-as-bitcoin-exchange-reserves-drop-to-1-year-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 12-month low}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The fundamentals are pointing to a possible rally in Bitcoin, but do the technicals also project a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  picture? Let\u8217\'20\'19s find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is being squeezed between the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,499) and the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. A tight consolidation near a critical resistance can be a sign of accumulation by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b6bfbc1d59169d7918b1d54b775a942a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index in positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. If the bulls can drive the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle a retest of $10,500 is possible.\par \par \uc2 This is a critical level to watch out for. If the bulls can push the price above $10,500 a sustained up move is likely to begin as traders sitting on the sidelines will be forced to jump in.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BTC/USD pair turns down from $10,500 once again, it could result in a long liquidation that drags the price to $8,130.58. If this support cracks the decline can extend to $6,500.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating in an uptrend. It has been stuck inside a tight range of $247.827\u8211\'20\'13$233.449 for the past few days. This suggests that both the bulls and the bears are waiting for the next trending move to begin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/92b0149fd087f03bd88ff0bc24d64b8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the $247.827\u8211\'20\'13 $253.556 resistance zone will signal that bulls have overpowered the bears. Above this zone, a rally to the resistance line of the ascending channel at $277 is likely.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index above 60 suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the $233.449\u8211\'20\'13$227.097 support zone, a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average ($209.52) is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 After failing to rebound off the moving averages, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is currently under pressure from sellers. If the bears can sink the price below the immediate support of $0.19614, a drop to $0.19130 is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/845076866e16ecb9fa2865f26843c726.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On a break below $0.19130 a retest of the critical support at $0.17372 is possible. If this support gives way, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, which will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bulls drive the price above the downtrend line. Above this level, a rally to $0.23612 is possible. However, as the XRP/USD pair has been a huge underperformer for the past few months, traders should be careful before initiating fresh long positions.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance of $255.46 on June 4, the bulls could not sustain the breakout. The price dipped back below $255.46 on June 6 and this suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5caea4543055c010cad9ca490cd25179.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks below the moving averages, a drop to $217.55 is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can sustain the price above $255.46, a rally to $280.47 is likely. This is a critical resistance to watch out for because if this is taken out, the possibility of a new uptrend increases.\par \par \uc2 As the BCH/USD pair has spent a long time inside the range, the next trending move is likely to be a strong one.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The lack of a trending move has driven the traders away from Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ). Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the 50 levels, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/92a826954e2f33010089c738e7ccfdca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $186, a drop to $170 is possible. A break below this support could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a strong bounce off $170 will indicate that the bulls are buying on dips to the bottom of the range. That could keep the BSV/USD pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the next trending move is likely to start above $227. Until then, the price action is likely to be tepid and directionless.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has again dipped back to the moving averages. If the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($44.93), the altcoin can dip to the support of the large $39\u8211\'20\'13$50.7864 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/be1d60d9bc441d237c38a58414614cc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the current levels, the bulls will make another attempt to climb above the $50.7864\u8211\'20\'13$52.2803 resistance zone. If successful, a new uptrend to $64 is likely.\par \par \uc2 As the LTC/USD pair has been stuck in a range, the price action is likely to remain volatile with both the bulls and the bears attempting to assert their supremacy. The next trending move will start on a breakout of $52.2803 or on a break below $39.\par \par \uc2 As the pair has spent a long time inside the range, a breakout of it is likely to be a significant event that can offer an opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 After defending the overhead resistance of $18.1377, the bears are now attempting to sink\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day SMA ($16.63). If successful, a drop to $15.70 and then to $14.95 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/34c170a10c392192b8bccdcc9fbdefc2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap bounces off the moving averages, the bulls will make another attempt to clear the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the trend followers and the momentum traders are likely to jump in. That can drive the BNB/USD pair to $21.50. The moving averages are gradually sloping up and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting that bulls have a marginal advantage.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has failed to break out and sustain above $2.8319 for the past three days. This suggests that the bears are aggressively defending this resistance. If the bears sink the altcoin below the moving averages, a drop to $2.3314 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6ab0239bf16c33f0923b0b5e96e7fadc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will make another attempt to push the price above $2.8319.\par \par \uc2 If successful, a rally to $3.1104 is possible. A breakout of this resistance will signal the start of a potential uptrend with a target objective of $3.8811.\par \par \uc2 However, if the EOS/USD pair turns down from $2.8319, it will extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The pair will turn negative on a break below $2.3314.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is currently correcting in a strong uptrend. If the bulls do not give up much ground, it increases the possibility of resumption of the uptrend. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone which suggests that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/71264cf3d09487524b281931b5c906de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The first strong support is at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0751964. The 20-day EMA ($0.0730) is placed just below this support. Hence, the bulls are likely to defend this zone aggressively.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off this zone will indicate that the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to get in. This increases the likelihood of a breakout of $0.0901373. Above this resistance, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to the $0.1\u8211\'20\'13$0.10652 zone.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair dips below the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0705811.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the intraday range made on June 2. The bears attempted to drag the altcoin below the 20-day EMA ($2.84) on June 7 but could not hold on to the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/adc10cfdf48e926b1ddf495edfad6c0f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls are aggressively defending the 20-day EMA. If they can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the $3.073\u8211\'20\'13$3.138 resistance zone, the momentum is likely to pick up and drive the price above the next resistance at $3.3367. Above this level, the rally can extend to $3.80.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the XTZ/USD pair turns down and slides below the moving averages. Such a move will indicate that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $3.073.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82NzIzZGFmNjVjNzRhZWQxNzgxZjI0MmZkMzhlMTlkNy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200608eg68000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Cryptocurrencies to Watch This Week: BTC, ETH, LINK,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , ETC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,001 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin can break above the overhead resistance, a few altcoins are likely to pick up momentum and provide short-term trading opportunities\par \par \uc2 When the price of an asset does not reverse direction from a critical resistance, it indicates that some traders are holding onto their positions in anticipation of a breakout. For the past month, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been repeatedly revisiting the $10,000 levels and even though the bulls have not been able to sustain above this level, they have not given up much ground either.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that traders are accumulating on dips and not closing their positions at $10,000. This is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign and it increases the possibility of a breakout above the resistance in the short-term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/98e95b6d11d695f6369cf582e03ddd64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-fpje2fq19a_1589129732773"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Before and after the halving, institutional investors have also been building larger Bitcoin positions. As reported by Cointelegraph, crypto fund manager Grayscale has aggressively been buying the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap and recent reporting shows they also purchased about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-is-buying-up-more-than-just-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $110 million}}}\uc2  worth of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ). This strong inflow of funds into the top two cryptocurrencies bodes well for the sector.\par \par \uc2 The next few days are critical as they will determine whether the crypto market will trend higher or take a break. If Bitcoin rises, these other crypto assets could offer a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is at a critical juncture. On June 1, the bulls propelled the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. However, due to lack of follow up buying, the price dipped back into the triangle on June 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2ab75af62eec4d81b4816a2cd43d4329.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Since then, the BTC/USD pair has been trading between the 20-day simple moving average ($9,423) and the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. This suggests buying on dips at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the triangle once again, a rally to $10,500 is possible. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively but if the bulls can scale it, a new uptrend is likely. The pattern target of a breakout of the triangle is $11,778.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair breaks below the 20-day SMA. In such a case, a drop to the support line of the symmetrical triangle is possible. Below the triangle, a drop to $8,130.58 is likely. However, the probability of such a fall remains low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/174a125aaf9ffe82f02de0bb1be5d2bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the bulls were able to drive the price above the resistance line of the triangle on two occasions but they could not build up on the breakout. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 However, on the downside, the bulls are not allowing the sellers to sink the price to the support line of the triangle. This is a positive sign. If the price rebounds off the current levels, the bulls are likely to make one more attempt to push the price above the triangle.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the pair is likely to move up to $10,400\u8211\'20\'13$10,500. Therefore, traders may look for entries above $9,900 and a stop-loss at $9,500. Taking partial profits closer to $10,500 might be wise if the pair struggles to break free of this resistance and the stops on the rest of the position can be kept at breakeven.\par \par \uc2 If the pair ascends $10,500 levels, it could start the next leg of the sustained up move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $9,400, a drop to $9,200 is likely. The bulls will make an aggressive attempt to defend this support zone because if it gives way, a deeper correction is possible.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend and has been trading inside the ascending channel for the past few weeks. Currently, the price is stuck between the 10-day exponential moving average ($235) and the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/96dec9689ae95312970e739bc47647d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the relative strength index is in the positive territory, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap bounces off the 10-day EMA and breaks out of the downtrend line, the uptrend is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below the 10-day EMA, a drop to the 20-day SMA ($223) is possible. However, as the bulls have held the support line of the channel on three previous occasions (marked as ellipse on the chart), a bounce off it can also offer a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c21b6ff45288ce3e34d47d161bdb0f00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are aggressively defending the downtrend line while the bulls are attempting to keep the ETH/USD pair above $236. If the pair slips below $236, it can drop to $229 and then to the support line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 If the pair bounces off the support line of the ascending channel, it can offer a buying opportunity to the traders with a close stop-loss kept just below the channel.\par \par \uc2 Another buying opportunity will open up if the pair bounces off $236 and breaks out of the downtrend line. Traders will likely buy on a close (UTC time) above the downtrend line with a stop-loss below $229. The first target on the upside is $252 and then $270.\par \par \uc2 A change in trend is likely to be signaled if the pair plummets below the channel. Therefore, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions below the channel should be avoided.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke out of an ascending triangle on June 1. The pattern target of this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout is $4.9656. However, the altcoin turned around from $4.6185 and is currently retesting the breakout level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3a6687c7669bb2149aee5332aa056876.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 14th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap bounces off the 10-day EMA ($4.27) or the breakout level of $4.2129, the bulls will attempt to resume the up move. The moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the pair below the breakout level, a drop to the 20-day SMA ($4.11) and then to the trendline of the triangle is possible. A breakdown of the triangle will be a negative sign that will signal a possible change in trend from \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  to range-bound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/782817cff538f418da86f6369510a460.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart suggests that the bulls are struggling to hold on to the higher levels. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has also dipped into the negative territory, which suggests that bears are attempting to make a comeback in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are likely to step in and defend the breakout level of $4.2129 aggressively. If the rebound off this support rises above the downtrend line it will signal a possible resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Opening a position above the downtrend line and keeping a stop-loss below $4.10 might be a reasonable trade setup. The first target objective would be a rally to $4.6185, then $4.9656.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the LINK/USD pair below the trendline of the ascending triangle.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few days. If the trend is strong, the bulls usually buy the dips to the 10-day EMA ($0.079). Even if this level is broken, the possibility of a bounce off the 20-day SMA ($0.068) remains high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6e5bdb8590e0d43be8210b49a6b10bcd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is witnessing profit booking. However, both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls remain in command.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, if the price bounces off the 10-day EMA, the bulls will make another attempt to reach the stiff overhead resistance at $0.10. In the past, this level has acted as a strong resistance, hence, the bears are likely to defend it aggressively once again.\par \par \uc2 If the 10-day EMA breaks down, a deeper correction to the 20-day SMA is possible. Such a fall would signal weakening momentum and increase the likelihood of a range formation for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3744edbc75706f1f9920e9195c7d530c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the bulls are defending the zone between $0.0839747\u8211\'20\'13$0.0832290 but are struggling to propel the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair above the downtrend line. This suggests that the bears are posing stiff resistance at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds off the current levels and rallies above $0.0901373, it is likely to resume its uptrend. Traders might look at buying half the desired position size after the pair closes (UTC time) above the moving averages and the rest of the position can be added above $0.0901373.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $0.0832, a drop to 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0810950 and then to 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.0789610 is possible. A strong bounce off these levels could also offer a buying opportunity with a close stop-loss.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the pair below $0.0789610. Below this support, a drop to $0.0759228 and then to $0.0720527 is possible.\par \par \uc2 ETC/USD\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ethereum-classic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ) turned down at the overhead resistance of $7.62717 on May 31. This shows that the bears are aggressively defending this level. Currently, the altcoin has dropped to the trendline of the ascending triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9b1cbfab9812b9ac4bedd4e29ddaa89f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum-classic/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 20th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the trendline support, the bulls will probably attempt to push the price back towards $7.62717. A breakout of this level will be a huge positive as it will complete an ascending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the trendline, a deeper pullback is likely. Below the trendline, a drop to $6 and below it to $5.50 is possible. The 10-day EMA is gradually sloping down and the RSI is just below the 50 level, which suggests that bears are trying to make a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/151c503eb60d9d8ff0f5fa952882ce40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETC/USD pair has dropped to the trendline of the ascending triangle. If the pair bounces off this level and rises above $7, traders can initiate long positions with a stop-loss below the trendline.\par \par \uc2 Traders may look to book partial profits close to $7.60 and trail the rest with a close stop-loss because if the momentum can drive the price above $7.62 the ascending triangle will complete. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $9.74.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink and sustain the pair below the trendline, it will signal weakness. Therefore, traders should avoid buying when the price stays below the trendline.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 The market data is provided by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9mZDc0ODQ4YmI4OGQ3ZGJmMmQyMGJmMzcxYzQzNGU2ZC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200607eg67000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin Struggling to Break $10,000, But Is  \highlight22\uc2 Bearish \highlight\uc2  Bias Warranted?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 1,083 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price must hold the low $9Ks to continue its upward grind and finally conquer the psychological $10,000 level\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trying to break above the psychological barrier of $10,000. However, during the week, it failed to go through this resistance. This \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/be-short-after-103k-bitcoin-price-head-fake-veteran-trader-warns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fakeout}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D caused a significant portion of the market to shift from a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias to a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias.\par \par \uc2 Is such a bias shift warranted in the current structure of the market? Altcoins have been continuing their upwards momentum since the drop with some demonstrating significant rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4ac3267c8c2e4ec6e4ce391a1f7fe004.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-rva3cwvapa_1591448835391"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin shows a harsh rejection at $10,000\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4e5df7c6700dfb477dd78d309e5c762f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/7MwoAqXL/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The daily chart of Bitcoin is showing a harsh rejection of the $10,000 barrier. This heavy selloff is causing a momentum and sentiment shift in the market, which seems unnecessary.\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin rallied above the previous high, which was $10,100. This is common, as the price takes the liquidity above this resistance to fuel a move in the opposite direction. In this case, \u8220\'20\'1Cbreakout traders\u8221\'20\'1D get trapped by buying the breakout.\par \par \uc2 However, what happened by the drop-down?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3332c40d5d6738126ede0192bcd8696c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 2-hour chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 2-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/H4VTdsCJ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 2-hour chart is showing a clear picture of these moves. Price rallied above the previous resistance while failing to establish support above the $10,100 level.\par \par \uc2 By failing to do so, the price dropped back in the range, causing a massive volatile move of $800 to the downside. The drop was very rapid and quick as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-main-reasons-bitcoin-price-plummeted-14-in-15-minutes-to-8-600"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price dropped}}}\uc2  in a matter of minutes.\par \par \uc2 The primary reason behind the fast pace of this drop is the chain reaction of stop/loss levels getting triggered. The majority of the traders moved their stop/loss beneath the $10,100 level, through which a vast majority of traders got stopped out.\par \par \uc2 However, is there any support level between $9,400 and $10,100? Basically not, so the price comes back to the previous support level to find buyers.\par \par \uc2 That {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitmex"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BitMEX}}}\uc2  and other exchanges have a wick towards $8,600 is provided by leveraged trading and should be a reason to be massively cautious trading leverage or using these platforms.\par \par \uc2 Is the upwards structure still intact?\par \par \uc2 The structure, which is upwards since March 12, is still valid.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/dfc9506f3d95aa66d82e5ef28244623d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/j7EkINTP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The chart shows a clear upwards trend where constant higher lows have been made. These higher lows are a crucial factor for upward momentum, which is still happening in this case.\par \par \uc2 But now, it\u8217\'20\'19s becoming crucial for the market not to make a lower low, i.e. below the $8,600 level.\par \par \uc2 However, personally, the green zone between $9,050-9,300 is an essential area to hold. If that level is lost, further downwards momentum towards $8,250-8,500 and possibly $7,500 is likely.\par \par \uc2 Total market capitalization still in an uptrend above 200-Day MA\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b4da639bd24a00a978084f2863dd4022.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Total market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/f3RpNawX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The total market capitalization of cryptocurrencies is still trending upwards. A similar fakeout to the upside is seen on the charts as with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s chart.\par \par \uc2 However, the total market capitalization is also acting above the 100-day and 200-day MA, which confirms a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend.\par \par \uc2 Preferably, the green area between $247-251 billion needs to remain as support. As long as $247-251 billion sustains, further upwards momentum is warranted. This upwards momentum could lead to a test of the $310 billion resistance level.\par \par \uc2 A breakthrough above this high would mean a new higher high and another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  argument for the start of a bull market.\par \par \uc2 Can the altcoin market cap go above $115 billion?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/42792810eacc9181f7d0a794f13528bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/HhdeAJEu/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market capitalization is showing a more reliable construction than Bitcoin or the total market capitalization. Will that mean that altcoins are going to outperform Bitcoin in the coming period? Some large caps like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), for example, are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-and-ethereum-price-surge-alongside-bitcoin-will-xlm-follow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 already showing strength}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, preferably support has to remain at $82-83 billion. If that sustains, further upwards momentum is confirmed on the altcoin market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 The next resistance level is $113-115 billion to be tested. Losing the $82-83 billion areas would mean a retest of the 200-day MA around $70 billion.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario for Bitcoin\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c5033c63f9c30519d68b561dbe2f2803.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  scenario chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/iZCGLoaW/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario is straightforward and has been stated earlier in this article. The green zone at $9,100-9,300 has to remain support to continue the momentum upwards.\par \par \uc2 A potential wick towards $8,750-8,800 is possible on the charts, but the price shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t make a new lower low.\par \par \uc2 As the liquidity is already taken above the $10,000 level, a renewed test of this resistance zone should lead to a continuation upwards. Given that the charts are still providing a CME gap at $11,500, confluent with a horizontal resistance level, it\u8217\'20\'19s likely to expect a rally towards $11,500 as the next resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario for Bitcoin\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e818d6b4668311680fccc4632363c9a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  scenario chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/JG2zBIsg/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenarios are depending heavily on whether the market holds support at the $9,100-9,300 level or not.\par \par \uc2 If the price of Bitcoin drops below the green zone, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  retest and confirmation of resistance will trigger continuation further downwards.\par \par \uc2 Likely targets in that regard would be the $8,250-8,500 levels and the $7,500-7,800 zones.\par \par \uc2 However, the price of Bitcoin is trending upward, so continuation to the upside is likely, particularly after the strong rally since March 12 to pare all losses.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8zODU2NmRmYjExZjFkNjlkODg3OWVhMWNiMWNmNTBmNS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200606eg660008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/5: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XTZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,794 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Many cryptocurrencies are showing strength by hovering close to their recent highs even as gold is selling off\par \par \uc2 The U.S. equity markets are on a tear as the traders cheer the largest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/06/05/stock-market-live-updates-job-report-looms-with-dow-up-4percent-this-week.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jobs gain}}}\uc2  ever. This report has improved sentiment as it suggests that the blip in the economy due to the pandemic was temporary.\par \par \uc2 Many traders who had been sitting on the sidelines are likely to jump into stocks due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/06/04/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fear of missing out}}}\uc2  on what could be the early stages of a strong rally. This shift into stocks has resulted in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/06/05/gold-markets-equities-us-dollar-coronavirus-in-focus.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop in gold}}}\uc2  price, which is considered as a safe haven against market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, it is important to note that the crypto markets were not impacted as negatively and are holding up quite well. This shows that traders are not shifting out of cryptocurrencies as they expect prices to rise further. After the euphoria in the stock markets reduces, traders are likely to shift their focus back to cryptocurrencies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9c8b7ae98a1898ec8d85b0b6031c7a56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-gh6vgbvqpk_1591046430942"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the short-term looks uncertain, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bloomberg-bitcoin-will-approach-record-high-of-about-20-000-this-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  by Bloomberg states that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) will retest it's all-time high and might even reach a new high of $28,000 this year. The report points to the pick up in demand from the institutional investors as indicated by the rise in the assets under management at \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is close to a critical resistance. Will it breakout or turn down from here? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out the path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle and the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,441) for the past two days. This suggests a tussle between the bulls and the bears for supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1a091a270ca59d160867798bbb38e0da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the triangle will be the first indication that bulls have overpowered the bears. Above the triangle, a rally to $10,500 is likely. This level would be the acid test for bulls because if $10,500 is scaled, the next leg of the uptrend is likely to begin.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BTC/USD pair turns down from the current levels and drops below the 20-day EMA, a decline to the support line of the triangle is possible. The 50-day simple moving average ($8,322) is just below the triangle, hence, the bulls are likely to aggressively defend this support zone.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, if the pair slips below the 50-day SMA, a drop to $8,130.58 and below it to $6,752 is likely.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 For the past two days, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside the large intraday range formed on June 2. If the bulls can propel the price above $253.556, the biggest altcoin could rally to the resistance of the ascending channel at $270.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5ee7339fafc1c45546738411245c41c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI above 60 indicates that bulls have the upper hand. However, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns around from the current levels and plummets below the 20-day EMA ($224) the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum will weaken.\par \par \uc2 The bears will gain the upper hand after the ETH/USD pair dips below the 20-day SMA. Below this level a drop to the 50-day SMA (205) and then to $176.112 is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been trading close to the moving averages for the past two days. The failure of the bulls to achieve a strong rebound off this support indicates a lack of demand at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/20921fd419a869d39dd1bfd6c0deb3e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the moving averages, a drop to $0.19 and then to $0.17372 is possible. A breakdown below this support will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, which will be a huge negative.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the XRP/USD pair picks up momentum and breaks out of the downtrend line, the bulls will attempt to carry the price to the $0.23612\u8211\'20\'13$0.24770 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend this zone aggressively, therefore, traders can book profits when the price nears it. Currently, the stops can be retained at $0.19 but can be trailed higher after the pair sustains above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have once again pushed the price of Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $255.46. If the bulls can sustain this level, the altcoin is likely to rise to the critical resistance of $280.47.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f5e12b22dafbb3bc70e765300745aadd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout of $280.47 could start a new uptrend that can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $350. The traders can buy on a close (UTC time) above $280.47 with a stop below $235.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BCH/USD pair turns down from the current levels and slides below the moving averages, a drop to $217.55 and then to $200 is likely. The next leg of the down move could start if $200 gives way.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the moving averages for the past two days. This suggests that neither the bulls nor the bears are showing any interest in trading the altcoin at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/19c5b7206891c5cd5f7ef78d40374bb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 As the trading range has been in place for more than two months, a strong momentum is needed to start the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Traders can keep an eye on the $227 level as a close (UTC time) above it will signal the possible start of a new uptrend. Such a breakout can offer a buying opportunity to the traders with a target objective of $326.80.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap plummets below $170, a new downtrend is likely to begin.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Although \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the moving averages, the bulls are struggling to reach the resistance of the range at $50.7864\u8211\'20\'13$52.2803. This suggests a lack of conviction among the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/25957af70dde002c284be7d63eb908c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Without a pickup in momentum, the bulls will find it difficult to scale above the overhead resistance. This indicates that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario would come into play if the LTC/USD pair breaks out and closes (UTC time) above $52.2803. Such a move can offer a buying opportunity to the traders as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-6-3-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, the trend will turn in favor of the bears on a break below the support of the range at $39.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade between the 20-day EMA ($17) and the overhead resistance of $18.1377 for the past few days. This is a positive sign as it shows that the bulls are not allowing the price to slip below the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e70bf019b87477a0f08b821548237f6f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above $18.1377 is likely to start the next leg of the recovery that can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap to $21.50. Therefore, traders can buy on a close (UTC time) above $18.1377.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the bears sink the BNB/USD pair below the moving averages. Below this support, a drop to $15.80 and then to $13.65 is possible.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 After two days of tepid trading action, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  is showing promise today. The altcoin has reached the overhead resistance at $2.8319. If the bulls can push the price above this resistance, a rally to $3.1104 is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/759d4bfce9793ef268dfb700b34b8a91.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to pick up momentum on a break above $3.1104. A close (UTC time) above this resistance can offer a buying opportunity to the traders. The target objective to watch out for is $3.8811.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario will be invalidated if the EOS/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the moving averages. Below this support, a drop to $2.3314 is likely.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The altcoin resumed its up move on June 4 after it broke above the immediate resistance of $0.0865169. The next target objective is a rally to the $0.1\u8211\'20\'13$0.10652 overhead resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d101515d3e88166bf479d25d96ff87ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the trend is up, the relative strength index is in the overbought zone. This suggests that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap could correct for one to three days. This dip can offer a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, $0.1\u8211\'20\'13$0.10652 is likely to be a tough hurdle to cross, hence, profits can be booked in this zone.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum will be invalidated if the bears drag the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair to $0.072. Such a sharp pullback will indicate profit-booking by traders.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls nudged Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) above $3.074 on June 4 but they could not hold on to the higher levels. This suggests that bears are aggressively defending this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2899e6994828648f00b890bcd1e0172c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA ($2.83), a drop to the 50-day SMA ($2.68) is possible. The trend is likely to turn in favor of the bears on a break below $2.24.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the XTZ/USD pair turns around from the current levels or bounces off the uptrend line, the bulls will make another attempt to carry the price above $3.073\u8211\'20\'13$3.1384 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the pair is likely to start its journey towards its target objective of $3.3367 and then $3.80. Traders can trail the stop-loss on the long positions below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy84YWRlNWJmMmU0MjBmMjU2OGVhMWE3NDc4NzQwN2JiZS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200605eg65000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/3: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,922 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin price consolidates and searches for support, large cap altcoins are setting up for a resumption of their uptrends\par \par \uc2 Blockstream\uc2  CEO Adam Back recently said that institutional money is not needed to propel Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/adam-back-crisis-will-push-btc-to-300k-even-without-institutions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $300,000}}}\uc2  within five years. This is partially because the current financial situation could drive retail traders to look for alternative investments to preserve the value of money in a time where there is a lot of money printing across the world. This is likely to create enough demand from retail traders to start the next mega bull run in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 A strong resistance level that has held on two or more occasions and resulted in a major reversal can be a tough nut to crack. Such resistances make the bulls nervous as they are not willing to risk their paper profits, hence, the short-term traders tend to book profits close to the resistance. On the other hand, aggressive traders use the stiff resistance levels to establish short positions with a stop-loss placed just above the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6c899a51b3793092184d6bfa459e935e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-gh6vgbvqpk_1591046430942"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While short-term traders are fixated on whether BTC will break out of $10,000 or not, \uc2 Michael Novogratz\uc2  of \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  believes that the unrest in the U.S. and the abysmal financial situation will soon send BTC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businessinsider.in/stock-market/news/get-on-the-train-famed-investor-michael-novogratz-says-bitcoin-will-soon-break-the-10000-threshold-as-us-turmoil-spreads/articleshow/76160152.cms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 above the key resistance level}}}\uc2 . Novogratz expects the momentum to pick up after Bitcoin sustains above $10,000, hence, he tweeted that traders should \u8220\'20\'1Cget on the train.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the symmetrical triangle and surged to a high of $10,362.42 on June 1. However, the bulls could not sustain the momentum and scale the price above the critical resistance of $10,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0078a6f6990ba2a217d413d7074c7f54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This was the third occasion that the BTC/USD pair had turned down from close to $10,500 levels. The previous two incidents (marked as ellipses on the chart) had resulted in a sharp trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 However, on June 2, the bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,362), which is a huge positive. This suggests that the sentiment remains to buy the dips as traders anticipate higher levels in the future.\par \par \uc2 If the pair sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to push the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. Above this level, the final barrier will be $10,500. If the momentum can ascend this level, a new sustained uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the 20-day EMA. In such a case, a drop to the support line of the triangle is likely. A breakdown of the triangle will be a huge negative that can drag the pair to $8,130.58. The only development in favor of the sellers is the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the relative strength index.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 On June 2, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) reached a high of $253.556, just shy of $257, which was the target objective of a breakout of the inverse head and shoulders pattern. From there, the biggest altcoin plunged to $225.873.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e7e4ea725a1f623a3c7c4b3a888862d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to $227.097 on June 3, which is a positive sign. Currently, the bulls are again attempting to resume the uptrend. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rises above $253.556, a rally to the resistance of the ascending channel at $265 is possible.\par \par \uc2 A trend change will be signaled if the ETH/USD pair turns down from the current levels and plummets below the 20-day EMA ($219). If this support cracks, a fall to the 50-day simple moving average ($202) is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 On June 1, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  closed (UTC time) above the overhead resistance of $0.20570. This was an indication that the bulls had overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0226bf7dc30418b5e4721b688320fa78.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, on June 2, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap was back below $0.20570. This suggests that buying dried up at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to keep the price above the moving averages. If successful, the XRP/USD pair is likely to make another attempt to rally to the $0.23612\u8211\'20\'13$0.24770 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the pair could correct to $0.19 and then to $0.17372. Traders who own long positions can continue to keep the stop-loss at $0.19. The stops can be trailed higher after the pair sustains above $0.215.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) spiked above the immediate resistance of $255.46 on June 2 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The altcoin turned around from $269.17 and plunged back into the $217.55\u8211\'20\'13$255.46 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5185c246145114de8caf0f8bc04e962f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is currently attempting to bounce off the moving averages. If the bulls can again push the price above $255.46, it will increase the possibility of a rally to $280.47.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of $280.47 is likely to start a new uptrend that has a target objective of $350. Hence, traders can piggyback on this possible ride after the price closes (UTC time) above $280.47.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BCH/USD pair reverses direction from $255.46 and breaks below $236, it can correct to $217.55. A break below this support can drag the pair to $200.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating close to the $200 levels for the past few days. The flat moving averages and the RSI close to the midpoint suggests a balance between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cf78efea72fee4eeaa2e7d915688a96c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks free and moves above $209, it could reach the top of the range at $227. A breakout of this level could start a new uptrend that can offer a buying opportunity to traders.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BSV/USD pair turns down and slides below $187, a drop to $170 is possible. A break below this support could start a new downtrend. There is no reliable trading setup at the current levels.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from $49.9445 on June 3, which suggests that the bears are aggressively defending the $50.7864\u8211\'20\'13$52.2803 resistance zone. If bears sink the altcoin below the moving averages, it could drop to $39.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d699a747268a85ca0e4c6f922d7bd369.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the current levels, the bulls will make another attempt to scale above the overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the LTC/USD pair is likely to start a new uptrend that has a target objective of $64. Therefore, traders can watch for a buying opportunity on a close (UTC time) above $52.2803 with a stop-loss below $44.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the $18.1377 resistance for the past four days. This is a positive sign as it suggests that the bulls are not closing their positions aggressively at the resistance of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f780cfdc2030cbddcb2533cd1a686be9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This increases the possibility of a breakout of $18.1377. Both moving averages are gradually sloping up and the RSI is above the 50 levels, which suggests that bulls have a minor advantage.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $18.1377, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap could start a new uptrend that can offer a buying opportunity to the traders. Above $18.1377, a rally to $21.50 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BNB/USD pair fails to scale above $18.1377, the bears will attempt to sink it below $15.80. If successful, the pair can decline to $14.9586 and then to $13.65.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to drive {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  above the $2.3314\u8211\'20\'13$2.8319 range on June 2 but the markets quickly rejected the higher levels. The altcoin reversed direction and dipped back into the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8b28aa4ec5d29ea803bcf5bc16eb0e1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI close to the midpoint indicates a balance between supply and demand. This points to a few more days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The first indication of strength would be a close (UTC time) above $2.8319. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap sustains above this level, the bulls will make another attempt to break out of $3.1104. If successful, it could start a new uptrend and offer a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair breaks below $2.3314 it could start a new downtrend with a target objective of $1.5524.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) made an outside day candlestick pattern on June 2. The altcoin broke out of the $2.963\u8211\'20\'13$3.073 overhead resistance zone to hit a high of $3.1384 but it could not sustain the higher levels. It quickly turned around and broke below the 20-day EMA ($2.79).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/baf0e0646b0d71f606b8d435ff44ef21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive thing is that the bulls bought the dips below the 20-day EMA indicating demand at lower levels. Currently, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is back above the 20-day EMA and the bulls are trying to push it above $3.1384.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the uptrend is likely to resume. The target objective on the upside is $3.3367 and then $3.80. Traders can continue to hold their long positions with stops at $2.57. The stops can be trailed higher after the XTZ/USD pair sustains above $3.1384.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario will come into play if the pair turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $2.60. Below this level, a drop to $2.24 is possible.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have held Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the critical support at $0.0722 for the past three days. This is a positive sign as it shows that the bulls are buying on dips as they anticipate the uptrend to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4c86f219b2fc79209ef4de5ab97edfcc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the $0.0830\u8211\'20\'13$0.0866 zone can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to the target objective of $0.1\u8211\'20\'13$0.10652.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be threatened if the bears sink and sustain the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair below $0.0722722. Below this support a drop to the 50-day SMA is possible.\par \par \uc2 Although the overbought reading on the RSI warrants caution, it does not signal a trend reversal until the price turns down and breaks the support at $0.0722722.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9kNzk2NGVkOTg2ZGIyZjU4OGMwNDBkOGE3OGM1NTBlYy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200603eg63000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/1: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,914 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Tension between China and the U.S. is increasing and if the current trade deal is scrapped Bitcoin could be a major beneficiary\par \par \uc2 The tensions between the United States and China have escalated once again. This is bad news for the global economy, which is currently witnessing one of the worst crises since the Great Recession.\par \par \uc2 If either the U.S. or China {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/06/01/china-asks-state-firms-to-halt-purchases-of-us-soybeans-pork-sources-say.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/06/01/china-asks-state-firms-to-halt-purchases-of-us-soybeans-pork-sources-say.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 keep up}}}\uc2  its part of the trade deal, this could make matters worse. Scrapping of the Phase I trade deal could ultimately result in a huge sell-off in global equity markets.\par \par \uc2 If uncertainty persists, investors might consider taking shelter in safe-haven assets like gold and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap. History also favors a Bitcoin rally as the month of June has typically been a good month for the bulls. Between 2014 and 2019, the only year when June ended in the red was in 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/825ea881a8cc15701af9d7a60c12fc76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-gh6vgbvqpk_1591046430942"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While most traders are keenly watching the $10,000 level on BTC and worrying about the next $1,000 move, Plan B \u8212\'20\'14 the creator of the stock-to-flow price prediction model \u8212\'20\'14 has projected a target of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-analyst-releases-stock-to-flow-model-indicator-for-btc-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100,000}}}\uc2  for BTC by the end of 2021. This figure looks to be a far cry from the current levels but as history has shown, anything is possible in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 To date, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to consolidate in an uptrend. It is currently stuck inside a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. The majority of the time, the breakout of the triangle happens in the direction of the prevailing trend, but sometimes, the breakout can result in a reversal. Hence, it is better to wait for the breakout to occur before initiating a trade.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9cebb69eaea8ac515a4c92883448fa96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness would be a drop below the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,261). Below this level, a drop to the support line of the triangle is possible. This is an important level to watch out for because a breakdown of the triangle will signal the start of a possible downtrend with a target objective of $6,752.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BTC/USD pair bounces off the 20-day EMA and breaks out of the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, a rally to $10,500 and then to $11,828 is possible. The bears are likely to defend the resistance line of the large symmetrical triangle, but if this level is crossed, a sustained new uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) completed the inverse head and shoulders pattern on May 28. After hesitation on May 29, the biggest altcoin soared on May 30 to an intraday high of $246.916. Although the bears are mounting stiff resistance close to $250, the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the breakout level of $227, which is a huge positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0e5791a3a039966f0724e94f52c01d62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $227.097, another attempt to resume the uptrend is likely. With both moving averages sloping up and the relative strength index above 60 levels, the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On a breakout above $246.916, the ETH/USD pair is likely to rally to $257 and then to the resistance line of the ascending channel close to $265. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels and drops below $227.097. Below this level, a drop to the neckline is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance of $0.20570 on May 31, but they could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are defending this resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ea041a285a3f0ed7815f3c58e7fe6fb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive thing is that the bulls have not allowed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to slip below the moving averages. The bulls are likely to make another attempt to carry the XRP/USD pair to the next level of $0.23612.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the pair below the moving averages, a drop to $0.19130 and then to $0.17372 is possible. Therefore, traders who own long positions as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-29-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis can keep their stop-loss at $0.19. The stops can be trailed higher after the pair sustains above $0.20570.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 A well-defined range offers a reliable trading opportunity at the critical support and resistance levels or on a breakout of the range. Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is currently stuck inside the $217.55\u8211\'20\'13$255.46 range. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests a balance between the bulls and bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c7382a79437014306c69f27e480ad689.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above $255.46 can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $280.47. This is likely to act as a stiff resistance, as the BCH/USD pair has reversed direction from this level on three previous occasions.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair fails to break out of $255.46, the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days. A break below $217.55 can drag the price to $200, which is critical support.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) jumped above the downtrend line on May 30, but the bulls could not hold onto the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are unwilling to give up ground to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b436d554458b49a59314283af24af37b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On May 31, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sixth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap again dipped back below the downtrend line. If the price sustains below the moving averages, a drop to the next support at $180 and then $170 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI at the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $200, the bulls are likely to make another attempt to rally towards $227. A break above this level is likely to be a huge positive, hence, it can offer a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) surged above the downtrend line on May 30. With this move, the bulls have increased the possibility of a rally to $50.7864. A breakout of $50.7864 will invalidate the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern. Hence, this could offer a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/787fea1ae34c56a3e1e6acf662a0d15c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls fail to sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seventh-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line and the moving averages, the bears will try to sink the price to the critical support at $39.\par \par \uc2 A break below $39 will be a huge negative that could result in a drop to $32 and then to $28. However, if the LTC/USD pair rebounds off $39, the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days. The flat moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory point to a consolidation.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) reached the critical overhead resistance of $18.1377 on May 31, but the bears defended this level aggressively. However, a positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($16.71).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/22b2aa118a5b0057d915e53680349e74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls are buying the dips. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eighth}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap is now stuck in a tight range between the 20-day EMA and $18.1377. This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the BNB/USD pair above $18.1377, the momentum is likely to pick up and open the doors for a rally to $21.50. This could offer a buying opportunity to the traders. On the other hand, if the 20-day EMA gives way, a drop to $15.7218 and then to $14.9586 is likely.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  is largely range-bound between $2.3314\u8211\'20\'13$2.8319. If bulls can push the price above the range, a move to $3.1104 is possible. This is the level from where the altcoin had turned down on April 30. Therefore, the bears are likely to defend the $3.1104 level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/181e60db1f0845d935926d4edc72d24d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Still, if the bulls can drive the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ninth-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $3.1104, the momentum is likely to pick up. This could offer a buying opportunity to traders. The first target to watch out for on the upside is $3.8811.\par \par \uc2 If the EOS/USD pair again turns down from $2.8319, it will extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the 50 levels also points to a possible consolidation for the next few days. The trend is likely to turn in favor of the bears on a break below the range.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) has not been able to scale above $2.963 for three days in a row. This means that bears are aggressively defending this resistance. If they can sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($2.75), a drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($2.60) is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e5920d93ef14889280a9b0eeb6f02d46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a break above the $2.963\u8211\'20\'13$3.073 zone increases. Above this zone, the uptrend is likely to resume. The first target is $3.3367 and then $3.80 levels.\par \par \uc2 With both moving averages gradually sloping up and the RSI close to 60 levels, the bulls have a slight advantage. Therefore, traders can hold their long positions with stops at $2.57. A break above $2.963\u8211\'20\'13$3.073 zone is likely to offer another buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. It resumed its up move on May 30 and surged above the overhead resistance of $0.0722722. This is a huge positive as it shows that the bulls continue to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/79a7b0f93032ac657fe06ff373abf7de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.0722722, the next level to watch on the upside is $0.1\u8211\'20\'13$0.10652. This zone has been a major barrier for about twenty months. Hence, the bulls will find it difficult to break above it.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair back below $0.0722722, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.060) is likely. A bounce off this level will suggest that the sentiment to buy the dips remains intact. However, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8xZjYxNDcxMjQ1NGNhYWM5NzdhMGUxZDI4NWQwNTRkYi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200602eg610002x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 6/1: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,915 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Tension between China and the U.S. is increasing and if the current trade deal is scrapped Bitcoin could be a major beneficiary\par \par \uc2 The tensions between the U.S. and China have escalated once again. This is bad news for the global economy which is currently witnessing one of the worst crises since the Great Recession.\par \par \uc2 If either the U.S. or China {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/06/01/china-asks-state-firms-to-halt-purchases-of-us-soybeans-pork-sources-say.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not}}}\uc2  keep up their part of the trade deal, it could only make matters worse. Scrapping of the Phase I trade deal could ultimately result in a huge sell-off in global equity markets.\par \par \uc2 If uncertainty persists, investors might consider taking shelter in safe haven assets like gold and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap. History also favors a Bitcoin rally as the month of June has typically been a good month for the bulls. Between 2014 and 2019, the only year when June ended in the red was in 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/825ea881a8cc15701af9d7a60c12fc76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-gh6vgbvqpk_1591046430942"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While most traders are keenly watching the $10,000 level on BTC and worrying about the next $1,000 move, Plan B, the creator of the stock-to-flow price prediction model, has projected a target of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-analyst-releases-stock-to-flow-model-indicator-for-btc-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100,000}}}\uc2  for BTC by the end of 2021. This figure looks to be a far cry from the current levels but as history has shown, anything is possible in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 To date, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to consolidate in an uptrend. It is currently stuck inside a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. The majority of the time, the breakout of the triangle happens in the direction of the prevailing trend but sometimes the breakout can result in a reversal. Hence, it is better to wait for the breakout to occur before initiating a trade.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9cebb69eaea8ac515a4c92883448fa96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness would be a drop below the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,261). Below this level, a drop to the support line of the triangle is possible. This is an important level to watch out for because a breakdown of the triangle will signal the start of a possible downtrend with a target objective of $6,752.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BTC/USD pair bounces off the 20-day EMA and breaks out of the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, a rally to $10,500 and then to $11,828 is possible. The bears are likely to defend the resistance line of the large symmetrical triangle but if this level is crossed, a sustained new uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) completed the inverse head and shoulders pattern on May 28. After hesitation on May 29, the biggest altcoin soared on May 30 to an intraday high of $246.916. Although the bears are mounting stiff resistance close to $250, the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the breakout level of $227 which is a huge positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0e5791a3a039966f0724e94f52c01d62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2nd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $227.097, another attempt to resume the uptrend is likely. With both moving averages sloping up and the relative strength index above 60 levels, the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On a breakout above $246.916, the ETH/USD pair is likely to rally to $257 and then to the resistance line of the ascending channel close to $265. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels and drops below $227.097. Below this level, a drop to the neckline is possible.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance of $0.20570 on May 31 but they could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are defending this resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ea041a285a3f0ed7815f3c58e7fe6fb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive thing is that the bulls have not allowed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3rd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to slip below the moving averages. The bulls are likely to make another attempt to carry the XRP/USD pair to the next level of $0.23612.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the pair below the moving averages, a drop to $0.19130 and then to $0.17372 is possible. Therefore, traders who own long positions as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-29-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis can keep their stop-loss at $0.19. The stops can be trailed higher after the pair sustains above $0.20570.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 A well-defined range offers a reliable trading opportunity at the critical support and resistance levels or on a breakout of the range. Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is currently stuck inside the $217.55-$255.46 range. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests a balance between the bulls and bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c7382a79437014306c69f27e480ad689.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above $255.46 can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $280.47. This is likely to act as a stiff resistance because the BCH/USD pair has reversed direction from this level on three previous occasions.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair fails to break out of $255.46, the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days. A break below $217.55 can drag the price to $200, which is critical support.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) jumped above the downtrend line on May 30 but the bulls could not hold onto the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are unwilling to give up ground to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b436d554458b49a59314283af24af37b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On May 31, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 6th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap again dipped back below the downtrend line. If the price sustains below the moving averages, a drop to the next support at $180 and then $170 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI at the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $200, the bulls are likely to make another attempt to rally towards $227. A break above this level is likely to be a huge positive, hence, it can offer a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) surged above the downtrend line on May 30. With this move, the bulls have increased the possibility of a rally to $50.7864. A breakout of $50.7864 will invalidate the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern. Hence, this could offer a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/787fea1ae34c56a3e1e6acf662a0d15c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls fail to sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line and the moving averages, the bears will try to sink the price to the critical support at $39.\par \par \uc2 A break below $39 will be a huge negative that could result in a drop to $32 and then to $28. However, if the LTC/USD pair rebounds off $39, the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days. The flat moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory point to a consolidation.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) reached the critical overhead resistance of $18.1377 on May 31 but the bears defended this level aggressively. However, a positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($16.71).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/22b2aa118a5b0057d915e53680349e74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls are buying the dips. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 8th}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap is now stuck in a tight range between the 20-day EMA and $18.1377. This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the BNB/USD pair above $18.1377, the momentum is likely to pick up and open the doors for a rally to $21.50. This could offer a buying opportunity to the traders. On the other hand, if the 20-day EMA gives way, a drop to $15.7218 and then to $14.9586 is likely.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  is largely range-bound between $2.3314-$2.8319. If bulls can push the price above the range, a move to $3.1104 is possible. This is the level from where the altcoin had turned down on April 30. Therefore, the bears are likely to defend the $3.1104 level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/181e60db1f0845d935926d4edc72d24d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Still, if the bulls can drive the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 9th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $3.1104, the momentum is likely to pick up. This could offer a buying opportunity to the traders. The first target to watch out on the upside is $3.8811.\par \par \uc2 If the EOS/USD pair again turns down from $2.8319, it will extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the 50 levels also points to a possible consolidation for the next few days. The trend is likely to turn in favor of the bears on a break below the range.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) has not been able to scale above $2.963 for three days in a row. This means that bears are aggressively defending this resistance. If they can sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($2.75), a drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($2.60) is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e5920d93ef14889280a9b0eeb6f02d46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a break above the $2.963-$3.073 zone increases. Above this zone, the uptrend is likely to resume. The first target is $3.3367 and then $3.80 levels.\par \par \uc2 With both moving averages gradually sloping up and the RSI close to 60 levels, the bulls have a slight advantage. Therefore, traders can hold their long positions with stops at $2.57. A break above $2.963-$3.073 zone is likely to offer another buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. It resumed its up move on May 30 and surged above the overhead resistance of $0.0722722. This is a huge positive as it shows that the bulls continue to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/79a7b0f93032ac657fe06ff373abf7de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $0.0722722, the next level to watch on the upside is $0.1-$0.10652. This zone has been a major barrier for about twenty months. Hence, the bulls will find it difficult to break above it.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair back below $0.0722722, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.060) is likely. A bounce off this level will suggest that the sentiment to buy the dips remains intact. However, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8xZjYxNDcxMjQ1NGNhYWM5NzdhMGUxZDI4NWQwNTRkYi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200601eg61000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 XRP Price Must Shake 30-Month Lows Vs. Bitcoin to Start Rally\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 1,068 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 June 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s high time for XRP and XLM to catch up to not only Bitcoin but also some notable altcoin counterparts such as Ethereum and Cardano\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating recently, many majors have been showing strength with double-digit movements. For instance, Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rallied from $195 to $245, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rallied with 65% in the recent week.\par \par \uc2 However, some relatively large altcoins are lagging heavily, and two of them are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ), the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/stellar/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 13th}}}\uc2  cryptocurrencies by market capitalization, respectively. So what\u8217\'20\'19s next for them?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d50b52e4557f12b5c502569b5f051cea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-khi1atwrps_1591014705598"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 One billion XRP being dumped on the markets every month\par \par \uc2 One of the fundamental reasons for XRP to lag behind the other majors is the monthly supply coming on the markets by the headquarters. On the first of every month, one billion XRP is unlocked and transferred to exchanges.\par \par \uc2 What does that mean? It does mean that every month one billion XRP is being sold on the exchange, which is causing a significant amount of selling pressure. As the current price of XRP is $0.21, the total value of this supply is $210 million, every month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0370cc15023ead4924479befae02fb89."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/rUWieY1h/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The big difference between XRP and the other majors is seen in the chart. While Ether and Cardano are facing the February high as resistance (or broke above that level), XRP is still lagging 40% lower.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, there\u8217\'20\'19s also a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend that can be spotted. The price of XRP has flipped a significant level at $0.19 as support. Alongside with that, the 100-day and 200-day MA (moving average) are coming into play.\par \par \uc2 If XRP breaks through the 200-day MA and $0.23 resistance, the next levels are $0.28 and $0.34.\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s BTC pair is showing extreme weakness\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7ca2784968779b0de180a0721d776e35."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/BTC 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/IZHw3Sr0/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The real problem of XRP lies in the fact that its BTC pair is doing exceptionally poorly. It\u8217\'20\'19s currently at the lowest point since December 2017, which is more than thirty months!\par \par \uc2 Heavily needed for any upwards momentum would be a rally and break back above the previous support, which is found between 0.00002300-0.00002350 sats.\par \par \uc2 If XRP can break back in this range, a further surge towards the 0.00003200-0.00003300 sats level is likely to occur. Next to that, a breakthrough towards 0.00003200-0.00003300 sats would mean a break above the 100-day and 200-day MAs. A \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign.\par \par \uc2 However, the price of XRP is currently still showing weakness and printing new lows, making trading this coin tricky.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s next if the 0.00002300-0.00002350 sats level can\u8217\'20\'19t provide support? A further downward move toward the green zones is then on the table with the most likely support at 0.00001550-0.00001625 sats level.\par \par \uc2 Why is XLM stronger?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0e46d6d6a78e4d4d3ecf96d46f6e74f1."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/0QFrXQC1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Remarkably, while XRP is showing weakness, XLM is showing strength and continuation to the upside. Could it be because XLM doesn\u8217\'20\'19t have the selling pressure a la Ripple?\par \par \uc2 It seems to be acting stronger than XRP recently. However, when XLM runs, XRP usually follows, so it\u8217\'20\'19s vital to keep an eye on both of the coins. If one of the two starts to show strength, the other one will likely follow.\par \par \uc2 The chart is showing some substantial implications of further upwards momentum to occur. One of them is that the price of XLM is moving above the 100-day and 200-day MAs and holds support above these Moving Averages.\par \par \uc2 Alongside with that support, the green zone is also providing support (which is a horizontal support level). Crucial to continue showing momentum, as the cryptocurrency is in an uptrend since the massive crash on March 12.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the volume is heavily increased in the recent period. Volume precedes price, through which assumptions can be derived from this data that the coin is being accumulated heavily.\par \par \uc2 All are a combination of factors that can fuel further upwards momentum. So what\u8217\'20\'19s the most likely scenarios now for XLM and XRP?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3a57f39ed5fc6a003fefe0e10e6a6dbf."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/WcJ56Xf4/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens is facing a crucial resistance to breakthrough. Once the next level at $0.075 is broken, a further surge towards the $0.085 level is expected. However, as Cardano has shown, this is just a mere resistance level in which the price is more likely to continue rallying.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s the next major pivot for Stellar Lumens? It\u8217\'20\'19s found at $0.105-0.11, which would mean a surge of more than 50%.\par \par \uc2 However, when the $0.075 doesn\u8217\'20\'19t break, a retest of $0.06 is back on the table. That level must hold as support to keep the upward trend intact.\par \par \uc2 Stellar Lumens\u8217\'20\'19 BTC pair is showing strength\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4e008fc2a61fac6466a7218aa952fe54."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/BTC 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/LjLhNFqX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC pair of Stellar Lumens is showing significant strength, and similar signals as Cardano showed before that one surged massively.\par \par \uc2 There was an apparent support/resistance flip of the 100-day and 200-day MAs alongside with a support flip of the 0.00000700 sats level.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s next to happen for Stellar Lumens? A breakthrough of the 0.00000860-0.00000915 sats level is the next goal. The cryptocurrency has been hovering inside this accumulation range for more than a year. If a break of that resistance occurs, a heavy continuation to the upside can be expected.\par \par \uc2 The arguments are there as the price flipped the 100-day and 200-day MAs into support. But now, the continuation still has to occur. Such a surge is something, which XRP can only dream of after losing its range support. However, as discussed, once Stellar Lumens starts to move, usually, XRP tends to follow.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy83NjM3ZGU4MmE0ODM3MzdlNGY5YmNlY2MzNjZkYTFmYS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200601eg610008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Is Bitcoin Price Finally Ready for Breakout Above $10,000?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 1,131 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is looking to retake the key psychological level at $10,000, which may now propel BTC to multi-year highs\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) had seen a substantial rally before the halving, as the price topped at $10,100. Since then, the BTC price has been hovering inside a sideways range between $8,200 and $10,000.\par \par \uc2 However, are the markets making itself ready for a breakout above this crucial resistance? Bitcoin is showing strength, but other cryptocurrencies like Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) are also showing strength with double-digit performances in the past week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/84cca96ff8280771d3deb23a25b99151.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-95wahmuju5_1590843591108"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin facing $10,000 resistance as a crucial level to break\par \par \uc2 The 6-hour chart is showing a clear range-bound structure since the high at $10,100. The market showed a pre-halving crash (i.e. buy the rumor, sell the news), after which the price stabilized and consolidated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fd5fd3e835519e875fdc5fe5a0a0e207.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 6-hour chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 6-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zM1rHm48/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The chart is showing a breakdown of the rising wedge at $9,800, after which support was found at $8,600. That\u8217\'20\'19s important, as that shows another higher low. The critical fact is that the market has been providing these higher lows since the crash on March 12.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, Bitcoin is still trending upward since. What\u8217\'20\'19s more, is that the price of Bitcoin was able to break through the critical level at $9,300. As long as Bitcoin remains above the $9,300 level, a further upward move can occur to retest the resistance zone at $9,800-10,100, increasing the chances of a breakout to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Once Bitcoin can do so, the next targets are $11,000 and $11,500, leading to a further surge of the whole cryptocurrency markets.\par \par \uc2 Total market capitalization cryptocurrency ready for a move towards $310 billion\par \par \uc2 The total market capitalization of cryptocurrencies is showing support above the 100-day and 200-day MA (moving average). The total market capitalization has consolidated inside a range as well, with support at $225 and resistance at $267-268 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0ecbe901be767c9ee85667d11890a9e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total cryptocurrency market capitalization 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Total cryptocurrency market capitalization 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ka7juw5K/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The construction is a good sign for further upwards momentum, as the total market capitalization is also showing higher lows as a trend. Next to that, the market is in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  territory as long as the 100-day and 200-day MAs remain support.\par \par \uc2 The previous cycle sustained support above these MAs during the entire cycle, which makes it an essential indicator.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f8a763a094d95d274bf51ac6a96dc533.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total cryptocurrency market capitalization 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Total cryptocurrency market capitalization 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6qqqgser/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart is also hinting further upwards momentum as a clear ascending triangle is emerging.\par \par \uc2 At $265-267 billion, the resistance area has been tested several times, which makes the resistance weaker on each test. The total market capitalization is making higher lows, which makes this an ascending triangle.\par \par \uc2 In other words, another test of the resistance can be a trigger for a breakout and further upward momentum. The next targets for the total market capitalization are $310 and $325 billion.\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market capitalization showing impressive strength\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cbf88f2566e58db26bfa0445e1b9887a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization cryptocurrency 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/pwmlBwkH/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market capitalization finally flipped the 100-day and 200-day MA as support. Not only these MAs are providing support, but $70 billion is also currently holding. That\u8217\'20\'19s opening the doors for further upwards momentum as the altcoin market capitalization broke above $82-83 billion in recent days.\par \par \uc2 What are the next targets for this market capitalization? The following primary resistance is found at $110-115 billion.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum leading with a rally towards $240\par \par \uc2 The most important indicator for altcoins is Ether. Once ETH starts to move, the other altcoins are ready to follow suit. In recent days, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-and-ethereum-price-surge-alongside-bitcoin-will-xlm-follow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum moved}}}\uc2  from $195 and $240, which is a strong signal for altcoins to follow.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3773f7689ac5c121f0fa09f0449c33ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USDT 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/SsZKGa1n/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The chart of Ether price is identical to the altcoin market capitalization. ETH found support above the 100-day and 200-day MAs while showing increased volume, a sign of strength.\par \par \uc2 Alongside with that, the $195 level flipped for support, which triggered a further continuation to the upside. As the $215 level has been tested several times, a next test would mean a breakthrough of that resistance level.\par \par \uc2 The price of Ether broke through the barrier and is currently rallying towards the next resistance level at $250-253. If the price of Ethereum breaks through that resistance level, the next zone is $290.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario for Bitcoin\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5ee88f46b0d2c4316dc3a83ee42bff4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USD 3-hour chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 3-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/hmpE4gG2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario involves a rejection at $9,800, but more importantly, a breakdown below the $9,300 support area.\par \par \uc2 If the $9,300 area is lost, further downwards is likely to occur. Traders should watch for potential \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  retests of previous support levels. Such a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  retest marks the previous support level for resistance, in which further downwards momentum is warranted. The essentials of a downwards trend.\par \par \uc2 The primary area to watch for if the price of Bitcoin drops below $9,300 is the $8,600-8,800 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario for Bitcoin\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0316328e134c7f71ad14e70f52793850.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC USD 3-hour chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD 3-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/QpAPLjNZ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario is straightforward. The price of Bitcoin needs to hold above the green area at $9,300. As long as that level remains support, further upwards momentum should be expected.\par \par \uc2 In that regard, an upward grind towards the resistance at $9,850-10,100 can be expected. As discussed, once the upper resistance level is tested a few more times, the expectations of a breakout to the upside are increasing.\par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin breaks through this resistance level, a further sustainable rally towards $10,500, $11,000, and $11,600 is on the table.\par \par \uc2 The best environment for altcoins is a slow, upward move following Bitcoin. As we\u8217\'20\'19ve seen in recent days, other altcoins like Ether and Cardano have started to show strength. If Bitcoin remains to move to the upside, more altcoins can see upward breakouts.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8xN2JjOGY0NDM2NmRhZmY4MjI1NDc1NWI2NDgxYzJiYi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200530eg5u0008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Cardano and Ethereum Price Surge Alongside Bitcoin \u8212\'20\'14 Will XLM Follow?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe \par \uc2 1,208 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The recent surge in Bitcoin price led to rallies in Ethereum, Cardano, Theta Token and Band Protocol, can the upswing continue?\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a defined range over the past weeks as the halving hype has passed. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action also led to increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in altcoins and some of the smaller altcoins have been showing impressive strength. So far, Theta Token ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/theta-theta"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 THETA}}}\uc2  ) and Band Protocol ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/band-protocol-band"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BAND}}}\uc2  ) have been heavy movers.\par \par \uc2 However, in the previous days, the larger cap altcoins have started to move up, with Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) as the primary movers. As Bitcoin attempts to find a way back to $10,000, traders will closely watch to see if there is more to follow from these large cap altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/307d1c696d2c4450857ad20486fc8c2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-c06g9b5vu9_1590759932251"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether breaks through the $215 barrier\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c5869df1e3e063f18436782f80a6693b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH USDT 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Ck0Cldqj/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The daily chart is showing an evident compression between $195 and $215, which finally broke to the upside. Alongside that, the chart is also showing some critical metrics for further upward momentum.\par \par \uc2 Key indicators for bull or bear markets are the support above or below the 100-day and 200-day moving average. As long as the price of a certain asset continues to move above the moving averages the asset is in bull territory.\par \par \uc2 Why is that important? Throughout the entire previous bull cycle, the price of Ethereum remained above these indicators, leading to a peak of $1,400 in January 2018.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the volume is also massively increasing in recent periods, showing signs of accumulation as volume precedes price. A similar sign is shown on the altcoin market capitalization chart.\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market capitalization prepares to shift toward $110-$140 billion\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/527ebdb24fb19f5b31ae860b260eb0ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoin market capitalization 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market capitalization 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/3HdQDjRS/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The total market capitalization for altcoins is showing an impressive increase in volume, while the capitalization is also flipping the 100-day and 200-day MA for support.\par \par \uc2 As the chart is showing, the support is found at these MAs in which $68-$72 billion is an essential support.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the resistance is established at $113 and $136 billion. This is a vital resistance as the $113 billion level can be compared with the $6,000 floor of Bitcoin in 2018. The price of Bitcoin is now far above the $6,000 barrier, as it\u8217\'20\'19s currently hovering between $9,100 and $10,000.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, it\u8217\'20\'19s time for altcoins to start pacing up, and the next resistance levels are found at the $113 and $136 billion level. If the total market capitalization rallies towards the $136 billion level, that would mean a surge of 60% for the entire altcoin market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s happening with Cardano?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/941cfd8c30eee17628162fd5a536b193.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  USDT 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/9vvisdOp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The strongest large-cap altcoin in the past week has been Cardano which has moved 30% in recent days. This last push made the cryptocurrency rally towards the levels from February 2020, through which all the losses of the March 12 market crash have vanished.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s behind this push? From a fundamental perspective, a new roadmap for the release of Shelley is complete, triggering a further rally on the price.\par \par \uc2 However, on the technical side, the price has been holding the 100-day and 200-day MA as support earlier. After that, the green area around $0.05 became support, which fueled the continuation of the upwards momentum.\par \par \uc2 Right now, the next resistance of this pair is found at $0.07, with a potentially exciting support level at $0.057-$0.06.\par \par \uc2 If the $0.057-$0.06 confirms as support, a potential continuation rally towards $0.07 and $0.09 as the next targets are on the tables.\par \par \uc2 Confluent with previous statements, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s trading volume is also increasing this week. A possible explanation is that investors are jumping from Bitcoin towards altcoins as various projects are finally starting to release their products and platforms.\par \par \uc2 Will Stellar Lumens follow Cardano?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/785b35639be345684682f6d17f6c0791.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM USDT 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM USDT 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/buvtWGFx/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, other large-caps are starting to show signals of potential upwards continuation as well. Cardano has been rallying in the previous days, Ether broke through $213-$215 as a key resistance level. Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) is also showing signals of potential continuation as well.\par \par \uc2 The green zone at $0.06-$0.0625 has to remain a support, but overall the structure is beginning to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pennant. This is due to the fact the price of Stellar Lumens continues to make higher lows, leading to a potential continuation to the upside.\par \par \uc2 The next primary target for Stellar Lumens is the resistance at $0.085-$0.087.\par \par \uc2 What to expect from the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC and ETH/BTC\par \par \uc2 The ETH/BTC pair has been trading inside a range structure since the August-September of 2019. However, since it\u8217\'20\'19s low in September 2019, the price has been making structural higher lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a1bba45408759d7a414e51141598f9d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH BTC 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH BTC 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ryNPnfot/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Through that, the trend for ETH/BTC can be classified as an uptrend. What are the next significant hurdles for Ether?\par \par \uc2 First of all, a breakthrough above the 0.024 sats level should be beneficial for continuation. The 0.024 sats level is confluent with the 200-day MA and needs to be broken for a sustainable extension. As discussed, finding support above the 200-day MA is a vital indicator for further \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Once the price of Ether is above the resistance level (whether or not a retest of the 0.021 sats level occurs), a new higher high should be made.\par \par \uc2 By creating a new higher high, the price of Ether will finally break out of this range. If the 0.027 sats level is broken to the upside, the next target lies at 0.034 sats.\par \par \uc2 Where Ether is still fighting the moving averages, is \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC is already leading the pack and acting above them.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/29cfe60abeb863bf0c27ce688a1ec538.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  BTC 1-day chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC 1-day chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/03vDBUTx/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The Cardano chart in the BTC pair is showing an apparent breakthrough in the resistance at 0.00000625 sats, after which the price rallied towards the next resistance at 0.00000680-0.00000700 sats.\par \par \uc2 This is the last hurdle before a further surge. Preferably, the price should come down for a retest of the 0.00000625-0.00000640 sats level for support.\par \par \uc2 However, once the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC breaks through the 0.00000690 sats level, a further, mpre sustainable rally towards 0.00001000 - 0.00001070 sats level is on the table. Such a rally would mean a new surge of 60%-70%.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptomichnl?lang=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8xZDhlZTU4ZjY4NDIxZTM0YzczN2MwN2E1OTFmZjY0ZS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200529eg5t0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 5/29: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,861 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Many altcoins are showing significant strength as they approach their 200-day moving averages, this suggests that the sentiment in the sector remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Institutional demand for Bitcoin remains high, even as the price turned down after the block reward halving. Some in the space believe that if institutional and retail demand picks up, there will be a severe shortage of ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which can quickly push its price higher.\par \par \uc2 A small example can be seen in the way crypto fund manager Grayscale Investments has been lapping up Bitcoin, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap. Since the halving, Grayscale alone has bought about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-is-now-buying-15-times-the-amount-of-bitcoin-being-mined"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 150%}}}\uc2  of the newly mined Bitcoin. If this pace of purchasing continues for a few more weeks, traders\u8217\'20\'19 sentiment could turn decidedly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Stocks usually react {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-shrugs-off-goldman-sachs-criticism-with-price-spike"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strongly}}}\uc2  to upgrades or downgrades by large brokerage houses or investment banks. However, the crypto community decided to go contra to Goldman\u8217\'20\'19s recent warning to its clientele against investing in Bitcoin. This suggests that crypto traders do not give much weight to the reports by traditional brokerages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4d34a3824d0e6a0a7e26e0b087214cec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-ihq9q7iblx_1590602665908"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The huge rise in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price over the past decade has not happened due to support from the government or from the brokerage houses. It happened as people saw an opportunity in the possibility of a decentralized world. Digital Assets Data CEO Mike Alfred recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-replace-gold-crypto-data-analytics-company-ceo-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Cointelegraph}}}\uc2  that as the world becomes more digital and virtual, the younger generation would be more interested in digital gold, rather than physical gold.\par \par \uc2 Today also marks the expiry of CME BTC Options contracts. Typically the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-volatility-expected-as-328m-in-btc-derivatives-expire-friday"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expiry}}}\uc2  has led to a 2.3% drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price. Usually, fluctuations caused due to derivatives expiry are short-term blips and they don't change the ongoing trend. Therefore, swing traders should initiate trades based on the trend and not so much on the CME expiry.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,151) on May 27 and followed it up with another strong up move on May 28. This suggests that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7575569a52daabd83409199cc4d10f9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight. They are mounting a strong resistance at the $9,600 level. If this level is scaled, a move to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle is likely.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the triangle will signal the possible start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pattern target following a breakout of the triangle is $11,828.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BTC/USD pair turns down from the current levels, the bears will try to sink it back below the 20-day EMA. If successful, the next stop would be the support line of the symmetrical triangle. A break below this level will be a huge negative as the pattern target of the breakdown from the triangle is $6,752.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) jumped above the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern on May 28, which is a positive sign. There is a minor resistance at $227.097 above which the rally can extend to $257.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4983235c63dcea7e3be3993444a6efdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bears are attempting to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2nd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap back below the neckline. If the price sustains below the neckline, it will suggest that the current breakout was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA and the support at $191.692 could signal the start of a possible downtrend. Therefore, traders who have purchased on the recommendation given in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-27-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis can keep their stops at $200.\par \par \uc2 However, if the ETH/USD pair bounces off the neckline, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the $220.097 hurdle. If successful, the uptrend is likely to resume. The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index above 60 levels suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are defending the downtrend line. If {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  turns down from the current levels, the bears will try to drag the price towards the critical support at $0.17372. A breakdown of this support will be a huge negative as it is likely to start a new downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1c657e46864b7fa66bc394a269875ed1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3rd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line and the horizontal resistance of $0.20570, a move to $0.22504 and then to $0.23612 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Traders who don\u8217\'20\'19t own long positions can buy if the XRP/USD pair sustains above $0.20570 for a few hours. The stop-loss for this trade can be kept at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) had broken above the 50-day simple moving average ($238) today but the bulls are facing stiff resistance at higher levels. If the price turns down and slips back below the moving averages, a drop to $217.55 is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4453856889595668a32a84835303e5d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $217.55, a drop to $200 and then to $166 is possible. Therefore, traders can avoid holding long positions below $217.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BCH/USD pair rebounds off the moving averages, a move to $255.46 and then to $280.47 is possible. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance but if crossed, a new uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are facing stiff resistance at the downtrend line. If Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) turns down from the current levels, a drop to $170 is possible. If the bulls defend this level aggressively, the consolidation is likely to extend for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9f8e443ed48bcad11f1c1001fda588fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 6th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $170, a new downtrend is likely. The first support on the downside is $145 and then $120. Therefore, traders can protect their long positions with a stop below $170.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can scale the price above the downtrend line, a rally to $227 is possible. A break above this level will signal the start of a new uptrend. However, if the price turns down from this resistance, the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has reached the downtrend line. If the bulls can propel the price above this resistance, a rally to $50.7864 is possible. A break above this resistance will invalidate the developing H&S pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/382aadc4b531f490f7a259e45ace3717.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Therefore, traders can look for buying opportunities on a breakout and close (UTC time) above $50.7864.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the downtrend line, it can drop to $41.7 and then to $39.\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair bounces off the supports, the range-bound is likely to continue. The trend will turn in favor of the bears on a break below $39.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have carried Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) to the downtrend line but are struggling to scale the price above it. This suggests that bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e4b79c864cc826f212ae5d64dcbd3ee1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 8th}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap above the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a break above the downtrend line. Above this level, a rally to $18.1377 is likely.\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USD pair is likely to pick up momentum above $18.1377, which can offer a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair slips below the moving averages, a drop to $14.95 and then to $13.65 is possible.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  continues to be in a range with both the bulls and bears playing it safe. Although the bulls have managed to push the price above the moving averages, the breakout lacks momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3e9da11f5a8ba0e3b06654c28a8600b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 9th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap sustains above the moving averages, a rally to $2.8319 is possible. On the other hand, if the price drops below the moving averages, a decline to $2.3314 is likely.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to start on a breakout above $2.8319 or on a breakdown below $2.3314. Therefore, until then, traders can remain on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls have managed to drive Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on May 28, the breakout lacks momentum. This suggests hesitation by the bulls at higher levels. The failure to sustain the price above the downtrend line is likely to attract selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1c5bba2bcae467f562bd3f318532608f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap back below the downtrend line, a drop to the 20-day EMA ($2.70) is likely. This is an important support to watch out for because if this breaks, a drop to $2.5795 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, traders can keep a stop-loss of $2.57 on the long positions initiated as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-27-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par \uc2 However, if the XTZ/USD pair bounces off the downtrend line, it will indicate strength. Such a move can result in a rally to $3.07 and then $3.27.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) surged on May 28 and broke above the overhead resistance of $0.0619885. Traders who bought after the suggestion in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-27-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis are likely to be sitting on profits. They can either book complete profits at the current levels or book profits on a major portion and trail the rest with a tight stop-loss.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6d8ed481331fa97857e7de02f7482343.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 After the sharp rally on May 28, a few days of consolidation or a minor correction is possible. If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $0.0619885, the pullback is likely to deepen further to $0.05928.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls defend the immediate support at $0.0619885, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair is likely to attempt a rally to $0.0722722. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the pair dips back to $0.055. However, the possibility of such a drop looks dim.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy80MjIxZTMzMzY3NTRkZmIwYjY5Yzk0MDhkZmRhZTZiOS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200529eg5t000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Falling Wedge Breakout Propels Bitcoin Price Above Key Resistance at $9.2K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Horus Hughes \par \uc2 406 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price closed the CME gap and made a decisive move above the $9K and $9.2K resistance as traders attempt to carve a new path to $10K\par \par \uc2 Within the past few hours Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price managed to press through the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-caught-between-key-support-levels-as-bearish-sentiment-grows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $9,200 resistance level}}}\uc2  to $9,281. While the 2.58% gain may not be much to talk about, the move above the key resistance level is a step forward and the initial move to $9,180 closed the CME gap from last weekend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bd75414851ea681c2bb4982a44715c11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-cr898fd4pc_1590636226220"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Since dropping to $8,640 on May 25, Bitcoin price has gained 7% and this occurred as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/05/27/us-stock-futures-flat-after-reopen-rally-puts-dow-back-above-25000.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 S&P 500 and Dow both rallied higher}}}\uc2  this week.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday both indexes broke above their 200-day moving average, nearly reclaiming all of the losses caused by the coronavirus-driven correction that started in March.\par \par \uc2 The sharp rallies in both markets also led analysts to suggest that the Dow is now \u8220\'20\'1Con track for its best week since the week ended April 8.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2bd27e81ee4b11cb6d6581372394021f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BitMEX XBTUSD Liquidations. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Data from Skew shows that as Bitcoin reclaimed $9,000 earlier in the day on May 27 approximately $18 million in XBT-USD short positions were liquidated.\par \par \uc2 Traders will be closely watching to see if the top-ranked \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  on CoinMarketCap can secure a daily close above the $9,200 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/94b5016df4eb5e4863cbc27a4eaf1214.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin 4-hour price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As shown by the 4-hour chart, Bitcoin price surged through the falling wedge pattern and in the short-term the price may pull back to retest $9,150 and recent resistance in the $9,000 to $8,800 range. After this bulls will be ready to take aim at $9,350, then $9,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/de8505d49e794c7dc313f936c8bcb5ee.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins also managed to post moderate 1-3 percent gains as Bitcoin price pushed through it\u8217\'20\'19s key resistance level. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rallied 2.57%, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) gained 2.37%, and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) added 3.51%.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 , the overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $256.4 billion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 65.9%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8wMDkxODk1NWQ4Njg3MmEzMTNkNWZiMjgyMjdhMGU2YS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200528eg5s00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 5/27: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,805 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Most major cryptocurrencies have seen strong buying at lower levels, which shows traders remain interested in buying the dips\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has weathered the current crisis and come out on top, \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  only focused on the March 12 fall in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-butts-heads-with-bloomberg-over-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 presentation}}}\uc2  to its clients. Using liberally interpreted information, Goldman appears to be discouraging their clients from diversifying their portfolios with Bitcoin allocations.\par \par \uc2 Luckily, there are a few large players who understand the potential of cryptocurrencies. Kingdom Trust, a financial custodian that manages more than $13 billion in assets, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/13b-custodian-launches-retirement-account-supporting-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched}}}\uc2  a retirement account dubbed \u8220\'20\'1CChoice\u8221\'20\'1D, which offers an opportunity to its clients to invest in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency along with other traditional assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2b5132505937fbc9c529557a85c332b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-ihq9q7iblx_1590602665908"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Several traders stay away from cryptocurrencies as they are scared of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, those who can identify the trend and trade along with proper risk management principles can benefit from the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . On the other hand, several whales have made a fortune by not selling their holding on every swing.\par \par \uc2 This shows that people are using different strategies to make the most of this new asset class which consistently offers retail investors the opportunity to generate profits with all the overhead and \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  required by traditional investment brokers.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from $8,638.79 on May 25, which is a positive sign. It suggests that selling pressure dries up at lower levels and at the same time, bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/62312a900ced7c06222ab7f7019565a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair has formed a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. That means the breakout is likely to happen in the direction that was in play before this pattern developed.\par \par \uc2 In this case, the pair had risen sharply from the lows, hence, the possibility of a break above the triangle is high. However, there are no certainties in trading. Therefore, traders should be ready for any eventuality.\par \par \uc2 A break above the triangle will be a huge positive as the pattern target is $11,828. However, traders should keep an eye on the $10,500 level as the bears are likely to defend this aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario would come into play if the pair turns down and plummets below the triangle. The pattern target of such a drop is $6,752.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the downtrend line on May 26 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that the bulls are buying on dips. The bulls are now likely to make another attempt to push the price above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ddd76ea299015acac93ed1119d78d04f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2nd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern. This setup has a target objective of $257. Although the bears will defend the $227.097 level aggressively, it is likely to be scaled.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, a close (UTC time) above the downtrend line offers a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair turns down from the downtrend line and plummets below $191.692. If this support cracks, a drop to $176.112 is likely.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 After aggressively buying the dip on May 25, the bulls are now attempting to drive {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the moving averages and the downtrend line. If successful, a rally to $0.22504 and then to $0.23612 is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/895844a72b27de65620ad6277ed0be76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, both moving averages remain flat and the relative strength index is also just below the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3rd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the moving averages or the downtrend line, it will indicate a lack of buyers at higher levels. In such a case, the bears will make another attempt to sink the price below $0.17372. If successful, the XRP/USD pair could turn negative.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the tight $217.55-$255.46 range. The bulls purchased the dip to the support of this range on May 25 and are now attempting to drive the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c4fd4482d2c4d29677333e9aa71cb259.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, a rally to $255.46 and above it to $280.47 is possible. Therefore, traders who have purchased on the suggestion given in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-25-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis can keep the stops just below $217 and can trail the stops higher as the price moves up.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the moving averages and plummets below $217.55. Below this level, a drop to $200 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) turned around from $176.410 on May 26, which suggests that bulls are defending the support of the $170-$227 range. If traders have purchased on a bounce off the lows as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-25-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis, the stops can be placed just below $170.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/64b6e04af78f80c4327ee27d14eee0c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 A break below $170 will be a huge negative as it will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls. That could drag the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 6th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to $145 and then to $120.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls succeed in pushing the price above the downtrend line, a rally to $227 is possible. A break above $227 could start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 If the BSV/USD pair turns down from the downtrend line, it will suggest weakness. Therefore, traders can reduce their risk by trailing the stops higher as the price moves north.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to drag \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) down towards the critical support of $39 shows a lack of selling at lower levels. The bulls will now attempt to push the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e1bb3df0ed917cd44557f6164ffad388.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, a move to the downtrend line and above it to $50.7864 is likely. Such a move will invalidate the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is likely to pick up momentum above the $50.7864-52.2803 overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the LTC/USD pair turns down from the downtrend line once again, it will increase the possibility of a break below $39, which will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to move up to the downtrend line. However, the gradual pace of rise shows that the bulls are in no urgency to buy aggressively at the current levels. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests that the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9efd84eb9a8467c7137b9165d56d56ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 8th}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap could rise to $18.1377. This is an important level to watch out for. If the bulls can drive the price above $18.1377, the momentum is likely to pick up. The first target on the upside would be $21.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BNB/USD pair turns down from the downtrend line or from $18.1377, the range-bound action is likely to continue for a few more days. A new downtrend is likely to start on a break below $13.65.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 Although {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been trading below both the moving averages for the past few days, the bears have not been able to sink the price below the critical support of $2.3314. This indicates a lack of selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d98e754e6ed4d855bc81c2c408494351.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can now push the price above the moving averages, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 9th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $2.8319. A break above this level will invalidate the developing H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price again turns down from the moving averages, then the possibility of a break below $2.3314 increases. Both moving averages are flattening out and the RSI is just below the 50 levels, which indicates a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 Traders can wait for the EOS/USD pair to breakout of the range and start a trending move before initiating a long position.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Although Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the ascending channel on May 24, the bears have not been able to capitalize on the breakdown. This suggests a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4225e4f78a702c6fc8bfd17fa4f11420.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have defended the 20-day exponential moving average ($2.67) for the past few days and are now likely to try and launch the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the uptrend is likely to resume with a target objective of $3.07 and then $3.27. Therefore, short-term traders can attempt to ride this move higher by using a stop-loss just below $2.57.\par \par \uc2 If the XTZ/USD pair turns down from the downtrend line, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. In such a case, a retest of $2.57 is possible. The price action at the downtrend line will determine whether the uptrend will resume or a decline to $2.24 will begin.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($0.052) in the past few days. This suggests that the bulls will now attempt to carry Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.0575409.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e8ebebd648c7e93277e898ef0456dbfa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, a rally to $0.0619885 is possible. The upsloping moving averages suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. The only negative development on the chart is the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI.\par \par \uc2 While the divergence warrants caution, it should not be the lone reason to short or to close the long position. Many times, the divergences can get negated with sharp rallies.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, traders can try to ride the uptrend in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down and plummets below $0.0504050.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9mM2E3OGNlZTk1Yzk0MjI5MmYxNjFhZjhiZGU2MTFkNi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200527eg5r000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 5/25: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,793 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Several major cryptocurrencies have turned down from their resistance levels, hinting that further downside could occur in the short-term\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has neither run away nor plunged following its halving, which suggests that history might be repeating itself. After the first halving, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap moved up only by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/05/11/bitcoin-halving-heres-what-you-need-to-know.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7%}}}\uc2  after a month. After the second halving the price dipped 10% during the same period.\par \par \uc2 However, the important thing to note is that both the halvings were followed by strong bull runs. Therefore, even if history doesn't repeat itself it could still offer handsome returns to investors at a time when the global economies are staring at their worst recessions in decades.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/97cdbdd773a13587a395fe02cf7e9b67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-e54br6njk6_1588362562087"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the bull markets following the previous two halvings were vertical in nature, the next bull market is likely to follow a gradual trajectory. This is because the derivatives market will keep the exuberance under check for some time. Nonetheless, every bull market ends with a parabolic move and the same can happen with Bitcoin as well.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, investors could use the dips as an opportunity to build their long-term portfolio. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the major cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support levels that can offer buying opportunities to traders.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on May 24. If the bulls fail to push the price back above the uptrend line within the next couple of days, it will suggest that the uptrend has ended.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9f1a96ad844b673f4fdb95bf9839c1a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is $8,130.58, which is just below the 50-day simple moving average ($8,262). If this support holds, the BTC/USD pair could remain range-bound between $8,130.58 and $10,000 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day exponential moving average ($9,073) and the relative strength index just below the midpoint indicates a balance between supply and demand. If the pair bounces off $8,130.58, it could offer a buying opportunity with a target objective of about $10,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the pair below $8,130.58, it could signal the start of a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not been able to keep Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) inside the ascending channel, which is a negative sign. Currently, the bulls are attempting to defend the uptrend line, which had held twice before (marked via ellipses on the chart).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fc09d6e4037b61bb67b4af0a4a57caee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2nd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap bounces off the uptrend line and closes (UTC time) above the downtrend line, it will complete an inverse head and shoulders pattern. This setup has a target objective of $257, which is close to the resistance line of the ascending channel. This could offer a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the ETH/USD pair below the uptrend line, a drop to $176.112 is possible. If this support holds, the pair might remain range-bound for a few days. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the 50 levels also point to a balance between supply and demand. A break below $176.112 will indicate the start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  turned down from the moving averages and plunged to $0.175 today. The strong bounce off this level suggests that the bulls are aggressively defending the critical support at $0.17372.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b08841678b9ec55ab5306581e7c6b922.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the traders purchased the bounce off the support at $0.175 as suggested in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-22-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-bnb-eos-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis, they can keep a stop-loss of $0.173.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3rd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap will show strength if the bulls can carry it above the downtrend line. Above this level, a move to $0.22504 and then to $0.23612 is possible. Traders can trail the stops higher as the price moves up.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the downtrend line and plummets below $0.17372, a drop to $0.14 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the moving averages on May 24 and dipped below the immediate support of $230. However, the bulls managed to keep the price above the next support at $217.55. This suggests some buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6022c55958ae6f77941ce18e121a034a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will once again attempt to propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the moving averages. If successful, a move to $255.46 is possible. A break out of this level can result in a rally to $280.47, which is likely to act as a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the BCH/USD pair again turns down from the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a fall to $217.55. This support has held thrice before, hence, a bounce off it can offer a buying opportunity with a tight stop-loss.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the moving averages on May 24, which is a negative sign. The next support on the downside is $170. If this support cracks, it will signal the possible start of a new downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ded93952630f38e31311ded47fdc3df8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls have defended the $170 level on three previous occasions, hence, a bounce off the support could offer a buying opportunity with a tight stop-loss.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 6th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line, a rally to $227 is possible. This is an important resistance from where the price has turned down twice before, hence, profits can be booked at this level.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the moving averages on May 24, which is a negative sign. If the bulls do not push the price back above the moving averages within the next few days, it will increase the possibility of a head and shoulders breakdown.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5928f29de93e8bd2e42ce4ce7fc2d1c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will complete on a breakdown and close (UTC time) below $39. This could start a downtrend that has a target objective of $27.2136. The RSI has also formed a H&S pattern, which will complete on a break below 41 levels.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario will be invalidated if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap rebounds off the support at $39 and breaks above the downtrend line. Above this resistance, a rally to $50.7864 is possible. The LTC/USD pair is likely to pick up momentum on a close above $52.2803.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been holding the 50-day SMA ($16) for the past few days. This has become the critical support to watch out for. If the price bounces off this support, the bulls will make another attempt to scale the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/653c44d60be141c8b7edfe3b22c80568.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, a rally to $18.1377 is likely. A breakout of this resistance will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The next level to watch on the upside is $21.50. Hence, this could offer a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 8th}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels or from the downtrend line and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it could drop to $14.9586 and below it to $13.65. A break below this level will signal the start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days, which is a negative sign. The bears will now try to sink the price below the critical support at $2.3314.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9c9bc224830a8197c404d311605d3b62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($2.59) has been sloping down and the RSI has been trading between 40-50 levels, which suggests that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 9th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap closes (UTC time) below $2.3314, it will complete a H&S pattern. This setup has a target objective of $1.5524.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls defend the $2.3314 support once again and push the EOS/USD pair above the moving averages, a rally to $2.8319 is likely.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the downtrend line on May 24, which suggests that the bears are aggressively defending this level. In the past few days, the bears have repeatedly broken below the support line of the ascending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/926506509cc31253bb3611aa6356581e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $2.5795, a drop to the 50-day SMA ($2.48) and below it to $2.24 is possible. A break below this level could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the XTZ/USD pair above the downtrend line, it will signal strength. Above this level, a rally to $3.07369 and then to $3.2712 is possible. Hence, a breakout and close (UTC time) above the downtrend line can be viewed as a buying opportunity.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.05166) for the past few days. While this is a positive sign, repeated retests of a support weaken it. Therefore, if Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) does not rise above $0.0575409 within the next few days, a deeper correction is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3a3baf72fd2346bda44f5deb4a8a6e2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink and sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.04481) is possible. A break below the critical support of $0.0427288 will signal the start of a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has dipped close to the midpoint, which suggests a range-bound action for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair bounces off the current levels and breaks out of $0.0575409, the uptrend is likely to resume.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jNzIzYjBlM2JhZjRjZjNkODJiZmRhMmYzNzY5ZTU0Ni5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200525eg5p000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Cryptocurrencies to Watch This Week: BTC, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LINK, ETC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,842 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin remains in an uptrend, these altcoins are likely to outperform the other major cryptocurrencies this week\par \par \uc2 The institutional interest in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-investors-buying-up-btc-like-crazy-after-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased}}}\uc2  in the past few months, according to data from \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 . If the trend continues at the same pace, by March 2021, GBTC would have purchased 75% of the newly mined Bitcoin during the period. By that time, its total holding of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  on CoinMarketCap would increase to 3% of the total circulating supply. If this happens, it could be a huge sentiment booster for investors who believe institutional investment is the key for mass adoption.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/432a49c0fa3365ee6a6fb0bba9d03a60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-fpje2fq19a_1589129732773"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Reddit co-founder Alexis Ohanian has said that he holds a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/reddits-co-founder-believes-we-are-in-crypto-spring"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 percentage}}}\uc2  of his wealth in crypto and he does not want to change it. Ohanian believes that Bitcoin is a hedge due to the fact that several \u8220\'20\'1COGs of Wall Street\u8221\'20\'1D have now entered the crypto space.\par \par \uc2 The long-term fundamentals for cryptocurrencies have been improving but the price is yet to catch up. Can the up move resume this week? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of five major cryptocurrencies that could offer trading opportunities this week.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside an ascending channel, which shows that the medium-term trend is up. However, the short-term has stalled as the price has dipped below both moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/69b332fb37f1422124f2d17b95310528.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC-USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USD pair has formed a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. The 10-day exponential moving average is sloping gradually and the relative strength index is just above the 50 levels, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 While the best way to trade a symmetrical triangle is to wait for the price to breakout or breakdown from it, another possible strategy is to buy close to the support line of the triangle as this helps in keeping a close stop-loss.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the support line of the triangle, it will be a first sign that the uptrend might be in danger. A break below the channel will confirm a change in trend. However, the end of an uptrend does not mean a downtrend has started as the prices might remain range-bound. The downtrend might start on a break below $8,130.58.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6a310c8b064bc2e92c858e058fe11427.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC-USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bulls are aggressively buying the dip to the support line of the symmetrical triangle. This is a positive sign as it confirms demand at lower levels. The bulls might now attempt to carry the price to the resistance line of the triangle, which is close to $9,850. This is the first target objective.\par \par \uc2 A break above $9,350 could indicate the resumption of the up move. This can offer a buying opportunity to the traders with a stop-loss of $8,950, which is just below the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 As the pair moves up, the stops can be trailed higher. Traders can book partial profits close to $9,850 and give some wiggle room to the remaining position because a breakout of the triangle will give it a pattern target of $11,778.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside an ascending channel, which shows the path of least resistance to the upside. However, the bulls have been facing stiff resistance at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6673277f0f9bd4c9374d915a31795003.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ-USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bears are attempting to change the trend. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels and plunges below the support line of the channel, it will signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, it could signal the resumption of the uptrend. The 10-day EMA has been gradually sloping up and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests that bulls have a slight advantage.\par \par \uc2 Above the downtrend line, a rally to $3.0603 is likely. If the momentum can carry the price above this level, the uptrend can reach the resistance line of the channel, close to $3.60 in the medium-term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5791a12a20ec02707350504ecff9e24c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ-USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart suggests that the bears are aggressively defending the downtrend line. However a minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground in the past two days (marked via ellipse on the chart).\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive the XTZ/USD pair above the downtrend line, the momentum is likely to pick up. Therefore, traders can buy on a breakout and close (UTC time) above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The first target objective on the upside is $3.06. Although there is a minor resistance at $2.963, this is likely to be crossed. On the downside, traders can keep a stop-loss at $2.65. As the price moves up, the stops can be trailed higher. A break above $3.06 can result in a rally to $3.20.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to be in an uptrend. The altcoin resumed its up move following a breakout of the recent highs at $0.0543484 on May 19. However, the sharp drop on May 21 dragged the price back below the breakout level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4fd1d4e1a518baa10f1f7b3ccd077d32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls aggressively purchased the dip to the 20-day simple moving average on May 22 and pushed the price back above $0.0543484. This move suggested strong demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has again dropped below the critical level at $0.0543484. However, the positive sign is that the bulls are attempting to defend the 10-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the current levels, the bulls are likely to make one more attempt to scale the price above $0.057555. If successful, the uptrend is likely to continue. The first target on the upside is a rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price back below $0.050, a drop to the support line of the channel is possible. A break below the channel will indicate a change in trend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests that the bulls might be losing momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/49b25b0aa7fe5ae156607dc149baf490.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to carry the price higher has attracted profit booking. As a result, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair has again broken below $0.0543484. If the price sustains below this level, a drop to $0.0504050 is likely.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair turns around from the current levels and climbs back above $0.0543484, the bulls will again try to scale the price above $0.057555. Aggressive traders can buy 50% of the desired position above the downtrend line and the rest above $0.057555.\par \par \uc2 The target objective of this trade is a rally to the $0.0615-$0.063 resistance zone. This trade can be protected on the downside by keeping the stop-loss below $0.053.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USD\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has largely been range-bound for the past few days. Both the moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, which suggests a balance between demand and supply.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7643de81441a05c3fa6a6513eb942af1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK-USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On May 21, the bulls attempted to resume the uptrend but they could not scale the price above the critical resistance at $4.2129. The bears again aggressively defended this resistance on May 22.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/chainlink/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 12th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap has formed a symmetrical triangle. A breakout and close (UTC time) above the triangle will resume the up move that has a target objective of $4.9127.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below the triangle, a drop to $3.4602-$3.2865 support zone is possible. A break below the zone could result in a drop to $3.0473 which is the pattern target of the breakdown from the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/594cf68845f1238363c73ac689489ee3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK-USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows a symmetrical triangle formation. Although this setup largely works as a continuation pattern, it sometimes can also act as a reversal pattern. Therefore, it is best to wait for a breakout of the triangle before buying.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close (UTC time) above the triangle will be the first sign that the bulls have overpowered the bears. Traders can wait for the LINK/USD pair to breakout above $4.2129 before initiating long positions.\par \par \uc2 The stop-loss for the trade can be kept below $3.7292 because if the bears sink the price below this level, a drop to $3.4602 is possible. Traders can avoid buying if the pair sustains below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 ETC/USD\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ethereum-classic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ) is currently consolidating inside a symmetrical triangle. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the 50 level, which suggests a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0c6cde77d0371911af7d9e9307d946cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETC-USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the balance will shift in favor of the bulls if they can push and close (UTC time) the price above the resistance line of the triangle. Above the triangle, the first target to watch out for is $7.62717 and then $8.4117.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum-classic/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 19th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turns down from the current levels, a drop to the support line of the triangle is likely. A breakdown of this support will signal the start of a new downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/36296715cb0c0c6bb6eadccacdfb3654.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETC-USD 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls had pushed the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. However, they could not sustain the price above the triangle, which suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the ETC/USD pair has again dipped back into the triangle but the 10-EMA is acting as a support. If the pair turns around from the current levels and rallies above $6.80, the up move is likely to resume.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, traders can buy above $6.80 and keep a stop-loss at $6.38. If the bears sink the pair below $6.38, a drop to the support line of the triangle is likely. A break below the triangle could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 The market data is provided by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9iNTBmZTAyNzg5NmU2ZTVkOTliY2M3YmRhMDQ5ZjM5Zi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200524eg5o000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Wild Weekend for Bitcoin Price? US Lockdown Loosens on Memorial Day\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Horus Hughes \par \uc2 599 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery to $10,000 is currently hindered by resistance at the 20-MA and with a holiday weekend coming up traders brace for \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Since dropping below the ascending channel trendline to $8,815 on May 21, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has recovered 4.78%. BTC/USD continues to meet resistance at the 20-day moving average, obstructing traders\u8217\'20\'19 desire to push the price above $9,300.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6819e7dcd441f1ca968d28f4cf07f0aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market weekly price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-gelqwkkgms_1590213324956"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In the United States, this weekend includes the Memorial Day holiday, meaning traditional markets will be closed on Monday and the crypto market will be left to its own devices.\par \par \uc2 Typically trading volume thins on weekends so investors who find time to step away from the family BBQ will be watching to see whether or not larger players exploit the market to push the price of the top-ranked asset on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2  in a new direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b29681c60931923682d4d71c746c3214.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In the 4-hour chart, we can see Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price marching along the gradient of the ascending channel trendline by painting higher lows. The price continues to meet resistance at the 20-MA of the Bollinger Band indicator but traders will also notice that there is a bull cross on the MACD and the indicator\u8217\'20\'19s histogram has printed a green bar above 0.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is also below the neutral zone (50), currently angled downward at 45. In situations such as these, purchasing volume is the key signal to watch, and at the time of writing, both buy and sell volume have screeched to a halt. Volume typically precedes price so keeping a close eye on increases in buy or sell volume on the shorter timeframes will be the tell.\par \par \uc2 The neutral Doji candle also shows buyers and sellers in equal contention on the direction of the price and based on the current setup, Bitcoin could either drop to the lower Bollinger Band arm at $8,865 where there are likely to be buyers.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a surge above the 20-MA would allow the price to run to $9,600 by exploiting the VPVR volume gap created by the swift fall from $9,634 to $8,820 on May 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/218748522bc1288fa44bbdb56811fe49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD 1-month chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On May 22, Cointelegraph contributor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/authors/filbfilb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filbfilb}}}\uc2  warned that Bitcoin price only has one week to make a decisive move that will define whether Bitcoin makes a decisive move that favors bulls or bears. filbfilb posted the above chart and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bulls-have-only-one-objective-before-next-week-starts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explained}}}\uc2  that:\par \par \uc2 The monthly chart of Bitcoin clearly demonstrates that Bitcoin has a long-term challenge to overcome, which is reclaiming the $10K handle. But more specifically, it must record a $9,300 monthly close that has eluded Bitcoin for the last 10 months, which sets the tone for the current price action.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5e80e511a94a1bb197cb8780e4b68079.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin mounted a slow recovery on Friday, many altcoins took advantage of the sideways trading by pulling off strong double-digit rallies.\par \par \uc2 OmiseGo ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/omisego/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 OMG}}}\uc2  ) continued its strong upside move for a second day by gaining 14.92%. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) followed suit by adding 7.27%, and Neo ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/neo/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEO}}}\uc2  ) moved higher with a 7.66% gain.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 , the overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $257.9 billion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 66.1%.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82ODdlYzVkZjUxODQyMDQ0MmU1MjQwZmY0ZjVmNjk0OC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200523eg5n00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 5/22: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,952 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A few major cryptocurrencies are in an uptrend and they could offer buying opportunities in the short-term\par \par \uc2 For some reason, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) analysts never take the middle path. They either project that the price will go to the moon or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-survived-halving-but-death-spiralists-still-say-btc-is-doomed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warn}}}\uc2  of imminent doom. After surviving and thriving for over a decade and being one of the best assets to own during the current crisis, any {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dont-buy-bitcoin-says-wealth-exec-as-lebanon-chooses-btc-over-fiat"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 doubts}}}\uc2  about its longevity should be put to rest.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap to replicate the previous bull run, it would first need to break out to new lifetime highs. There are several intermittent resistances between the current levels and the lifetime highs that need to be crossed first. Barring a miracle, this is likely to take time. The time spent in a bottoming formation will strengthen the base and act as a launchpad for the next bull run.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6012e2ec962c874729bbe90e41cbe22d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-e54br6njk6_1588362562087"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The investors who have purchased for the long-term should not be disturbed with small price swings. However, traders, who aim to profit from the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the crypto sector should be willing to book profits at stiff resistances and buy at strong supports. They should gradually aim to build their portfolio instead of waiting for a home run on every trade.\par \par \uc2 Although cryptocurrencies are volatile, if traded with proper risk management, they offer an attractive opportunity to generate wealth. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the major cryptocurrencies to see if we spot any reliable trade setups.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Repeated failure of the bulls to clear the $10,000 level attracted profit booking from the short-term traders. This dragged Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,145) on May 21 but the bulls defended the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/06975bbf0ebd86d4f7375f533e0e27a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If successful, the buyers will try to clear the hurdle at $10,000. We spot a possible ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakout and close (UTC time) above $10,000. This setup has a target objective of $11,869.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the BTC/USD pair above the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to break the uptrend line. If the pair sustains below the uptrend line, a drop to $8,130.58 is possible.\par \par \uc2 If this support holds, the pair is likely to remain range-bound between $8,130.58-$10,058.52 for a few days. The trend is likely to turn negative if the bears sink the price below $8,130.58.\par \par \uc2 A buying opportunity might open up for the aggressive traders if the price sustains above $9,400. Alternatively, a rebound off $8,130.58 could also open up a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the support line of the ascending channel on May 21. However, the positive sign is that the bulls held the trendline support. This is the second time that the bulls have purchased the drop to the trendline. Hence, this becomes an important support to watch out for on the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/eb9beefc355973b7fc013f9e33f7d214.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to push the price back into the channel. If successful, a rally to the $220-$227.097 range is possible. The aggressive traders can wait for the price to sustain inside the channel before looking for buying opportunities.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2nd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap inside the channel, the bears will make one more attempt to break below the trendline. If successful, a drop to $176.103 is possible.\par \par \uc2 A break below the trendline will signal an end to the uptrend. If $176.103 holds, the ETH/USD pair might remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  turned around from the overhead resistance of $0.20570 and broke below the 50-day simple moving average ($0.199) on May 21. However, the bears could not keep up the selling pressure and drag the price to $0.17372.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d37669399369bd01013fb0fa39fd1a37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3rd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap turned around from $0.1888 on May 21 and the bulls are currently attempting to push the price back above the moving averages. If successful, the bulls will make another attempt to break above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the downtrend line, a rally to $0.23612 is possible. The bulls can wait for the XRP/USD pair to close (UTC time) above the downtrend line before entering long positions. The stop-loss can be kept below $0.1800.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls fail to propel the price above the moving averages, the bears will make another attempt to drag the price to $0.17372. A strong rebound off this support could also offer a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $230-$250 range on May 21 but the bears have not been able to capitalize on the breakdown. This suggests a lack of selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0e7cefccd290772107d196c3f4601115.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $230. If successful, the price might remain stuck between $230-$250 once again.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BCH/USD pair turns down from the moving averages, the bears might make one more attempt to sink the price to $200.\par \par \uc2 Buying opportunities could open up if the pair bounces off $200 or breaks out and sustains above $280.47. Until then, the traders can wait on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating above and below the moving averages for the past few days. This suggests a lack of conviction among the bulls and the bears about the next trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/84ea91cdc0d8912a8d4d466c180930a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both the moving averages are flat and the relative strength index is just below the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 6th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap climbs above the downtrend line, it will be the first sign of strength. Above this level, a move to $227 is possible. The momentum is likely to pick up if the bulls can sustain the price above $227. Hence, this could offer a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below $170 will be a sign that bears have overpowered the bears. Below this level, a drop to $146 is possible.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on May 20 and broke below the moving averages on May 21. If the bears can sink and sustain the price below the critical support of $39, the head and shoulders pattern will complete.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/61794ffc3b16658cd183514ca3d7e16d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to $41.6167 on May 21 and are currently attempting to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap towards the downtrend line. If the bulls can scale the price above the downtrend line, a move to $50.7864 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the LTC/USD pair again turns down from the downtrend line, the bears are likely to make another attempt to sink the price below $39. The pair remains weak until it does not break above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on May 19 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. On May 21, the bears again dragged the price below the downtrend line. This suggests a lack of buyers at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f40b6f624b19dea5d24ce00253190007.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive thing is that the bulls defended the 50-day SMA ($15.86) and are currently attempting to propel the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 8th}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap back above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If successful, a rally to $18.1377 is possible where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense. A breakout of $18.1377 can result in a rally to $21.50.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario would come into play if the BNB/USD pair fails to sustain above the downtrend line. In such a case, the bears will make another attempt to sink the pair below the 50-day SMA. If successful, a deeper correction to $15 and below it to $13.65 is possible.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  looks weak as it has been struggling to move up for the past few days. If the bears can sink and close (UTC time) the price below the critical support of $2.3314, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern will complete. This setup has a target objective of $1.5524.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7baf38bb213b6a7bec39e7d72e99cb7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The H&S pattern will complete only if the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 9th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap breaks below $2.3314.\par \par \uc2 On May 21, the bulls purchased the dip to $2.4059. This suggests that the bulls are attempting to defend the support at $2.3314. If the EOS/USD pair breaks above the moving averages, a rally to $2.8319 and then to $3.1104 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, which suggests a balance between supply and demand. As there is no clear trend, the traders can sit on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside an ascending channel for the past few weeks, which shows that the trend is up. However, since May 10, the bulls have struggled to achieve a strong bounce off the support line of the channel. This suggests that buying dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/63e62e1085c3f3ff28d1638563508423.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to sustain the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line. If successful, a rally to $3.07369 and then to $3.2712 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Traders can attempt to ride this move higher by buying after the price sustains above the downtrend line. If the momentum picks up, a rally to the resistance line of the channel at $3.60 could also materialize.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the XTZ/USD pair fails to sustain above the downtrend line and plummets below $2.55, it could drop to $2.24.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend. The bears attempted to reverse the direction on May 21 but they could not break below the 20-day EMA ($0.051). This suggests that the sentiment is to buy the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/de83ec07ffe945ad18c9d3db8a09f86f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: Tradingview\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 With both moving averages sloping up and RSI in positive territory, the advantage is with the bulls. Therefore, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap is now likely to move up to $0.057555 and then to $0.0619885.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair turns around from the current levels or from $0.057555 and breaks below $0.0504050. Below this level, the decline can extend to the next critical support at $0.0427288.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81YTU3MjMwZjgzNWE5MzQyYjY1MGU1OWY1OWZkMDhkMi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200522eg5m000be\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis 5/20: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, BNB, EOS, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,644 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 May 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Most major cryptocurrencies have turned down from their immediate resistance levels, which suggests a minor correction in the next few days\par \par \uc2 While retail traders fret over whether Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) will break above $10,000 or not, the institutional players silently continue to build positions. On May 19 major \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  management fund Grayscale tweeted that its assets under management had increased over 80% from $2.1 billion to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscales-bitcoin-holdings-pass-3-billion-growing-76-year-on-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $3.8 billion}}}\uc2  over the period of one year.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that institutional money is gradually flowing into cryptocurrencies. The majority of the investment was done in Bitcoin, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap. Usually, institutional investors take a long-term view and are not perturbed by the short-term swings.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b3c57c2fae88b96f3683323dd44365c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-e54br6njk6_1588362562087"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the retail traders should also hold some of their investments as long-term positions and not be in a hurry to close them on every minor dip. However, as crypto markets are volatile, traders can use a portion of their allocation to trade and gradually build their portfolio. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts and attempt to find out the path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $9,953.33 on May 18 and made an inside day candlestick pattern on May 19, which is a sign of indecision among the bulls and the bears. However, the break below $9,460 today has resolved this uncertainty to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d759301e4f78f80182a92f8f11cde970.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day exponential moving average ($9,145). If the bulls purchase the dip to this support, it will indicate strength and could result in a move back to $10,000.\par \par \uc2 Above $10,000, the BTC/USD pair is likely to rally to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle at $10,500.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the pair below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the uptrend line is likely. If this support also cracks, the decline can extend to the 50-day simple moving average (8,044).\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which is a warning sign that the trend might be weakening.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend. Though the up move stalled just below the minor resistance of $220 on May 18, the bulls have not given up much ground. This increases the possibility of a breakout and rally to $227.097.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/80cceb09f81a258b420c1d5fdb43efca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both the moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to 60 levels, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. If the momentum can carry the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2nd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above $227.097, a rally to the resistance line of the channel at $248 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears aggressively defend the $227.097 levels, the ETH/USD pair might correct to the 20-day EMA ($202). Hence, traders can watch the price action at this level and book partial profits on the long positions and trail the rest with a suitable stop-loss.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below the support line of the channel and a downtrend could start on a break below $176.103.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to sustain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance of $0.20570 for the past few days. Seeing this as an opportunity, the bears are currently attempting to sink the price back below the 50-day SMA ($0.198).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8930fa088c7bad075971a0246706928c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3rd-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can dip to $0.19 and below it to $0.17372.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls defend the support at the 50-day SMA, the bulls might make one more attempt to scale above $0.20570 and the downtrend line. If successful, a move to $0.23612 is likely. This could offer a buying opportunity to the aggressive traders.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the tight $230-$250 range on May 18 but could not hold on to the higher levels. This suggests a lack of buyers at higher levels. Currently, the price has dipped back into the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6ec12f6c199d8a8cebe04b6a662a3a0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls defend the support at $230 once again, another attempt to clear the $250 levels is likely. If successful, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-cash/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can rally to $280.47. This can offer a buying opportunity to the short-term trader who wants to pocket in a quick profit.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the BCH/USD pair below $230, a drop to $217.55 and then to $200 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) reached the downtrend line on May 18 but could not scale above it. On May 19, the altcoin made an inside day candlestick pattern, which suggested indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e9231f81796f1024c375cee5f2b9ddd7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls again attempted to push the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin-sv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 6th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap above the downtrend line but failed. That attracted profit booking, which has dragged the price below both moving averages. If the bears can sustain the price below $191, a retest of $170 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BSV/USD pair turns around from the current levels and breaks above the downtrend line, a rally to $227 is likely. A break above $227 could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not propel \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line in the past two days, which suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. This could have resulted in profit booking by the aggressive traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5894c3dd7a79de93cce0a44a3922273c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently attempting to sustain the price below the moving averages. If successful, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can drop to $41.2979 and below it to $39.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the LTC/USD pair turns around from the current levels and breaks above the downtrend line, a rally to $50.7864 will be on the cards. A break above the $50.7864-$52.2803 resistance zone could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on May 19 but the bulls are struggling to hold onto the breakout. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/44f245e2b3a3cdcd6de229ae2664f118.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 8th}}}\uc2  -ranked crypto-asset on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA ($16.36), a drop to the 50-day SMA ($15.71) is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BNB/USD pair turns around from the current levels, a rally to $18.1377 is likely. Above this level, the pair is likely to pick up momentum and climb up to $21.50. Hence, this could offer a buying opportunity to the aggressive traders.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been trading in a tight range for the past few days. Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the 50 level, which suggests a balance between buyers and sellers. However, this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3d42b2a0781b87201e611bc947787083.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/eos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 9th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below $2.50, a drop to $2.3314 is possible. A break below this support will be a huge negative as it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, which has a target objective of $1.5524.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the EOS/USD pair bounces off the current levels and breaks above $2.8319, it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears and this could result in a rally to $3.1104.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls had managed to push Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line today, they could not hold on to the higher levels, which is a negative sign. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/eb92eba9fcfdeaab38b03e69e7fd3e18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ\u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears might attempt to sink the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tezos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10th}}}\uc2  -ranked cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap below the 20-day EMA ($2.63) and the support line of the ascending channel. If successful, a drop to $2.24 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the XTZ/USD pair bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls might make another attempt to carry the price above the downtrend line. If successful, a move to $3.07369 and then to $3.2712 is likely.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 With strong moves in the past two days, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has made it to our list. The bulls broke above the downtrend line on May 18 and followed it up with another strong move on May 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e394deeed086cc17c956e2dbdfdb3435.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. If the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11th-ranked}}}\uc2  cryptocurrency on CoinMarketCap can bounce off the downtrend line, the uptrend is likely to resume. The target objective on the upside is $0.0619885.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair below the 20-day EMA ($0.050), it will signal weakness. Although the trend is up, the RSI has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which warrants caution.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy85Mjk2OTVmMDhhMzYzMTg4YzRhMWJhMmE0MGVmNTg1Yi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200521eg5k00094\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Feb 17: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,681 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) scaled above $10,000 the mood among market participants turned hugely \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Daily talks of the asset making new highs blanketed crypto \uc2 Twitter\uc2  and this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment also rubbed off on altcoins which picked up momentum and rallied sharply in the past few days. As the week approached a close it was clear that the crypto market was looking overheated in the short-term as greed gripped the market participants.\par \par \uc2 Such a situation usually results in a sharp pullback that scares the weak hands away. Led by Bitcoin, the crypto markets have slipped sharply in the past two days. The total crypto market capitalization that had surged to over $308 billion on Feb. 15 dropped to about $274 billion on Feb. 17. This shows profit booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cf0ea1952e397a8186423da2c3d455dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-9f5dpnsqpk_1580932354768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long-term trend in most major cryptocurrencies remains intact. Therefore, we suggest traders view this current fall as a buying opportunity. Nonetheless, we recommend traders wait for the decline to end before jumping in.\par \par \uc2 The long-term Bitcoin bulls are unfazed by the current drop. Celebrated TV host Max Keiser has revised his target on Bitcoin from $100,000 to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-surge-to-400k-max-keiser-quadruples-btc-price-forecast"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $400,000}}}\uc2 . Though we are also \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the long-term, let\u8217\'20\'19s see what does the short-term project?\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain above the overhead resistance at $10,360.89 has attracted profit booking by the short-term traders. Though Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) bounced off the 20-day EMA at $9,700 on Feb. 16, the bulls could not build up on the rebound. This shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f187d69d77ef4d667cb49f348ed5eae5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bears are attempting to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If successful, the BTC/USD pair can drop to the next support at $9,097.15. We anticipate the bulls to defend this support aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has dipped close to the midpoint. This suggests a range-bound action in the near-term.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a drop below the $9,097.15-$8,820 support zone will turn the trend in favor of the bears. For now, the traders can keep the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $8,900.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) turned down from $288.599 on Feb. 15, which was very close to our first {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-feb-14-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 target}}}\uc2  objective of $289.221. The sharp pullback has dragged the price back to the breakout level of $235.70. Though the price rebounded sharply from $235.70 on Feb. 16, the bulls have not been able to build up on the bounce. This shows that sellers are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e85b7d8095207bfeeced15f8838c564a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are again attempting to defend the support at $235.70. If successful, the ETH/USD pair might attempt to resume the up move. However, if the bears sink the price below $235.70, the 20-day EMA at $229 might act as a support.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA will be a negative sign and it can drag the price to the next support at $197.75. The traders can trail the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $220.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  could not sustain above the resistance at $0.34229 on Feb. 15. The failure to do so attracted profit booking that dragged the price below the 20-day EMA, which is a negative sign. If the bears sink the price below $0.26362, the drop can extend to the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/26eeee93be331872957fba86f686610a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the price stays above $0.26362, the bulls will again attempt to carry the price to $0.34229. We anticipate a few days of consolidation between $0.26362 and $0.34229 before the XRP/USD pair starts a trending move. For now, the traders can keep the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $0.26.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) reversed direction from close to the stiff resistance at $500. The sharp correction dragged the price below the ascending channel. This breaks the uptrend that was in force.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/80afc8185e9bfc95794955a4d2492e0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to hold the breakout level at $360. If this support holds, the BCH/USD pair might rise to the 20-day EMA, which might act as a resistance. After the volatile action of the past few days, we anticipate a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 Our view will be negated if the bears sink the price below the support at $360 and the 50-day SMA at $343. If this support cracks the decline can extend to $306.78.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) dipped below the critical support at $337.80 on Feb. 15. This triggered further selling that dragged the price to the 50-day SMA at $243. Currently, the price has bounced off sharply from the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/693ad1da947d37cb4d2208cfeb8b304f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the next level to watch out for is $337.80. We anticipate a range-bound action between $236 and $337.8 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Our view will be invalidated if the BSV/USD pair price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $236. Below this level, the next level to watch out for is $173.66.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Though \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) closed (UTC time) above $80.2731 on Feb. 14, the bulls could not build up on it. This attracted selling, which plunged the price below the 20-day EMA on Feb. 16. Though the price rebounded off the 20-day EMA, the bulls could not carry it above $80.2731.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7e85e8f29b49d3108bdb9c708e486729.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bulls are attempting to defend the support at $66.1486. If successful, the LTC/USD pair might remain range-bound between $66.1486-$80.2731 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 The pair will pick up momentum on a break above $85, whereas a drop below $66.1486 will turn the trend in favor of the bears. We might suggest long positions if the rebound off $66.1486 sustains.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 We had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-feb-14-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xtz-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  the possibility of a pullback in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  as the RSI was in the deeply overbought territory. However, we had expected the price to find support between $4.8719 and the 20-day EMA at $4.58.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/badea91789c31effba505f58c900519b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, the pullback was sharp as it plunged below the support at $4.24. Currently, the bulls are attempting a rebound off $4.\par \par \uc2 If successful, the EOS/USD pair might consolidate between $4 and $4.8719 for a few days. The trend will turn negative on a break below the 50-day SMA at $3.80. We do not find any reliable buy setups at the current levels, hence, we suggest traders remain on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) plummeted below the support at $23.5213 and reached the next support at $21.80 on Feb. 16. Though the price rebounded sharply from $21.80, the bulls could not carry it above $23.5213, which shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/47b21e19a214ada771ae63bb3d800ba4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the BNB/USD pair has again bounced off the support at $21.80. We anticipate the bulls to make another attempt to carry the price above $23.5213. If successful, a move to $27.1905 is likely.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $23.5213, the bears will make another attempt to sink the price below $18.26. For now, the traders can keep the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $21.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) above the overhead resistance at $5.5989 on Feb. 14 and 15. That resulted in profit booking that dragged the price to just below $2.7809234 levels, which corresponds to 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of this leg of the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c9acd1fef442d74632787aec7fddab04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 16, the price bounced sharply from $2.752 levels but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that the sellers are back in action.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bears are attempting to sink the price below $2.7809234. If successful, a drop to the 20-day EMA at $2.59 is possible. This is close to the 50% retracement level of the recent rally, hence, we expect the bulls to defend this level aggressively. We will wait for the XTZ/USD pair to stop falling before suggesting a trade in it.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) turned down sharply on Feb. 15 and plunged below the previous resistance turned support of $0.65229. Selling continued on the next day and it dragged the price to the next support at $0.0560221.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/56ab3b54b794fb4eb21e96872ccadde1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This fall triggered our suggested stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $0.06. Currently the bears are attempting to sink the price below $0.0560221. If successful, the drop can extend to the 50-day SMA at $0.048.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair holds above $0.560221, the bulls will again attempt to carry the price above $0.065229. We will wait for the price to stop falling and suggest a turnaround before proposing a trade in it.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82Y2VjY2UzM2FkZGQzNTg4YmU1YmYxM2Y2NmVjNTlkYy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200217eg2h000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Feb 14: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,882 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Interest in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) has surged significantly after its rally above {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-tweets-reach-2-year-high-as-10k-fuels-google-interest-surge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $10,000}}}\uc2  and if the bulls can sustain the price above this psychological level, it is likely to attract further attention. While it is difficult to pinpoint the exact reason for this resurgence, a host of factors such as the China coronavirus scare, the upcoming Bitcoin halving, discussion of launching a central bank digital currency by various countries, and the increased institutional adoption of cryptocurrency might all be contributing to the rally.\par \par \uc2 An important highlight of the crypto rally in 2020 is that it has been broad-based. Several major {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-cryptocurrencies-making-a-comeback-in-2020-xrp-eth-xtz-ada-neo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins}}}\uc2  have made a sharp comeback, which shows wider participation by investors. Barring a few altcoins, the rise in most major cryptocurrencies has been gradual. Such uptrends usually tend to sustain for a long period. Therefore, when a the trend is firmly established, traders should look to buy on every dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/63877395f5aa23186e45ad26bc2533aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-9f5dpnsqpk_1580932354768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, every up move has its share of shakeouts. In every bull phase, there are periodic sharp corrections that scare the weaker hands and attract the investors with greater conviction. Here too, we expect a few sharp falls that will test the investors' patience. We will try to spot these beforehand to the best of our ability so that traders can position themselves accordingly.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the major cryptocurrencies to see if the uptrend can continue for a few more days or whether a pullback around the corner.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 After failing to sustain above the overhead resistance at $10,360.89, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) has dipped back below it. However, the positive thing is that the bulls have not given up much ground, which shows that the investors expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6a5f412ab259b5903a3cbfde6bf40719.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to the overbought zone, which shows that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The price might dip to the 20-day EMA, which is likely to act as a strong support. A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will increase the possibility of a move above $10,360.89. If successful, the BTC/USD pair might gradually move up to the downtrend line, which is at $11,500.\par \par \uc2 However, it is unlikely to be an easy ride up for the bulls because we anticipate the bears to mount a stiff resistance in the $10,360.89 to $11,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the sentiment will turn negative. A deeper correction will be signaled if the price dips below the recent support at $9,097.15. Therefore, the traders can keep the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $8,900.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) remains in a strong uptrend. It had been trading close to the $265 levels for the past two days. This shows that even after the recent sharp rally, the traders are not booking profits on their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/dcddbd91e72e9acfb3f92c44f646dd24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price consolidates close to the current levels for a few days, the uptrend is likely to resume. The next target objective is $289.221 and above it $318.238. If the momentum remains strong, the rally can even extend to $366.\par \par \uc2 However, we remain cautious in the short-term as the RSI is deep in the overbought territory. If the next dip bounces off the recent breakout level of $235.70, the bulls will attempt to resume the up move.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair dips and sustains below the breakout level of $237.70. The traders can keep the stops on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $210. We shall suggest trailing the stops higher after the price sustains above $289.221.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the overhead resistance at $0.31503 on Feb. 13, which completed the rounding bottom pattern. This setup has a target objective of $0.45538. Currently, the bulls are attempting to defend the overhead resistance at $0.34229.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cae6ab5508b20ee19b53ee42e262aef5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $0.34229, the up move will resume. Above this level, the next target to watch out for is $0.40.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price back below $0.31503, the XRP/USD pair can dip to the 20-day EMA at $0.274. A bounce off this level will increase the possibility of a break above $0.34229.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a deeper correction is likely. For now, the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions can be retained at $0.26. The stops can be trailed higher after the pair sustains above $0.34229.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) is nearing the psychological resistance at $500. We expect the rally to face stiff resistance in the $500-$515 zone. However, if the momentum can push the price above this zone, a move to the resistance line of the ascending channel at $550 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/74f877ab5ef7a04f74a4eb8d397ed49c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The recent up move has pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory, which suggests that the rally is overextended in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 If the BCH/USD pair turns down from the current levels or from the overhead resistance zone, it can dip to the support line of the channel. A breakdown below the channel will turn the tide in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) has pulled back to the breakout level of $337.80. We anticipate the bulls to defend this level aggressively. If the price sharply bounces off $337.80, it will once again attempt to resume the uptrend towards the lifetime highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ff7075ab6be2fab0620ebacb5055541f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the BSV/USD pair below $337.80, a drop to the 20-day EMA at $316 is possible. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will once again attempt to resume the up move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA can drag the price back towards the critical support at $236.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to defend the $80.2731 levels but they have not been able to sink \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) to the next support at the 20-day EMA. This is a positive sign as it shows a lack of sellers at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f5941bdf3edddee4f1ba3896f10a7822.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $85, the LTC/USD pair can move up to its target objective of $96.439.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $80.2731, a drop to the 20-day EMA at $71.68 is possible. A bounce off this support will keep the uptrend intact. However, if this support cracks, a drop to $66.1486 is possible.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been facing resistance near $5.5 levels. However, the bulls have not given up much ground, which shows buying even on minor dips. A break above $5.5 can push the price to the $6-$6.4 zone where we expect the bears to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2e6ac9b4bc81d824edebfbd9043a7904.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the momentum can carry the EOS/USD pair above the overhead resistance zone, the uptrend can extend to $7.60.\par \par \uc2 However, the sharp up move of the past few days has pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory. This points to a possible consolidation or a minor correction in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 The first support to watch on the downside is $4.8719 and below it the 20-day EMA at $4.61. If this support holds, the bulls will again attempt to resume the up move. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below $4.24.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) turned down from $27.1905 on Feb. 13. The bears will now try to drag the price to the support at $23.5213. If the price bounces off this support, the bulls will attempt to resume the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f9596ff8af5ae3a9c4431f3ee6873b73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The first target on the upside is $29 and above it $32. We expect the bears to defend the $32 level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the BNB/USD pair loses ground and dips below the support at $23.5213, it can drop to $21.80. A breakdown below this level will signal a deeper correction. Therefore, the traders can protect their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with stops at $21. The stops can be trailed higher after the price scales above $29.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) dipped to $2.9191 on Feb. 13 after reaching a high of $3.5989 on Feb. 12. However, the pullback was short-lived as the bulls have aggressively purchased the one-day fall. This shows that the bulls are buying on minor dips instead of waiting for a deeper fall.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/81f8bcb5e146e14847af55943bd3e59e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears could not even sink the price to $2.7809234, which corresponds to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of the most recent leg of the rally. This shows that the sentiment is hugely \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push and sustain the XTZ/USD pair above $3.5989, the rally can extend to $4.8 with a minor resistance at $3.86. It is difficult to call a top when an asset is backed by strong momentum. However, when the rally gets vertical, the traders should keep trailing the stops higher because the risk of a deeper pullback increases exponentially.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) remains in a strong up move. However, the deeply overbought reading on the RSI suggests that the rally has run ahead of itself in the short-term. Therefore, a few days of consolidation or a minor correction is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0a4c12ea211d58028b5242f22e19bca7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The previous resistance of $0.065229 will now act as a support on any pullback. If the price bounces off this level, the bulls will try to resume the up move. The target objective on the upside is $0.08 and above it to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears drag the price below $0.065229, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair can drop to the 20-day EMA at $0.0588, which is again likely to act as a strong support. The trend will weaken on a break below $0.0560221. The traders can protect their paper profits on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with a stop loss at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82YWM1NjEzZmYxMzM2N2I3YjVjZGI5NjNmYjIwYTgwOC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200214eg2e000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Regulation\par \b \uc2 OKEx Expands Into India\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Market via Partnership With Local Exchange\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 509 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Despite ongoing uncertainty regarding cryptocurrency \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  in India, major global crypto exchange OKEx has just made another push in the country\u8217\'20\'19s market.\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 14, OKEx partnered with India\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency trading platform, CoinDCX, to launch a new crypto futures product in India.\par \par \uc2 As part of the partnership, OKEx will make a major step into the Indian cryptocurrency market, enabling more liquidity with its extensive expertise in developing world-class futures, CoinDCX said in an announcement shared with Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Specifically, the partnership purportedly unlocks CoinDCX\u8217\'20\'19s new crypto futures product, DCXfutures, that will enable users to trade futures contracts with major cryptocurrencies with up to 15x leverage.\par \par \uc2 According to the firm, the futures contracts will be available for at least eight coins including Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2 , Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/cardano-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ), and Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/tron-trx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2 ). Additionally, users will be able to trade perpetual futures contracts with Bitcoin and Ether, the announcement reads.\par \par \uc2 According to the firm, maker fees will account for 0.2% at the DCXfutures launch, while the service will be initially open for select users on an invitation-only basis. Once available for the general public, users will be able to access DCXfutures from a single wallet from Q2, 2020.\par \par \uc2 India\u8217\'20\'19s potential to drive mass adoption of crypto\par \par \uc2 Zac Zou, head of OKEx India, emphasized the role of India \u8212\'20\'14 the world\u8217\'20\'19s second biggest nation \u8212\'20\'14 as a primary country behind the mass adoption of crypto:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs one of the largest economies in the world, India is primed to be the driving force behind the mass adoption of cryptocurrencies, which is why we are keen on adding more equitable currencies to the ecosystem. We believe having a variety of options to transact digital currencies will bolster the growth of economy in India as it positively impacts both crowdfunding and institutional funding\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sumit Gupta, co-founder and CEO at CoinDCX, outlined the rapidly increasing demand for futures trading in the Indian crypto market. Gupta noted:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith the huge potential of cryptocurrency markets to accelerate economic growth and wealth generation in India, we believe that this collaboration takes India one step closer to joining the \u8216\'20\'185 trillion dollar club\u8217\'20\'19 as one of the fastest growing economies in the world, allowing us to avail of new opportunities and take on new challenges.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contacted both OKEx and CoinDCX for additional comments on the partnership and will update this article if we hear back.\par \par \uc2 News of the new partnership comes on the heels of recent court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-fights-for-freedom-in-indias-supreme-court-critics-cite-risk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hearings}}}\uc2  regarding the existing complicated stance of the \uc2 Reserve Bank of India (RBI) \uc2 toward crypto. During the hearings, the Supreme Court asked the RBI to clarify its position as to why exactly it enforced a nationwide banking ban on the country\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market. Cointelegraph has recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/verdict-in-india-imminent-rbi-cites-warren-buffet-skepticism-as-reason-to-ban-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  on the latest developments in this regard, while CoinDCX\u8217\'20\'19s Gupta {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-call-for-sensible-regulation-the-fate-of-future-innovation-in-india"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 published}}}\uc2  a public call for a \u8220\'20\'1Csensible \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D approach.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9lMTQzNmZhOTMwMjBkY2U5MDgzMzI3NjdiZjdhOTU3Ny5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200214eg2e0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 5 Cryptocurrencies Making a Comeback in 2020: XRP, ETH, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , NEO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Horus Hughes \par \uc2 864 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 On Feb. 12, the crypto market achieved a new milestone by climbing above the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-cap-hits-300-billion-but-bitcoin-dominance-down-6-ytd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $300 billion}}}\uc2  market capitalization mark for the first time in 6-months. This shows interest in the sector continues to grow as a steady flow of funds enter the space. Since the start of 2020, the crypto market cap has increased from $218.4 billion to $303.1 billion, a 65.92% increase.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) dominance rate dropped from 68% to 62%, which has allowed altcoins to pull off some amazing triple-digit rallies over the last 2 months.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a090ec60c90d8847c61ae03ae18c3ac2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-qttxaabn77_1581583163544"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Even now as Bitcoin price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-suddenly-drops-300-in-1-hour-after-10-500-rejection"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 struggles to overcome}}}\uc2  the $10,500 resistance, several altcoins are continuing to rally in their BTC and USD pairs.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s take a look at some of the big performers of the day.\par \par \uc2 XRP\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e00e68e209718ba287e5ff3338b44e07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  price finally broke above the resistance at $0.30 and $0.31 and has since rallied more than 14%. The strong upside move was propelled by the highest surge in volume seen since May 13, 2019, when XRP price rocketed 56.25% as it climbed from $0.30 to $0.47 in one day.\par \par \uc2 XRP has now set a higher high above the previous high at $0.3145 set on Nov. 6 as part of a tweezer top that saw the price sharply reverse to a two-year low at $0.175.\par \par \uc2 Now that the key overhead resistances have been cleared, traders will likely set their short-term targets at $0.38 and $0.41\par \par \uc2 Tezos\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3ad041d3ccbdd2c5b353234639ebcd53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) has been on a tear since Jan. 15 when the altcoin broke from its bottom in the $1.20-$1.30 range and started what has become a 183% parabolic rally to a new all-time high at $3.61.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the XTZ rally has become over-extended after such a rapid move to a new high and at the time of publishing the altcoin has corrected 7.25% and is down 14.79% from its all-time high. As XTZ price bounced right at the 23.6% Fibonacci retracement level ($3.072) and traders will observe to see if the altcoin finds support and consolidates at the current level.\par \par \uc2 It is worth mentioning that parabolic moves tend to forgo establishing strong support levels as the price swiftly surges significantly higher each day. This means that if traders book profits and shift their attention to other cryptos, or if Bitcoin sharply corrects, XTZ could quickly reverse course and retrace the entire up move.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/02653170e22a633af3818fc525d03f63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Since bottoming at 0.00000400 satoshis on Jan. 14, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) has performed excellently. The altcoin is up 71% off its 2019 and 2020 bottom and since crossing above the 200-day moving average on Jan. 12, the altcoin has rallied 37.09%.\par \par \uc2 Traders will notice that above 0.00000682 satoshis there is limited pressure from sellers. This means all that is required is a heavy influx of volume to push the price higher in one massive candlestick.\par \par \uc2 There is also a sizable gap in the volume profile visible range indicator (VPVR). If a high volume breakout occurs, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price could rally 53.47% to 0.000001041 satoshis.\par \par \uc2 Ether\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/45c277d83f259d496c3ea0719837b67c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) continues to show that its price action is hinged to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hip and rallied to a new 2020 high at $275 on Feb. 13. As discussed in a previous analysis, the price easily pushed through the take profit zones at $240 and $260.\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin traders work to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $10,500 and above, Ether price continues to climb and appears set to reach $300 over the coming hours. Traders will note the VPVR gap from $270 to $300. If bulls can push the price above $276 then a shot at $300 is on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Neo\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c7bb241ee6b93b7dd883bb9757f89519.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 NEO USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After forming a double bottom at $7.73 on December 18, 2019, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/neo-neo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEO}}}\uc2  has doubled its price to reach a 2020 high at $15.85. Since Jan. 1, the altcoin has rallied 88.37% and traders will now target $17.44 and $19.60. If NEO pushes above $20, $25 and $40 are on the next zones traders will look to.\par \par \uc2 In the event of a pullback, traders will look for a bounce at the 21.6% Fibonacci retracement ($13.95) and below this $12.93. Generally, the support levels for NEO are closely aligned with the Fibonacci retracement levels so traders could follow the indicator if the altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price corrects.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HorusHughes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8zOTE4MmMzYWUxMWRmYzdjYzgxYzYxNzI5ZGM3MTJjZi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200213eg2d0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Feb 12: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB, XTZ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,738 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization has topped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/charts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $300 billion}}}\uc2  for the first time since early-August of 2019. This shows that the bulls are back in action. Interestingly, it is not only the crypto markets that have been moving up, even the US stock markets have been making new lifetime highs in 2020.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the Dow Jones index is currently close to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/quotes/?symbol=.DJI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 29,500}}}\uc2  points. However, Fundstrat Global Advisors co-founder, Tom Lee, believes that Bitcoin will pip the Dow Jones for the race to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-beat-dow-jones-to-40-000-tom-lee-doubles-down-on-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 40,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Chicago Mercantile Exchange chief economist Bluford Putnam echoed the popular belief that Bitcoin is a non-correlated asset and can be a valuable {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cmes-chief-economist-echoes-pomps-views-on-btc-as-hedge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 addition}}}\uc2  to traditional portfolios. Due to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Putnam suggested a 2% allocation to Bitcoin in the typical hedge-type portfolio, which normally holds 60% stocks and 40% fixed income assets, such as bonds.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ee5d4aa17a17d11d259e1275470488ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-9f5dpnsqpk_1580932354768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains the largest cryptocurrency in focus but throughout this recent rally many {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-eth-has-surged-92-in-2020-with-targets-set-on-300"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins}}}\uc2  that have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tezos-is-the-standout-in-new-2020-alt-season-gaining-54-in-7-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 led}}}\uc2  from the front. This shows that the market participants are diversifying away from Bitcoin and are buying altcoins that have strong potential.\par \par \uc2 Will altcoins continue to lead this rally or will Bitcoin pick up momentum? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) above the overhead resistance at $10,360.89. If successful, a rally to the long-term downtrend line at $11,500 is possible. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in positive territory show that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f1492d7f1c07d6a97f14c9ac7a9e814e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 In Aug. and Sep. of last year, the bulls had failed to push the price above $11,000. Therefore, we expect several hurdles between the current levels and the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls do not give up much ground during corrections, it would increase the possibility of a break above the downtrend line. Above this level, there is a minor resistance at $13,973.50. If this level is scaled, a retest of the lifetime highs is likely.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness would be a break below the 20-day EMA and a possible change in trend would be signaled if the bears sink the BTC/USD pair below $9,097.15. Therefore, the traders can retain the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $8,900. The stops can be trailed higher after the price sustains above $10,360.89.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) has broken above the overhead resistance at $235.70 without much difficulty, which is a huge positive. This shows that the sentiment is strongly in favor of the bulls. The next level to watch out for is $289.221 and above it $318.238.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ab550e291d418076eb09f8b40c4b912b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which shows that bulls are in command. During strong up moves, the RSI can remain in overbought territory for an extended period of time.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, we do not suggest closing a trade just because the RSI is in the overbought zone. Nonetheless, the deeper the RSI rises into the overbought territory, the more vulnerable the asset is to a correction. Therefore, it is prudent to protect the paper profits with a close stop loss.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair turns down from the current levels and sustains below the breakout level of $235.70. Therefore, the traders can trail the stop-loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $210.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 After a few days of consolidation, the bulls have pushed the price above the long-term downtrend line. This is a huge positive as it increases the possibility of a new uptrend in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 . The next level to watch out for is $0.31503.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d05c28fc2a1d5c8eb7d06428c0c29f3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We spot a rounding bottom pattern, which will complete on a breakout and close (UTC time) above $0.31503. This pattern has a target objective of $0.45538. Though there is a minor resistance at $0.34229, we expect it to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the overhead resistance at $0.31503 and plunge below the most recent low of $0.26362. Therefore, the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions can be trailed to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) has resumed its up move. It can now move up to the psychological resistance at $500 and above it to the resistance line of the ascending channel at about $522.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e43475c7fb2b5590e97da18a2838ce3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We anticipate the bears to mount a strong defense in the $500 to $522 range. The deeply overbought reading on the RSI also signals the possibility of a minor correction or a period of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 However, as long as the price remains inside the ascending channel, its uptrend remains intact. The first sign of weakness will be a break below the support line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) has resumed its up move towards the lifetime highs at $458.74. With both moving averages sloping up and RSI close to the overbought zone, the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d5cbfa1d9f483233aaa9434144d7b047.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears will attempt to stall the up move in the $373.653-$411.074 zone, which corresponds to 61.80% and 78.60% Fibonacci retracement level of the recent pullback from the peak of $458.74 to the trough of $236.\par \par \uc2 Any pullback in the BSV/USD pair is likely to find support at $337.80. A breakdown of this support will indicate a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) is close to the overhead resistance at $80.2731. If the bulls can push the price above this resistance, it will be a huge positive. The next level to watch on the upside is $96.439, which is the target objective of the breakout from the rounding bottom pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8201a7bebeda1810c3411882f0d2f852.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought territory, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below the 20-day EMA. Below this level, the next critical support is $66.1486. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the LTC/USDT pair below this support.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has resumed its up move towards the first target objective of $6. This is a huge positive. We anticipate the bears will defend the $6 levels aggressively. The RSI has risen deep into the overbought zone, which also suggests a possible correction or consolidation in the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/95854b805f0c7016f5a70a5839660a99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Any pullback from the overhead resistance level is likely to find support at $4.8719. If the price rebounds off $4.8719, the bulls will attempt to resume the up move. Above $6, the next level to watch out for is $7.60.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below $4.8719, the correction can extend to the next support at $4.24. A break below this level will turn the trend in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) has sustained above $23.5213 for the past three days, which confirms the breakout. It can now move up to the next target objective of $29. Though the trend remains up, the deeply overbought reading on the RSI suggests a possible correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/af25637f78157dc1f62107baa958f490.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Any dip is likely to find support in the $23.5213 to $21.80 zone. If the price bounces off this zone, the bulls will again attempt to carry the price to $29 and above it to $32.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below the support zone. Therefore, traders can keep the stop loss on the entire {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  position at $21.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 The momentum in Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) has carried the price above $3.35, which was the target objective of the breakout from the ascending triangle. Though the trend remains up, the rally following the breakout from the triangle has been vertical. Such rallies are usually not sustainable.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7b65beeb317fe9007100d8c06bf300a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp pace of the rally has pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory, which increases the possibility of a pullback. The pullback can drag the XTZ/USD pair to $2.67141380, which is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of the recent leg of the rally from $1.4576 to $3.4217.\par \par \uc2 We believe that the risk to reward ratio at the current levels is skewed to the downside. Hence, traders should protect their positions with a suitable stop loss and should not get carried away by greed.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $0.065229. If the bulls can sustain the breakout, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) can move up to its first target objective of $0.08 and above it to $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d91f2b33d63d32e2dc9b23b41c495eff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, this leg of the up move has pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory. This suggests that a pullback might be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $0.065229. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair bounces off this support, it is likely to climb up to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below $0.065229, the decline can extend to $0.0560221. A break below this level will turn the trend in favor of the bears. The traders can trail the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9jMTM2MjdmZDRiMzk2MGM4OTgyMDNmNjdmYzdhZTJkNy5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200212eg2c000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Feb 7: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XTZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,683 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The institutional investors have maintained their \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance on Bitcoin. Though the spot price is yet to hit $10,000, CME Bitcoin futures have already {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cme-bitcoin-futures-hit-10k-as-btc-price-finally-nears-five-figures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached}}}\uc2  the five-figure mark. Additionally, the Bitcoin futures {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-targets-10k-as-bitmex-open-interest-soars-to-15b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 open interest}}}\uc2  on BitMEX has topped $1.5 billion. This shows that the institutional traders expect the rally to extend further.\par \par \uc2 Morgan Creek Digital Co-Founder Anthony Pompliano meanwhile has said that his idea of Bitcoin acting as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hedge-argument-growing-stronger-with-time-says-pomp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hedge}}}\uc2  for portfolios due to its non-correlated nature has only solidified over time.\par \par \uc2 He added that Bitcoin moved in the opposite direction to both the S&P 500 index and gold in May 2019 during the trade war. This shows that Bitcoin can add a layer of protection to the portfolio, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/portfolios-with-bitcoin-allocation-outperform-traditional-investments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 no other asset class}}}\uc2  can do.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/83de5c57458e9d150e495a1d60b87caa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-9f5dpnsqpk_1580932354768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Governors of six major central banks will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/major-central-banks-to-discuss-digital-currencies-amid-imf-conference"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 discuss}}}\uc2  joint research on central bank digital currencies when they meet for an \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  conference in April.\par \par \uc2 Japan\u8217\'20\'19s former economy minister Akira Amari wants the \u8220\'20\'1CUnited States to set (digital currency) on the G7 agenda as chair.\u8221\'20\'1D Amari is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japanese-lawmakers-want-us-to-place-digital-currencies-on-g7-agenda"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 concerned}}}\uc2  about the possible struggle for currency supremacy should China launch a digital yuan.\par \par \uc2 Though Bitcoin has risen about 35% year-to-date, its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dominance}}}\uc2  continues to dip, though the total crypto market capitalization is attempting to hit the $300 billion mark. This shows that the \u8220\'20\'1Caltseason\u8221\'20\'1D narrative is still in play.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) has been trading above $9,600 for the past two days, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. There is a psychological resistance at $10,000 but we expect it to be crossed. The next target to watch on the upside is $10,360.89.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ec303f96ce3c1f6afa7e0cfca79edf79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We anticipate the bears to mount a stiff resistance at $10,360.89. Therefore, short-term traders can watch this level closely and book partial profit if the bulls struggle to scale the price above it.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls can push the price above $10,360.89, the BTC/USD pair is likely to move up to the long-term downtrend line at $11,500. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is close to the overbought territory, which suggests that bulls are in command. The traders can trail the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $8,900.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair breaks the series of higher highs and higher lows it has been making since bottoming out in December of last year. The first sign of weakness will be a break below the recent low of $9,097.15.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) picked up momentum after sustaining above $197.75 on Feb. 5. The sharp rally of the past three days carried the price above the overhead resistance at $223.999, which is a positive sign. If the price can sustain above $223.999, a move to $235.70 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6b3a407eb6b7e3ec0f55241218cd3653.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We expect the bears to mount a stiff resistance in the $223.999-$235.70 range. The overbought reading on the RSI also suggests a few days of consolidation or a minor correction. Therefore, the traders can book partial profits in this range and tighten the stops on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $190.\par \par \uc2 We anticipate the bulls to buy the next dip to $197.75. A bounce of this level will increase the possibility of a break above $235.70 but if the level cracks, the ETH/USD pair can dip to the 20-day EMA at $183.72.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  crossed $0.28132 on Feb. 5, which was the minimum target objective of the inverted head and shoulders bottom. The bulls might face some resistance at the long-term downtrend line, which is just above the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7582ed6de4b2947b17beaa139fed499a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI is in the overbought territory, which also suggests a correction might be around the corner. A dip from the current levels is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA at $0.25. A break below the 20-day EMA will signal weakness.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, a rally to $0.31503 and above it to $0.34229 is possible. The traders can trail the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to just below the 20-day EMA at $0.245.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) soared to our first target objective of $440 on Feb. 5. The bears are currently defending this level but if the bulls can push the price and sustain above it, a move to $500 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cb6b6b175516b14c7e7d33f055fdaf3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Though the bulls are in command, the RSI has risen into overbought territory, which suggests a minor consolidation or correction for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Any dip from the current levels is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA at $374. If the price bounces off this support, the bulls will again attempt to resume the up move. A break below $360 will turn the trend in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not been able to sustain Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) above the resistance line of the triangle in the past two days. This shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. The bears will now try to drag the price to the support line of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c595f26dc2ba9b4c219bb2dcaf465423.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The range in the BSV/USD pair has tightened in the past few days. Usually, such price action is followed by a sharp move. However, it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks out to the upside, $337.80 might offer some resistance above which, a retest of the lifetime highs is likely. Conversely, if the price breaks below the triangle, a dip to $236 and below it to $158.852 is possible.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Though \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) broke above the minor resistance at $73.5259, it has not been able to pick up momentum. This shows that the bulls are tiring out and a few days of range-bound action is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/3479b5a5340a44126bc56bc13e85ae7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair might consolidate between $80.2731 and $66.1486 for the next few days. On a close (UTC time) above $80.2731, a move to $96.439 will be on the cards. We might suggest long positions on the next dip to $66.1486.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the critical support at $66.1486, the pair will lose momentum and can extend its decline.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to carry {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  to the overhead resistance at $4.8719. This shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. The altcoin might now dip to the $4.24 to $4.0 support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f0cc96298c007ed842d0489d84cbabae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the support zone, it will indicate aggressive buying by the bulls. This will increase the possibility of a breakout above $4.8719. Above this level, the EOS/USD can rally to $6.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $4, the pair might lose momentum and drop to the next support at $3.3555.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) picked up momentum after breaking out of $19 levels on Feb. 5. The bulls are currently attempting to sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $21.80. If successful, the next level to watch out for is $23.5213.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e4ba174ee90457a44cc0de94835babaf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We expect the bears to defend the $21.80 to $23.5213 zone aggressively. If the bulls struggle to push the price above $23.5213, the traders might book partial profits.\par \par \uc2 However, if the momentum can carry the price above $23.5213, a rally to $27 is possible. The traders can trail the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $18. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the BNB/USD pair reverses direction sharply and breaks below $18.50.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to defend the overhead resistance at $0.065229. They will now try to drag Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) to the support at $0.0560221. If the support holds, the price might remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bfc179410766fb74b6f377052d50ba07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $0.065229, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair can extend its rally to $0.08. Conversely, the pair will lose momentum if the bears sink the price back below the 20-day EMA at $0.0522. The traders can trail the stop-loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $0.054.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) is facing resistance close to the $2.50 mark as suggested in our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-feb-5-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-ada-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis. The RSI has risen into the bought territory, which suggests that a pullback or a consolidation is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0d928cef623c9fd730809123a0717aae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current levels, it is likely to find support at the breakout level of $1.85. A strong rebound off this support will increase the possibility of a breakout of $2.50. Above this level, the rally can extend to $2.90 and above it to $3.35.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bears sink the price below the critical support at $1.85, the XTZ/USD pair will turn negative.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9mN2IyOGUwNGE3MTIwZjRkYWMwMmE0YmIwMGIxMjk1Ny5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200207eg270008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Tezos (XTZ) Outperforms Bitcoin Price With 80% Monthly Gain\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Horus Hughes \par \uc2 628 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Since the start of the year Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) has gained approximately 41% and on Feb. 5 the crypto asset thrilled investors as the price broke through the $9,500 resistance and rallied to set a new yearly high at $9,745.\par \par \uc2 In light of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strong trend reversal from its 2019 bottom at $6,400, there is a growing number of altcoins that have far eclipsed Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent gains. Take, for example, Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/tezos-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) which to date has rallied 205% off its October 2018 low at $0.728.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ac738d96e4dc8461d6ae09c2159c234f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market daily price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-mxsooft0kv_1580963021874"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin rallied 6.14%, XTZ blitzed 15.76% to top a 19-month high at $2.24. Aside from the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market trend that is driving many altcoins to produce double-digit gains, a growing number of crypto exchanges now offer staking rewards for investors who hold XTZ.\par \par \uc2 This week Binance also announced that it had added XTZ/{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  perpetual contracts. The new trading option will allow traders to choose between 1-50x leverage on their XTZ/USDT positions.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s take a look at the charts to see what the future may hold for Tezos.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/fe49c29afc696082922522f857f8565e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After crossing above the $1.15 resistance and the 200-day moving average (DMA) on Nov. 6, 2019, XTZ closed 2018 with a strong multi-month rally which brought the price just $0.02 away from its 2019 high at $1.86. Since forming a local bottom at $1.25 on Jan. 2, XTZ has rallied 80.29%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e85192184ba674b33814763c02030be0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD 6-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 At the time of publishing, the XTZ/USD pair is still strongly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as traders are maintaining purchasing volume and the relative strength index (RSI) continues to push deeper into the overbought region but eventually a pullback must occur.\par \par \uc2 When this occurs traders can simply follow the Fibonacci retracement levels and volume profile visible range (VPVR) as the current structure aligns well with both indicators.\par \par \uc2 XTZ could pull back to the 23.6% Fib retracement at $2.011 and below the $2.011 to $1.912 zone traders could see the price retrace to the 50% Fib retracement at $1.739 where the price history shows stronger support and a high volume node on the VPVR.\par \par \uc2 Below this support traders can look to play the golden pocket bounce between $1.633 and $1.574 (the 61.8% and 65% Fib retracement). In the unlikely event that XTZ retraced the entire rally from $1.231 to $2.246, the 200-DMA will most likely function as strong support.\par \par \uc2 In the meantime, traders are advised to keep an eye on trading volume in the shorter time frames, and also watch to see if the RSI begins to turn down from the overbought zone or if the MACD begins to curl down towards the signal line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4732a462454490f3118436f9caa721ba.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Tezos weekly price chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/tezos-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $272.5 billion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 64.2%. Tezos market cap has risen to $1.56 billion and the altcoin is close to flipping its positioning with Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-breaks-6-month-slump-signaling-potential-altcoin-revival"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) to rank among the top-10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 A handful of altcoins also rallied alongside Bitcoin. A few top performers were NEM ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/nem-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XEM}}}\uc2 ) with a 28% gain, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) which gained 14.34% and Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) at 12.04%. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) also continued to rally, adding 7.89% as the price rose to $205.27.\par \par \uc2 Keep track of top crypto markets in real time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy82OTc0ZTBkNTY0NDZhNDdkY2Y2ZmNmNzFiMTY4ZDA0Ny5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200206eg2600001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Feb 5: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XTZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,587 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin has rallied about 33% year-to-date, its dominance has dipped to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 64.40%}}}\uc2 , its lowest level since July 2019. This shows that altcoins have continued to outperform Bitcoin. However, with the Bitcoin halving fast approaching, the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to pick up.\par \par \uc2 Tom Lee, co-founder at Fundstrat Global Advisors, has again turned ultra \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin and expects a rally to about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-may-hit-27k-all-time-high-by-summer-predicts-tom-lee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 200%}}}\uc2  in the next six months. According to him, historically, whenever Bitcoin has broken above its 200-day moving average, it has recorded an average six month gain of 197%. Lee expects halving to act as a catalyst for the expected up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/14b6f8bc83e4082ac237f952ab2f7d0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-9f5dpnsqpk_1580932354768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While we agree that anything can happen in the crypto markets, we believe that Bitcoin will have to scale several stiff resistances before it reaches its lifetime highs. Until it breaks above the lifetime highs and goes into unchartered territory, it will not show the kind of momentum it did in 2017.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, traders should be cautious and should take informed decisions without getting carried away by lofty targets. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to locate the critical levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) dipped below the support of the tight $9,200 to $9,600 range on Feb. 4. However, the bears could not build up on the breakdown. This shows that bulls continue to buy the dips. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in positive territory suggest that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/35a721c12cbecbd904e4beb76ed90644.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Today, the buyers have carried the price close to the top of the range and then set a new 2020 high at $9,744. The breakout of this tight range is a positive sign and it suggests the BTC/USD pair can rally to $10,360.89, which is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 The short-term trend will weaken if the bears sink the pair below the 20-day EMA at $8,982. Below this level, a drop to $8247.60 is possible. For now, we suggest traders retain the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $8,200. If the price sustains above $9,600, the stops can be trailed higher to $8,900.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) is looking strong. The bulls purchased the minor dip on Feb. 4 and have today pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $197.75. If the bulls can sustain the price above this level, the altcoin is likely to pick up momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/567786e57887bbb894e8d7e51a1cc0be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Above $197.75, the rally can extend to the next resistance at $223.999 and above it to $235.70. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls are firmly in command. The traders can trail the stops on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $180.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to sustain the price above $197.75, the ETH/USD pair will lose momentum. The pair will turn negative on a break below the strong support at $173.841.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has picked up momentum since bouncing off the 20-day EMA on Feb. 2. This shows that as price moves higher, the bears are throwing in their towel. The upsloping 20-day EMA and RSI in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1c7f66afff43e00797cbdb3cf12b15bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The next target to watch on the upside is $0.28132, which is the target objective of the inverted head and shoulders pattern. If the bulls can sustain above this level, a rally to $0.31503 will be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the XRP/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below $0.2326. The traders can trail the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) has broken out of the overhead resistance at $403.88 with a sharp rally today. This shows that the bulls have asserted their supremacy. There is a minor resistance at $440 above which, the up move can extend to $500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/864b177fe18e210439fb3b931d6f7d29.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The current breakout has negated the developing negative divergence on the RSI, which is another positive.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the higher levels, the BCH/USD pair might again dip to the recent support at $360. A break below this support will turn the trend in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) has bounced off the support line of the symmetrical triangle. This shows that the bulls are defending this level aggressively. They will now attempt to carry the price above the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c67766b25584e89d4111ee1b9898b2c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If successful, a move to $337.80 will be on the cards. Above this level, a retest of the lifetime highs at $458.70 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the BSV/USD pair turns down from the current levels and plunges below the triangle, a drop to $236 is possible. We expect the buyers to defend this support aggressively.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) bounced off the breakout level of $66.1486 on Feb. 4, which is a positive sign. It shows that the bulls are defending this level aggressively. If the price can sustain above the minor resistance at $73.5259, a rally to $80.2731 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f181f2a69f49e39be9b527d97f89e59d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We anticipate the bears to defend the resistance at $80.2731 aggressively. However, if the momentum can carry the price above $80.2731, the LTC/USD pair can rally to $96.439.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price reverses direction from the current levels and slides below the strong support of $66.1486.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The tight $4 to $4.40 range in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has resolved to the upside. This shows that the bulls have overpowered the bears and the uptrend has resumed. The next level to watch on the upside is $4.8719.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f83b30b5cc08d1ad90663e4a8b2ca684.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 We expect the bears to defend the overhead resistance at $4.8719 aggressively. However, if the momentum carries the EOS/USD pair above this level, a move to $6 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The only \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup on the chart is the negative divergence on the RSI. If the price turns down from the current levels or from the overhead resistance and plunges below $4, it will turn the tide in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $19. If successful, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) can rally to $21.80. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9990c941978354789f42b5a498fcbeaf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the price fails to sustain above $19, it will signal a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USD pair will weaken below the 20-day EMA at $17.7 and the trend will turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a break below $16.50. Therefore, traders can retain the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $15.90. The stops can be trailed higher after the pair sustains above $19.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) is attempting to resume the uptrend. If the price sustains above $0.586027, a move to $0.065229 is likely. With both moving averages sloping up and the RSI in overbought territory, the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/92fda6468a9696ec596dc864094b2492.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend the overhead resistance at $0.065229 aggressively. However, if the bulls can propel the price above this level, a rally to $0.08 will be on the cards. For now, the traders can retain the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at breakeven.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair reverses direction and plummets below $0.052. Such a move will indicate a lack of buyers at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) pulled back to the breakout level on Feb. 4, which was a buying opportunity for the traders, as suggested in our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-feb-3-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-ada-xtz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis. The altcoin has resumed its up move with a sharp rally today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/018a8f0a4659356e94539004b482acb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The XTZ/USD pair can now move up to its target objective of $3.35. However, it is unlikely to be a straight dash to the target. The pair might face resistance at $2.5 and above that at $2.90.\par \par \uc2 Although the deeply overbought reading on the RSI indicates strong momentum, it also suggests that the rally has been too sharp in the short-term and a pullback or consolidation is possible. A break below $1.85 will invalidate our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9iMmZjNTYzM2NlODRlNzdlZTk3YTU5MDNiOWY0MmQxZS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200205eg25000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Feb 3: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XTZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,759 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The recovery in cryptocurrency prices has ignited interest among institutional investors. In 2019, dedicated crypto funds {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/e4369c82-4369-11ea-abea-0c7a29cd66fe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 returned}}}\uc2  more than 16% according to Eurekahedge while traditional hedge fund strategies returned 10.4% according to \uc2 Hedge Fund Research, Inc\uc2 . Several hedge funds and large trading firms use speed to their advantage by benefitting from pricing inefficiencies.\par \par \uc2 Others profit from the spreads between bids and offers. While such entrants will improve the liquidity and provide depth to the markets, the crypto space will benefit more from investors who are in it for the long-term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c509b57c009b9492a42ad7e8d5efe22d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-xhk9u07a0u_1575665276647"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin futures open interest has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-futures-volatility-coming-as-bitmex-hits-1b-open-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surged}}}\uc2  to over $1 billion on both Bitmex and OKEx. It is not only Bitcoin futures that are attracting traders, but even Bitcoin futures options turnover has also surged 70% month-on-month, according to Deribit.\par \par \uc2 Increasing open interest with a rise in price is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as it shows accumulation. However, as open interest increases, the market also becomes vulnerable to long liquidation if the price turns down sharply. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out whether they indicate a move higher or a correction from the current levels.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) has been trading inside the $9,200 to $9,600 range for the past few days. This shows that the bulls and the bears are playing it safe and are avoiding large directional bets.\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the range, a drop to the 20-day EMA at $8,897 is possible. We expect the bulls to defend the 20-day EMA aggressively. A bounce off this support will indicate demand on dips and will increase the possibility of a rally above $9,600.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/003fae231436f50ea970ca4cc4674d36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 With both moving averages sloping up and the RSI in the positive zone, the advantage is with the bulls. If the buyers can push the price above $9,600 and sustain it, a move to $10,360.89 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, if the bears sink the BTC/USD pair below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the 50-day SMA at $8,058 is likely. For now, the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions can be kept at $8,200. The short-term traders can book partial profits if the price sustains below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) bounced off the support at $173.841 on Jan. 31 and reached close to the overhead resistance at $197.75 on Feb. 3. We expect the bears to defend the resistance at $197.75 aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/0ea6800e3eeecef5189b3dbb9501838a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls do not give up much ground from the current levels, it will increase the possibility of a breakout of $197.75. With both moving averages sloping up and the RSI close to the overbought zone, the advantage is clearly with the bulls. On a break above $197.75, the next target to watch out for is $223.999.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the ETH/USD pair turns down from the current levels and dips below the 20-day EMA at $171.46. The traders can book partial profits on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at current levels and trail the stops on the rest to $170.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 After staying above $0.2326 for two days, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  bounced off sharply on Feb. 2 and broke above the immediate resistance at $0.25401. The inverted head and shoulders pattern has a target objective of $0.28132.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/44394ac0ee15cd3ea2aac0fde9a2e1a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand. If the buyers can push the price above $0.28132, a move to $0.31503 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the XRP/USD pair turns down from the current levels and breaks below the neckline. Therefore, the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-15-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-trx-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions can be kept at $0.21.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) has been consolidating between $360 and $400 for the past few days. A consolidation near the overhead resistance is a positive sign as it shows that the buyers are in no hurry to close their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7c0aab69c3dd7319ad8d6a113fcc9f3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the overhead resistance at $403.88, the BCH/USD pair will resume its up move. The next target to watch on the upside is $440 and above it $480. The upsloping moving averages show that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 However, the developing negative divergence on the RSI warrants caution. If the bears sink the price below the support at $360 and the 20-day EMA at $347, the pair will turn negative and can plummet to $306.78.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) has been bouncing off the support line of the symmetrical triangle for the past three days. However, the bulls have not been able to build upon the rebound, which suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/e7bec6afb5c2e3c6314f3d607a65ad9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BSV/USD pair fails to bounce sharply within the next couple of days, the bears will try to break below the triangle. If successful, a drop to $236 is possible. If this support also cracks, the decline can extend to $159.52.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can carry the price above the triangle and the overhead resistance at $337.80, the pair will attempt to retest the lifetime highs at $458.74.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) has been trading above the breakout level of $66.1486 for the past three days, which is a positive sign. However, the price has failed to pick up momentum and move up to the next overhead resistance at $80.2731.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b5f896332e5517c23b8ee52fe25ff113.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 This shows that the bulls are tiring. The RSI in the overbought zone suggests that the near-term rally has been overdone and a pullback is possible.\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair breaks below $66.1486, a drop to the 20-day EMA at $60.7 is possible. We expect the bulls to defend this support aggressively. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will once again attempt to push the price above $80.2731. If successful, the rally can extend to $96.439.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair dips below the 20-day EMA. In such a case, the decline can extend to the next support at $50.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  has been trading close to $4.24 for the past few days. This is a positive sign as it shows that the traders are not booking profits at these levels. With both moving averages sloping up, the advantage is with the bulls. If the buyers can push the price above $4.4, a rally to $4.8719 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d6543f3ef611181b72a7f889d55c02ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls fail to scale above $4.4, the EOS/USD pair is likely to dip to the 20-day EMA at $3.82, which should act as strong support.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will once again attempt to carry the price to $4.8719. However, if the bears sink the pair below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $3.3555 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) has been hovering around the overhead resistance at $18.50 for the past few days. This shows indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next likely direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/d47f53c90b2694fd6e683840b9d24fd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to push the price above $19 within the next few days, a dip to the 20-day EMA is likely. We expect the price to bounce off this support. If successful, the bulls will again attempt to carry the price to the next overhead resistance at $21.80.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the next support at $16.50 is possible. The traders can keep the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $15.90.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to propel Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) to the next overhead resistance at $0.065229. However, they have not been able to sustain the price above $0.0560221. This shows that buying dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/4dae7310536ece3f213719cf3077c473.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 When the price fails to move up, it leads to profit-booking by short-term traders. This can drag the price down to the immediate support. In this case, the failure to move up can sink the price to the 20-day EMA at $0.0488. If the bulls defend this level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair will again attempt to move up to $0.065229.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA. Therefore, traders can keep the stop loss on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at breakeven.\par \par \uc2 XTZ/USD\par \par \uc2 Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/tezos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2 ) has soared today that has propelled it to the top 10 list. The altcoin broke out of the stiff overhead resistance at $1.85 on Feb. 2, which completed an ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $3.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/46bb84f3c9cbf772ea446df205402132.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XTZ USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XTZUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI has jumped deep into the overbought territory, which suggests that the rally has run up ahead of itself in the short-term. Therefore, a pullback to the breakout level of $1.85 is possible. Such a dip would offer a buying opportunity to the traders.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the XTZ/USD pair continues to move higher, it can reach $2.475, which might act as a resistance. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down and sustains below the breakout level of $1.85.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy85MWY0MjgzNGZmNmI0YjY1MGVjOTlkYzhiYzVjNjgxMi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200203eg230005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoin\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Cryptos This Week (Feb 2): ETC, LTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MIOTA, ZEC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,360 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Several major altcoins have outperformed Bitcoin in January 2020. However, with the reward halving just over three months away, Bitcoin might play catch up. During the previous two halvings, Bitcoin rallied just before and after the event. Weiss Ratings believes that history will repeat itself in the upcoming halving and the only question is how {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/12-to-12k-the-100-000-bitcoin-halving-is-just-100-days-away"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 high}}}\uc2  can the rally extend.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s current technical set up has a variety of social media personalities feeling \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s future price action. In a recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=70Dc2SBmEH8&feature=youtu.be"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market discussion}}}\uc2  with Cointelegraph, popular YouTubers The Moon (Carl Runefelt) and DataDash (Nicholas Merten) said that Bitcoin has already entered a bull market when viewed from a longer-term time frame. However, Merten said that a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-100k-bullrun-is-here-say-crypto-youtubers-as-price-eyes-10k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 parabolic}}}\uc2  move is unlikely to start until Bitcoin rises above $20,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6a7c4fa503212c5d27687b00d49855ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data weekly view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/?period=7d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 LVC Corporation, the crypto subsidiary of Line, plans to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/messaging-giant-line-to-launch-link-token-trading-for-japan-in-april"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch}}}\uc2  trading of its LINK digital currency in Japan from April of this year. Although LINK started trading on Line\u8217\'20\'19s international BITBOX cryptocurrency exchange in mid-October 2018, LVC had to wait for the Japan launch due to the strict national cryptocurrency regulations in the country.\par \par \uc2 In other news, \uc2 Twitter\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/twitter-adds-bitcoin-emoji-jack-dorsey-suggests-unicode-does-the-same"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  the Bitcoin emoji, which will show up if the user writes Bitcoin or the BTC hashtag. This new addition was the result of Twitter co-founder and CEO \uc2 Jack Dorsey\uc2  suggesting that Unicode, the consortium managing the character standard, include the symbol in its text encoding standard.\par \par \uc2 So far the top crypto performers of this week have all risen more than 25%, which shows that they are backed by momentum but for long can bulls keep it up? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to see what next week has in store for investors.\par \par \uc2 ETC/USD\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ethereum-classic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2 ) is the top performer with a stellar run of about 32% in the past seven days. The network {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/eth_classic/status/1223807249690374144"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hashrate}}}\uc2  of ETC hit a new lifetime high recently and has been able to sustain it, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/c7d391d85f3f261ae6aeb19c245e55c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls struggled to push the price above the overhead resistance at $10 for the past two weeks. However, the positive thing was that they did not give up much ground, which showed that the bulls were confident of a further rise.\par \par \uc2 This week, the ETC/USD pair resumed its rally and broke above $10. The sharp up move carried the price to an intra-week high of $12.87278, which is just below the overhead resistance at $14.\par \par \uc2 The break above $10 has a target objective of $16.60. Though there is a minor resistance at $14, we expect it to be crossed. If the momentum is strong, the rally can extend to $19. However, as RSI is in the overbought zone, the pair might consolidate or enter a minor correction before breaking above $14.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price back below the support at $10. Such a move will indicate a lack of buyers at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) has seen a sharp rally of about 31% in the past seven days. This move culminated a strong month for the altcoin where it surged about 65% from the lows. This rally has stoked interest among the market participants because, in 2019, LTC had risen about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-price-gains-22-as-chart-cup-and-handle-targets-100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 350%}}}\uc2  from January to June.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7c7445b1fcc55017a642e1d732d6a810.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD pair will complete a rounding bottom formation if it closes (UTC time) above $66.1486 on the weekly candlestick. This pattern has a target objective of $96.439.\par \par \uc2 However, it is unlikely to be a straight dash towards the target level. The bears are likely to defend the zone between the 50-week SMA at $73 and $80.2731. If the price turns down from this resistance zone, a retest of the breakout level at $66.1486 is possible.\par \par \uc2 If the retest is successful, it might offer a low-risk buying opportunity to the traders. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink and sustain the price below $66.2486. Such a move will indicate that the current breakout is a bull trap.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ), with a rally of about 31% is the third-best performer. During the week Cardano co-founder and CEO of IOHK Charles Hoskinson {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=74UdVaxyMec&feature=youtu.be&t=305"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  a partnership with PriceWaterhouseCoopers (PwC) to build a new commercial strategy. This news was cheered by the market participants and the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged.\par \par \uc2 In an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/charles-hoskinson-cardano-will-become-the-most-decentralized-cryptocurrency-in-the-world"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with Cointelegraph, Hoskinson claimed that once all the upgrades of the protocol are implemented, Cardano would become the most decentralized cryptocurrency in the world.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7fd1307bbd157040cea9f32171758e64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp up move this week carried the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair above the overhead resistance level at $0.0461161 and $0.0560221. There is a minor resistance at $0.065229 above which, the rally is likely to pick up steam and move towards its medium-term target zone of $0.10 to $0.10652.\par \par \uc2 The pair has closed in the green for the past five weeks. This shows that bulls are in command. However, the sharp rise in the short-term indicates that the price might have run up too far too soon. Therefore, we anticipate the pair to face stiff resistance in the $0.0560221 to $0.065229 zone.\par \par \uc2 The price might dip to the breakout level of $0.0461161, which might offer a low-risk buying opportunity. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price breaks down and sustains below $0.0461161. However, we give this a low probability of occurring.\par \par \uc2 MIOTA/USD\par \par \uc2 IOTA ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/iota"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MIOTA}}}\uc2 ) rallied by about 29% in the past seven days to take up the fourth spot among top performers. Bittrex Global added {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/iotatoken/status/1222554554383945728"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 support}}}\uc2  to the IOTA token this week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b4ca1046dd1a6f8f333629b3babe7930.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 MIOTA USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/IOTAUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The rally this week has pushed the IOTA/USD pair above the 50-week SMA at $0.288. There is a minor resistance at $0.334574 above which, the rally can extend to $0.385033. We anticipate the bears to aggressively defend this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.385033, the pair might remain range-bound for a few weeks. However, if the momentum carries the price above $0.385033, the next level to watch out for is $0.541.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and plummets below $0.244553. However, we give this a low probability of occurring.\par \par \uc2 ZEC/USD\par \par \uc2 Zcash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/zcash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZEC}}}\uc2 ) rallied roughly 26% this week to make the list in fifth place. The Zcash community has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/zcash-community-approves-new-mining-reward-distribution-scheme"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved}}}\uc2  Zcash mining reward changes that will take effect in November of this year during the coin\u8217\'20\'19s halving.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/2706cc5aa900e172b3f913f0432a677e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ZEC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ZECUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The ZEC/USD pair has been rising for the past four weeks. Though bears attempted to stall the relief rally at the 50-week SMA, the momentum this week has pushed the price above it.\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $66.1326. If the bulls can sustain above it, we do not find any significant resistance until the pair reaches the $125.3636 to 139.66 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $66.1326, the pair might again dip to $45.67, which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price bounces off this support, the bulls will attempt to resume the up move. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below $45.67.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 The market data is provided by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9iYmQ0ODQzZmI2NTkyYmRmYzVhNDJjZTVhMTk4M2RjYS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200202eg220005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Jan 31: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , ETC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,723 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Morgan Creek Capital CEO Mark Yusko believes that Bitcoin should be a part of every investment portfolio. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1-bitcoin-no-longer-crazy-for-portfolios-says-morgan-creek-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 performance}}}\uc2  analysis of the past five years shows that even portfolios that only held 1% of their total investments in Bitcoin managed to outperform their competitors. Bitcoin offers a ten-to-one downside capture, which makes it one of the most asymmetric assets that Yusko has ever seen.\par \par \uc2 The growing popularity of crypto derivatives indicates institutional players are gradually entering the space. The Chicago Mercantile Exchange group Managing Director and Global Head of Equity Index Alternative Investment Products, Tim McCourt, said: \u8220\'20\'1CCME Bitcoin futures have surpassed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cme-bitcoin-futures-hit-100b-in-volume-since-2017-director-mccourt-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100 billion}}}\uc2  in total notional value traded since their launch in December 2017.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ebeabf8609ed302c4501ba5be90e9f1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-xhk9u07a0u_1575665276647"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bank of Japan deputy governor Masayoshi Amamiya said in a seminar that the central bank should be ready to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bank-of-japan-must-be-ready-to-issue-digital-currency-says-exec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issue}}}\uc2  a central bank digital currency if the public demand for it increases. This shows that several major economies are exploring the possibility of launching a CBDC.\par \par \uc2 As January comes to an end, multiple cryptocurrencies have risen sharply but can the bulls sustain the momentum? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) has turned down from the minor resistance at $9,600. However, with the 20-day EMA sloping up and the RSI in positive zone, the advantage is with the bulls. We anticipate the bulls to defend the dip to the 20-day EMA at $8,736, which is just below the 200-day SMA at $8,881.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/601f0deb4123940bf3103c36b8449df9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead resistance at $9,600. If successful, the BTC/USD pair is likely to move up to $10,360.89.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair will weaken and can plummet to $8,240.67. The pair will turn negative if the price drops below the critical support at $7,856.76. The traders can trail the stops on their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $8,200, which can be tightened further if the price dips below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) surged above the $173.841 to $180 resistance zone on Jan. 30 but the bulls have not been able to build on the strong up move. The price has reversed direction from $186.969.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8ca547a872219609a37c89011c609c68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a strong support at $173.841, which is just below the 200-day SMA at $175. If this support breaks, we expect the bulls to defend the 20-day EMA at $166. If the price bounces off either of these support levels, the bulls will make another attempt to move up to $197.75.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the next support to watch out for is the $157.50 to $150 zone. A break below this zone will be a huge negative. The traders can trail the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $160.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to sustain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above $0.2326. This is a negative sign as it shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. There are several supports between $0.2326 and the neckline of the inverted head and shoulders pattern. We anticipate the bulls to defend this support zone aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1f53f27feb9653e28156b891d5a79ef9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will make another attempt to scale above the resistance at $0.25401. If successful, a move to $0.31503 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the XRP/USD pair breaks below the neckline, a drop to $0.20041 is possible. As the pair is struggling to move up, we suggest traders reduce their risk by trailing the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-15-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-trx-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) came very close to the overhead resistance at $403.88 on Jan. 30. However, the bulls have not been able to scale above this level and the price has once again turned down from it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7d42dd6f38a3b493facefca61d4bac6a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a strong support at $360 but if the bears sink the price below this support, a drop to the 20-day EMA at $335 is likely. We expect the bulls to defend the 20-day EMA aggressively. If the price rebounds off $360 or the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a breakout of $403.88.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $306.78 is possible. If this support holds, the BCH/USD pair might consolidate for a few days. The pair will turn negative on a break below $296.13. The developing negative divergence on the RSI warrants caution.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) is currently at the support line of the symmetrical triangle. If the bears sink and sustain the price below the triangle, it will be a huge negative. This pattern has a target objective of $159.52 on the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/433c6ea154a8e37788a64f2e5eb253d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, we anticipate the bulls to attempt to stall the decline at $236. If successful, the BSV/USD pair will continue to consolidate between $337.8 and $236 for a few more days. The pair will turn positive above $337.80.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) broke above the overhead resistance at $66.1486 on Jan. 30, which completed a cup and handle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $96.439. The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, which suggests that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/8ef84e904a2021c0de068aa69faeae0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, the bears are attempting to sink the price back below $66.1486. If successful, the price can dip to the 200-day SMA at $61.73 and below it to the 20-day EMA at $57.50. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will once again attempt to push the LTC/USD pair above $70.50.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $50 is possible. If the price sustains below $66.1486, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. Therefore, we will wait and watch for a couple of days before suggesting a trade in it.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  broke above the overhead resistance of $4.24 on Jan. 30, which was a huge positive. However, the bulls could not sustain the breakout and the price has again dipped back below $4.24. This suggests profit booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6cb87af536f29eb91102db8ef92b59ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The EOS/USD pair can now dip to the 20-day EMA at $3.68, which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will once again attempt to propel the pair above $4.24.\par \par \uc2 However, we spot a developing negative divergence on the RSI, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to the 200-day SMA at $3.3 is possible.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) above the overhead resistance at $18.50 on Jan. 30 and 31 but they have not been able to hold on to the breakout. This shows a lack of buyers at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/87cf70db26e8e599324351fe92a82900.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $18.50, the BNB/USD pair will remain range-bound for a few more days. The pair will turn negative on a break below $16.50.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA and breaks out of $18.50, a move to the 200-day SMA at $18.79 and above it to $21.8 is possible. For now, the stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions can be retained at $15.90.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to scale above the overhead resistance at $0.0560221. This shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) can now dip to the next support at $0.0461161. The 20-day EMA is also placed close to this level, hence, we expect the bulls to defend it aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/75c0e950e9057d04227cbf19dac873ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $0.0461161, the bulls will again attempt to push the price above $0.0560221. If successful, a rally to $0.0652290 is likely.\par \par \uc2 As the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair has not been able to break above $0.0560221, partial profits can be booked at the current levels, if not done already, as suggested in our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-29-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-etc-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis. The stops on the remaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions can be kept at breakeven.\par \par \uc2 ETC/USD\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ethereum-classic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2 ) has turned down from $12.87278. The altcoin can now retest the breakout level of $10, as suggested in our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-29-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-etc-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous}}}\uc2  analysis. If the price bounces off $10, it might offer a low-risk buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/935f0002df335d0947d706045025ae1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the retest of $10 fails to hold, the pullback can extend to the 20-day EMA at $9.15. We expect the bulls to defend the 20-day EMA aggressively. A bounce off this level or from $10 will increase the possibility of a move to $14.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $7.7853 is possible. The developing negative divergence on the RSI is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. Hence, traders should wait for the uptrend to resume before initiating long positions once again.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy9iM2EyOTI4MGViMGIxZjJjZmQzZWRjZTJlNGI0MmNlZS5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020200131eg1v000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price Analysis Jan 29: BTC, ETH, XRP, BCH, BSV, LTC, EOS, BNB, ETC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,630 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 January 2020\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2020. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Japanese consulting firm Nomura Research Institute, which is an affiliate of financial services giant \uc2 Nomura Holdings\uc2 , has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/largest-japanese-consulting-firm-to-launch-new-cryptocurrency-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched}}}\uc2  a tradable cryptocurrency index in partnership with cryptocurrency investment solution provider Intelligence Unit. The index, which is meant for financial institutions, will track a basket of cryptocurrencies and can be traded in US dollars and yen.\par \par \uc2 Though several financial companies have launched services for institutional investors, the inflow of money into the crypto space has been slow. Bitcoin options {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-month-after-launch-bakkt-bitcoin-options-volumes-are-lackluster"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading}}}\uc2  on Intercontinental Exchange\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  platform Bakkt has been lackluster with nil volume reported for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f0b70085cf232628b12683c695cb8a1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/sharing/0-xhk9u07a0u_1575665276647"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 German investment bank \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2 , in a series of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/deutsche-bank-cryptocurrencies-wont-replace-cash-anytime-soon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2  on \u8220\'20\'1CThe Future of Payments\u8221\'20\'1D has said that \u8220\'20\'1Ca real digital payment revolution has been underway for the past ten years. Cash is losing ground as a payment method.\u8221\'20\'1D The report also said that \u8220\'20\'1Cnon-sovereign cryptocurrencies pose a threat to political and financial stability.\u8221\'20\'1D However, \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2  forecasts that cash is unlikely to vanish in the near future.\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets are gradually picking up steam, which is a positive sign. Can the rally forge ahead or will it succumb to profit-booking? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2 ) convincingly broke above the 200-day SMA at $8,893 on Jan. 28, which is a positive sign. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI closing in on the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cfe5c9df454795efc60862c7be1d809a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls might face minor resistance at $9,600 above which, the rally can extend to $10,360.89. Above this level, the next level to watch out for is the long-term downtrend line, which is close to $11,700.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the 200-day SMA, the BTC/USD pair might dip back to the 20-day EMA, which is likely to act as strong support. A break below $7,856.76 will be a huge negative. Therefore, stops on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-8-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xmr-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions can be kept at $7,600.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2 ) above the $173.841 to $180 resistance zone. If successful, the next stop is likely to be $197.75. Therefore, traders can retain the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $150.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/898488aed73c8009741becaf8f84a6d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 The price had previously reversed direction from $197.75 on two occasions (marked via ellipse on the chart). Hence, we anticipate this level to act as a stiff resistance once again. The traders can book partial profits at $195 and trail the stops on the remaining position to about $170.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bulls fail to scale and sustain the price above the overhead resistance zone, the ETH/USD pair might dip back into the $173.841 to $157.50 range.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  scaled above the overhead resistance at $0.2326 on Jan. 28. The price can now move up to the minor resistance at $0.25401. We anticipate the bears to defend the zone between $0.25401 and the 200-day SMA at $0.258\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6830cbfa86de1f46854009925627c0dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this zone, it might again dip to $0.2326. However, if the bulls push the price above the resistance zone, a rally to $0.34229 will be on the cards. The 20-day EMA has started to turn up once again and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USD pair will turn negative on a break below $0.20041. Therefore, traders can protect their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-15-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-trx-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions with stops at $0.1995\par \par \uc2 BCH/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2 ) is facing profit booking close to the overhead resistance at $403.88. This shows that bears are aggressively defending this level. If the price turns down from this level, it might trade in a large range of $306.78 to $403.88.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/963d568b37d2dfed9341fd979c461c55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, with the 20-day EMA sloping up and the RSI close to the overbought zone, the advantage is clearly with the bulls. If the buyers can push the price above $403.88, the BCH/USD pair might move up to $480 where it is likely to hit a wall.\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink the pair below the recent low of $296.13. However, we give it a low probability of occurring.\par \par \uc2 BSV/USD\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-sv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2 ) continues to trade inside the $337.8 to $236 range. However, the range has shrunk further and we spot a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/05ffff1309bbf258b199e2d13e7c573f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BSVUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not advisable to take a trade inside the triangle because it is difficult to predict which way the breakout will happen.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above the triangle and the overhead resistance at $337.8, a rally to $458.74 is possible. On the other hand, if the bears sink the BSV/USD pair below the triangle and the support at $236, a drop to $158 is likely.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USD\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2 ) is again facing selling close to the 200-day EMA at $62. This shows that the bears are defending this level. If the price turns down from the current levels, it might dip to the 20-day EMA at $55, which is likely to act as a support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/ed652e4bec9faaf7b8340c874501efb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USD pair bounces off the 20-day EMA, we expect the bulls to make another attempt to clear the overhead resistance at the 200-day SMA and above it $66.1486. If successful, it will complete a cup and handle pattern, which has a target objective of $96.439.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA and the support at $50, the pair will turn negative.\par \par \uc2 EOS/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are facing resistance at the overhead resistance at $4.24. However, the positive thing is that they have not given up much ground. If {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  consolidates near $4.24, it will increase the possibility of a breakout of this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b2a7fa97124a4f7445c664bb319bc540.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 EOS USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/EOSUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 With the 20-day EMA sloping up and the RSI in the positive zone, the advantage is with the bulls. Above $4.24, a rally to $4.8719 is likely.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the 20-day EMA, a drop to $3.3555 is possible. A break below this support will turn the EOS/USD pair negative.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 ) above the overhead resistance at $18.50. However, with 20-day EMA sloping up and the RSI in the positive territory, the advantage is with the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/5aa1201ad5dee91b2e0ae6a33105e3f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground and the BNB/USD pair consolidates close to $18.50, the possibility of a breakout increase. Above $18.50, the next level to watch out for is the 200-day SMA at $19.89 and above it $21.80.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to our assumption, if the bears sink the price back towards $16.50, the pair will extend its stay inside the range. A break below $16.50 can turn the tables in favor of the bears. Therefore, traders can keep the stop loss on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-06-btc-eth-xrp-bch-ltc-eos-bnb-bsv-xlm-xmr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long}}}\uc2  positions at $15.90.\par \par \uc2 ETC/USD\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ethereum-classic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2 ) is in a strong uptrend. It has easily scaled above $12.04 from where it had reversed direction on Jan. 17. This shows that the bulls are firmly in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The next level to watch out for is $14 and above it $16.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/9fe3362aaedaa6d3051111e22dd4f5e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \uc2 ETC USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 However, after rallying sharply for the past four days, the ETC/USD pair might take a break and pullback towards the breakout level of $10. A successful retest of this level will give a low-risk buying opportunity\par \par \uc2 Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bears sink and sustain the price below the breakout level of $10. In such a case, a drop to the 20-day EMA is possible.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 ) has again entered the top 10 list. The bulls scaled above the overhead resistance at $0.0461161 on Jan. 27, which triggered our buy recommendation given in an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-jan-20-btc-eth-xrp-bch-bsv-ltc-eos-bnb-xlm-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier}}}\uc2  analysis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/6166222149c49b20f7b77095c7af7c08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tradingview}}}\par \par \uc2 With the sharp rally of the past three days, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD pair has reached the overhead resistance at $0.0560221. If the bulls fail to push the price above the resistance, the traders can book partial profits and raise the stops on the remaining position to breakeven.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls easily carry the price above $0.0560221, the next target is $0.0652290. Our \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the pair turns down from the current levels and slips below $0.0461161.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmll